ery day."],"u":"S01U06"},{"id":"lex.00195","w":"do","pos":"verb","ipa":"duː","uz":"qilmoq","ru":"делать","ex":["What do you do?"],"u":"S01U06"},{"id":"lex.00196","w":"make","pos":"verb","ipa":"meɪk","uz":"yasamoq, tayyorlamoq","ru":"делать","ex":["I make breakfast every morning."],"u":"S01U06"},{"id":"lex.00197","w":"morning","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmɔːrnɪŋ","uz":"tong, ertalab","ru":"утро","ex":["I get up early in the morning."],"u":"S01U06"},{"id":"lex.00198","w":"afternoon","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌæftərˈnuːn","uz":"tushdan keyin","ru":"день","ex":["I work in the afternoon."],"u":"S01U06"},{"id":"lex.00199","w":"evening","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈiːvnɪŋ","uz":"kechqurun","ru":"вечер","ex":["We watch TV in the evening."],"u":"S01U06"},{"id":"lex.00200","w":"night","pos":"noun","ipa":"naɪt","uz":"tun","ru":"ночь","ex":["I sleep eight hours at night."],"u":"S01U06"},{"id":"lex.00201","w":"day","pos":"noun","ipa":"deɪ","uz":"kun","ru":"день","ex":["I study every day."],"u":"S01U06"},{"id":"lex.00202","w":"today","pos":"adv","ipa":"təˈdeɪ","uz":"bugun","ru":"сегодня","ex":["Today is Monday."],"u":"S01U06"},{"id":"lex.00203","w":"always","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈɔːlweɪz","uz":"doim","ru":"всегда","ex":["I always get up at six."],"u":"S01U06"},{"id":"lex.00204","w":"usually","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈjuːʒuəli","uz":"odatda","ru":"обычно","ex":["I usually walk to work."],"u":"S01U06"},{"id":"lex.00205","w":"often","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈɔːfən","uz":"tez-tez","ru":"часто","ex":["We often go to the park."],"u":"S01U06"},{"id":"lex.00206","w":"sometimes","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈsʌmtaɪmz","uz":"ba'zan","ru":"иногда","ex":["I sometimes work on Saturday."],"u":"S01U06"},{"id":"lex.00207","w":"never","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈnevər","uz":"hech qachon","ru":"никогда","ex":["I never drink coffee at night."],"u":"S01U06"},{"id":"lex.00208","w":"every","pos":"det","ipa":"ˈevri","uz":"har","ru":"каждый","ex":["I study every day."],"u":"S01U06"},{"id":"lex.00209","w":"home","pos":"noun","ipa":"hoʊm","uz":"uy","ru":"дом","ex":["I go home at six."],"u":"S01U06"},{"id":"lex.00210","w":"school","pos":"noun","ipa":"skuːl","uz":"maktab","ru":"школа","ex":["My children go to school."],"u":"S01U06"},{"id":"lex.00211","w":"university","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌjuːnɪˈvɜːrsəti","uz":"universitet","ru":"университет","ex":["She studies at university."],"u":"S01U06"},{"id":"lex.00212","w":"early","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈɜːrli","uz":"erta","ru":"рано","ex":["I get up early."],"u":"S01U06"},{"id":"lex.00213","w":"late","pos":"adj","ipa":"leɪt","uz":"kech","ru":"поздно","ex":["I'm sorry, I'm late."],"u":"S01U06"},{"id":"lex.00214","w":"breakfast","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈbrekfəst","uz":"nonushta","ru":"завтрак","ex":["I have breakfast at seven."],"u":"S01U06"},{"id":"lex.00215","w":"homework","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈhoʊmwɜːrk","uz":"uy vazifasi","ru":"домашнее задание","ex":["I do my homework in the evening."],"u":"S01U06"},{"id":"lex.00216","w":"care","pos":"verb","ipa":"ker","uz":"ahamiyat bermoq","ru":"заботиться, придавать значение","ex":["She cares about the school more than anyone."],"u":"S01U07"},{"id":"lex.00217","w":"owner","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈoʊnər","uz":"egasi","ru":"владелец","ex":["The owner is not here today."],"u":"S01U07"},{"id":"lex.00218","w":"doctor","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdɑːktər","uz":"shifokor","ru":"врач","ex":["My mother is a doctor."],"u":"S01U07"},{"id":"lex.00219","w":"nurse","pos":"noun","ipa":"nɜːrs","uz":"hamshira","ru":"медсестра","ex":["She is a nurse."],"u":"S01U07"},{"id":"lex.00220","w":"engineer","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌendʒɪˈnɪr","uz":"muhandis","ru":"инженер","ex":["My brother is an engineer."],"u":"S01U07"},{"id":"lex.00221","w":"driver","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdraɪvər","uz":"haydovchi","ru":"водитель","ex":["My father is a taxi driver."],"u":"S01U07"},{"id":"lex.00222","w":"cook","pos":"noun","ipa":"kʊk","uz":"oshpaz","ru":"повар","ex":["He is a cook in a restaurant."],"u":"S01U07"},{"id":"lex.00223","w":"waiter","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈweɪtər","uz":"ofitsiant","ru":"официант","ex":["The waiter brings the menu."],"u":"S01U07"},{"id":"lex.00224","w":"farmer","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfɑːrmər","uz":"fermer, dehqon","ru":"фермер","ex":["My grandfather is a farmer."],"u":"S01U07"},{"id":"lex.00225","w":"dentist","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdentɪst","uz":"tish shifokori","ru":"стоматолог","ex":["I go to the dentist every year."],"u":"S01U07"},{"id":"lex.00226","w":"lawyer","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈlɔːjər","uz":"advokat","ru":"юрист","ex":["His sister is a lawyer."],"u":"S01U07"},{"id":"lex.00227","w":"businessman","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈbɪznəsmæn","uz":"tadbirkor","ru":"бизнесмен","ex":["My uncle is a businessman."],"u":"S01U07"},{"id":"lex.00228","w":"police officer","pos":"noun","ipa":"pəˈliːs ˌɔːfɪsər","uz":"politsiyachi","ru":"полицейский","ex":["My cousin is a police officer."],"u":"S01U07"},{"id":"lex.00229","w":"shop assistant","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈʃɑːp əˌsɪstənt","uz":"sotuvchi","ru":"продавец","ex":["She is a shop assistant."],"u":"S01U07"},{"id":"lex.00230","w":"manager","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmænɪdʒər","uz":"menejer, rahbar","ru":"менеджер","ex":["He is the manager of the shop."],"u":"S01U07"},{"id":"lex.00231","w":"hospital","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈhɑːspɪtəl","uz":"kasalxona","ru":"больница","ex":["My mother works in a hospital."],"u":"S01U07"},{"id":"lex.00232","w":"office","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɔːfɪs","uz":"ofis","ru":"офис","ex":["I work in an office."],"u":"S01U07"},{"id":"lex.00233","w":"shop","pos":"noun","ipa":"ʃɑːp","uz":"do'kon","ru":"магазин","ex":["There is a shop near my house."],"u":"S01U07"},{"id":"lex.00234","w":"factory","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfæktəri","uz":"zavod, fabrika","ru":"завод","ex":["He works in a car factory."],"u":"S01U07"},{"id":"lex.00235","w":"restaurant","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈrestrɑːnt","uz":"restoran","ru":"ресторан","ex":["We eat in a restaurant on Fridays."],"u":"S01U07"},{"id":"lex.00236","w":"bank","pos":"noun","ipa":"bæŋk","uz":"bank","ru":"банк","ex":["My father works in a bank."],"u":"S01U07"},{"id":"lex.00237","w":"market"