lease."],"u":"S01U10"},{"id":"lex.00355","w":"tea","pos":"noun","ipa":"tiː","uz":"choy","ru":"чай","ex":["I drink green tea."],"u":"S01U10"},{"id":"lex.00356","w":"coffee","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkɔːfi","uz":"qahva","ru":"кофе","ex":["I don't drink coffee."],"u":"S01U10"},{"id":"lex.00357","w":"juice","pos":"noun","ipa":"dʒuːs","uz":"sharbat","ru":"сок","ex":["Orange juice, please."],"u":"S01U10"},{"id":"lex.00358","w":"sugar","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈʃʊɡər","uz":"shakar","ru":"сахар","ex":["Two sugars, please."],"u":"S01U10"},{"id":"lex.00359","w":"menu","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmenjuː","uz":"menyu","ru":"меню","ex":["Can I see the menu, please?"],"u":"S01U10"},{"id":"lex.00360","w":"bill","pos":"noun","ipa":"bɪl","uz":"hisob","ru":"счёт","ex":["The bill, please."],"u":"S01U10"},{"id":"lex.00361","w":"cup","pos":"noun","ipa":"kʌp","uz":"piyola, chashka","ru":"чашка","ex":["A cup of tea, please."],"u":"S01U10"},{"id":"lex.00362","w":"glass","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɡlæs","uz":"stakan","ru":"стакан","ex":["A glass of water, please."],"u":"S01U10"},{"id":"lex.00363","w":"plate","pos":"noun","ipa":"pleɪt","uz":"tarelka","ru":"тарелка","ex":["Put it on the plate."],"u":"S01U10"},{"id":"lex.00364","w":"lunch","pos":"noun","ipa":"lʌntʃ","uz":"tushlik","ru":"обед","ex":["I have lunch at one o'clock."],"u":"S01U10"},{"id":"lex.00365","w":"dinner","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdɪnər","uz":"kechki ovqat","ru":"ужин","ex":["We have dinner at seven."],"u":"S01U10"},{"id":"lex.00366","w":"some","pos":"det","ipa":"sʌm","uz":"biroz, bir necha","ru":"немного","ex":["I would like some bread."],"u":"S01U10"},{"id":"lex.00367","w":"any","pos":"det","ipa":"ˈeni","uz":"hech, biror","ru":"какой-нибудь","ex":["I don't have any money."],"u":"S01U10"},{"id":"lex.00368","w":"much","pos":"det","ipa":"mʌtʃ","uz":"ko'p (sanalmaydigan)","ru":"много","ex":["I don't have much time."],"u":"S01U10"},{"id":"lex.00369","w":"many","pos":"det","ipa":"ˈmeni","uz":"ko'p (sanaladigan)","ru":"много","ex":["How many brothers do you 