","w":"piece","pos":"noun","ipa":"pis","uz":"bo'lak; asar","ru":"кусок; статья","ex":["A piece of bread and a glass of tea."],"u":"S02U02"},{"id":"lex.00475","w":"hall","pos":"noun","ipa":"hɔːl","uz":"zal","ru":"зал","ex":["The hall is behind the school."],"u":"S02U02"},{"id":"lex.00476","w":"bus stop","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈbʌs stɑːp","uz":"bekat","ru":"остановка","ex":["The bus stop is near my house."],"u":"S02U02"},{"id":"lex.00477","w":"station","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsteɪʃən","uz":"vokzal","ru":"вокзал","ex":["The train station is in the centre."],"u":"S02U02"},{"id":"lex.00478","w":"airport","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈerpɔːrt","uz":"aeroport","ru":"аэропорт","ex":["The airport is far from here."],"u":"S02U02"},{"id":"lex.00479","w":"post office","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpoʊst ˌɔːfɪs","uz":"pochta","ru":"почта","ex":["The post office is opposite the bank."],"u":"S02U02"},{"id":"lex.00480","w":"hotel","pos":"noun","ipa":"hoʊˈtel","uz":"mehmonxona","ru":"отель","ex":["We stayed in a small hotel."],"u":"S02U02"},{"id":"lex.00481","w":"café","pos":"noun","ipa":"kæˈfeɪ","uz":"kafe","ru":"кафе","ex":["Let's meet at the café."],"u":"S02U02"},{"id":"lex.00482","w":"cinema","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsɪnəmə","uz":"kinoteatr","ru":"кинотеатр","ex":["We go to the cinema on Friday."],"u":"S02U02"},{"id":"lex.00483","w":"library","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈlaɪbreri","uz":"kutubxona","ru":"библиотека","ex":["I study in the library."],"u":"S02U02"},{"id":"lex.00484","w":"museum","pos":"noun","ipa":"mjuˈziːəm","uz":"muzey","ru":"музей","ex":["The museum is closed on Monday."],"u":"S02U02"},{"id":"lex.00485","w":"mosque","pos":"noun","ipa":"mɑːsk","uz":"masjid","ru":"мечеть","ex":["The mosque is very old."],"u":"S02U02"},{"id":"lex.00486","w":"supermarket","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsuːpərmɑːrkɪt","uz":"supermarket","ru":"супермаркет","ex":["I buy food at the supermarket."],"u":"S02U02"},{"id":"lex.00487","w":"pharmacy","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfɑːrməsi","uz":"dorixona","ru":"аптека","ex":["Is there a pharmacy near here?"],"u":"S02U02"},{"id":"lex.00488","w":"left","pos":"noun","ipa":"left","uz":"chap","ru":"лево","ex":["Turn left at the bank."],"u":"S02U02"},{"id":"lex.00489","w":"right","pos":"noun","ipa":"raɪt","uz":"o'ng","ru":"право","ex":["Turn right after the bridge."],"u":"S02U02"},{"id":"lex.00490","w":"straight","pos":"adv","ipa":"streɪt","uz":"to'g'ri","ru":"прямо","ex":["Go straight on."],"u":"S02U02"},{"id":"lex.00491","w":"turn","pos":"verb","ipa":"tɜːrn","uz":"burilmoq","ru":"поворачивать","ex":["Turn left here."],"u":"S02U02"},{"id":"lex.00492","w":"cross","pos":"verb","ipa":"krɔːs","uz":"kesib o'tmoq","ru":"переходить","ex":["Cross the road here."],"u":"S02U02"},{"id":"lex.00493","w":"corner","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkɔːrnər","uz":"burchak","ru":"угол","ex":["The shop is on the corner."],"u":"S02U02"},{"id":"lex.00494","w":"road","pos":"noun","ipa":"roʊd","uz":"yo'l","ru":"дорога","ex":["Cross the road carefully."],"u":"S02U02"},{"id":"lex.00495","w":"bridge","pos":"noun","ipa":"brɪdʒ","uz":"ko'prik","ru":"мост","ex":["Go over the bridge."],"u":"S02U02"},{"id":"lex.00496","w":"traffic lights","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtræfɪk laɪts","uz":"svetofor","ru":"светофор","ex":["Turn left at the traffic lights."],"u":"S02U02"},{"id":"lex.00497","w":"map","pos":"noun","ipa":"mæp","uz":"xarita","ru":"карта","ex":["Look at the map."],"u":"S02U02"},{"id":"lex.00498","w":"way","pos":"noun","ipa":"weɪ","uz":"yo'l","ru":"путь","ex":["Excuse me, which way is the station?"],"u":"S02U02"},{"id":"lex.00499","w":"centre","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsentər","uz":"markaz","ru":"центр","ex":["I work in the city centre."],"u":"S02U02"},{"id":"lex.00500","w":"bus","pos":"noun","ipa":"bʌs","uz":"avtobus","ru":"автобус","ex":["I go to work by bus."],"u":"S02U02"},{"id":"lex.00501","w":"train","pos":"noun","ipa":"treɪn","uz":"poyezd","ru":"поезд","ex":["The train leaves at six."],"u":"S02U02"},{"id":"lex.00502","w":"taxi","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtæksi","uz":"taksi","ru":"такси","ex":["Let's take a taxi."