 a lot of stress at work."],"u":"S03U04"},{"id":"lex.01036","w":"earn","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɜːrn","uz":"ishlab topmoq","ru":"зарабатывать","ex":["She earns more than I do."],"u":"S03U05"},{"id":"lex.01037","w":"tournament","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtʊrnəmənt","uz":"turnir","ru":"турнир","ex":["The tournament starts on Friday."],"u":"S03U05"},{"id":"lex.01038","w":"competitor","pos":"noun","ipa":"kəmˈpetɪtər","uz":"raqib, ishtirokchi","ru":"участник, соперник","ex":["There are twenty competitors."],"u":"S03U05"},{"id":"lex.01039","w":"spectator","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈspekteɪtər","uz":"tomoshabin","ru":"зритель","ex":["The spectators shouted loudly."],"u":"S03U05"},{"id":"lex.01040","w":"trophy","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtroʊfi","uz":"kubok","ru":"кубок","ex":["They lifted the trophy together."],"u":"S03U05"},{"id":"lex.01041","w":"defeat","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˈfiːt","uz":"mag'lubiyat","ru":"поражение","ex":["It was their first defeat."],"u":"S03U05"},{"id":"lex.01042","w":"opponent","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈpoʊnənt","uz":"raqib","ru":"противник","ex":["Her opponent played very well."],"u":"S03U05"},{"id":"lex.01043","w":"teammate","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtiːmmeɪt","uz":"jamoadosh","ru":"товарищ по команде","ex":["He passed the ball to his teammate."],"u":"S03U05"},{"id":"lex.01044","w":"whistle","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈwɪsəl","uz":"hushtak","ru":"свисток","ex":["The whistle blew at half time."],"u":"S03U05"},{"id":"lex.01045","w":"victory","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈvɪktəri","uz":"g'alaba","ru":"победа","ex":["It was an easy victory."],"u":"S03U05"},{"id":"lex.01046","w":"athlete","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈæθliːt","uz":"sportchi","ru":"спортсмен","ex":["She is a professional athlete."],"u":"S03U05"},{"id":"lex.01047","w":"amateur","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈæmətʃʊr","uz":"havaskor","ru":"любитель","ex":["He plays as an amateur."],"u":"S03U05"},{"id":"lex.01048","w":"professional","pos":"noun","ipa":"prəˈfeʃənəl","uz":"professional","ru":"профессионал","ex":["She became a professional at nineteen."],"u":