y rich."],"u":"S03U07"},{"id":"lex.01132","w":"branch","pos":"noun","ipa":"bræntʃ","uz":"shox","ru":"ветка","ex":["A bird sat on the branch."],"u":"S03U07"},{"id":"lex.01133","w":"leaf","pos":"noun","ipa":"liːf","uz":"barg","ru":"лист","ex":["The leaves fall in autumn."],"u":"S03U07"},{"id":"lex.01134","w":"sunset","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsʌnset","uz":"quyosh botishi","ru":"закат","ex":["The sunset was beautiful."],"u":"S03U07"},{"id":"lex.01135","w":"humid","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈhjuːmɪd","uz":"nam","ru":"влажный","ex":["The air is humid today."],"u":"S03U07"},{"id":"lex.01136","w":"landscape","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈlændskeɪp","uz":"manzara","ru":"пейзаж","ex":["The landscape changes near the mountains."],"u":"S03U07"},{"id":"lex.01137","w":"countryside","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkʌntrisaɪd","uz":"qishloq joy","ru":"сельская местность","ex":["We spent the weekend in the countryside."],"u":"S03U07"},{"id":"lex.01138","w":"scenery","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsiːnəri","uz":"tabiat manzarasi","ru":"пейзаж","ex":["The scenery was wonderful."],"u":"S03U07"},{"id":"lex.01139","w":"nature","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈneɪtʃər","uz":"tabiat","ru":"природа","ex":["I love nature."],"u":"S03U07"},{"id":"lex.01140","w":"environment","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪnˈvaɪrənmənt","uz":"atrof-muhit","ru":"окружающая среда","ex":["We must protect the environment."],"u":"S03U07"},{"id":"lex.01141","w":"pollution","pos":"noun","ipa":"pəˈluːʃən","uz":"ifloslanish","ru":"загрязнение","ex":["Air pollution is a big problem."],"u":"S03U07"},{"id":"lex.01142","w":"rubbish","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈrʌbɪʃ","uz":"axlat","ru":"мусор","ex":["Don't drop rubbish."],"u":"S03U07"},{"id":"lex.01143","w":"recycle","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌriːˈsaɪkəl","uz":"qayta ishlamoq","ru":"перерабатывать","ex":["We recycle paper and glass."],"u":"S03U07"},{"id":"lex.01144","w":"protect","pos":"verb","ipa":"prəˈtekt","uz":"himoya qilmoq","ru":"защищать","ex":["We must protect the forest."],"u":"S03U07"},{"id":"lex.01145","w":"tree","pos":"noun","ipa":"triː","uz":"daraxt","ru":"дерево","ex":["There are old trees in the park."],"u":"S03U07"},{"id":"lex.01146","w":"plant","pos":"verb","ipa":"plænt","uz":"ekmoq","ru":"сажать","ex":["We planted flowers in spring."],"u":"S03U07"},{"id":"lex.01147","w":"grow","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɡroʊ","uz":"o'smoq, o'stirmoq","ru":"расти","ex":["Vegetables grow well here."],"u":"S03U07"},{"id":"lex.01148","w":"field","pos":"noun","ipa":"fiːld","uz":"dala","ru":"поле","ex":["The fields are green in spring."],"u":"S03U07"},{"id":"lex.01149","w":"hill","pos":"noun","ipa":"hɪl","uz":"tepalik","ru":"холм","ex":["We walked up the hill."],"u":"S03U07"},{"id":"lex.01150","w":"valley","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈvæli","uz":"vodiy","ru":"долина","ex":["The Fergana valley is beautiful."],"u":"S03U07"},{"id":"lex.01151","w":"animal","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈænɪməl","uz":"hayvon","ru":"животное","ex":["I like animals."],"u":"S03U07"},{"id":"lex.01152","w":"bird","pos":"noun","ipa":"bɜːrd","uz":"qush","ru":"птица","ex":["Listen to the birds."],"u":"S03U07"},{"id":"lex.01153","w":"horse","pos":"noun","ipa":"hɔːrs","uz":"ot","ru":"лошадь","ex":["He rides a horse very well."],"u":"S03U07"},{"id":"lex.01154","w":"sheep","pos":"noun","ipa":"ʃiːp","uz":"qo'y","ru":"овца","ex":["There are sheep in the field."],"u":"S03U07"},{"id":"lex.01155","w":"insect","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɪnsekt","uz":"hasharot","ru":"насекомое","ex":["There are a lot of insects in summer."],"u":"S03U07"},{"id":"lex.01156","w":"climate","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈklaɪmət","uz":"iqlim","ru":"климат","ex":["The climate here is dry."],"u":"S03U07"},{"id":"lex.01157","w":"dry","pos":"adj","ipa":"draɪ","uz":"quruq","ru":"сухой","ex":["The summer was very dry."],"u":"S03U07"},{"id":"lex.01158","w":"wet","pos":"adj","ipa":"wet","uz":"ho'l","ru":"мокрый","ex":["My shoes are wet."],"u":"S03U07"},{"id":"lex.01159","w":"fog","pos":"noun","ipa":"fɔːɡ","uz":"tuman","ru":"туман","ex":["There was thick fog this morning."],"u":"S03U07"},{"id":"lex.01160","w":"storm","pos":"noun","ipa":"stɔːrm","uz":"bo'ron","ru":"буря","ex":["There was a storm last night."],"u":"S03U07"},{"id":"lex.01161","w":"forecast","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfɔːrkæst","uz":"prognoz","ru":"прогноз","ex":["What is the forecast for tomorrow?"],"u":"S03U07"},{"id":"lex.01162","w":"outdoors","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˌaʊtˈdɔːrz","uz":"ochiq havoda","ru":"на улице","ex":["We eat outdoors in summer."],"u":"S03U07"},{"id":"lex.01163","w":"indoors","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˌɪnˈdɔːrz","uz":"uy ichida","ru":"в помещении","ex":["Stay indoors — it is raining."],"u":"S03U07"},{"id":"lex.01164","w":"differently","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈdɪfrəntli","uz":"boshqacha tarzda","ru":"по-другому","ex":["He sees it differently."],"u":"S03U08"},{"id":"lex.01165","w":"grandparent","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɡrænperənt","uz":"buva-buvi","ru":"дедушка или бабушка","ex":["My grandparents lived in a village."],"u":"S03U08"},{"id":"lex.01166","w":"neighbourhood","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈneɪbərhʊd","uz":"mahalla","ru":"район","ex":["I grew up in this neighbourhood."],"u":"S03U08"},{"id":"lex.01167","w":"photograph","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfoʊtəɡræf","uz":"surat","ru":"фотография","ex":["This is an old photograph of my mother."],"u":"S03U08"},{"id":"lex.01168","w":"funeral","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfjuːnərəl","uz":"dafn marosimi","ru":"похороны","ex":["The funeral was on Tuesday."],"u":"S03U08"},{"id":"lex.01169","w":"recently","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈriːsəntli","uz":"yaqinda","ru":"недавно","ex":["I saw him recently."],"u":"S03U08"},{"id":"lex.01170","w":"nostalgia","pos":"noun","ipa":"nɑːˈstældʒə","uz":"sog'inch","ru":"ностальгия","ex":["The song filled him with nostalgia."],"u":"S03U08"},{"id":"lex.01171","w":"toy","pos":"noun","ipa":"tɔɪ","uz":"o'yinchoq","ru":"игрушка","ex":["My favourite toy was a wooden horse."],"u":"S03U08"},{"id":"lex.01172","w":"playground","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpleɪɡraʊnd","uz":"o'yin maydonchasi","ru":"детская площадка","ex":["We played in the playground after school."],"u":"S03U08"},{"id":"lex.01173","w":"classmate","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈklæsmeɪt","uz":"sinfdosh","ru":"одноклассник","ex":["I still write to my old classmates."],"u":"S03U08"},{"id":"lex.01174","w":"uniform","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈjuːnɪfɔːrm","uz":"forma","ru":"форма","ex":["We wore a blue uniform at school."],"u":"S03U08"},{"id":"lex.01175","w":"bedtime","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈbedtaɪm","uz":"uxlash vaqti","ru":"время сна","ex":["Bedtime was at eight o'clock."],"u":"S03U08"},{"id":"lex.01176","w":"storybook","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈstɔːribʊk","uz":"ertaklar kitobi","ru":"книга сказок","ex":["I had one storybook and I read it many times."],"u":"S03U08"},{"id":"lex.01177","w":"former","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈfɔːrmər","uz":"sobiq","ru":"бывший","ex":["He is a former teacher."],"u":"S03U08"},{"id":"lex.01178","w":"previously","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈpriːviəsli","uz":"ilgari","ru":"ранее","ex":["Previously, we lived in a small flat."],"u":"S03U08"},{"id":"lex.01179","w":"era","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɪrə","uz":"davr","ru":"эпоха","ex":["It was the end of an era."],"u":"S03U08"},{"id":"lex.01180","w":"decade","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdekeɪd","uz":"o'n yillik","ru":"десятилетие","ex":["He lived there for a decade."],"u":"S03U08"},{"id":"lex.01181","w":"lifetime","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈlaɪftaɪm","uz":"umr","ru":"жизнь","ex":["She saw many changes in her lifetime."],"u":"S03U08"},{"id":"lex.01182","w":"upbringing","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈʌpbrɪŋɪŋ","uz":"tarbiya","ru":"воспитание","ex":["He had a strict upbringing."],"u":"S03U08"},{"id":"lex.01183","w":"childhood","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtʃaɪldhʊd","uz":"bolalik","ru":"детство","ex":["I had a happy childhood."],"u":"S03U08"},{"id":"lex.01184","w":"memory","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmeməri","uz":"xotira","ru":"память","ex":["I have a good memory."],"u":"S03U08"},{"id":"lex.01185","w":"grow up","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌɡroʊ ˈʌp","uz":"o'smoq, ulg'aymoq","ru":"расти","ex":["I grew up in Andijan."],"u":"S03U08"},{"id":"lex.01186","w":"change","pos":"verb","ipa":"tʃeɪndʒ","uz":"o'zgarmoq","ru":"менять","ex":["The city has changed a lot."],"u":"S03U08"},{"id":"lex.01187","w":"nowadays","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈnaʊədeɪz","uz":"hozirgi kunda","ru":"в наши дни","ex":["Nowadays everyone has a phone."],"u":"S03U08"},{"id":"lex.01188","w":"past","pos":"noun","ipa":"pæst","uz":"o'tmish","ru":"прошлое","ex":["In the past there were fewer cars."],"u":"S03U08"},{"id":"lex.01189","w":"during","pos":"prep","ipa":"ˈdʊrɪŋ","uz":"davomida","ru":"во время","ex":["I studied during the summer."],"u":"S03U08"},{"id":"lex.01190","w":"while","pos":"conj","ipa":"waɪl","uz":"-ayotganda","ru":"пока","ex":["While I was cooking, he arrived."],"u":"S03U08"},{"id":"lex.01191","w":"until","pos":"prep","ipa":"ənˈtɪl","uz":"-gacha","ru":"до","ex":["Wait until Monday."],"u":"S03U08"},{"id":"lex.01192","w":"since","pos":"prep","ipa":"sɪns","uz":"-dan beri","ru":"с","ex":["I have lived here since 2019."],"u":"S03U08"},{"id":"lex.01193","w":"already","pos":"adv","ipa":"ɔːlˈredi","uz":"allaqachon","ru":"уже","ex":["I have already eaten."],"u":"S03U08"},{"id":"lex.01194","w":"anymore","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˌeniˈmɔːr","uz":"endi (inkorda)","ru":"больше не","ex":["I don't live there anymore."],"u":"S03U08"},{"id":"lex.01195","w":"used to","pos":"phrase","ipa":"ˈjuːst tuː","uz":"ilgari qilardim","ru":"раньше","ex":["I used to play football."],"u":"S03U08"},{"id":"lex.01196","w":"custom","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkʌstəm","uz":"urf-odat","ru":"обычай","ex":["It is an old custom here."],"u":"S03U08"},{"id":"lex.01197","w":"generation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌdʒenəˈreɪʃən","uz":"avlod","ru":"поколение","ex":["My grandmother's generation worked hard."],"u":"S03U08"},{"id":"lex.01198","w":"century","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsentʃəri","uz":"asr","ru":"век","ex":["It was built in the fifteenth century."],"u":"S03U08"},{"id":"lex.01199","w":"history","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈhɪstəri","uz":"tarix","ru":"история","ex":["I like history."],"u":"S03U08"},{"id":"lex.01200","w":"ancient","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈeɪnʃənt","uz":"qadimiy","ru":"древний","ex":["Samarkand is an ancient city."],"u":"S03U08"},{"id":"lex.01201","w":"defend","pos":"verb","ipa":"dɪˈfend","uz":"himoya qilmoq","ru":"защищать","ex":["She defended her decision."],"u":"S03U09"},{"id":"lex.01202","w":"essay","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈeseɪ","uz":"insho","ru":"эссе, сочинение","ex":["The essay is due on Thursday."],"u":"S03U09"},{"id":"lex.01203","w":"certificate","pos":"noun","ipa":"sərˈtɪfɪkət","uz":"sertifikat","ru":"сертификат","ex":["I got a certificate at the end of the course."],"u":"S03U09"},{"id":"lex.01204","w":"lecture","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈlektʃər","uz":"ma'ruza","ru":"лекция","ex":["The lecture starts at nine."],"u":"S03U09"},{"id":"lex.01205","w":"scholarship","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈskɑːlərʃɪp","uz":"stipendiya","ru":"стипендия","ex":["She won a scholarship to study abroad."],"u":"S03U09"},{"id":"lex.01206","w":"tuition","pos":"noun","ipa":"tuˈɪʃən","uz":"o'qish to'lovi","ru":"плата за обучение","ex":["Tuition is very expensive."],"u":"S03U09"},{"id":"lex.01207","w":"dormitory","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdɔːrmɪtɔːri","uz":"talabalar turar joyi","ru":"общежитие","ex":["He lives in a dormitory near the campus."],"u":"S03U09"},{"id":"lex.01208","w":"graduation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌɡrædʒuˈeɪʃən","uz":"bitiruv","ru":"выпуск","ex":["Graduation is in June."],"u":"S03U09"},{"id":"lex.01209","w":"apprentice","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈprentɪs","uz":"shogird","ru":"ученик, подмастерье","ex":["He started as an apprentice at sixteen."],"u":"S03U09"},{"id":"lex.01210","w":"trainee","pos":"noun","ipa":"treɪˈniː","uz":"stajyor","ru":"стажёр","ex":["She is a trainee at the hospital."],"u":"S03U09"},{"id":"lex.01211","w":"resign","pos":"verb","ipa":"rɪˈzaɪn","uz":"ishdan bo'shamoq","ru":"уволиться","ex":["He resigned last month."],"u":"S03U09"},{"id":"lex.01212","w":"workload","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈwɜːrkloʊd","uz":"ish yuki","ru":"нагрузка","ex":["My workload is heavy this month."],"u":"S03U09"},{"id":"lex.01213","w":"profession","pos":"noun","ipa":"prəˈfeʃən","uz":"kasb","ru":