:["That is a fact."],"u":"S03U10"},{"id":"lex.01268","w":"opinion","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈpɪnjən","uz":"fikr","ru":"мнение","ex":["In my opinion, it is too expensive."],"u":"S03U10"},{"id":"lex.01269","w":"disagree","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌdɪsəˈɡriː","uz":"rozi bo'lmaslik","ru":"не соглашаться","ex":["I disagree with that."],"u":"S03U10"},{"id":"lex.01270","w":"true","pos":"adj","ipa":"truː","uz":"rost","ru":"правда","ex":["Is that true?"],"u":"S03U10"},{"id":"lex.01271","w":"false","pos":"adj","ipa":"fɔːls","uz":"yolg'on","ru":"ложный","ex":["That is false."],"u":"S03U10"},{"id":"lex.01272","w":"extend","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪkˈstend","uz":"uzaytirmoq, kengaytirmoq","ru":"продлевать, расширять","ex":["They extended the deadline."],"u":"S03U11"},{"id":"lex.01273","w":"flour","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈflaʊər","uz":"un","ru":"мука","ex":["We need a kilo of flour."],"u":"S03U11"},{"id":"lex.01274","w":"bakery","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈbeɪkəri","uz":"nonvoyxona","ru":"пекарня","ex":["The bakery opens at five."],"u":"S03U11"},{"id":"lex.01275","w":"length","pos":"noun","ipa":"leŋθ","uz":"uzunlik","ru":"длина, продолжительность","ex":["The length of the table is two metres."],"u":"S03U11"},{"id":"lex.01276","w":"dot","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɑt","uz":"nuqta","ru":"точка","ex":["Put a dot over the letter."],"u":"S03U11"},{"id":"lex.01277","w":"decoration","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌdekəˈreɪʃən","uz":"bezak","ru":"украшение","ex":["We put decorations on the walls."],"u":"S03U11"},{"id":"lex.01278","w":"feast","pos":"noun","ipa":"fiːst","uz":"ziyofat","ru":"пир","ex":["The wedding feast lasted all night."],"u":"S03U11"},{"id":"lex.01279","w":"dessert","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˈzɜːrt","uz":"shirinlik","ru":"десерт","ex":["What is for dessert?"],"u":"S03U11"},{"id":"lex.01280","w":"flavour","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfleɪvər","uz":"ta'm","ru":"вкус","ex":["This ice cream has a strange flavour."],"u":"S03U11"},{"id":"lex.01281","w":"firework","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfaɪərwɜːrk","uz":"mushakbozlik","ru":"фейерверк"