uz":"qashshoqlik","ru":"бедность","ex":["Many families live in poverty."],"u":"S03U14"},{"id":"lex.01390","w":"loan","pos":"noun","ipa":"loʊn","uz":"qarz, kredit","ru":"кредит","ex":["He took a loan from the bank."],"u":"S03U14"},{"id":"lex.01391","w":"bargain","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈbɑːrɡɪn","uz":"arzon narsa","ru":"выгодная покупка","ex":["That coat was a real bargain."],"u":"S03U14"},{"id":"lex.01392","w":"worth","pos":"adj","ipa":"wɜːrθ","uz":"arziydi","ru":"стоящий","ex":["This house is worth a lot of money."],"u":"S03U14"},{"id":"lex.01393","w":"median","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmiːdiən","uz":"o'rtacha (median)","ru":"медиана","ex":["The median price is lower than the average."],"u":"S03U14"},{"id":"lex.01394","w":"rate","pos":"noun","ipa":"reɪt","uz":"stavka, daraja","ru":"ставка, уровень","ex":["The hotel offers a special rate."],"u":"S03U14"},{"id":"lex.01395","w":"equal","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈiːkwəl","uz":"teng","ru":"равный","ex":["The two halves are equal."],"u":"S03U14"},{"id":"lex.01396","w":"compare","pos":"verb","ipa":"kəmˈper","uz":"taqqoslamoq","ru":"сравнивать","ex":["Compare the two pictures."],"u":"S03U14"},{"id":"lex.01397","w":"choice","pos":"noun","ipa":"tʃɔɪs","uz":"tanlov","ru":"выбор","ex":["It was a difficult choice."],"u":"S03U14"},{"id":"lex.01398","w":"advantage","pos":"noun","ipa":"ədˈvæntɪdʒ","uz":"afzallik","ru":"преимущество","ex":["The main advantage is the price."],"u":"S03U14"},{"id":"lex.01399","w":"disadvantage","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌdɪsədˈvæntɪdʒ","uz":"kamchilik","ru":"недостаток","ex":["The disadvantage is the noise."],"u":"S03U14"},{"id":"lex.01400","w":"quality","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkwɑːləti","uz":"sifat","ru":"качество","ex":["The quality is very good."],"u":"S03U14"},{"id":"lex.01401","w":"value","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈvæljuː","uz":"qiymat","ru":"ценность","ex":["It is very good value."],"u":"S03U14"},{"id":"lex.01402","w":"cost","pos":"noun","ipa":"kɔːst","uz":"narx","ru":"стоимость","ex":["The cost is too high."],"u":"S03U14"},{"id":"lex.01403","w":"afford","pos":"verb","ipa":"əˈfɔːrd","uz":"qurbi yetmoq","ru":"позволить себе","ex":["I can't afford a new car."],"u":"S03U14"},{"id":"lex.01404","w":"waste","pos":"verb","ipa":"weɪst","uz":"behuda sarflamoq","ru":"тратить впустую","ex":["Don't waste your time."],"u":"S03U14"},{"id":"lex.01405","w":"owe","pos":"verb","ipa":"oʊ","uz":"qarzdor bo'lmoq","ru":"быть должным","ex":["I owe you ten dollars."],"u":"S03U14"},{"id":"lex.01406","w":"average","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈævərɪdʒ","uz":"o'rtacha","ru":"средний","ex":["The average price is ten dollars."],"u":"S03U14"},{"id":"lex.01407","w":"per cent","pos":"noun","ipa":"pər ˈsent","uz":"foiz","ru":"процент","ex":["Twenty per cent of students walk."],"u":"S03U14"},{"id":"lex.01408","w":"increase","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪnˈkriːs","uz":"oshmoq","ru":"увеличиваться","ex":["Prices increased last year."],"u":"S03U14"},{"id":"lex.01409","w":"decrease","pos":"verb","ipa":"dɪˈkriːs","uz":"kamaymoq","ru":"уменьшаться","ex":["Prices decreased slightly."],"u":"S03U14"},{"id":"lex.01410","w":"amount","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈmaʊnt","uz":"miqdor","ru":"количество","ex":["A large amount of water."],"u":"S03U14"},{"id":"lex.01411","w":"enough","pos":"det","ipa":"ɪˈnʌf","uz":"yetarli","ru":"достаточно","ex":["I don't have enough money."],"u":"S03U14"},{"id":"lex.01412","w":"exactly","pos":"adv","ipa":"ɪɡˈzæktli","uz":"aniq","ru":"точно","ex":["It costs exactly ten dollars."],"u":"S03U14"},{"id":"lex.01413","w":"probably","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈprɑːbəbli","uz":"ehtimol","ru":"вероятно","ex":["He will probably come."],"u":"S03U14"},{"id":"lex.01414","w":"instead","pos":"adv","ipa":"ɪnˈsted","uz":"o'rniga","ru":"вместо","ex":["Let's take a taxi instead."],"u":"S03U14"},{"id":"lex.01415","w":"anyway","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈeniweɪ","uz":"baribir","ru":"всё равно","ex":["It was raining, but we went anyway."],"u":"S03U14"},{"id":"lex.01416","w":"fund","pos":"noun","ipa":"fʌnd","uz":"mablag', jamg'arma","ru":"фонд, средства","ex":["The fund pays for repairs."],"u":"S04U01"},{"id":"lex.01417","w":"funding","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfʌndɪŋ","uz":"moliyalashtirish","ru":"финансирование","ex":["Funding runs out in June."],"u":"S04U01"},{"id":"lex.01418","w":"adventure","pos":"noun","ipa":"ædˈventʃər","uz":"sarguzasht","ru":"приключение","ex":["Our trip to the mountains was a real adventure."],"u":"S04U01"},{"id":"lex.01419","w":"achievement","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈtʃiːvmənt","uz":"yutuq","ru":"достижение","ex":["Finishing the race was a great achievement."],"u":"S04U01"},{"id":"lex.01420","w":"attempt","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈtempt","uz":"urinish","ru":"попытка","ex":["It was my first attempt."],"u":"S04U01"},{"id":"lex.01421","w":"challenge","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtʃælɪndʒ","uz":"sinov, qiyin vazifa","ru":"вызов","ex":["The new job is a challenge for him."],"u":"S04U01"},{"id":"lex.01422","w":"crowd","pos":"noun","ipa":"kraʊd","uz":"olomon","ru":"толпа","ex":["A big crowd waited outside."],"u":"S04U01"},{"id":"lex.01423","w":"festival","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfestɪvəl","uz":"festival","ru":"фестиваль","ex":["We went to a music festival."],"u":"S04U01"},{"id":"lex.01424","w":"volunteer","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌvɑːlənˈtɪr","uz":"ko'ngilli","ru":"волонтёр","ex":["She works as a volunteer at the hospital."],"u":"S04U01"},{"id":"lex.01425","w":"opportunity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌɑːpərˈtuːnəti","uz":"imkoniyat","ru":"возможность","ex":["It was a good opportunity to travel."],"u":"S04U01"},{"id":"lex.01426","w":"risk","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪsk","uz":"xavf","ru":"риск","ex":["There is a small risk."],"u":"S04U01"},{"id":"lex.01427","w":"unusual","pos":"adj","ipa":"ʌnˈjuːʒuəl","uz":"g'ayrioddiy","ru":"необычный","ex":["That is an unusual name."],"u":"S04U01"},{"id":"lex.01428","w":"ordinary","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈɔːrdəneri","uz":"oddiy","ru":"обычный","ex":["It was an ordinary day."],"u":"S04U01"},{"id":"lex.01429","w":"amazing","pos":"adj","ipa":"əˈmeɪzɪŋ","uz":"ajoyib","ru":"удивительный","ex":["The view was amazing."],"u":"S04U01"},{"id":"lex.01430","w":"incredible","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪnˈkredəbəl","uz":"aql bovar qilmas","ru":"невероятный","ex":["He has an incredible memory."],"u":"S04U01"},{"id":"lex.01431","w":"frightening","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈfraɪtənɪŋ","uz":"qo'rqinchli","ru":"пугающий","ex":["The storm was frightening."],"u":"S04U01"},{"id":"lex.01432","w":"brave","pos":"adj","ipa":"breɪv","uz":"jasur","ru":"смелый","ex":["She was very brave."],"u":"S04U01"},{"id":"lex.01433","w":"curious","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈkjʊriəs","uz":"qiziquvchan","ru":"любопытный","ex":["Children are curious about everything."],"u":"S04U01"},{"id":"lex.01434","w":"dare","pos":"verb","ipa":"der","uz":"jur'at qilmoq","ru":"осмелиться","ex":["I did not dare to ask."],"u":"S04U01"},{"id":"lex.01435","w":"explore","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪkˈsplɔːr","uz":"kashf qilmoq, aylanmoq","ru":"исследовать","ex":["We explored the old town."],"u":"S04U01"},{"id":"lex.01436","w":"discover","pos":"verb","ipa":"dɪˈskʌvər","uz":"kashf qilmoq","ru":"обнаружить","ex":["I discovered a small café near my house."],"u":"S04U01"},{"id":"lex.01437","w":"ski","pos":"verb","ipa":"skiː","uz":"chang'i uchmoq","ru":"кататься на лыжах","ex":["Have you ever skied?"],"u":"S04U01"},{"id":"lex.01438","w":"dive","pos":"verb","ipa":"daɪv","uz":"suvga sho'ng'imoq","ru":"нырять","ex":["He dived into the water."],"u":"S04U01"},{"id":"lex.01439","w":"sail","pos":"verb","ipa":"seɪl","uz":"suzmoq (kemada)","ru":"плыть под парусом","ex":["They sailed across the lake."],"u":"S04U01"},{"id":"lex.01440","w":"guidebook","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɡaɪdbʊk","uz":"yo'l ko'rsatkich kitob","ru":"путеводитель","ex":["I bought a guidebook at the station."],"u":"S04U01"},{"id":"lex.01441","w":"wander","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈwɑːndər","uz":"maqsadsiz yurmoq","ru":"бродить","ex":["We wandered around the old streets."],"u":"S04U01"},{"id":"lex.01442","w":"hostel","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈhɑːstəl","uz":"yotoqxona (arzon mehmonxona)","ru":"хостел","ex":["We stayed in a cheap hostel."],"u":"S04U01"},{"id":"lex.01443","w":"campsite","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkæmpsaɪt","uz":"chodir maydoni","ru":"кемпинг","ex":["The campsite is next to the river."],"u":"S04U01"},{"id":"lex.01444","w":"tent","pos":"noun","ipa":"tent","uz":"chodir","ru":"палатка","ex":["We slept in a tent."],"u":"S04U01"},{"id":"lex.01445","w":"thrill","pos":"noun","ipa":"θrɪl","uz":"hayajon","ru":"острые ощущения","ex":["It was a real thrill."],"u":"S04U01"},{"id":"lex.01446","w":"scary","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈskeri","uz":"qo'rqinchli","ru":"страшный","ex":["That film was scary."],"u":"S04U01"},{"id":"lex.01447","w":"bold","pos":"adj","ipa":"boʊld","uz":"dadil","ru":"смелый","ex":["It was a bold plan."],"u":"S04U01"},{"id":"lex.01448","w":"hiking","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈhaɪkɪŋ","uz":"piyoda sayohat","ru":"пеший туризм","ex":["We go hiking every spring."],"u":"S04U01"},{"id":"lex.01449","w":"camel","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkæməl","uz":"tuya","ru":"верблюд","ex":["Have you ever ridden a camel?"],"u":"S04U01"},{"id":"lex.01450","w":"trek","pos":"noun","ipa":"trek","uz":"uzoq piyoda yurish","ru":"поход","ex":["It was a long trek to the top."],"u":"S04U01"},{"id":"lex.01451","w":"expedition","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌekspəˈdɪʃən","uz":"ekspeditsiya","ru":"экспедиция","ex":["They joined an expedition to the desert."],"u":"S04U01"},{"id":"lex.01452","w":"daring","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈderɪŋ","uz":"jur'atli","ru":"дерзкий","ex":["It was a daring escape."],"u":"S04U01"},{"id":"lex.01453","w":"whole","pos":"adj","ipa":"hoʊl","uz":"butun","ru":"целый","ex":["I read the whole book in one day."],"u":"S04U01"},{"id":"lex.01454","w":"rare","pos":"adj","ipa":"rer","uz":"kam uchraydigan","ru":"редкий","ex":["It is a rare bird."],"u":"S04U01"},{"id":"lex.01455","w":"unforgettable","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌʌnfərˈɡetəbəl","uz":"unutilmas","ru":"незабываемый","ex":["It was an unforgettable evening."],"u":"S04U01"},{"id":"lex.01456","w":"pressure","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpreʃər","uz":"bosim","ru":"давление","ex":["There is pressure to finish early."],"u":"S04U02"},{"id":"lex.01457","w":"blow","pos":"verb","ipa":"bloʊ","uz":"puflamoq; shamol esmoq","ru":"дуть","ex":["The wind blew all night."],"u":"S04U02"},{"id":"lex.01458","w":"remove","pos":"verb","ipa":"rɪˈmuv","uz":"olib tashlamoq","ru":"убирать, удалять","ex":["Remove the second paragraph and it reads better."],"u":"S04U02"},{"id":"lex.01459","w":"landlord","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈlændlɔːrd","uz":"uy egasi","ru":"хозяин квартиры","ex":["The landlord lives downstairs."],"u":"S04U02"},{"id":"lex.01460","w":"tenant","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtenənt","uz":"ijarachi","ru":"арендатор","ex":["The new tenant moved in last week."],"u":"S04U02"},{"id":"lex.01461","w":"carpet","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkɑːrpɪt","uz":"gilam","ru":"ковёр","ex":["There is a red carpet in the living room."],"u":"S04U02"},{"id":"lex.01462","w":"curtain","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkɜːrtən","uz":"parda","ru":"штора","ex":["Please close the curtains."],"u":"S04U02"},{"id":"lex.01463","w":"drawer","pos":"noun","ipa":"drɔːr","uz":"tortma","ru":"ящик","ex":["The keys are in the top drawer."],"u":"S04U02"},{"id":"lex.01464","w":"basement","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈbeɪsmənt","uz":"yerto'la","ru":"подвал","ex":["We keep old boxes in the basement."],"u":"S04U02"},{"id":"lex.01465","w":"attic","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈætɪk","uz":"chordoq","ru":"чердак","ex":["The attic is full of old furniture."],"u":"S04U02"},{"id":"lex.01466","w":"ceiling","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsiːlɪŋ","uz":"shift","ru":"потолок","ex":["The ceiling is very high."],"u":"S04U02"},{"id":"lex.01467","w":"staircase","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsterkeɪs","uz":"zinapoya","ru":"лестница","ex":["The staircase is on the left."],"u":"S04U02"},{"id":"lex.01468","w":"suburb","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsʌbɜːrb","uz":"shahar chekkasi","ru":"пригород","ex":["They live in a quiet suburb."],"u":"S04U02"},{"id":"lex.01469","w":"agent","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈeɪdʒənt","uz":"vositachi, agent","ru":"агент","ex":["The agent showed us three flats."],"u":"S04U02"},{"id":"lex.01470","w":"unpack","pos":"verb","ipa":"ʌnˈpæk","uz":"buyumlarni chiqarmoq","ru":"распаковать","ex":["I have not unpacked yet."],"u":"S04U02"},{"id":"lex.01471","w":"apartment","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈpɑːrtmənt","uz":"kvartira","ru":"квартира","ex":["Their apartment is on the fourth floor."],"u":"S04U02"},{"id":"lex.01472","w":"studio","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈstuːdioʊ","uz":"bir xonali kvartira","ru":"студия","ex":["She rents a small studio."],"u":"S04U02"},{"id":"lex.01473","w":"wallpaper","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈwɔːlpeɪpər","uz":"devor qog'ozi","ru":"обои","ex":["The wallpaper is old and yellow."],"u":"S04U02"},{"id":"lex.01474","w":"tile","pos":"noun","ipa":"taɪl","uz":"kafel","ru":"плитка","ex":["One tile is broken."],"u":"S04U02"},{"id":"lex.01475","w":"lease","pos":"noun","ipa":"liːs","uz":"ijara shartnomasi","ru":"договор аренды","ex":["The lease is for one year."],"u":"S04U02"},{"id":"lex.01476","w":"furnish","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈfɜːrnɪʃ","uz":"jihozlamoq","ru":"меблировать","ex":["They furnished the flat cheaply."],"u":"S04U02"},{"id":"lex.01477","w":"cramped","pos":"adj","ipa":"kræmpt","uz":"tor, siqiq","ru":"тесный","ex":["The kitchen is a bit cramped."],"u":"S04U02"},{"id":"lex.01478","w":"damp","pos":"adj","ipa":"dæmp","uz":"nam","ru":"сырой","ex":["The basement is damp in winter."],"u":"S04U02"},{"id":"lex.01479","w":"rug","pos":"noun","ipa":"rʌɡ","uz":"kichik gilam","ru":"коврик","ex":["There is a small rug by the door."],"u":"S04U02"},{"id":"lex.01480","w":"fireplace","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfaɪərpleɪs","uz":"kamin","ru":"камин","ex":["The old house has a fireplace."],"u":"S04U02"},{"id":"lex.01481","w":"porch","pos":"noun","ipa":"pɔːrtʃ","uz":"ayvon","ru":"крыльцо","ex":["They were sitting on the porch."],"u":"S04U02"},{"id":"lex.01482","w":"furnished","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈfɜːrnɪʃt","uz":"jihozlangan","ru":"меблированный","ex":["We rented a furnished flat."],"u":"S04U02"},{"id":"lex.01483","w":"utilities","pos":"noun","ipa":"juːˈtɪlətiz","uz":"kommunal xizmatlar","ru":"коммунальные услуги","ex":["The rent does not include utilities."],"u":"S04U02"},{"id":"lex.01484","w":"estate","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪˈsteɪt","uz":"turar joy majmuasi","ru":"жилой комплекс","ex":["They live on a new estate."],"u":"S04U02"},{"id":"lex.01485","w":"mortgage","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmɔːrɡɪdʒ","uz":"ipoteka","ru":"ипотека","ex":["They are paying a mortgage."],"u":"S04U02"},{"id":"lex.01486","w":"rearrange","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌriːəˈreɪndʒ","uz":"qayta joylashtirmoq","ru":"переставить","ex":["We rearranged the furniture."],"u":"S04U02"},{"id":"lex.01487","w":"hallway","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈhɔːlweɪ","uz":"dahliz","ru":"прихожая","ex":["Leave your coat in the hallway."],"u":"S04U02"},{"id":"lex.01488","w":"rented","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈrentɪd","uz":"ijaraga olingan","ru":"арендованный","ex":["It is a rented flat."],"u":"S04U02"},{"id":"lex.01489","w":"doorstep","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdɔːrstep","uz":"eshik oldi","ru":"порог","ex":["He left the box on the doorstep."],"u":"S04U02"},{"id":"lex.01490","w":"roomy","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈruːmi","uz":"keng","ru":"просторный","ex":["The car is roomy enough for five."],"u":"S04U02"},{"id":"lex.01491","w":"household","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈhaʊshoʊld","uz":"xonadon","ru":"домашнее хозяйство","ex":["There are five people in our household."],"u":"S04U02"},{"id":"lex.01492","w":"underneath","pos":"prep","ipa":"ˌʌndərˈniθ","uz":"ostida","ru":"под, снизу","ex":["The key is underneath the mat."],"u":"S04U03"},{"id":"lex.01493","w":"plumber","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈplʌmər","uz":"santexnik","ru":"сантехник","ex":["We called a plumber this morning."],"u":"S04U03"},{"id":"lex.01494","w":"electrician","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪˌlekˈtrɪʃən","uz":"elektrik","ru":"электрик","ex":["An electrician is coming tomorrow."],"u":"S04U03"},{"id":"lex.01495","w":"mechanic","pos":"noun","ipa":"məˈkænɪk","uz":"avtoulov ustasi","ru":"механик","ex":["The mechanic looked at the engine."],"u":"S04U03"},{"id":"lex.01496","w":"damage","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdæmɪdʒ","uz":"zarar","ru":"повреждение","ex":["The storm caused a lot of damage."],"u":"S04U03"},{"id":"lex.01497","w":"crack","pos":"noun","ipa":"kræk","uz":"yoriq","ru":"трещина","ex":["There is a crack in the glass."],"u":"S04U03"},{"id":"lex.01498","w":"scratch","pos":"noun","ipa":"skrætʃ","uz":"tirnalgan joy","ru":"царапина","ex":["There is a scratch on the door."],"u":"S04U03"},{"id":"lex.01499","w":"replace","pos":"verb","ipa":"rɪˈpleɪs","uz":"almashtirmoq","ru":"заменить","ex":["We had to replace the battery."],"u":"S04U03"},{"id":"lex.01500","w":"spare","pos":"adj","ipa":"sper","uz":"zapas","ru":"запасной","ex":["Do you have a spare key?"],"u":"S04U03"},{"id":"lex.01501","w":"tool","pos":"noun","ipa":"tuːl","uz":"asbob","ru":"инструмент","ex":["I need a tool for this screw."],"u":"S04U03"},{"id":"lex.01502","w":"hammer","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈhæmər","uz":"bolg'a","ru":"молоток","ex":["Pass me the hammer, please."],"u":"S04U03"},{"id":"lex.01503","w":"screwdriver","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈskruːdraɪvər","uz":"otvertka","ru":"отвёртка","ex":["I need a small screwdriver."],"u":"S04U03"},{"id":"lex.01504","w":"nail","pos":"noun","ipa":"neɪl","uz":"mix","ru":"гвоздь","ex":["Put a nail in the wall."],"u":"S04U03"},{"id":"lex.01505","w":"screw","pos":"noun","ipa":"skruː","uz":"vint","ru":"винт","ex":["One screw is missing."],"u":"S04U03"},{"id":"lex.01506","w":"wire","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈwaɪər","uz":"sim","ru":"провод","ex":["Do not touch that wire."],"u":"S04U03"},{"id":"lex.01507","w":"pipe","pos":"noun","ipa":"paɪp","uz":"quvur","ru":"труба","ex":["The pipe under the sink is leaking."],"u":"S04U03"},{"id":"lex.01508","w":"boiler","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈbɔɪlər","uz":"suv isitgich","ru":"котёл","ex":["The boiler is not working."],"u":"S04U03"},{"id":"lex.01509","w":"heater","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈhiːtər","uz":"isitgich","ru":"обогреватель","ex":["Turn on the heater, please."],"u":"S04U03"},{"id":"lex.01510","w":"fault","pos":"noun","ipa":"fɔːlt","uz":"nosozlik, ayb","ru":"неисправность, вина","ex":["There is a fault in the machine."],"u":"S04U03"},{"id":"lex.01511","w":"guarantee","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌɡærənˈtiː","uz":"kafolat","ru":"гарантия","ex":["The phone has a two-year guarantee."],"u":"S04U03"},{"id":"lex.01512","w":"blocked","pos":"adj","ipa":"blɑːkt","uz":"tiqilgan","ru":"засорённый","ex":["The sink is blocked."],"u":"S04U03"},{"id":"lex.01513","w":"drain","pos":"noun","ipa":"dreɪn","uz":"suv chiqish teshigi","ru":"слив","ex":["The drain is blocked again."],"u":"S04U03"},{"id":"lex.01514","w":"bulb","pos":"noun","ipa":"bʌlb","uz":"lampochka","ru":"лампочка","ex":["The bulb has gone."],"u":"S04U03"},{"id":"lex.01515","w":"fuse","pos":"noun","ipa":"fjuːz","uz":"saqlagich","ru":"предохранитель","ex":["A fuse has blown."],"u":"S04U03"},{"id":"lex.01516","w":"brake","pos":"noun","ipa":"breɪk","uz":"tormoz","ru":"тормоз","ex":["The brakes are not good."],"u":"S04U03"},{"id":"lex.01517","w":"tyre","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtaɪər","uz":"shina","ru":"шина","ex":["The front tyre is flat."],"u":"S04U03"},{"id":"lex.01518","w":"dent","pos":"noun","ipa":"dent","uz":"botiq joy","ru":"вмятина","ex":["There is a dent in the door."],"u":"S04U03"},{"id":"lex.01519","w":"polish","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈpɑːlɪʃ","uz":"yaltiratmoq","ru":"полировать","ex":["He polished the table."],"u":"S04U03"},{"id":"lex.01520","w":"tighten","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈtaɪtən","uz":"mahkamlamoq","ru":"затянуть","ex":["Tighten the screw a little."],"u":"S04U03"},{"id":"lex.01521","w":"instructions","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪnˈstrʌkʃənz","uz":"yo'riqnoma","ru":"инструкция","ex":["Read the instructions first."],"u":"S04U03"},{"id":"lex.01522","w":"manual","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmænjuəl","uz":"qo'llanma","ru":"руководство","ex":["The manual explains everything."],"u":"S04U03"},{"id":"lex.01523","w":"toolbox","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtuːlbɑːks","uz":"asboblar quttisi","ru":"ящик для инструментов","ex":["The hammer is in the toolbox."],"u":"S04U03"},{"id":"lex.01524","w":"glue","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɡluː","uz":"yelim","ru":"клей","ex":["Use glue for the paper."],"u":"S04U03"},{"id":"lex.01525","w":"tape","pos":"noun","ipa":"teɪp","uz":"skotch","ru":"скотч","ex":["Put some tape on the box."],"u":"S04U03"},{"id":"lex.01526","w":"rusty","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈrʌsti","uz":"zanglagan","ru":"ржавый","ex":["The gate is rusty."],"u":"S04U03"},{"id":"lex.01527","w":"maintenance","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmeɪntənəns","uz":"texnik xizmat","ru":"обслуживание","ex":["The building needs maintenance."],"u":"S04U03"},{"id":"lex.01528","w":"workshop","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈwɜːrkʃɑːp","uz":"ustaxona","ru":"мастерская","ex":["The car is in the workshop."],"u":"S04U03"},{"id":"lex.01529","w":"faulty","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈfɔːlti","uz":"nosoz","ru":"неисправный","ex":["The switch is faulty."],"u":"S04U03"},{"id":"lex.01530","w":"leaking","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈliːkɪŋ","uz":"oqayotgan","ru":"протекающий","ex":["There is a leaking pipe upstairs."],"u":"S04U03"},{"id":"lex.01531","w":"repairman","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈpermæn","uz":"usta","ru":"мастер по ремонту","ex":["The repairman came at ten."],"u":"S04U03"},{"id":"lex.01532","w":"toolkit","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtuːlkɪt","uz":"asboblar to'plami","ru":"набор инструментов","ex":["A small toolkit came with the bike."],"u":"S04U03"},{"id":"lex.01533","w":"mend","pos":"verb","ipa":"mend","uz":"tuzatmoq","ru":"чинить","ex":["Can you mend this chair?"],"u":"S04U03"},{"id":"lex.01534","w":"wooden","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈwʊdən","uz":"yog'och","ru":"деревянный","ex":["A wooden bridge crossed the stream."],"u":"S04U04"},{"id":"lex.01535","w":"flood","pos":"verb","ipa":"flʌd","uz":"suv bosmoq","ru":"затоплять","ex":["The lower field floods twice a year."],"u":"S04U04"},{"id":"lex.01536","w":"narrow","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈnæroʊ","uz":"toraytirmoq","ru":"сужать, сужаться","ex":["The channel has narrowed since 1998."],"u":"S04U04"},{"id":"lex.01537","w":"strongly","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈstrɔŋli","uz":"qattiq, kuchli tarzda","ru":"сильно, решительно","ex":["I strongly advise you to read 