ure","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌmænjuˈfæktʃər","uz":"ishlab chiqarmoq (zavodda)","ru":"изготавливать","ex":["The parts are manufactured in Korea."],"u":"S04U04"},{"id":"lex.01553","w":"package","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpækɪdʒ","uz":"o'ram","ru":"упаковка","ex":["A package arrived for you."],"u":"S04U04"},{"id":"lex.01554","w":"label","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈleɪbəl","uz":"yorliq","ru":"этикетка","ex":["Read the label first."],"u":"S04U04"},{"id":"lex.01555","w":"export","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪkˈspɔːrt","uz":"eksport qilmoq","ru":"экспортировать","ex":["They export fruit to Russia."],"u":"S04U04"},{"id":"lex.01556","w":"import","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪmˈpɔːrt","uz":"import qilmoq","ru":"импортировать","ex":["We import machines from Germany."],"u":"S04U04"},{"id":"lex.01557","w":"cloth","pos":"noun","ipa":"klɔːθ","uz":"mato","ru":"ткань","ex":["Clean it with a soft cloth."],"u":"S04U04"},{"id":"lex.01558","w":"linen","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈlɪnən","uz":"zig'ir mato","ru":"лён","ex":["Linen is cool in summer."],"u":"S04U04"},{"id":"lex.01559","w":"marble","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmɑːrbəl","uz":"marmar","ru":"мрамор","ex":["The floor is marble."],"u":"S04U04"},{"id":"lex.01560","w":"sand","pos":"noun","ipa":"sænd","uz":"qum","ru":"песок","ex":["Glass is made from sand."],"u":"S04U04"},{"id":"lex.01561","w":"cement","pos":"noun","ipa":"sɪˈment","uz":"sement","ru":"цемент","ex":["They bought ten bags of cement."],"u":"S04U04"},{"id":"lex.01562","w":"mixture","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmɪkstʃər","uz":"aralashma","ru":"смесь","ex":["It is a mixture of sand and cement."],"u":"S04U04"},{"id":"lex.01563","w":"melt","pos":"verb","ipa":"melt","uz":"eritmoq","ru":"плавить","ex":["The metal is melted first."],"u":"S04U04"},{"id":"lex.01564","w":"pour","pos":"verb","ipa":"pɔːr","uz":"quymoq","ru":"наливать","ex":["Pour the water slowly."],"u":"S04U04"},{"id":"lex.01565","w":"sew","pos":"verb","ipa":"soʊ","uz":"tikmoq","ru":"шить","ex":["My grandmother sews very well."],"u":"S04U04"},{"id":"lex.01566","w":"weave",