lps me relax."],"u":"S04U13"},{"id":"lex.01888","w":"posture","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpɑːstʃər","uz":"gavda holati","ru":"осанка","ex":["Bad posture causes back pain."],"u":"S04U13"},{"id":"lex.01889","w":"stretch","pos":"verb","ipa":"stretʃ","uz":"cho'zmoq","ru":"растягивать","ex":["Stretch your legs before running."],"u":"S04U13"},{"id":"lex.01890","w":"breathing","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈbriːðɪŋ","uz":"nafas olish","ru":"дыхание","ex":["Slow breathing helps you calm down."],"u":"S04U13"},{"id":"lex.01891","w":"pulse","pos":"noun","ipa":"pʌls","uz":"puls","ru":"пульс","ex":["The nurse took my pulse."],"u":"S04U13"},{"id":"lex.01892","w":"nutrition","pos":"noun","ipa":"nuːˈtrɪʃən","uz":"ovqatlanish","ru":"питание","ex":["Good nutrition is important for children."],"u":"S04U13"},{"id":"lex.01893","w":"protein","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈproʊtiːn","uz":"oqsil","ru":"белок","ex":["Meat and beans are full of protein."],"u":"S04U13"},{"id":"lex.01894","w":"calorie","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkæləri","uz":"kaloriya","ru":"калория","ex":["This meal has 600 calories."],"u":"S04U13"},{"id":"lex.01895","w":"wellbeing","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈwelbiːɪŋ","uz":"salomatlik va farovonlik","ru":"благополучие","ex":["Sleep affects your wellbeing."],"u":"S04U13"},{"id":"lex.01896","w":"therapy","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈθerəpi","uz":"terapiya","ru":"терапия","ex":["She started therapy last year."],"u":"S04U13"},{"id":"lex.01897","w":"burnout","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈbɜːrnaʊt","uz":"charchab tugash","ru":"выгорание","ex":["Burnout is common in that job."],"u":"S04U13"},{"id":"lex.01898","w":"resilience","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈzɪliəns","uz":"chidamlilik","ru":"устойчивость","ex":["She has great resilience."],"u":"S04U13"},{"id":"lex.01899","w":"tiredness","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtaɪərdnəs","uz":"charchoq","ru":"усталость","ex":["The tiredness went away after a nap."],"u":"S04U13"},{"id":"lex.01900","w":"restful","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈrestfəl","uz":"tinchlantiruvchi","ru":"успокаивающий","ex":["It was a restful weekend."],"u":"S04U13"},{"id":"lex.01901","w":"energetic","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌenərˈdʒetɪk","uz":"g'ayratli","ru":"энергичный","ex":["I feel energetic in the morning."],"u":"S04U13"},{"id":"lex.01902","w":"mindful","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈmaɪndfəl","uz":"e'tiborli","ru":"осознанный","ex":["Try to be mindful when you eat."],"u":"S04U13"},{"id":"lex.01903","w":"strength","pos":"noun","ipa":"streŋθ","uz":"kuch","ru":"сила","ex":["He has great strength."],"u":"S04U13"},{"id":"lex.01904","w":"weakness","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈwiːknəs","uz":"zaiflik","ru":"слабость","ex":["Sweet food is my weakness."],"u":"S04U13"},{"id":"lex.01905","w":"quit","pos":"verb","ipa":"kwɪt","uz":"tashlamoq (odatni)","ru":"бросить","ex":["He quit smoking last year."],"u":"S04U13"},{"id":"lex.01906","w":"unhealthy","pos":"adj","ipa":"ʌnˈhelθi","uz":"sog'liqqa zarar","ru":"нездоровый","ex":["It is an unhealthy habit."],"u":"S04U13"},{"id":"lex.01907","w":"relaxation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌriːlækˈseɪʃən","uz":"dam olish","ru":"расслабление","ex":["Relaxation is part of training."],"u":"S04U13"},{"id":"lex.01908","w":"fitness","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfɪtnəs","uz":"jismoniy tayyorgarlik","ru":"физическая форма","ex":["His fitness has improved."],"u":"S04U13"},{"id":"lex.01909","w":"option","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɑːpʃən","uz":"variant","ru":"вариант","ex":["We have three options."],"u":"S04U14"},{"id":"lex.01910","w":"alternative","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɔːlˈtɜːrnətɪv","uz":"muqobil","ru":"альтернатива","ex":["Is there an alternative?"],"u":"S04U14"},{"id":"lex.01911","w":"select","pos":"verb","ipa":"sɪˈlekt","uz":"tanlamoq","ru":"выбирать","ex":["Select one of these three."],"u":"S04U14"},{"id":"lex.01912","w":"brand","pos":"noun","ipa":"brænd","uz":"brend","ru":"бренд","ex":["Which brand do you prefer?"],"u":"S04U14"},{"id":"lex.01913","w":"model","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmɑːdəl","uz":"model","ru":"модель","ex":["This is last year's model."],"u":"S04U14"},{"id":"lex.01914","w":"variety","pos":"noun","ipa":"vəˈraɪəti","uz":"turli-tumanlik","ru":"разнообразие","ex":["There is a variety of colours."],"u":"S04U14"},{"id":"lex.01915","w":"selection","pos":"noun","ipa":"sɪˈlekʃən","uz":"tanlov, assortiment","ru":"выбор","ex":["The selection is small."],"u":"S04U14"},{"id":"lex.01916","w":"preference","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈprefərəns","uz":"afzallik","ru":"предпочтение","ex":["I have no preference."],"u":"S04U14"},{"id":"lex.01917","w":"criteria","pos":"noun","ipa":"kraɪˈtɪriə","uz":"mezonlar","ru":"критерии","ex":["What are your criteria?"],"u":"S04U14"},{"id":"lex.01918","w":"consider","pos":"verb","ipa":"kənˈsɪdər","uz":"ko'rib chiqmoq","ru":"рассматривать","ex":["We considered both options."],"u":"S04U14"},{"id":"lex.01919","w":"evaluate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪˈvæljueɪt","uz":"baholamoq","ru":"оценивать","ex":["We evaluated three suppliers."],"u":"S04U14"},{"id":"lex.01920","w":"durable","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈdʊrəbəl","uz":"chidamli","ru":"прочный","ex":["This bag is very durable."],"u":"S04U14"},{"id":"lex.01921","w":"defect","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdiːfekt","uz":"nuqson","ru":"дефект","ex":["The shirt has a small defect."],"u":"S04U14"},{"id":"lex.01922","w":"loyalty","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈlɔɪəlti","uz":"sodiqlik","ru":"лояльность","ex":["The shop rewards loyalty."],"u":"S04U14"},{"id":"lex.01923","w":"swap","pos":"verb","ipa":"swɑːp","uz":"almashtirmoq","ru":"обменять","ex":["Can I swap this for a larger one?"],"u":"S04U14"},{"id":"lex.01924","w":"upgrade","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈʌpɡreɪd","uz":"yaxshilamoq (darajasini)","ru":"улучшить","ex":["We upgraded to a bigger room."],"u":"S04U14"},{"id":"lex.01925","w":"sample","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsæmpəl","uz":"namuna","ru":"образец","ex":["They gave me a free sample."],"u":"S04U14"},{"id":"lex.01926","w":"affordable","pos":"adj","ipa":"əˈfɔːrdəbəl","uz":"arzon, ko'tara oladigan","ru":"доступный по цене","ex":["It is an affordable flat."],"u":"S04U14"},{"id":"lex.01927","w":"set","pos":"noun","ipa":"set","uz":"to'plam","ru":"набор","ex":["She bought a set of plates."],"u":"S04U14"},{"id":"lex.01928","w":"pair","pos":"noun","ipa":"per","uz":"juft","ru":"пара","ex":["I need a new pair of shoes."],"u":"S04U14"},{"id":"lex.01929","w":"item","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈaɪtəm","uz":"buyum","ru":"предмет","ex":["Each item has a price."],"u":"S04U14"},{"id":"lex.01930","w":"deliver","pos":"verb","ipa":"dɪˈlɪvər","uz":"yetkazib bermoq","ru":"доставлять","ex":["They deliver on Saturdays."],"u":"S04U14"},{"id":"lex.01931","w":"delivery","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˈlɪvəri","uz":"yetkazib berish","ru":"доставка","ex":["Delivery is free."],"u":"S04U14"},{"id":"lex.01932","w":"purchase","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpɜːrtʃəs","uz":"xarid","ru":"покупка","ex":["Keep the receipt for your purchase."],"u":"S04U14"},{"id":"lex.01933","w":"stock","pos":"noun","ipa":"stɑːk","uz":"zaxira, tovar","ru":"запас","ex":["That size is out of stock."],"u":"S04U14"},{"id":"lex.01934","w":"catalogue","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkætəlɔːɡ","uz":"katalog","ru":"каталог","ex":["Choose from the catalogue."],"u":"S04U14"},{"id":"lex.01935","w":"trolley","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtrɑːli","uz":"aravacha","ru":"тележка","ex":["Take a trolley at the entrance."],"u":"S04U14"},{"id":"lex.01936","w":"refundable","pos":"adj","ipa":"rɪˈfʌndəbəl","uz":"qaytariladigan","ru":"возвратный","ex":["The ticket is not refundable."],"u":"S04U14"},{"id":"lex.01937","w":"secondhand","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌsekəndˈhænd","uz":"ishlatilgan","ru":"подержанный","ex":["He bought a secondhand car."],"u":"S04U14"},{"id":"lex.01938","w":"instalment","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪnˈstɔːlmənt","uz":"bo'lib to'lash","ru":"платёж в рассрочку","ex":["We pay in monthly instalments."],"u":"S04U14"},{"id":"lex.01939","w":"warranty","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈwɔːrənti","uz":"kafolat hujjati","ru":"гарантия","ex":["The warranty lasts two years."],"u":"S04U14"},{"id":"lex.01940","w":"deposit","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˈpɑːzɪt","uz":"oldindan to'lov","ru":"залог","ex":["We paid a deposit of fifty dollars."],"u":"S04U14"},{"id":"lex.01941","w":"quality","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈkwɑːləti","uz":"sifatli","ru":"качественный","ex":["They sell quality furniture."],"u":"S04U14"},{"id":"lex.01942","w":"effort","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈefərt","uz":"harakat, mehnat","ru":"усилие","ex":["It took a lot of effort to finish."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01943","w":"patience","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpeɪʃəns","uz":"sabr","ru":"терпение","ex":["Learning a language takes patience."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01944","w":"master","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈmæstər","uz":"puxta egallamoq","ru":"овладеть","ex":["It took her years to master the piano."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01945","w":"beginner","pos":"noun","ipa":"bɪˈɡɪnər","uz":"boshlovchi","ru":"начинающий","ex":["The class is for beginners."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01946","w":"intermediate","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌɪntərˈmiːdiət","uz":"o'rta daraja","ru":"средний","ex":["She is at an intermediate level."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01947","w":"advanced","pos":"adj","ipa":"ədˈvænst","uz":"yuqori daraja","ru":"продвинутый","ex":["He has been studying at an advanced level."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01948","w":"steady","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈstedi","uz":"barqaror","ru":"устойчивый","ex":["She has made steady progress."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01949","w":"constant","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈkɑːnstənt","uz":"doimiy","ru":"постоянный","ex":["It needs constant practice."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01950","w":"occasional","pos":"adj","ipa":"əˈkeɪʒənəl","uz":"vaqti-vaqti bilan bo'ladigan","ru":"редкий","ex":["I make the occasional mistake."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01951","w":"gradual","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈɡrædʒuəl","uz":"asta-sekin bo'ladigan","ru":"постепенный","ex":["The change has been gradual."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01952","w":"milestone","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmaɪlstoʊn","uz":"muhim bosqich","ru":"веха","ex":["Reading a whole book was a milestone."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01953","w":"struggle","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈstrʌɡəl","uz":"qiynalmoq","ru":"бороться, с трудом справляться","ex":["I have been struggling with grammar."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01954","w":"overcome","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌoʊvərˈkʌm","uz":"yengib o'tmoq","ru":"преодолеть","ex":["She overcame her fear of speaking."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01955","w":"commitment","pos":"noun","ipa":"kəˈmɪtmənt","uz":"sodiqlik, mas'uliyat","ru":"обязательство","ex":["It requires real commitment."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01956","w":"discipline","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdɪsəplɪn","uz":"intizom","ru":"дисциплина","ex":["Learning alone needs discipline."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01957","w":"motivation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌmoʊtəˈveɪʃən","uz":"rag'bat","ru":"мотивация","ex":["My motivation comes and goes."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01958","w":"lately","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈleɪtli","uz":"so'nggi paytlarda","ru":"в последнее время","ex":["I have been busy lately."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01959","w":"barely","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈberli","uz":"zo'rg'a","ru":"едва","ex":["I have barely started."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01960","w":"repetition","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌrepəˈtɪʃən","uz":"takrorlash","ru":"повторение","ex":["Repetition helps you remember."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01961","w":"drill","pos":"noun","ipa":"drɪl","uz":"mashq","ru":"упражнение","ex":["We did a short pronunciation drill."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01962","w":"revision","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈvɪʒən","uz":"takrorlash (imtihonga)","ru":"повторение к экзамену","ex":["I have been doing revision all week."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01963","w":"memorise","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈmeməraɪz","uz":"yodlamoq","ru":"заучивать","ex":["Do not just memorise the words."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01964","w":"retain","pos":"verb","ipa":"rɪˈteɪn","uz":"esda saqlab qolmoq","ru":"удерживать","ex":["I retain new words better in the morning."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01965","w":"fluent","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈfluːənt","uz":"ravon (til biladigan)","ru":"свободно владеющий","ex":["She is fluent in three languages."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01966","w":"fluency","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfluːənsi","uz":"ravonlik","ru":"беглость","ex":["Fluency takes longer than accuracy."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01967","w":"accuracy","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈækjərəsi","uz":"aniqlik","ru":"точность","ex":["Accuracy matters in writing."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01968","w":"pace","pos":"noun","ipa":"peɪs","uz":"sur'at","ru":"темп","ex":["Work at your own pace."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01969","w":"stamina","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈstæmɪnə","uz":"chidam","ru":"выносливость","ex":["Long lessons need stamina."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01970","w":"endurance","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪnˈdʊrəns","uz":"bardosh","ru":"выдержка","ex":["It was a test of endurance."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01971","w":"devote","pos":"verb","ipa":"dɪˈvoʊt","uz":"bag'ishlamoq","ru":"посвящать","ex":["He devotes an hour a day to reading."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01972","w":"pursue","pos":"verb","ipa":"pərˈsuː","uz":"intilmoq, davom ettirmoq","ru":"продолжать, добиваться","ex":["She has been pursuing a career in music."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01973","w":"daily","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈdeɪli","uz":"kundalik","ru":"ежедневный","ex":["Daily practice works best."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01974","w":"weekly","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈwiːkli","uz":"haftalik","ru":"еженедельный","ex":["We have a weekly meeting."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01975","w":"monthly","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈmʌnθli","uz":"oylik","ru":"ежемесячный","ex":["I pay a monthly fee."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01976","w":"yearly","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈjɪrli","uz":"yillik","ru":"ежегодный","ex":["There is a yearly exam."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01977","w":"ongoing","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈɑːnɡoʊɪŋ","uz":"davom etayotgan","ru":"продолжающийся","ex":["It is an ongoing project."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01978","w":"lifelong","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈlaɪflɔːŋ","uz":"umrbod","ru":"пожизненный","ex":["Learning is a lifelong process."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01979","w":"hardworking","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌhɑːrdˈwɜːrkɪŋ","uz":"mehnatkash","ru":"трудолюбивый","ex":["She is a hardworking student."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01980","w":"eager","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈiːɡər","uz":"ishtiyoqli","ru":"стремящийся","ex":["He is eager to start."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01981","w":"keen","pos":"adj","ipa":"kiːn","uz":"qiziquvchan, ishtiyoqli","ru":"увлечённый","ex":["She is very keen on cooking."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01982","w":"determined","pos":"adj","ipa":"dɪˈtɜːrmɪnd","uz":"qat'iyatli","ru":"решительный","ex":["He is determined to pass."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01983","w":"tutor","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtuːtər","uz":"repetitor","ru":"репетитор","ex":["I have been seeing a tutor since March."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01984","w":"coursework","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkɔːrswɜːrk","uz":"kurs ishi","ru":"курсовая работа","ex":["The coursework counts for half the mark."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01985","w":"assignment","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈsaɪnmənt","uz":"topshiriq","ru":"задание","ex":["The assignment is due on Monday."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01986","w":"feedback","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfiːdbæk","uz":"fikr-mulohaza","ru":"обратная связь","ex":["Her feedback was very helpful."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01987","w":"correction","pos":"noun","ipa":"kəˈrekʃən","uz":"tuzatish","ru":"исправление","ex":["He made two corrections."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01988","w":"fluently","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈfluːəntli","uz":"ravon","ru":"свободно","ex":["She speaks fluently now."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01989","w":"steadily","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈstedɪli","uz":"barqaror ravishda","ru":"постоянно","ex":["My reading has improved steadily."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01990","w":"constantly","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈkɑːnstəntli","uz":"doimiy ravishda","ru":"постоянно","ex":["He is constantly checking his phone."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01991","w":"persistent","pos":"adj","ipa":"pərˈsɪstənt","uz":"qat'iy, tinimsiz","ru":"настойчивый","ex":["She is persistent and it works."],"u":"S05U01"},{"id":"lex.01992","w":"happiness","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈhæpinəs","uz":"baxt","ru":"счастье","ex":["Money is not the same as happiness."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.01993","w":"unhappy","pos":"adj","ipa":"ʌnˈhæpi","uz":"baxtsiz, xafa","ru":"несчастный, недовольный","ex":["She was unhappy about the decision and said so."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.01994","w":"incident","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɪnsɪdənt","uz":"hodisa","ru":"происшествие","ex":["Nobody mentioned the incident again."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.01995","w":"event","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪˈvent","uz":"voqea","ru":"событие","ex":["The events of that night changed everything."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.01996","w":"sudden","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈsʌdən","uz":"to'satdan bo'lgan","ru":"внезапный","ex":["There was a sudden noise."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.01997","w":"unexpected","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌʌnɪkˈspektɪd","uz":"kutilmagan","ru":"неожиданный","ex":["It was completely unexpected."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.01998","w":"fortunately","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈfɔːrtʃənətli","uz":"yaxshiyamki","ru":"к счастью","ex":["Fortunately, nobody was hurt."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.01999","w":"unfortunately","pos":"adv","ipa":"ʌnˈfɔːrtʃənətli","uz":"afsuski","ru":"к сожалению","ex":["Unfortunately we had already left."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.02000","w":"luckily","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈlʌkɪli","uz":"omadga qarab","ru":"к счастью","ex":["Luckily I had my phone."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.02001","w":"eventually","pos":"adv","ipa":"ɪˈventʃuəli","uz":"oxir-oqibat","ru":"в конце концов","ex":["Eventually the bus came."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.02002","w":"meanwhile","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈmiːnwaɪl","uz":"shu orada","ru":"тем временем","ex":["Meanwhile, I had been waiting outside."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.02003","w":"afterwards","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈæftərwərdz","uz":"keyin","ru":"потом","ex":["Afterwards we went for tea."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.02004","w":"beforehand","pos":"adv","ipa":"bɪˈfɔːrhænd","uz":"oldindan","ru":"заранее","ex":["I had checked the times beforehand."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.02005","w":"recall","pos":"verb","ipa":"rɪˈkɔːl","uz":"eslamoq","ru":"вспоминать","ex":["I cannot recall his name."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.02006","w":"confusion","pos":"noun","ipa":"kənˈfjuːʒən","uz":"chalkashlik","ru":"путаница","ex":["There was a lot of confusion at first."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.02007","w":"panic","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpænɪk","uz":"vahima","ru":"паника","ex":["There was no panic."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.02008","w":"relief","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈliːf","uz":"yengillik","ru":"облегчение","ex":["It was a relief when he called."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.02009","w":"disaster","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˈzæstər","uz":"falokat","ru":"катастрофа","ex":["The trip was a disaster."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.02010","w":"narrow","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈnæroʊ","uz":"tor","ru":"узкий","ex":["It was a narrow escape."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.02011","w":"escape","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪˈskeɪp","uz":"qutulish","ru":"спасение, побег","ex":["It was a lucky escape."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.02012","w":"chaos","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkeɪɑːs","uz":"tartibsizlik","ru":"хаос","ex":["The station was complete chaos."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.02013","w":"remarkable","pos":"adj","ipa":"rɪˈmɑːrkəbəl","uz":"diqqatga sazovor","ru":"замечательный","ex":["It was a remarkable recovery."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.02014","w":"astonish","pos":"verb","ipa":"əˈstɑːnɪʃ","uz":"hayratda qoldirmoq","ru":"поражать","ex":["The news astonished everyone."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.02015","w":"astonishing","pos":"adj","ipa":"əˈstɑːnɪʃɪŋ","uz":"hayratlanarli","ru":"поразительный","ex":["It was an astonishing result."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.02016","w":"dramatic","pos":"adj","ipa":"drəˈmætɪk","uz":"keskin, dramatik","ru":"драматичный","ex":["There was a dramatic change."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.02017","w":"tragic","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈtrædʒɪk","uz":"fojiali","ru":"трагический","ex":["It was a tragic accident."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.02018","w":"fortunate","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈfɔːrtʃənət","uz":"omadli","ru":"удачливый","ex":["We were fortunate to find a taxi."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.02019","w":"misfortune","pos":"noun","ipa":"mɪsˈfɔːrtʃən","uz":"omadsizlik","ru":"несчастье","ex":["He had the misfortune to arrive late."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.02020","w":"coincidence","pos":"noun","ipa":"koʊˈɪnsɪdəns","uz":"tasodif","ru":"совпадение","ex":["What a coincidence!"],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.02021","w":"circumstance","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsɜːrkəmstæns","uz":"holat, sharoit","ru":"обстоятельство","ex":["In the circumstances she did well."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.02022","w":"aftermath","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈæftərmæθ","uz":"oqibat","ru":"последствия","ex":["In the aftermath everyone helped."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.02023","w":"survive","pos":"verb","ipa":"sərˈvaɪv","uz":"omon qolmoq","ru":"выжить","ex":["Everyone survived the crash."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.02024","w":"trapped","pos":"adj","ipa":"træpt","uz":"qamalib qolgan","ru":"застрявший","ex":["They were trapped in the lift."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.02025","w":"crash","pos":"noun","ipa":"kræʃ","uz":"halokat","ru":"авария","ex":["There was a crash on the main road."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.02026","w":"fire","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfaɪər","uz":"yong'in","ru":"пожар","ex":["A fire started in the kitchen."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.02027","w":"shock","pos":"noun","ipa":"ʃɑːk","uz":"zarba, hayrat","ru":"шок","ex":["The news was a shock."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.02028","w":"frightened","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈfraɪtənd","uz":"qo'rqqan","ru":"испуганный","ex":["The children were frightened."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.02029","w":"bystander","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈbaɪstændər","uz":"guvoh, yondagi odam","ru":"случайный свидетель","ex":["A bystander called for help."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.02030","w":"injured","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈɪndʒərd","uz":"jarohatlangan","ru":"раненый","ex":["Two people were injured."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.02031","w":"shaken","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈʃeɪkən","uz":"larzaga kelgan","ru":"потрясённый","ex":["She was shaken but unhurt."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.02032","w":"alarm","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈlɑːrm","uz":"signal, xavotir","ru":"тревога","ex":["The alarm went off at three."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.02033","w":"siren","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsaɪrən","uz":"sirena","ru":"сирена","ex":["We heard a siren outside."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.02034","w":"gather","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈɡæðər","uz":"to'planmoq","ru":"собираться","ex":["A crowd had gathered by then."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.02035","w":"abrupt","pos":"adj","ipa":"əˈbrʌpt","uz":"keskin, to'satdan","ru":"резкий","ex":["It was an abrupt ending."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.02036","w":"shocking","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈʃɑːkɪŋ","uz":"hayratlanarli, dahshatli","ru":"шокирующий","ex":["The news was shocking."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.02037","w":"terrifying","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈterəfaɪɪŋ","uz":"dahshatli","ru":"ужасающий","ex":["It was a terrifying moment."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.02038","w":"dreadful","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈdredfəl","uz":"juda yomon","ru":"ужасный","ex":["The weather was dreadful."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.02039","w":"awful","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈɔːfəl","uz":"dahshatli","ru":"ужасный","ex":["I felt awful about it."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.02040","w":"horrible","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈhɔːrəbəl","uz":"jirkanch, yomon","ru":"ужасный","ex":["It was a horrible experience."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.02041","w":"blessed","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈblesɪd","uz":"baxtli, omadli","ru":"счастливый","ex":["We felt blessed that day."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.02042","w":"midnight","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmɪdnaɪt","uz":"yarim tun","ru":"полночь","ex":["It happened just after midnight."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.02043","w":"dawn","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɔːn","uz":"tong","ru":"рассвет","ex":["By dawn the rain had stopped."],"u":"S05U02"},{"id":"lex.02044","w":"trouble","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtrʌbəl","uz":"muammo, tashvish","ru":"трудность, беда","ex":["We had trouble finding the house."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02045","w":"remain","pos":"verb","ipa":"rɪˈmeɪn","uz":"qolmoq","ru":"оставаться","ex":["Two questions remain unanswered."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02046","w":"proper","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈprɑpər","uz":"tegishli, to'g'ri","ru":"надлежащий, должный","ex":["Fill in the proper form and it takes a week."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02047","w":"viewpoint","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈvjuːpɔɪnt","uz":"nuqtai nazar","ru":"точка зрения","ex":["From my viewpoint it was fair."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02048","w":"attitude","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈætɪtuːd","uz":"munosabat","ru":"отношение","ex":["His attitude has changed."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02049","w":"belief","pos":"noun","ipa":"bɪˈliːf","uz":"e'tiqod, ishonch","ru":"убеждение","ex":["It is a common belief."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02050","w":"assumption","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈsʌmpʃən","uz":"taxmin","ru":"предположение","ex":["That is only an assumption."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02051","w":"reason","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈriːzən","uz":"sabab","ru":"причина","ex":["Give me one good reason."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02052","w":"justify","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈdʒʌstɪfaɪ","uz":"asoslamoq","ru":"оправдывать","ex":["How would you justify that?"],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02053","w":"doubt","pos":"noun","ipa":"daʊt","uz":"shubha","ru":"сомнение","ex":["I have my doubts."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02054","w":"certain","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈsɜːrtən","uz":"aniq, ishonchli","ru":"уверенный","ex":["I am certain about it."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02055","w":"uncertain","pos":"adj","ipa":"ʌnˈsɜːrtən","uz":"noaniq","ru":"неуверенный","ex":["The result is still uncertain."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02056","w":"likely","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈlaɪkli","uz":"ehtimoli bor","ru":"вероятный","ex":["That is the likely answer."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02057","w":"unlikely","pos":"adj","ipa":"ʌnˈlaɪkli","uz":"ehtimoldan yiroq","ru":"маловероятный","ex":["It is unlikely that he will come."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02058","w":"possibility","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌpɑːsəˈbɪləti","uz":"imkoniyat, ehtimol","ru":"возможность","ex":["There is a possibility of rain."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02059","w":"probability","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌprɑːbəˈbɪləti","uz":"ehtimollik","ru":"вероятность","ex":["The probability is low."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02060","w":"imagine","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪˈmædʒɪn","uz":"tasavvur qilmoq","ru":"представлять","ex":["Imagine you had a year free."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02061","w":"suppose","pos":"verb","ipa":"səˈpoʊz","uz":"faraz qilmoq","ru":"предполагать","ex":["Suppose it rained — what then?"],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02062","w":"assume","pos":"verb","ipa":"əˈsuːm","uz":"deb hisoblamoq","ru":"предполагать","ex":["Do not assume she knows."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02063","w":"priority","pos":"noun","ipa":"praɪˈɔːrəti","uz":"ustuvorlik","ru":"приоритет","ex":["Safety is the first priority."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02064","w":"decision","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˈsɪʒən","uz":"qaror","ru":"решение","ex":["It was a difficult decision."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02065","w":"hesitate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈhezɪteɪt","uz":"ikkilanmoq","ru":"колебаться","ex":["Do not hesitate to ask."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02066","w":"perspective","pos":"noun","ipa":"pərˈspektɪv","uz":"qarash, nuqtai nazar","ru":"перспектива, точка зрения","ex":["It gave me a new perspective."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02067","w":"bias","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈbaɪəs","uz":"noxolislik","ru":"предвзятость","ex":["The report shows a clear bias."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02068","w":"subjective","pos":"adj","ipa":"səbˈdʒektɪv","uz":"shaxsiy, subyektiv","ru":"субъективный","ex":["Beauty is subjective."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02069","w":"valid","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈvælɪd","uz":"asosli, amal qiladigan","ru":"действительный, обоснованный","ex":["That is a valid point."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02070","w":"invalid","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪnˈvælɪd","uz":"haqiqiy emas","ru":"недействительный","ex":["The argument is invalid."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02071","w":"convincing","pos":"adj","ipa":"kənˈvɪnsɪŋ","uz":"ishonarli","ru":"убедительный","ex":["It was a convincing argument."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02072","w":"questionable","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈkwestʃənəbəl","uz":"shubhali","ru":"сомнительный","ex":["The evidence is questionable."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02073","w":"debatable","pos":"adj","ipa":"dɪˈbeɪtəbəl","uz":"bahsli","ru":"спорный","ex":["That is debatable."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02074","w":"controversial","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌkɑːntrəˈvɜːrʃəl","uz":"bahs-munozarali","ru":"спорный","ex":["It is a controversial subject."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02075","w":"moderate","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈmɑːdərət","uz":"mo''tadil","ru":"умеренный","ex":["He holds moderate views."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02076","w":"extreme","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪkˈstriːm","uz":"o'ta, keskin","ru":"крайний","ex":["That is an extreme view."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02077","w":"reasonable","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈriːzənəbəl","uz":"o'rinli, oqilona","ru":"разумный","ex":["That sounds reasonable."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02078","w":"sensible","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈsensəbəl","uz":"aqlli, o'ylangan","ru":"благоразумный","ex":["It was a sensible choice."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02079","w":"rational","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈræʃənəl","uz":"mantiqiy","ru":"рациональный","ex":["There is a rational explanation."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02080","w":"support","pos":"verb","ipa":"səˈpɔːrt","uz":"qo'llab-quvvatlamoq","ru":"поддерживать","ex":["I support that idea."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02081","w":"oppose","pos":"verb","ipa":"əˈpoʊz","uz":"qarshi chiqmoq","ru":"противиться","ex":["Many people opposed the plan."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02082","w":"reject","pos":"verb","ipa":"rɪˈdʒekt","uz":"rad etmoq","ru":"отвергать","ex":["They rejected the offer."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02083","w":"approve","pos":"verb","ipa":"əˈpruːv","uz":"ma'qullamoq","ru":"одобрять","ex":["Her parents do not approve."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02084","w":"disapprove","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌdɪsəˈpruːv","uz":"ma'qullamaslik","ru":"не одобрять","ex":["He disapproves of the idea."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02085","w":"against","pos":"prep","ipa":"əˈɡenst","uz":"qarshi","ru":"против","ex":["I am against the idea."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02086","w":"neutral","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈnuːtrəl","uz":"betaraf","ru":"нейтральный","ex":["She stayed neutral."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02087","w":"unfair","pos":"adj","ipa":"ʌnˈfer","uz":"adolatsiz","ru":"несправедливый","ex":["That seems unfair to me."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02088","w":"stance","pos":"noun","ipa":"stæns","uz":"pozitsiya","ru":"позиция","ex":["What is your stance on this?"],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02089","w":"weigh","pos":"verb","ipa":"weɪ","uz":"tortib ko'rmoq, o'lchamoq","ru":"взвешивать","ex":["Weigh the advantages first."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02090","w":"mild","pos":"adj","ipa":"maɪld","uz":"yumshoq","ru":"мягкий","ex":["He made a mild criticism."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02091","w":"firm","pos":"adj","ipa":"fɜːrm","uz":"qat'iy","ru":"твёрдый","ex":["She was firm but polite."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02092","w":"weak","pos":"adj","ipa":"wiːk","uz":"zaif","ru":"слабый","ex":["It was a weak argument."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02093","w":"solid","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈsɑːlɪd","uz":"puxta, mustahkam","ru":"прочный","ex":["There is solid evidence."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02094","w":"shaky","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈʃeɪki","uz":"beqaror","ru":"шаткий","ex":["The argument is a bit shaky."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02095","w":"sound","pos":"adj","ipa":"saʊnd","uz":"puxta, to'g'ri","ru":"обоснованный","ex":["That is sound advice."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02096","w":"logical","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈlɑːdʒɪkəl","uz":"mantiqiy","ru":"логичный","ex":["It is the logical next step."],"u":"S05U03"},{"id":"lex.02097","w":"writer","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈraɪtər","uz":"yozuvchi","ru":"писатель, автор","ex":["The writer never gave her name."],"u":"S05U04"},{"id":"lex.02098","w":"affect","pos":"verb","ipa":"əˈfekt","uz":"ta'sir qilmoq","ru":"влиять, затрагивать","ex":["The change affects every district in the region."],"u":"S05U04"},{"id":"lex.02099","w":"senior","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈsiːnjər","uz":"katta lavozimli","ru":"старший","ex":["A senior official signed the letter."],"u":"S05U04"},{"id":"lex.02100","w":"beauty","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈbjuti","uz":"go'zallik","ru":"красота","ex":["The beauty of the design is that it needs no power."],"u":"S05U04"},{"id":"lex.02101","w":"regret","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈɡret","uz":"afsus","ru":"сожаление","ex":["My only regret is leaving early."],"u":"S05U04"},{"id":"lex.02102","w":"desire","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˈzaɪər","uz":"orzu, istak","ru":"желание","ex":["She had a strong desire to travel."],"u":"S05U04"},{"id":"lex.02103","w":"ambition","pos":"noun","ipa":"æmˈbɪʃən","uz":"orzu-maqsad","ru":"амбиция","ex":["My ambition was to be a pilot."],"u":"S05U04"},{"id":"lex.02104","w":"longing","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈlɔːŋɪŋ","uz":"sog'inch","ru":"тоска","ex":["She felt a longing for home."],"u":"S05U04"},{"id":"lex.02105","w":"outdated","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌaʊtˈdeɪtɪd","uz":"eskirgan","ru":"устаревший","ex":["The rules are outdated."],"u":"S05U04"},{"id":"lex.02106","w":"youth","pos":"noun","ipa":"juːθ","uz":"yoshlik","ru":"молодость","ex":["In my youth I walked everywhere."],"u":"S05U04"},{"id":"lex.02107","w":"maturity","pos":"noun","ipa":"məˈtʃʊrəti","uz":"yetuklik","ru":"зрелость","ex":["She shows real maturity."],"u":"S05U04"},{"id":"lex.02108","w":"transform","pos":"verb","ipa":"trænsˈfɔːrm","uz":"tubdan o'zgartirmoq","ru":"преобразовать","ex":["The town has been transformed."],"u":"S05U04"},{"id":"lex.02109","w":"yearn","pos":"verb","ipa":"jɜːrn","uz":"qattiq sog'inmoq","ru":"тосковать","ex":["He yearned for the countryside."],"u":"S05U04"},{"id":"lex.02110","w":"cherish","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈtʃerɪʃ","uz":"qadrlamoq","ru":"дорожить","ex":["I cherish those memories."],"u":"S05U04"},{"id":"lex.02111","w":"sentimental","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌsentɪˈmentəl","uz":"hissiyotli","ru":"сентиментальный","ex":["It has sentimental value."],"u":"S05U04"},{"id":"lex.02112","w":"bittersweet","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌbɪtərˈswiːt","uz":"achchiq-shirin","ru":"горько-сладкий","ex":["It was a bittersweet moment."],"u":"S05U04"},{"id":"lex.02113","w":"reminisce","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌremɪˈnɪs","uz":"xotiralarni eslamoq","ru":"вспоминать","ex":["They reminisced about school."],"u":"S05U04"},{"id":"lex.02114","w":"recollection","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌrekəˈlekʃən","uz":"xotira","ru":"воспоминание","ex":["I have no recollection of it."],"u":"S05U04"},{"id":"lex.02115","w":"ancestral","pos":"adj","ipa":"ænˈsestrəl","uz":"ajdodlarga oid","ru":"родовой","ex":["It is their ancestral home."],"u":"S05U04"},{"id":"lex.02116","w":"vanish","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈvænɪʃ","uz":"g'oyib bo'lmoq","ru":"исчезать","ex":["The old market has vanished."],"u":"S05U04"},{"id":"lex.02117","w":"fade","pos":"verb","ipa":"feɪd","uz":"so'nmoq, o'chmoq","ru":"выцветать, угасать","ex":["The colours have faded."],"u":"S05U04"},{"id":"lex.02118","w":"revive","pos":"verb","ipa":"rɪˈvaɪv","uz":"qayta jonlantirmoq","ru":"возрождать","ex":["They revived the old festival."],"u":"S05U04"},{"id":"lex.02119","w":"homesick","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈhoʊmsɪk","uz":"uyni sog'ingan","ru":"тоскующий по дому","ex":["I was homesick for a month."],"u":"S05U04"},{"id":"lex.02120","w":"precious","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈpreʃəs","uz":"qimmatli","ru":"драгоценный","ex":["Time is precious."],"u":"S05U04"},{"id":"lex.02121","w":"priceless","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈpraɪsləs","uz":"bebaho","ru":"бесценный","ex":["The photograph is priceless to her."],"u":"S05U04"},{"id":"lex.02122","w":"faded","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈfeɪdɪd","uz":"rangi o'chgan","ru":"выцветший","ex":["A faded photograph fell out."],"u":"S05U04"},{"id":"lex.02123","w":"worn","pos":"adj","ipa":"wɔːrn","uz":"eskirgan","ru":"изношенный","ex":["The steps are worn."],"u":"S05U04"},{"id":"lex.02124","w":"antique","pos":"adj","ipa":"ænˈtiːk","uz":"antiqa","ru":"антикварный","ex":["It is an antique clock."