,"u":"S05U04"},{"id":"lex.02138","w":"nostalgic","pos":"adj","ipa":"nɑːˈstældʒɪk","uz":"sog'inchli","ru":"ностальгический","ex":["The song made me nostalgic."],"u":"S05U04"},{"id":"lex.02139","w":"elderly","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈeldərli","uz":"keksa","ru":"пожилой","ex":["An elderly woman answered."],"u":"S05U04"},{"id":"lex.02140","w":"aged","pos":"adj","ipa":"eɪdʒd","uz":"yoshli","ru":"в возрасте","ex":["Children aged six to twelve."],"u":"S05U04"},{"id":"lex.02141","w":"youthful","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈjuːθfəl","uz":"yosh ko'rinadigan","ru":"юношеский","ex":["He has a youthful face."],"u":"S05U04"},{"id":"lex.02142","w":"immature","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌɪməˈtʃʊr","uz":"yetilmagan","ru":"незрелый","ex":["That was immature of him."],"u":"S05U04"},{"id":"lex.02143","w":"raise","pos":"verb","ipa":"reɪz","uz":"tarbiyalamoq, ko'tarmoq","ru":"растить, поднимать","ex":["She raised four children alone."],"u":"S05U04"},{"id":"lex.02144","w":"nurture","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈnɜːrtʃər","uz":"parvarishlamoq","ru":"взращивать","ex":["Good teachers nurture confidence."],"u":"S05U04"},{"id":"lex.02145","w":"grandma","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɡrænmɑː","uz":"buvi","ru":"бабушка","ex":["My grandma used to sing that."],"u":"S05U04"},{"id":"lex.02146","w":"grandpa","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɡrænpɑː","uz":"bobo","ru":"дедушка","ex":["Grandpa taught me to fish."],"u":"S05U04"},{"id":"lex.02147","w":"teens","pos":"noun","ipa":"tiːnz","uz":"o'smirlik yillari","ru":"подростковые годы","ex":["She learned English in her teens."],"u":"S05U04"},{"id":"lex.02148","w":"twenties","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtwentiz","uz":"yigirma yoshlar","ru":"двадцатые годы жизни","ex":["He travelled a lot in his twenties."],"u":"S05U04"},{"id":"lex.02149","w":"heirloom","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈerluːm","uz":"oilaviy meros buyum","ru":"семейная реликвия","ex":["The clock is a family heirloom."],"u":"S05U04"},{"id":"lex.02150","w":"bygone","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈbaɪɡɔːn","uz":"o'tgan davrga oid","ru":"минувший","ex":["It belongs to a bygone age."],"u":"S05U04"},{"id":"lex.02151","w":"respect","pos":"verb","ipa":"rɪˈspekt","uz":"hurmat qilmoq","ru":"уважать, соблюдать","ex":["Everyone in the office respected him."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02152","w":"regulation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌreɡjuˈleɪʃən","uz":"qoida, nizom","ru":"правило, регламент","ex":["New regulations have been introduced."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02153","w":"policy","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpɑːləsi","uz":"siyosat, tartib","ru":"политика, правило","ex":["It is company policy."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02154","w":"procedure","pos":"noun","ipa":"prəˈsiːdʒər","uz":"tartib-qoida","ru":"процедура","ex":["Follow the normal procedure."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02155","w":"prohibited","pos":"adj","ipa":"proʊˈhɪbɪtɪd","uz":"taqiqlangan","ru":"запрещённый","ex":["Smoking is prohibited here."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02156","w":"required","pos":"adj","ipa":"rɪˈkwaɪərd","uz":"talab qilinadigan","ru":"требуемый","ex":["A signature is required."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02157","w":"forbidden","pos":"adj","ipa":"fərˈbɪdən","uz":"man etilgan","ru":"запрещённый","ex":["It is forbidden to park here."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02158","w":"compulsory","pos":"adj","ipa":"kəmˈpʌlsəri","uz":"majburiy","ru":"обязательный","ex":["Helmets are compulsory."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02159","w":"optional","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈɑːpʃənəl","uz":"ixtiyoriy","ru":"необязательный","ex":["The second essay is optional."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02160","w":"official","pos":"adj","ipa":"əˈfɪʃəl","uz":"rasmiy","ru":"официальный","ex":["We are waiting for the official result."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02161","w":"formal","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈfɔːrməl","uz":"rasmiy uslubdagi","ru":"формальный","ex":["Write a formal letter."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02162","w":"document","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdɑːkjumənt","uz":"hujjat","ru":"документ","ex":["Bring the documents with you."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02163","w":"application","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌæplɪˈkeɪʃən","uz":"ariza","ru":"заявление","ex":["My application was accepted."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02164","w":"form","pos":"noun","ipa":"fɔːrm","uz":"blanka, shakl","ru":"бланк","ex":["Fill in the form, please."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02165","w":"approval","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈpruːvəl","uz":"tasdiq","ru":"одобрение","ex":["We are waiting for approval."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02166","w":"extension","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪkˈstenʃən","uz":"muddat uzaytirish","ru":"продление","ex":["I asked for an extension."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02167","w":"replacement","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈpleɪsmənt","uz":"almashtirish","ru":"замена","ex":["A replacement has been ordered."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02168","w":"enforce","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪnˈfɔːrs","uz":"amalga oshirmoq (qonunni)","ru":"обеспечивать соблюдение","ex":["The rule is rarely enforced."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02169","w":"enforcement","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪnˈfɔːrsmənt","uz":"qonun ijrosi","ru":"обеспечение соблюдения","ex":["Enforcement has been tightened."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02170","w":"compliance","pos":"noun","ipa":"kəmˈplaɪəns","uz":"qoidaga rioya","ru":"соблюдение","ex":["Compliance is checked every year."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02171","w":"violation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌvaɪəˈleɪʃən","uz":"qoidabuzarlik","ru":"нарушение","ex":["It is a serious violation."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02172","w":"penalty","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpenəlti","uz":"jarima","ru":"штраф","ex":["The penalty has been reduced."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02173","w":"appeal","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈpiːl","uz":"shikoyat, apellyatsiya","ru":"апелляция","ex":["He made an appeal."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02174","w":"exempt","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪɡˈzempt","uz":"ozod qilingan","ru":"освобождённый","ex":["Students are exempt from the fee."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02175","w":"issue","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈɪʃuː","uz":"bermoq (hujjat)","ru":"выдавать","ex":["The licence was issued last year."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02176","w":"submit","pos":"verb","ipa":"səbˈmɪt","uz":"topshirmoq","ru":"подавать","ex":["Submit the form by Friday."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02177","w":"stamp","pos":"noun","ipa":"stæmp","uz":"muhr","ru":"печать, штамп","ex":["The document needs a stamp."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02178","w":"copy","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkɑːpi","uz":"nusxa","ru":"копия","ex":["Keep a copy for yourself."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02179","w":"print","pos":"verb","ipa":"prɪnt","uz":"chop etmoq","ru":"печатать","ex":["Print two copies, please."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02180","w":"receive","pos":"verb","ipa":"rɪˈsiːv","uz":"olmoq","ru":"получать","ex":["I received the letter yesterday."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02181","w":"attach","pos":"verb","ipa":"əˈtætʃ","uz":"biriktirmoq","ru":"прикреплять","ex":["Attach a photograph to the form."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02182","w":"file","pos":"noun","ipa":"faɪl","uz":"jild, hujjat to'plami","ru":"дело, файл","ex":["Your file is with the office."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02183","w":"record","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈrekərd","uz":"yozuv, qayd","ru":"запись","ex":["We keep a record of every visit."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02184","w":"register","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈredʒɪstər","uz":"ro'yxatdan o'tmoq","ru":"регистрировать","ex":["You must register within a week."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02185","w":"licence","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈlaɪsəns","uz":"litsenziya, guvohnoma","ru":"лицензия","ex":["My licence expires in June."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02186","w":"permit","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpɜːrmɪt","uz":"ruxsatnoma","ru":"разрешение","ex":["A permit is required."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02187","w":"signature","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsɪɡnətʃər","uz":"imzo","ru":"подпись","ex":["The form needs your signature."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02188","w":"clerk","pos":"noun","ipa":"klɜːrk","uz":"kotib, xizmatchi","ru":"служащий","ex":["Ask the clerk at the desk."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02189","w":"seal","pos":"noun","ipa":"siːl","uz":"muhr","ru":"печать","ex":["The envelope has an official seal."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02190","w":"grant","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɡrænt","uz":"bermoq (ruxsat)","ru":"предоставлять","ex":["Permission was granted."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02191","w":"withdraw","pos":"verb","ipa":"wɪðˈdrɔː","uz":"qaytarib olmoq","ru":"отзывать, снимать","ex":["She withdrew her application."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02192","w":"renew","pos":"verb","ipa":"rɪˈnuː","uz":"yangilamoq (muddatni)","ru":"продлевать","ex":["I must renew my passport."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02193","w":"expire","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪkˈspaɪər","uz":"muddati tugamoq","ru":"истекать","ex":["My card expires next month."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02194","w":"pending","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈpendɪŋ","uz":"ko'rib chiqilayotgan","ru":"в ожидании","ex":["The decision is still pending."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02195","w":"counter","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkaʊntər","uz":"peshtaxta, oyna","ru":"стойка, окошко","ex":["Go to counter three."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02196","w":"desk","pos":"noun","ipa":"desk","uz":"stol, qabul joyi","ru":"стойка, стол","ex":["Ask at the information desk."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02197","w":"inspector","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪnˈspektər","uz":"nazoratchi","ru":"инспектор","ex":["The inspector checked the tickets."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02198","w":"supervisor","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsuːpərvaɪzər","uz":"nazoratchi, rahbar","ru":"руководитель","ex":["Ask your supervisor first."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02199","w":"envelope","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈenvəloʊp","uz":"konvert","ru":"конверт","ex":["Put the form in an envelope."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02200","w":"postage","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpoʊstɪdʒ","uz":"pochta haqi","ru":"почтовые расходы","ex":["Postage is included."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02201","w":"courier","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkʊriər","uz":"kuryer","ru":"курьер","ex":["It was sent by courier."],"u":"S05U05"},{"id":"lex.02202","w":"noun","pos":"noun","ipa":"naʊn","uz":"ot","ru":"существительное","ex":["'Bridge' is a noun."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02203","w":"verb","pos":"noun","ipa":"vɜrb","uz":"fe'l","ru":"глагол","ex":["Every sentence needs a verb."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02204","w":"adjective","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈædʒɪktɪv","uz":"sifat","ru":"прилагательное","ex":["'Cold' is an adjective."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02205","w":"adverb","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈædvɜrb","uz":"ravish","ru":"наречие","ex":["'Slowly' is an adverb."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02206","w":"simply","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈsɪmpli","uz":"oddiy qilib, shunchaki","ru":"просто","ex":["Write it simply and they will read it."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02207","w":"define","pos":"verb","ipa":"dɪˈfaɪn","uz":"ta'riflamoq","ru":"определять","ex":["Define the term before you use it."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02208","w":"dialogue","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdaɪəlɔːɡ","uz":"suhbat, dialog","ru":"диалог","ex":["The dialogue in the film is good."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02209","w":"discussion","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˈskʌʃən","uz":"muhokama","ru":"обсуждение","ex":["We had a long discussion."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02210","w":"declaration","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌdekləˈreɪʃən","uz":"bayonot, deklaratsiya","ru":"заявление","ex":["He made a public declaration."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02211","w":"promise","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈprɑːmɪs","uz":"va'da","ru":"обещание","ex":["He made a promise and kept it."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02212","w":"explanation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌekspləˈneɪʃən","uz":"tushuntirish","ru":"объяснение","ex":["Her explanation made sense."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02213","w":"clarification","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌklærəfɪˈkeɪʃən","uz":"aniqlashtirish","ru":"уточнение","ex":["I asked for clarification."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02214","w":"interpretation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪnˌtɜːrprəˈteɪʃən","uz":"talqin","ru":"толкование","ex":["That is one interpretation."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02215","w":"misunderstanding","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌmɪsʌndərˈstændɪŋ","uz":"tushunmovchilik","ru":"недоразумение","ex":["It was just a misunderstanding."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02216","w":"confidential","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌkɑːnfɪˈdenʃəl","uz":"maxfiy","ru":"конфиденциальный","ex":["The report is confidential."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02217","w":"reveal","pos":"verb","ipa":"rɪˈviːl","uz":"oshkor qilmoq","ru":"раскрывать","ex":["She revealed the whole story."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02218","w":"disclose","pos":"verb","ipa":"dɪsˈkloʊz","uz":"ma'lum qilmoq","ru":"разглашать","ex":["They refused to disclose the figures."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02219","w":"imply","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪmˈplaɪ","uz":"ishora qilmoq","ru":"подразумевать","ex":["He implied that I was late."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02220","w":"indicate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈɪndɪkeɪt","uz":"ko'rsatmoq","ru":"указывать","ex":["The results indicate a problem."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02221","w":"phrase","pos":"noun","ipa":"freɪz","uz":"ibora","ru":"фраза","ex":["It is a common phrase."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02222","w":"expression","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪkˈspreʃən","uz":"ifoda, ibora","ru":"выражение","ex":["That is a useful expression."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02223","w":"summarise","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈsʌməraɪz","uz":"qisqacha bayon qilmoq","ru":"резюмировать","ex":["Could you summarise what she said?"],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02224","w":"quotation","pos":"noun","ipa":"kwoʊˈteɪʃən","uz":"iqtibos","ru":"цитата","ex":["He used a quotation from a poem."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02225","w":"account","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈkaʊnt","uz":"bayon, hikoya","ru":"рассказ, отчёт","ex":["She gave a full account of it."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02226","w":"version","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈvɜːrʒən","uz":"variant","ru":"версия","ex":["I heard a different version."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02227","w":"text","pos":"noun","ipa":"tekst","uz":"matn","ru":"текст","ex":["Read the text carefully."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02228","w":"word","pos":"noun","ipa":"wɜːrd","uz":"so'z","ru":"слово","ex":["He did not say a word."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02229","w":"sentence","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsentəns","uz":"gap","ru":"предложение","ex":["Write one sentence about it."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02230","w":"question","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkwestʃən","uz":"savol","ru":"вопрос","ex":["She asked a difficult question."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02231","w":"silence","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsaɪləns","uz":"sukunat","ru":"тишина","ex":["There was a long silence."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02232","w":"shout","pos":"verb","ipa":"ʃaʊt","uz":"baqirmoq","ru":"кричать","ex":["Do not shout at me."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02233","w":"respond","pos":"verb","ipa":"rɪˈspɑːnd","uz":"javob bermoq","ru":"отвечать","ex":["She did not respond."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02234","w":"pause","pos":"noun","ipa":"pɔːz","uz":"pauza","ru":"пауза","ex":["There was a short pause."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02235","w":"voice","pos":"noun","ipa":"vɔɪs","uz":"ovoz","ru":"голос","ex":["She has a quiet voice."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02236","w":"accent","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈæksent","uz":"aksent, talaffuz","ru":"акцент","ex":["He speaks with a strong accent."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02237","w":"briefing","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈbriːfɪŋ","uz":"qisqacha ma'lumot","ru":"инструктаж","ex":["There is a briefing at nine."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02238","w":"summary","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsʌməri","uz":"xulosa, qisqacha bayon","ru":"краткое изложение","ex":["Write a short summary."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02239","w":"outline","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈaʊtlaɪn","uz":"reja, qisqacha tavsif","ru":"план, набросок","ex":["Give me an outline of the plan."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02240","w":"memo","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmemoʊ","uz":"xizmat xati","ru":"служебная записка","ex":["She sent a memo to the team."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02241","w":"row","pos":"noun","ipa":"raʊ","uz":"janjal","ru":"ссора","ex":["They had a terrible row."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02242","w":"criticism","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkrɪtɪsɪzəm","uz":"tanqid","ru":"критика","ex":["He does not take criticism well."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02243","w":"compliment","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkɑːmplɪmənt","uz":"maqtov","ru":"комплимент","ex":["She paid me a compliment."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02244","w":"insult","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɪnsʌlt","uz":"haqorat","ru":"оскорбление","ex":["That was a real insult."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02245","w":"reminder","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈmaɪndər","uz":"eslatma","ru":"напоминание","ex":["Send me a reminder."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02246","w":"demand","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˈmænd","uz":"talab","ru":"требование","ex":["They rejected his demands."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02247","w":"content","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkɑːntent","uz":"mazmun","ru":"содержание","ex":["The content of the letter surprised me."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02248","w":"meaning","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmiːnɪŋ","uz":"ma'no","ru":"значение","ex":["What is the meaning of this word?"],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02249","w":"sense","pos":"noun","ipa":"sens","uz":"ma'no, his","ru":"смысл, чувство","ex":["That does not make sense."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02250","w":"detail","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˈteɪl","uz":"tafsilot","ru":"деталь","ex":["She explained it in detail."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02251","w":"questionnaire","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌkwestʃəˈner","uz":"so'rovnoma","ru":"анкета","ex":["Please fill in the questionnaire."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02252","w":"survey","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsɜːrveɪ","uz":"so'rov","ru":"опрос","ex":["A survey was carried out."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02253","w":"poll","pos":"noun","ipa":"poʊl","uz":"so'rov (ovoz berish)","ru":"опрос","ex":["The poll gave a surprising answer."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02254","w":"column","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkɑːləm","uz":"ustun, rukn","ru":"колонка","ex":["She writes a weekly column."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02255","w":"chatter","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtʃætər","uz":"g'ovur-g'uvur","ru":"болтовня","ex":["There was constant chatter."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02256","w":"newsletter","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈnuːzletər","uz":"axborotnoma","ru":"информационный бюллетень","ex":["The newsletter comes out monthly."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02257","w":"phrasing","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfreɪzɪŋ","uz":"so'z tanlash","ru":"формулировка","ex":["The phrasing was unfortunate."],"u":"S05U06"},{"id":"lex.02258","w":"reputation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌrepjuˈteɪʃən","uz":"obro'","ru":"репутация","ex":["She has a good reputation."],"u":"S05U07"},{"id":"lex.02259","w":"background","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈbækɡraʊnd","uz":"kelib chiqish, tajriba","ru":"происхождение, опыт","ex":["He comes from a farming background."],"u":"S05U07"},{"id":"lex.02260","w":"origin","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɔːrɪdʒɪn","uz":"kelib chiqish","ru":"происхождение","ex":["The word is of Arabic origin."],"u":"S05U07"},{"id":"lex.02261","w":"nationality","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌnæʃəˈnæləti","uz":"fuqarolik, millat","ru":"национальность","ex":["What nationality is she?"],"u":"S05U07"},{"id":"lex.02262","w":"ancestry","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈænsestri","uz":"nasl-nasab","ru":"происхождение","ex":["She is proud of her ancestry."],"u":"S05U07"},{"id":"lex.02263","w":"individual","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌɪndɪˈvɪdʒuəl","uz":"shaxs","ru":"личность","ex":["Each individual is different."],"u":"S05U07"},{"id":"lex.02264","w":"modest","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈmɑːdɪst","uz":"kamtarin","ru":"скромный","ex":["He is modest about his success."],"u":"S05U07"},{"id":"lex.02265","w":"arrogant","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈærəɡənt","uz":"manman","ru":"высокомерный","ex":["He sounded arrogant."],"u":"S05U07"},{"id":"lex.02266","w":"sincere","pos":"adj","ipa":"sɪnˈsɪr","uz":"samimiy","ru":"искренний","ex":["Her apology was sincere."],"u":"S05U07"},{"id":"lex.02267","w":"trait","pos":"noun","ipa":"treɪt","uz":"xislat","ru":"черта","ex":["Patience is a useful trait."],"u":"S05U07"},{"id":"lex.02268","w":"characteristic","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌkærəktəˈrɪstɪk","uz":"xususiyat","ru":"характеристика","ex":["Kindness is her main characteristic."],"u":"S05U07"},{"id":"lex.02269","w":"conduct","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkɑːndʌkt","uz":"xatti-harakat","ru":"поведение","ex":["His conduct was excellent."],"u":"S05U07"},{"id":"lex.02270","w":"behaviour","pos":"noun","ipa":"bɪˈheɪvjər","uz":"xulq-atvor","ru":"поведение","ex":["Her behaviour surprised us."],"u":"S05U07"},{"id":"lex.02271","w":"impression","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪmˈpreʃən","uz":"taassurot","ru":"впечатление","ex":["He made a good impression."],"u":"S05U07"},{"id":"lex.02272","w":"loud","pos":"adj","ipa":"laʊd","uz":"baland ovozli","ru":"громкий","ex":["He has a loud voice."],"u":"S05U07"},{"id":"lex.02273","w":"impatient","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪmˈpeɪʃənt","uz":"sabrsiz","ru":"нетерпеливый","ex":["He gets impatient in queues."],"u":"S05U07"},{"id":"lex.02274","w":"gloomy","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈɡluːmi","uz":"ma'yus","ru":"мрачный","ex":["He was in a gloomy mood."],"u":"S05U07"},{"id":"lex.02275","w":"easygoing","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌiːziˈɡoʊɪŋ","uz":"yumshoq tabiatli","ru":"лёгкий в общении","ex":["She is very easygoing."],"u":"S05U07"},{"id":"lex.02276","w":"outgoing","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈaʊtɡoʊɪŋ","uz":"kirishimli","ru":"общительный","ex":["He is outgoing and confident."],"u":"S05U07"},{"id":"lex.02277","w":"distant","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈdɪstənt","uz":"sovuq, uzoq","ru":"отстранённый","ex":["He seemed distant today."],"u":"S05U07"},{"id":"lex.02278","w":"hostile","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈhɑːstəl","uz":"dushmanona","ru":"враждебный","ex":["The crowd turned hostile."],"u":"S05U07"},{"id":"lex.02279","w":"insecure","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌɪnsɪˈkjʊr","uz":"o'ziga ishonchsiz","ru":"неуверенный","ex":["He feels insecure about his English."],"u":"S05U07"},{"id":"lex.02280","w":"humble","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈhʌmbəl","uz":"kamtar","ru":"скромный","ex":["He stayed humble after winning."],"u":"S05U07"},{"id":"lex.02281","w":"proud","pos":"adj","ipa":"praʊd","uz":"faxrlanadigan","ru":"гордый","ex":["I am proud of you."],"u":"S05U07"},{"id":"lex.02282","w":"visitor","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈvɪzɪtər","uz":"mehmon","ru":"посетитель","ex":["We had visitors last night."],"u":"S05U07"},{"id":"lex.02283","w":