fruit and milk."],"u":"S05U08"},{"id":"lex.02351","w":"roast","pos":"verb","ipa":"roʊst","uz":"qovurmoq (duxovkada)","ru":"запекать","ex":["The meat is roasted for an hour."],"u":"S05U08"},{"id":"lex.02352","w":"freeze","pos":"verb","ipa":"friːz","uz":"muzlatmoq","ru":"замораживать","ex":["The fruit is frozen at once."],"u":"S05U08"},{"id":"lex.02353","w":"harden","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈhɑːrdən","uz":"qotmoq","ru":"твердеть","ex":["The cement hardens overnight."],"u":"S05U08"},{"id":"lex.02354","w":"soften","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈsɔːfən","uz":"yumshatmoq","ru":"смягчать","ex":["Soften the butter first."],"u":"S05U08"},{"id":"lex.02355","w":"dough","pos":"noun","ipa":"doʊ","uz":"xamir","ru":"тесто","ex":["The dough must rest for an hour."],"u":"S05U08"},{"id":"lex.02356","w":"batter","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈbætər","uz":"suyuq xamir","ru":"жидкое тесто","ex":["Pour the batter into the pan."],"u":"S05U08"},{"id":"lex.02357","w":"pan","pos":"noun","ipa":"pæn","uz":"tova","ru":"сковорода","ex":["Heat the pan first."],"u":"S05U08"},{"id":"lex.02358","w":"pot","pos":"noun","ipa":"pɑːt","uz":"qozon","ru":"кастрюля","ex":["Put the rice in the pot."],"u":"S05U08"},{"id":"lex.02359","w":"lid","pos":"noun","ipa":"lɪd","uz":"qopqoq","ru":"крышка","ex":["Put the lid on."],"u":"S05U08"},{"id":"lex.02360","w":"nozzle","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈnɑːzəl","uz":"nayza uchi","ru":"насадка","ex":["The nozzle is blocked."],"u":"S05U08"},{"id":"lex.02361","w":"collapse","pos":"verb","ipa":"kəˈlæps","uz":"qulamoq, barbod bo'lmoq","ru":"обрушиться, рухнуть","ex":["The bank of the channel collapsed in the night."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02362","w":"proof","pos":"noun","ipa":"pruːf","uz":"dalil, isbot","ru":"доказательство","ex":["There is no proof of that."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02363","w":"clue","pos":"noun","ipa":"kluː","uz":"ishora","ru":"подсказка","ex":["The letter gave us a clue."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02364","w":"indication","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌɪndɪˈkeɪʃən","uz":"belgi, alomat","ru":"признак","ex":["There was no indication of trouble."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02365","w":"suspicion","pos":"noun","ipa":"səˈspɪʃən","uz":"gumon","ru":"подозрение","ex":["I have a suspicion he knew."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02366","w":"conclusion","pos":"noun","ipa":"kənˈkluːʒən","uz":"xulosa","ru":"вывод","ex":["I came to the same conclusion."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02367","w":"theory","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈθɪri","uz":"nazariya, taxmin","ru":"теория","ex":["That is only a theory."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02368","w":"certainty","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsɜːrtənti","uz":"ishonch, aniqlik","ru":"уверенность","ex":["Nobody can say with certainty."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02369","w":"likelihood","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈlaɪklihʊd","uz":"ehtimollik","ru":"вероятность","ex":["The likelihood is small."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02370","w":"obvious","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈɑːbviəs","uz":"ko'rinib turgan","ru":"очевидный","ex":["The answer is obvious."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02371","w":"apparent","pos":"adj","ipa":"əˈpærənt","uz":"ayon, sezilarli","ru":"очевидный","ex":["It soon became apparent."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02372","w":"unclear","pos":"adj","ipa":"ʌnˈklɪr","uz":"noaniq","ru":"неясный","ex":["The rules are unclear."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02373","w":"mysterious","pos":"adj","ipa":"mɪˈstɪriəs","uz":"sirli","ru":"загадочный","ex":["There was a mysterious noise."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02374","w":"speculate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈspekjuleɪt","uz":"taxmin qilmoq","ru":"строить догадки","ex":["People speculated about the cause."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02375","w":"verify","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈverɪfaɪ","uz":"tasdiqlamoq","ru":"проверять","ex":["We must verify the details."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02376","w":"plausible","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈplɔːzəbəl","uz":"ishonarli","ru":"правдоподобный","ex":["It is a plausible explanation."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02377","w":"possibly","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈpɑːsəbli","uz":"ehtimol","ru":"возможно","ex":["He is possibly still at work."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02378","w":"certainly","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈsɜːrtənli","uz":"albatta","ru":"конечно","ex":["She certainly knew about it."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02379","w":"definitely","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈdefɪnətli","uz":"aniq","ru":"определённо","ex":["He definitely said Friday."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02380","w":"clearly","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈklɪrli","uz":"aniq-ravshan","ru":"явно","ex":["She clearly did not know."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02381","w":"surely","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈʃʊrli","uz":"albatta, shubhasiz","ru":"наверняка","ex":["Surely he must have noticed."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02382","w":"apparently","pos":"adv","ipa":"əˈpærəntli","uz":"aftidan","ru":"по-видимому","ex":["Apparently he has left."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02383","w":"seemingly","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈsiːmɪŋli","uz":"go'yo, ko'rinishidan","ru":"по-видимому","ex":["He was seemingly calm."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02384","w":"guess","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɡes","uz":"taxmin qilmoq","ru":"угадывать","ex":["Guess what happened."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02385","w":"wonder","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈwʌndər","uz":"qiziqmoq, o'ylamoq","ru":"интересоваться","ex":["I wonder where he is."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02386","w":"conclude","pos":"verb","ipa":"kənˈkluːd","uz":"xulosa chiqarmoq","ru":"заключать","ex":["We concluded that he had left."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02387","w":"prove","pos":"verb","ipa":"pruːv","uz":"isbotlamoq","ru":"доказывать","ex":["Can you prove it?"],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02388","w":"disprove","pos":"verb","ipa":"dɪsˈpruːv","uz":"rad etmoq (dalil bilan)","ru":"опровергать","ex":["Nobody could disprove the story."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02389","w":"doubtful","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈdaʊtfəl","uz":"shubhali","ru":"сомнительный","ex":["It is doubtful that he will come."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02390","w":"trace","pos":"noun","ipa":"treɪs","uz":"iz","ru":"след","ex":["There was no trace of him."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02391","w":"track","pos":"verb","ipa":"træk","uz":"izlab bormoq","ru":"отслеживать","ex":["The police tracked the car."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02392","w":"detect","pos":"verb","ipa":"dɪˈtekt","uz":"aniqlamoq","ru":"обнаруживать","ex":["The alarm detects smoke."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02393","w":"uncover","pos":"verb","ipa":"ʌnˈkʌvər","uz":"fosh qilmoq","ru":"раскрывать","ex":["They uncovered the truth."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02394","w":"hide","pos":"verb","ipa":"haɪd","uz":"yashirmoq","ru":"прятать","ex":["She hid the letter."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02395","w":"conceal","pos":"verb","ipa":"kənˈsiːl","uz":"berkitmoq","ru":"скрывать","ex":["He concealed the truth for years."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02396","w":"disguise","pos":"verb","ipa":"dɪsˈɡaɪz","uz":"yashirmoq, niqoblamoq","ru":"маскировать","ex":["She disguised her disappointment."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02397","w":"mislead","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌmɪsˈliːd","uz":"chalg'itmoq","ru":"вводить в заблуждение","ex":["The sign misled us."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02398","w":"fingerprint","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfɪŋɡərprɪnt","uz":"barmoq izi","ru":"отпечаток пальца","ex":["They found fingerprints on the glass."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02399","w":"footprint","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfʊtprɪnt","uz":"oyoq izi","ru":"след ноги","ex":["There were footprints in the snow."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02400","w":"shadow","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈʃædoʊ","uz":"soya","ru":"тень","ex":["A shadow moved by the wall."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02401","w":"stain","pos":"noun","ipa":"steɪn","uz":"dog'","ru":"пятно","ex":["There is a stain on the carpet."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02402","w":"scar","pos":"noun","ipa":"skɑːr","uz":"chandiq","ru":"шрам","ex":["He has a small scar on his hand."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02403","w":"testimony","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtestɪmoʊni","uz":"guvohlik","ru":"показания","ex":["Her testimony was important."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02404","w":"log","pos":"noun","ipa":"lɔːɡ","uz":"jurnal, yozuv daftari","ru":"журнал записей","ex":["Keep a log of the calls."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02405","w":"data","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdeɪtə","uz":"ma'lumotlar","ru":"данные","ex":["The data shows a clear pattern."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02406","w":"measurement","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmeʒərmənt","uz":"o'lchov","ru":"измерение","ex":["Take the measurements first."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02407","w":"observation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌɑːbzərˈveɪʃən","uz":"kuzatuv","ru":"наблюдение","ex":["That is a fair observation."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02408","w":"hunch","pos":"noun","ipa":"hʌntʃ","uz":"sezgi, taxmin","ru":"догадка","ex":["I had a hunch he would call."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02409","w":"inkling","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɪŋklɪŋ","uz":"kichik shama","ru":"смутное представление","ex":["I had no inkling of the problem."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02410","w":"gut","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɡʌt","uz":"ichki his","ru":"нутро, интуиция","ex":["Trust your gut on this."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02411","w":"instinct","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɪnstɪŋkt","uz":"instinkt, ichki tuyg'u","ru":"инстинкт","ex":["Her first instinct was to run."],"u":"S05U09"},{"id":"lex.02412","w":"surface","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈsɜrfɪs","uz":"yuzaga chiqmoq","ru":"всплывать, обнаруживаться","ex":["The second letter surfaced twenty years later."],"u":"S05U10"},{"id":"lex.02413","w":"consequence","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkɑːnsəkwens","uz":"oqibat","ru":"последствие","ex":["He had to face the consequences."],"u":"S05U10"},{"id":"lex.02414","w":"outcome","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈaʊtkʌm","uz":"natija","ru":"результат","ex":["The outcome was better than expected."],"u":"S05U10"},{"id":"lex.02415","w":"result","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈzʌlt","uz":"natija","ru":"результат","ex":["The results come out on Monday."],"u":"S05U10"},{"id":"lex.02416","w":"impact","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɪmpækt","uz":"ta'sir","ru":"воздействие","ex":["It had a big impact on her."],"u":"S05U10"},{"id":"lex.02417","w":"effect","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪˈfekt","uz":"ta'sir, natija","ru":"эффект","ex":["The medicine had no effect."],"u":"S05U10"},{"id":"lex.02418","w":"influence","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɪnfluəns","uz":"ta'sir, obro'","ru":"влияние","ex":["She has a lot of influence here."],"u":"S05U10"},{"id":"lex.02419","w":"responsibility","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˌspɑːnsəˈbɪləti","uz":"mas'uliyat","ru":"ответственность","ex":["He took responsibility for it."],"u":"S05U10"},{"id":"lex.02420","w":"error","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈerər","uz":"xato","ru":"ошибка","ex":["It was a simple error."],"u":"S05U10"},{"id":"lex.02421","w":"judgement","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdʒʌdʒmənt","uz":"hukm, mulohaza","ru":"суждение","ex":["It was an error of judgement."],"u":"S05U10"},{"id":"lex.02422","w":"hindsight","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈhaɪndsaɪt","uz":"keyingi aql","ru":"взгляд назад","ex":["With hindsight, I should have waited."],"u":"S05U10"},{"id":"lex.02423","w":"warning","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈwɔːrnɪŋ","uz":"ogohlantirish","ru":"предупреждение","ex":["He gave me a warning."],"u":"S05U10"},{"id":"lex.02424","w":"caution","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkɔːʃən","uz":"ehtiyotkorlik","ru":"осторожность","ex":["Proceed with caution."],"u":"S05U10"},{"id":"lex.02425","w":"precaution","pos":"noun","ipa":"prɪˈkɔːʃən","uz":"ehtiyot chorasi","ru":"предосторожность","ex":["Take the usual precautions."],"u":"S05U10"},{"id":"lex.02426","w":"deliberate","pos":"adj","ipa":"dɪˈlɪbərət","uz":"ataylab qilingan","ru":"намеренный","ex":["It was a deliberate choice."],"u":"S05U10"},{"id":"lex.02427","w":"accidental","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌæksɪˈdentəl","uz":"tasodifiy","ru":"случайный","ex":["The damage was accidental."],"u":"S05U10"},{"id":"lex.02428","w":"intentional","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪnˈtenʃənəl","uz":"qasddan qilingan","ru":"умышленный","ex":["I am sure it was not intentional."],"u":"S05U10"},{"id":"lex.02429","w":"prevent","pos":"verb","ipa":"prɪˈvent","uz":"oldini olmoq","ru":"предотвращать","ex":["Nothing could prevent it."],"u":"S05U10"},{"id":"lex.02430","w":"careless","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈkerləs","uz":"e'tiborsiz","ru":"небрежный","ex":["That was careless of me."],"u":"S05U10"},{"id":"lex.02431","w":"lucky","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈlʌki","uz":"omadli","ru":"везучий","ex":["We were lucky with the weather."],"u":"S05U10"},{"id":"lex.02432","w":"unlucky","pos":"adj","ipa":"ʌnˈlʌki","uz":"omadsiz","ru":"невезучий","ex":["He was unlucky to miss it."],"u":"S05U10"},{"id":"lex.02433","w":"reckless","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈrekləs","uz":"beparvo, ehtiyotsiz","ru":"безрассудный","ex":["It was reckless driving."],"u":"S05U10"},{"id":"lex.02434","w":"cautious","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈkɔːʃəs","uz":"ehtiyotkor","ru":"осторожный","ex":["She is cautious by nature."],"u":"S05U10"},{"id":"lex.02435","w":"hasty","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈheɪsti","uz":"shoshma-shosharlik bilan qilingan","ru":"поспешный","ex":["It was a hasty decision."],"u":"S05U10"},{"id":"lex.02436","w":"rushed","pos":"adj","ipa":"rʌʃt","uz":"shoshilinch qilingan","ru":"поспешный","ex":["The work looks rushed."],"u":"S05U10"},{"id":"lex.02437","w":"fee","pos":"noun","ipa":"fiː","uz":"to'lov","ru":"плата","ex":["There is a small fee."],"u":"S05U10"},{"id":"lex.02438","w":"payment","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpeɪmənt","uz":"to'lov","ru":"платёж","ex":["The payment was late."],"u":"S05U10"},{"id":"lex.02439","w":"loss","pos":"noun","ipa":"lɔːs","uz":"zarar, yo'qotish","ru":"потеря","ex":["It was a big loss for the company."],"u":"S05U10"},{"id":"lex.02440","w":"debt","pos":"noun","ipa":"det","uz":"qarz","ru":"долг","ex":["He is in debt."],"u":"S05U10"},{"id":"lex.02441","w":"verdict","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈvɜːrdɪkt","uz":"hukm, qaror","ru":"вердикт","ex":["The verdict surprised everyone."],"u":"S05U10"},{"id":"lex.02442","w":"obligation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌɑːblɪˈɡeɪʃən","uz":"majburiyat","ru":"обязательство","ex":["You are under no obligation."],"u":"S05U10"},{"id":"lex.02443","w":"justification","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌdʒʌstɪfɪˈkeɪʃən","uz":"asos","ru":"оправдание","ex":["There is no justification for it."],"u":"S05U10"},{"id":"lex.02444","w":"slip","pos":"noun","