ure."],"u":"S05U11"},{"id":"lex.02471","w":"prospect","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈprɑːspekt","uz":"istiqbol","ru":"перспектива","ex":["The job prospects are good."],"u":"S05U11"},{"id":"lex.02472","w":"aspiration","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌæspəˈreɪʃən","uz":"intilish","ru":"стремление","ex":["Her aspirations are high."],"u":"S05U11"},{"id":"lex.02473","w":"benchmark","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈbentʃmɑːrk","uz":"mezon, o'lchov","ru":"эталон","ex":["It has become the benchmark."],"u":"S05U11"},{"id":"lex.02474","w":"timeline","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtaɪmlaɪn","uz":"vaqt jadvali","ru":"график","ex":["The timeline is very tight."],"u":"S05U11"},{"id":"lex.02475","w":"projection","pos":"noun","ipa":"prəˈdʒekʃən","uz":"prognoz","ru":"прогноз","ex":["The projections look good."],"u":"S05U11"},{"id":"lex.02476","w":"anticipate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ænˈtɪsɪpeɪt","uz":"kutmoq, oldindan bilmoq","ru":"предвидеть","ex":["We did not anticipate the delay."],"u":"S05U11"},{"id":"lex.02477","w":"foresee","pos":"verb","ipa":"fɔːrˈsiː","uz":"oldindan ko'rmoq","ru":"предвидеть","ex":["Nobody could foresee this."],"u":"S05U11"},{"id":"lex.02478","w":"strategy","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈstrætədʒi","uz":"strategiya","ru":"стратегия","ex":["We need a better strategy."],"u":"S05U11"},{"id":"lex.02479","w":"term","pos":"noun","ipa":"tɜːrm","uz":"muddat, semestr","ru":"семестр, срок","ex":["The new term starts in September."],"u":"S05U11"},{"id":"lex.02480","w":"season","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsiːzən","uz":"fasl, mavsum","ru":"сезон","ex":["The season ends in May."],"u":"S05U11"},{"id":"lex.02481","w":"aim","pos":"noun","ipa":"eɪm","uz":"maqsad","ru":"цель","ex":["What is the aim of the course?"],"u":"S05U11"},{"id":"lex.02482","w":"purpose","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpɜːrpəs","uz":"maqsad","ru":"цель","ex":["What is the purpose of this form?"],"u":"S05U11"},{"id":"lex.02483","w":"intention","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪnˈtenʃən","uz":"niyat","ru":"намерение","ex":["I have no intention of leaving."],"u":"S05U11"},{"id":"lex.02484","w":