on filler."],"u":"S05U16"},{"id":"lex.02725","w":"hesitation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌhezɪˈteɪʃən","uz":"ikkilanish","ru":"колебание","ex":["He agreed without hesitation."],"u":"S05U16"},{"id":"lex.02726","w":"rephrase","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌriːˈfreɪz","uz":"boshqacha aytmoq","ru":"перефразировать","ex":["Could you rephrase that?"],"u":"S05U16"},{"id":"lex.02727","w":"elaborate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪˈlæbəreɪt","uz":"batafsil aytmoq","ru":"уточнять","ex":["Could you elaborate on that?"],"u":"S05U16"},{"id":"lex.02728","w":"digress","pos":"verb","ipa":"daɪˈɡres","uz":"mavzudan chetga chiqmoq","ru":"отклоняться от темы","ex":["Sorry, I am digressing."],"u":"S05U16"},{"id":"lex.02729","w":"emphasise","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈemfəsaɪz","uz":"ta'kidlamoq","ru":"подчёркивать","ex":["She emphasised the deadline."],"u":"S05U16"},{"id":"lex.02730","w":"pardon","pos":"interj","ipa":"ˈpɑːrdən","uz":"kechirasiz (qaytaring)","ru":"простите","ex":["Pardon? I did not hear."],"u":"S05U16"},{"id":"lex.02731","w":"slower","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈsloʊər","uz":"sekinroq","ru":"медленнее","ex":["Could you speak slower?"],"u":"S05U16"},{"id":"lex.02732","w":"louder","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈlaʊdər","uz":"balandroq","ru":"громче","ex":["Speak louder, please."],"u":"S05U16"},{"id":"lex.02733","w":"clearer","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈklɪrər","uz":"aniqroq","ru":"яснее","ex":["Could you say it clearer?"],"u":"S05U16"},{"id":"lex.02734","w":"object","pos":"verb","ipa":"əbˈdʒekt","uz":"e'tiroz bildirmoq","ru":"возражать","ex":["Nobody objected to the plan."],"u":"S05U16"},{"id":"lex.02735","w":"clarify","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈklærəfaɪ","uz":"aniqlashtirmoq","ru":"прояснять","ex":["Could you clarify that point?"],"u":"S05U16"},{"id":"lex.02736","w":"blunt","pos":"adj","ipa":"blʌnt","uz":"to'g'ridan-to'g'ri, keskin","ru":"прямолинейный","ex":["He was rather blunt about it."],"u":"S05U16"},{"id":"lex.02737","w":"vague","pos":"adj","ipa":"veɪɡ","uz":"noaniq","ru":"расплывчатый","ex":["His answer was vague."],"u":"S05U16"},{