 (ta'til)","ru":"болезнь","ex":["Sickness absence has fallen."],"u":"S06U01"},{"id":"lex.02791","w":"maternity","pos":"noun","ipa":"məˈtɜːrnəti","uz":"tug'ruq ta'tili","ru":"декрет","ex":["She is on maternity leave."],"u":"S06U01"},{"id":"lex.02792","w":"entitlement","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪnˈtaɪtəlmənt","uz":"huquq, imtiyoz","ru":"право на льготу","ex":["Your holiday entitlement is 25 days."],"u":"S06U01"},{"id":"lex.02793","w":"dismissal","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪsˈmɪsəl","uz":"ishdan bo'shatish","ru":"увольнение","ex":["He is appealing against his dismissal."],"u":"S06U01"},{"id":"lex.02794","w":"demotion","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˈmoʊʃən","uz":"lavozimni pasaytirish","ru":"понижение","ex":["He took the demotion badly."],"u":"S06U01"},{"id":"lex.02795","w":"employable","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪmˈplɔɪəbəl","uz":"ishga yaroqli","ru":"пригодный к найму","ex":["The course makes students more employable."],"u":"S06U01"},{"id":"lex.02796","w":"managerial","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌmænəˈdʒɪriəl","uz":"boshqaruvga oid","ru":"управленческий","ex":["It is a managerial post."],"u":"S06U01"},{"id":"lex.02797","w":"induction","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪnˈdʌkʃən","uz":"ishga kirish kursi","ru":"вводный курс","ex":["Induction lasts two days."],"u":"S06U01"},{"id":"lex.02798","w":"mentoring","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmentɔːrɪŋ","uz":"ustozlik","ru":"наставничество","ex":["Mentoring helps new teachers."],"u":"S06U01"},{"id":"lex.02799","w":"coaching","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkoʊtʃɪŋ","uz":"murabbiylik","ru":"коучинг","ex":["He gets coaching once a month."],"u":"S06U01"},{"id":"lex.02800","w":"supervision","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌsuːpərˈvɪʒən","uz":"nazorat","ru":"надзор","ex":["Trainees work under supervision."],"u":"S06U01"},{"id":"lex.02801","w":"morale","pos":"noun","ipa":"məˈræl","uz":"ruhiyat, kayfiyat","ru":"моральный дух","ex":["Morale is low at the moment."],"u":"S06U01"},{"id":"lex.02802","w":"absence","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈæbsəns","uz":"yo'qlik","ru":"отсутствие","ex":["Absence has to be reported."],"u":"S06U01"},{"id":"lex.02803","w":"jobless","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈdʒɑːbləs","uz":"ishsiz","ru":"безработный","ex":["He has been jobless since March."],"u":"S06U01"},{"id":"lex.02804","w":"retiree","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˌtaɪəˈriː","uz":"nafaqaxo'r","ru":"пенсионер","ex":["The club is mostly retirees."],"u":"S06U01"},{"id":"lex.02805","w":"staff","pos":"noun","ipa":"stæf","uz":"xodimlar","ru":"персонал","ex":["The staff are very helpful."],"u":"S06U01"},{"id":"lex.02806","w":"recruitment","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈkruːtmənt","uz":"ishga qabul","ru":"набор персонала","ex":["Recruitment takes about six weeks."],"u":"S06U01"},{"id":"lex.02807","w":"actually","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈæktʃuəli","uz":"aslida","ru":"на самом деле","ex":["What do you actually do?"],"u":"S06U01"},{"id":"lex.02808","w":"unsure","pos":"adj","ipa":"ʌnˈʃʊr","uz":"ishonchsiz, ikkilanayotgan","ru":"неуверенный","ex":["I am unsure of the second figure."],"u":"S06U02"},{"id":"lex.02809","w":"shot","pos":"noun","ipa":"ʃɑt","uz":"o'q otish; ukol","ru":"выстрел; укол","ex":["Two shots were heard from the road."],"u":"S06U02"},{"id":"lex.02810","w":"imitate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈɪmɪteɪt","uz":"taqlid qilmoq","ru":"подражать","ex":["Do not imitate her voice; find your own."],"u":"S06U02"},{"id":"lex.02811","w":"crossroads","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkrɔːsroʊdz","uz":"chorraha, hal qiluvchi payt","ru":"перепутье","ex":["He is at a crossroads in his career."],"u":"S06U02"},{"id":"lex.02812","w":"gamble","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɡæmbəl","uz":"tavakkal","ru":"риск, авантюра","ex":["Leaving the job was a gamble."],"u":"S06U02"},{"id":"lex.02813","w":"fate","pos":"noun","ipa":"feɪt","uz":"taqdir","ru":"судьба","ex":["He believes in fate."],"u":"S06U02"},{"id":"lex.02814","w":"destiny","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdestəni","uz":"qismat","ru":"судьба","ex":["She felt it was her destiny."],"u":"S06U02"},{"id":"lex.02815","w":"luck","pos":"noun","ipa":"lʌk","uz":"omad","ru":"удача","ex":["It was pure luck."],"u":"S06U02"},{"id":"lex.02816","w":"timing","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtaɪmɪŋ","uz":"vaqtni to'g'ri tanlash","ru":"выбор момента","ex":["The timing was unfortunate."],"u":"S06U02"},{"id":"lex.02817","w":"dilemma","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˈlemə","uz":"og'ir tanlov","ru":"дилемма","ex":["It is a real dilemma."],"u":"S06U02"},{"id":"lex.02818","w":"tradeoff","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtreɪdɔːf","uz":"murosa, almashuv","ru":"компромисс","ex":["There is a tradeoff between speed and cost."],"u":"S06U02"},{"id":"lex.02819","w":"sacrifice","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsækrɪfaɪs","uz":"qurbonlik","ru":"жертва","ex":["It meant a sacrifice for the family."],"u":"S06U02"},{"id":"lex.02820","w":"impulse","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɪmpʌls","uz":"beixtiyor istak","ru":"порыв","ex":["I bought it on impulse."],"u":"S06U02"},{"id":"lex.02821","w":"inevitable","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪnˈevɪtəbəl","uz":"muqarrar","ru":"неизбежный","ex":["The change was inevitable."],"u":"S06U02"},{"id":"lex.02822","w":"avoidable","pos":"adj","ipa":"əˈvɔɪdəbəl","uz":"oldini olish mumkin","ru":"предотвратимый","ex":["The delay was entirely avoidable."],"u":"S06U02"},{"id":"lex.02823","w":"preventable","pos":"adj","ipa":"prɪˈventəbəl","uz":"oldini olsa bo'ladigan","ru":"предотвратимый","ex":["It was a preventable accident."],"u":"S06U02"},{"id":"lex.02824","w":"unforeseen","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌʌnfɔːrˈsiːn","uz":"kutilmagan","ru":"непредвиденный","ex":["There were unforeseen costs."],"u":"S06U02"},{"id":"lex.02825","w":"unintended","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌʌnɪnˈtendɪd","uz":"ko'zda tutilmagan","ru":"непреднамеренный","ex":["The rule had unintended effects."],"u":"S06U02"},{"id":"lex.02826","w":"calculated","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈkælkjuleɪtɪd","uz":"o'ylab qilingan","ru":"расчётливый","ex":["It was a calculated risk."],"u":"S06U02"},{"id":"lex.02827","w":"substitute","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsʌbstɪtuːt","uz":"o'rinbosar","ru":"замена","ex":["We found a substitute teacher."],"u":"S06U02"},{"id":"lex.02828","w":"reverse","pos":"verb","ipa":"rɪˈvɜːrs","uz":"bekor qilmoq, orqaga qaytarmoq","ru":"отменить","ex":["The decision was reversed."],"u":"S06U02"},{"id":"lex.02829","w":"persevere","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌpɜːrsəˈvɪr","uz":"qat'iyat bilan davom etmoq","ru":"упорствовать","ex":["She persevered and finally passed."],"u":"S06U02"},{"id":"lex.02830","w":"surrender","pos":"verb","ipa":"səˈrendər","uz":"taslim bo'lmoq","ru":"сдаваться","ex":["He refused to surrender."],"u":"S06U02"},{"id":"lex.02831","w":"decisive","pos":"adj","ipa":"dɪˈsaɪsɪv","uz":"qat'iy","ru":"решительный","ex":["She was decisive under pressure."],"u":"S06U02"},{"id":"lex.02832","w":"indecisive","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌɪndɪˈsaɪsɪv","uz":"qat'iyatsiz","ru":"нерешительный","ex":["He is hopelessly indecisive."],"u":"S06U02"},{"id":"lex.02833","w":"unavoidable","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌʌnəˈvɔɪdəbəl","uz":"muqarrar","ru":"неизбежный","ex":["The delay was unavoidable."],"u":"S06U02"},{"id":"lex.02834","w":"preferable","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈprefərəbəl","uz":"afzalroq","ru":"предпочтительный","ex":["Waiting is preferable to guessing."],"u":"S06U02"},{"id":"lex.02835","w":"regrettable","pos":"adj","ipa":"rɪˈɡretəbəl","uz":"achinarli","ru":"достойный сожаления","ex":["It was a regrettable mistake."],"u":"S06U02"},{"id":"lex.02836","w":"reconsider","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌriːkənˈsɪdər","uz":"qayta ko'rib chiqmoq","ru":"пересмотреть","ex":["Would you reconsider your decision?"],"u":"S06U02"},{"id":"lex.02837","w":"rethink","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌriːˈθɪŋk","uz":"qayta o'ylamoq","ru":"переосмыслить","ex":["We need to rethink the whole plan."],"u":"S06U02"},{"id":"lex.02838","w":"ponder","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈpɑːndər","uz":"mulohaza qilmoq","ru":"размышлять","ex":["She pondered the offer for a week."],"u":"S06U02"},{"id":"lex.02839","w":"resolve","pos":"verb","ipa":"rɪˈzɑːlv","uz":"hal qilmoq","ru":"разрешить","ex":["The dispute was resolved quickly."],"u":"S06U02"},{"id":"lex.02840","w":"irreversible","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌɪrɪˈvɜːrsəbəl","uz":"qaytarib bo'lmaydigan","ru":"необратимый","ex":["The damage is irreversible."],"u":"S06U02"},{"id":"lex.02841","w":"misstep","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmɪsstep","uz":"noto'g'ri qadam","ru":"оплошность","ex":["One misstep cost him the contract."],"u":"S06U02"},{"id":"lex.02842","w":"wager","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈweɪdʒər","uz":"garov","ru":"пари","ex":["They made a small wager on it."],"u":"S06U02"},{"id":"lex.02843","w":"foreseeable","pos":"adj","ipa":"fɔːrˈsiːəbəl","uz":"oldindan ko'rish mumkin","ru":"обозримый","ex":["Nothing will change in the foreseeable future."],"u":"S06U02"},{"id":"lex.02844","w":"outweigh","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌaʊtˈweɪ","uz":"ustun kelmoq","ru":"перевешивать","ex":["The benefits outweigh the costs."],"u":"S06U02"},{"id":"lex.02845","w":"forgo","pos":"verb","ipa":"fɔːrˈɡoʊ","uz":"voz kechmoq","ru":"отказаться от","ex":["She forwent the bonus to keep the holiday."],"u":"S06U02"},{"id":"lex.02846","w":"imitation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌɪmɪˈteɪʃən","uz":"taqlid, nusxa","ru":"подражание, имитация","ex":["A good imitation of her style for about a page."],"u":"S06U03"},{"id":"lex.02847","w":"remedy","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈremədi","uz":"chora, davo","ru":"средство, решение","ex":["There is a simple remedy."],"u":"S06U03"},{"id":"lex.02848","w":"goodwill","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌɡʊdˈwɪl","uz":"xayrixohlik","ru":"добрая воля","ex":["They refunded it as a gesture of goodwill."],"u":"S06U03"},{"id":"lex.02849","w":"inconvenience","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌɪnkənˈviːniəns","uz":"noqulaylik","ru":"неудобство","ex":["We apologise for the inconvenience."],"u":"S06U03"},{"id":"lex.02850","w":"resolution","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌrezəˈluːʃən","uz":"hal qilish","ru":"разрешение","ex":["We reached a resolution at last."],"u":"S06U03"},{"id":"lex.02851","w":"settlement","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsetəlmənt","uz":"kelishuv","ru":"урегулирование","ex":["They agreed a settlement."],"u":"S06U03"},{"id":"lex.02852","w":"acknowledgement","pos":"noun","ipa":"əkˈnɑːlɪdʒmənt","uz":"tan olish, tasdiq","ru":"признание","ex":["I received an acknowledgement of my letter."],"u":"S06U03"},{"id":"lex.02853","w":"reconciliation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌrekənsɪliˈeɪʃən","uz":"yarashuv","ru":"примирение","ex":["Reconciliation took years."],"u":"S06U03"},{"id":"lex.02854","w":"amends","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈmendz","uz":"tuzatish, kechirim so'rash","ru":"возмещение","ex":["He wanted to make amends."],"u":"S06U03"},{"id":"lex.02855","w":"grievance","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɡriːvəns","uz":"norozilik, shikoyat","ru":"претензия","ex":["She raised a formal grievance."],"u":"S06U03"},{"id":"lex.02856","w":"dispute","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˈspjuːt","uz":"nizo","ru":"спор","ex":["The dispute lasted six months."],"u":"S06U03"},{"id":"lex.02857","w":"arbitration","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌɑːrbɪˈtreɪʃən","uz":"hakamlik","ru":"арбитраж","ex":["The case went to arbitration."],"u":"S06U03"},{"id":"lex.02858","w":"sorrow","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsɑːroʊ","uz":"qayg'u","ru":"печаль","ex":["She spoke with great sorrow."],"u":"S06U03"},{"id":"lex.02859","w":"embarrassment","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪmˈbærəsmənt","uz":"xijolat","ru":"смущение","ex":["To my embarrassment, I had forgotten."],"u":"S06U03"},{"id":"lex.02860","w":"humiliation","pos":"noun","ipa":"hjuːˌmɪliˈeɪʃən","uz":"xo'rlik","ru":"унижение","ex":["It was a public humiliation."],"u":"S06U03"},{"id":"lex.02861","w":"mercy","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmɜːrsi","uz":"rahm","ru":"милосердие","ex":["He asked for mercy."],"u":"S06U03"},{"id":"lex.02862","w":"sympathy","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsɪmpəθi","uz":"hamdardlik","ru":"сочувствие","ex":["You have my sympathy."],"u":"S06U03"},{"id":"lex.02863","w":"empathy","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈempəθi","uz":"hamdardlik, tushunish","ru":"эмпатия","ex":["Good teachers need empathy."],"u":"S06U03"},{"id":"lex.02864","w":"compassion","pos":"noun","ipa":"kəmˈpæʃən","uz":"shafqat","ru":"сострадание","ex":["She treated them with compassion."],"u":"S06U03"},{"id":"lex.02865","w":"tolerance","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtɑːlərəns","uz":"bag'rikenglik","ru":"терпимость","ex":["Tolerance is learned at home."],"u":"S06U03"},{"id":"lex.02866","w":"apologetic","pos":"adj","ipa":"əˌpɑːləˈdʒetɪk","uz":"uzr so'rovchi","ru":"извиняющийся","ex":["He sounded genuinely apologetic."],"u":"S06U03"},{"id":"lex.02867","w":"acceptable","pos":"adj","ipa":"əkˈseptəbəl","uz":"maqbul","ru":"приемлемый","ex":["That is an acceptable answer."],"u":"S06U03"},{"id":"lex.02868","w":"concede","pos":"verb","ipa":"kənˈsiːd","uz":"tan olmoq, yon bermoq","ru":"уступать, признавать","ex":["He conceded that he had been wrong."],"u":"S06U03"},{"id":"lex.02869","w":"acknowledge","pos":"verb","ipa":"əkˈnɑːlɪdʒ","uz":"tan olmoq","ru":"признавать","ex":["They acknowledged the mistake."],"u":"S06U03"},{"id":"lex.02870","w":"condolence","pos":"noun","ipa":"kənˈdoʊləns","uz":"ta'ziya","ru":"соболезнование","ex":["She sent her condolences."],"u":"S06U03"},{"id":"lex.02871","w":"reassurance","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌriːəˈʃʊrəns","uz":"tinchlantirish","ru":"заверение","ex":["He wanted some reassurance."],"u":"S06U03"},{"id":"lex.02872","w":"comfort","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkʌmfərt","uz":"tasalli","ru":"утешение","ex":["Her words were a comfort."],"u":"S06U03"},{"id":"lex.02873","w":"consolation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌkɑːnsəˈleɪʃən","uz":"tasalli","ru":"утешение","ex":["It was small consolation."],"u":"S06U03"},{"id":"lex.02874","w":"overlook","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌoʊvərˈlʊk","uz":"e'tibor bermaslik, kechirmoq","ru":"не заметить, простить","ex":["We will overlook it this time."],"u":"S06U03"},{"id":"lex.02875","w":"resentment","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈzentmənt","uz":"g'azab, xafalik","ru":"обида","ex":["There is still some resentment."],"u":"S06U03"},{"id":"lex.02876","w":"bitterness","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈbɪtərnəs","uz":"alam","ru":"горечь","ex":["He spoke without bitterness."],"u":"S06U03"},{"id":"lex.02877","w":"odd","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɑd","uz":"g'alati","ru":"странный","ex":["It was an odd thing to say."],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02878","w":"plainly","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈpleɪnli","uz":"ochiq aytganda","ru":"прямо, ясно","ex":["Say it plainly, once."],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02879","w":"embarrass","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪmˈbærəs","uz":"xijolat qilmoq","ru":"смущать, ставить в неловкое положение","ex":["The question embarrassed the whole committee."],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02880","w":"reporter","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈpɔːrtər","uz":"muxbir","ru":"репортёр","ex":["A reporter called this morning."],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02881","w":"source","pos":"noun","ipa":"sɔːrs","uz":"manba","ru":"источник","ex":["Where did you get that? What is your source?"],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02882","w":"coverage","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkʌvərɪdʒ","uz":"yoritilishi","ru":"освещение","ex":["The coverage was mostly fair."],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02883","w":"bulletin","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈbʊlətɪn","uz":"axborot xabari","ru":"сводка","ex":["The news bulletin is at six."],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02884","w":"allegation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌæləˈɡeɪʃən","uz":"ayblov (isbotlanmagan)","ru":"обвинение","ex":["The allegations were denied."],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02885","w":"spokesperson","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈspoʊkspɜːrsən","uz":"matbuot vakili","ru":"представитель","ex":["A spokesperson confirmed the news."],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02886","w":"scandal","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈskændəl","uz":"janjal, mojaro","ru":"скандал","ex":["The scandal broke last week."],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02887","w":"editorial","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌedɪˈtɔːriəl","uz":"bosh maqola","ru":"передовица","ex":["The editorial was very critical."],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02888","w":"commentary","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkɑːmənteri","uz":"sharh","ru":"комментарий","ex":["The commentary was better than the match."],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02889","w":"tabloid","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtæblɔɪd","uz":"ommabop gazeta","ru":"таблоид","ex":["The tabloids ran the story for a week."],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02890","w":"censorship","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsensərʃɪp","uz":"tsenzura","ru":"цензура","ex":["Censorship was relaxed in the 1990s."],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02891","w":"propaganda","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌprɑːpəˈɡændə","uz":"targ'ibot","ru":"пропаганда","ex":["It reads like propaganda."],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02892","w":"sensational","pos":"adj","ipa":"senˈseɪʃənəl","uz":"shov-shuvli","ru":"сенсационный","ex":["The headline was sensational."],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02893","w":"credible","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈkredəbəl","uz":"ishonarli","ru":"заслуживающий доверия","ex":["Is the source credible?"],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02894","w":"anonymous","pos":"adj","ipa":"əˈnɑːnəməs","uz":"noma'lum, anonim","ru":"анонимный","ex":["The letter was anonymous."],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02895","w":"television","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈteləvɪʒən","uz":"televideniye","ru":"телевидение","ex":["He works in television."],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02896","w":"radio","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈreɪdioʊ","uz":"radio","ru":"радио","ex":["I heard it on the radio."],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02897","w":"internet","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɪntərnet","uz":"internet","ru":"интернет","ex":["I read it on the internet."],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02898","w":"podcast","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpɑːdkæst","uz":"podkast","ru":"подкаст","ex":["She has a weekly podcast."],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02899","w":"investigation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪnˌvestɪˈɡeɪʃən","uz":"tergov, tekshiruv","ru":"расследование","ex":["An investigation has been opened."],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02900","w":"exposure","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪkˈspoʊʒər","uz":"fosh qilish, e'tibor","ru":"разоблачение, огласка","ex":["The story got a lot of exposure."],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02901","w":"publicity","pos":"noun","ipa":"pʌˈblɪsəti","uz":"reklama, ommaga tanitish","ru":"огласка","ex":["The film got good publicity."],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02902","w":"informative","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪnˈfɔːrmətɪv","uz":"ma'lumotga boy","ru":"информативный","ex":["The programme was very informative."],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02903","w":"truthful","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈtruːθfəl","uz":"rostgo'y","ru":"правдивый","ex":["Give me a truthful answer."],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02904","w":"believable","pos":"adj","ipa":"bɪˈliːvəbəl","uz":"ishonarli","ru":"правдоподобный","ex":["His story is believable."],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02905","w":"unbelievable","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌʌnbɪˈliːvəbəl","uz":"ishonib bo'lmaydigan","ru":"невероятный","ex":["The claim is unbelievable."],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02906","w":"reportedly","pos":"adv","ipa":"rɪˈpɔːrtɪdli","uz":"xabarlarga ko'ra","ru":"как сообщается","ex":["He has reportedly resigned."],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02907","w":"allegedly","pos":"adv","ipa":"əˈledʒɪdli","uz":"da'voga ko'ra","ru":"предположительно","ex":["He allegedly took the money."],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02908","w":"broadcaster","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈbrɔːdkæstər","uz":"teleradio kompaniyasi","ru":"вещатель","ex":["The national broadcaster covered it live."],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02909","w":"publisher","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpʌblɪʃər","uz":"nashriyot","ru":"издатель","ex":["The publisher rejected the book."],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02910","w":"correspondent","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌkɔːrəˈspɑːndənt","uz":"maxsus muxbir","ru":"корреспондент","ex":["Our correspondent reports from Almaty."],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02911","w":"columnist","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkɑːləmnɪst","uz":"ruknchi","ru":"обозреватель","ex":["The columnist disagreed sharply."],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02912","w":"reader","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈriːdər","uz":"o'quvchi","ru":"читатель","ex":["Readers wrote in to complain."],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02913","w":"circulation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌsɜːrkjuˈleɪʃən","uz":"tiraj","ru":"тираж","ex":["Circulation has halved since 2010."],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02914","w":"newsroom","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈnuːzruːm","uz":"tahririyat","ru":"редакция","ex":["The newsroom was very quiet."],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02915","w":"footage","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfʊtɪdʒ","uz":"video yozuv","ru":"видеозапись","ex":["They showed footage from the scene."],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02916","w":"clip","pos":"noun","ipa":"klɪp","uz":"qisqa video","ru":"клип, ролик","ex":["A short clip went round online."],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02917","w":"caption","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkæpʃən","uz":"sarlavha (rasm ostida)","ru":"подпись","ex":["The caption was wrong."],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02918","w":"anchor","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈæŋkər","uz":"boshlovchi (yangiliklar)","ru":"ведущий новостей","ex":["The anchor introduced the report."],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02919","w":"analyst","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈænəlɪst","uz":"tahlilchi","ru":"аналитик","ex":["An analyst explained the figures."],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02920","w":"commentator","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkɑːmənteɪtər","uz":"sharhlovchi","ru":"комментатор","ex":["The commentator got the name wrong."],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02921","w":"reviewer","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈvjuːər","uz":"taqrizchi","ru":"рецензент","ex":["The reviewer praised the acting."],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02922","w":"impartial","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪmˈpɑːrʃəl","uz":"xolis","ru":"беспристрастный","ex":["The report was impartial."],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02923","w":"seller","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈselər","uz":"sotuvchi","ru":"продавец","ex":["The sellers are moving to the new hall."],"u":"S06U04"},{"id":"lex.02924","w":"handover","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈhændoʊvər","uz":"ishni topshirish","ru":"передача дел","ex":["The handover takes a week."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02925","w":"delegate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈdeləɡeɪt","uz":"vakolat bermoq","ru":"делегировать","ex":["A good manager delegates."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02926","w":"assign","pos":"verb","ipa":"əˈsaɪn","uz":"tayinlamoq","ru":"поручать","ex":["Each case is assigned to one officer."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02927","w":"negotiate","pos":"verb","ipa":"nɪˈɡoʊʃieɪt","uz":"muzokara olib bormoq","ru":"вести переговоры","ex":["They negotiated for three hours."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02928","w":"concession","pos":"noun","ipa":"kənˈseʃən","uz":"yon berish","ru":"уступка","ex":["Both sides made concessions."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02929","w":"clause","pos":"noun","ipa":"klɔːz","uz":"band, modda","ru":"пункт, статья","ex":["Read clause four carefully."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02930","w":"condition","pos":"noun","ipa":"kənˈdɪʃən","uz":"shart","ru":"условие","ex":["We accepted on one condition."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02931","w":"stakeholder","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsteɪkhoʊldər","uz":"manfaatdor tomon","ru":"заинтересованная сторона","ex":["All the stakeholders were consulted."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02932","w":"counterpart","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkaʊntərpɑːrt","uz":"hamkasb (boshqa tomondan)","ru":"коллега с другой стороны","ex":["He met his counterpart in Almaty."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02933","w":"tender","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtendər","uz":"tender","ru":"тендер","ex":["The tender closes on Friday."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02934","w":"bid","pos":"noun","ipa":"bɪd","uz":"taklif narxi","ru":"заявка","ex":["Their bid was the lowest."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02935","w":"deal","pos":"noun","ipa":"diːl","uz":"kelishuv","ru":"сделка","ex":["They signed the deal in May."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02936","w":"liability","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌlaɪəˈbɪləti","uz":"javobgarlik","ru":"ответственность","ex":["The contract limits our liability."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02937","w":"breach","pos":"noun","ipa":"briːtʃ","uz":"buzilish (shartnoma)","ru":"нарушение","ex":["It was a breach of contract."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02938","w":"renewal","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈnuːəl","uz":"yangilash","ru":"продление","ex":["Renewal is automatic."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02939","w":"buyer","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈbaɪər","uz":"xaridor","ru":"покупатель","ex":["The buyer wants a discount."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02940","w":"trader","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtreɪdər","uz":"savdogar","ru":"торговец","ex":["Market traders start at five."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02941","w":"wholesale","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈhoʊlseɪl","uz":"ulgurji","ru":"оптовый","ex":["They buy at wholesale prices."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02942","w":"retail","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈriːteɪl","uz":"chakana","ru":"розничный","ex":["The retail price is double."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02943","w":"markup","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmɑːrkʌp","uz":"ustama","ru":"наценка","ex":["The markup is thirty per cent."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02944","w":"turnover","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtɜːrnoʊvər","uz":"aylanma","ru":"оборот","ex":["Turnover rose last year."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02945","w":"revenue","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈrevənuː","uz":"daromad (tashkilotning)","ru":"выручка","ex":["Revenue fell in the second quarter."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02946","w":"profitable","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈprɑːfɪtəbəl","uz":"foydali","ru":"прибыльный","ex":["The shop is finally profitable."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02947","w":"competitive","pos":"adj","ipa":"kəmˈpetətɪv","uz":"raqobatbardosh","ru":"конкурентный","ex":["Our prices are competitive."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02948","w":"negotiator","pos":"noun","ipa":"nɪˈɡoʊʃieɪtər","uz":"muzokarachi","ru":"переговорщик","ex":["She is a tough negotiator."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02949","w":"mediator","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmiːdieɪtər","uz":"vositachi","ru":"посредник","ex":["They asked for a mediator."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02950","w":"arbitrator","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɑːrbɪtreɪtər","uz":"hakam","ru":"арбитр","ex":["An arbitrator settled the case."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02951","w":"associate","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈsoʊʃiət","uz":"hamkor","ru":"партнёр, коллега","ex":["He is a business associate."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02952","w":"vendor","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈvendər","uz":"sotuvchi tashkilot","ru":"поставщик","ex":["The vendor delivers on Tuesdays."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02953","w":"purchaser","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpɜːrtʃəsər","uz":"sotib oluvchi","ru":"покупатель","ex":["The purchaser pays the fee."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02954","w":"contractor","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkɑːntræktər","uz":"pudratchi","ru":"подрядчик","ex":["The contractor starts on Monday."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02955","w":"consultant","pos":"noun","ipa":"kənˈsʌltənt","uz":"maslahatchi","ru":"консультант","ex":["They brought in a consultant."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02956","w":"estimate","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈestɪmət","uz":"taxminiy hisob","ru":"смета","ex":["Can you give me an estimate?"],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02957","w":"bargaining","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈbɑːrɡənɪŋ","uz":"savdolashish","ru":"торг","ex":["Bargaining went on all afternoon."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02958","w":"wholesaler","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈhoʊlseɪlər","uz":"ulgurji sotuvchi","ru":"оптовик","ex":["We buy from a wholesaler."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02959","w":"retailer","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈriːteɪlər","uz":"chakana sotuvchi","ru":"розничный продавец","ex":["Retailers set their own prices."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02960","w":"warehouse","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈwerhaʊs","uz":"ombor","ru":"склад","ex":["The goods are in the warehouse."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02961","w":"depot","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdiːpoʊ","uz":"bazа, ombor","ru":"депо, склад","ex":["The bus depot is by the river."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02962","w":"freight","pos":"noun","ipa":"freɪt","uz":"yuk tashish","ru":"грузоперевозка","ex":["Freight costs have risen."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02963","w":"cargo","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkɑːrɡoʊ","uz":"yuk","ru":"груз","ex":["The cargo was damaged."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02964","w":"shipping","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈʃɪpɪŋ","uz":"yuk jo'natish","ru":"доставка","ex":["Shipping is free over fifty dollars."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02965","w":"haulage","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈhɔːlɪdʒ","uz":"avtoyuk tashish","ru":"грузоперевозки","ex":["He runs a haulage business."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02966","w":"quota","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkwoʊtə","uz":"kvota","ru":"квота","ex":["We met our quota for May."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02967","w":"mineral","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmɪnərəl","uz":"qazilma boylik","ru":"минерал","ex":["The region is rich in minerals."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02968","w":"ore","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɔːr","uz":"ruda","ru":"руда","ex":["Iron ore is mined nearby."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02969","w":"textile","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtekstaɪl","uz":"to'qimachilik mahsuloti","ru":"текстиль","ex":["The textile industry employs thousands."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02970","w":"refinery","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈfaɪnəri","uz":"qayta ishlash zavodi","ru":"завод по переработке","ex":["The refinery was built in 1980."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02971","w":"mill","pos":"noun","ipa":"mɪl","uz":"tegirmon, fabrika","ru":"мельница, фабрика","ex":["The old mill is now a museum."],"u":"S06U05"},{"id":"lex.02972","w":"inspect","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪnˈspekt","uz":"tekshirmoq","ru":"осматривать, инспектировать","ex":["The bridge is inspected every two years."],"u":"S06U06"},{"id":"lex.02973","w":"edit","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈedɪt","uz":"tahrirlamoq","ru":"редактировать","ex":["Please edit the first paragraph."],"u":"S06U06"},{"id":"lex.02974","w":"proofread","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈpruːfriːd","uz":"korrektura qilmoq","ru":"вычитывать","ex":["Proofread it before you send it."],"u":"S06U06"},{"id":"lex.02975","w":"concise","pos":"adj","ipa":"kənˈsaɪs","uz":"qisqa va aniq","ru":"краткий","ex":["Keep the summary concise."],"u":"S06U06"},{"id":"lex.02976","w":"wordy","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈwɜːrdi","uz":"so'zga boy, cho'zilgan","ru":"многословный","ex":["The opening is too wordy."],"u":"S06U06"},{"id":"lex.02977","w":"coherence","pos":"noun","ipa":"koʊˈhɪrəns","uz":"mantiqiy bog'liqlik","ru":"связность","ex":["The essay lacks coherence."],"u":"S06U06"},{"id":"lex.02978","w":"redundancy","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈdʌndənsi","uz":"ortiqchalik","ru":"избыточность","ex":["Cut the redundancy in paragraph two."],"u":"S06U06"},{"id":"lex.02979","w":"ambiguity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌæmbɪˈɡjuːəti","uz":"ikki ma'nolilik","ru":"двусмысленность","ex":["The wording creates ambiguity."],"u":"S06U06"},{"id":"lex.02980","w":"clarity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈklærəti","uz":"aniqlik","ru":"ясность","ex":["Clarity is more important than style."],"u":"S06U06"},{"id":"lex.02981","w":"precision","pos":"noun","ipa":"prɪˈsɪʒən","uz":"aniqlik, nozillik","ru":"точность","ex":["He writes with great precision."],"u":"S06U06"},{"id":"lex.02982","w":"brevity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈbrevəti","uz":"qisqalik","ru":"краткость","ex":["Brevity is a virtue here."],"u":"S06U06"},{"id":"lex.02983","w":"coherent","pos":"adj","ipa":"koʊˈhɪrənt","uz":"izchil","ru":"связный","ex":["It is a coherent argument."],"u":"S06U06"},{"id":"lex.02984","w":"subheading","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsʌbhedɪŋ","uz":"kichik sarlavha","ru":"подзаголовок","ex":["Add subheadings to break it up."],"u":"S06U06"},{"id":"lex.02985","w":"bullet","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈbʊlɪt","uz":"nuqta (ro'yxatda)","ru":"маркер списка","ex":["Use bullets, not long sentences."],"u":"S06U06"},{"id":"lex.02986","w":"editing","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈedɪtɪŋ","uz":"tahrir","ru":"редактирование","ex":["Editing took longer than writing."],"u":"S06U06"},{"id":"lex.02987","w":"layout","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈleɪaʊt","uz":"sahifa tuzilishi","ru":"вёрстка","ex":["The layout is hard to follow."],"u":"S06U06"},{"id":"lex.02988","w":"font","pos":"noun","ipa":"fɑːnt","uz":"shrift","ru":"шрифт","ex":["Use a larger font."],"u":"S06U06"},{"id":"lex.02989","w":"spacing","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈspeɪsɪŋ","uz":"oraliq","ru":"интервал","ex":["Double spacing is required."],"u":"S06U06"},{"id":"lex.02990","w":"indent","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɪndent","uz":"abzats chekinishi","ru":"отступ","ex":["Start each paragraph with an indent."],"u":"S06U06"},{"id":"lex.02991","w":"numbering","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈnʌmbərɪŋ","uz":"raqamlash","ru":"нумерация","ex":["The numbering restarts each chapter."],"u":"S06U06"},{"id":"lex.02992","w":"appendix","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈpendɪks","uz":"ilova","ru":"приложение","ex":["The figures are in the appendix."],"u":"S06U06"},{"id":"lex.02993","w":"footnote","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfʊtnoʊt","uz":"izoh (sahifa ostida)","ru":"сноска","ex":["Put the source in a footnote."],"u":"S06U06"},{"id":"lex.02994","w":"bibliography","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌbɪbliˈɑːɡrəfi","uz":"adabiyotlar ro'yxati","ru":"библиография","ex":["The bibliography runs to six pages."],"u":"S06U06"},{"id":"lex.02995","w":"readable","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈriːdəbəl","uz":"o'qishga oson","ru":"читаемый","ex":["The report is clear and readable."],"u":"S06U06"},{"id":"lex.02996","w":"unreadable","pos":"adj","ipa":"ʌnˈriːdəbəl","uz":"o'qib bo'lmaydigan","ru":"нечитаемый","ex":["His handwriting is unreadable."],"u":"S06U06"},{"id":"lex.02997","w":"descriptive","pos":"adj","ipa":"dɪˈskrɪptɪv","uz":"tasvirlovchi","ru":"описательный","ex":["The opening is very descriptive."],"u":"S06U06"},{"id":"lex.02998","w":"explanatory","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪkˈsplænətɔːri","uz":"tushuntiruvchi","ru":"пояснительный","ex":["Add an explanatory note."],"u":"S06U06"},{"id":"lex.02999","w":"persuasive","pos":"adj","ipa":"pərˈsweɪsɪv","uz":"ishontiruvchi","ru":"убедительный","ex":["It is a persuasive argument."],"u":"S06U06"},{"id":"lex.03000","w":"repetitive","pos":"adj","ipa":"rɪˈpetətɪv","uz":"takrorlanuvchi","ru":"повторяющийся","ex":["The middle section is repetitive."],"u":"S06U06"},{"id":"lex.03001","w":"manuscript","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmænjuskrɪpt","uz":"qo'lyozma","ru":"рукопись","ex":["The manuscript is with the publisher."],"u":"S06U06"},{"id":"lex.03002","w":"edition","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪˈdɪʃən","uz":"nashr","ru":"издание","ex":["This is the third edition."],"u":"S06U06"},{"id":"lex.03003","w":"section","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsekʃən","uz":"bo'lim","ru":"раздел","ex":["Read section three first."],"u":"S06U06"},{"id":"lex.03004","w":"jargon","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdʒɑːrɡən","uz":"kasbiy atamalar","ru":"жаргон","ex":["Avoid jargon in a public notice."],"u":"S06U06"},{"id":"lex.03005","w":"slang","pos":"noun","ipa":"slæŋ","uz":"jargon, ko'cha tili","ru":"сленг","ex":["Do not use slang in an essay."],"u":"S06U06"},{"id":"lex.03006","w":"idiom","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɪdiəm","uz":"ibora","ru":"идиома","ex":["'Break the ice' is an idiom."],"u":"S06U06"},{"id":"lex.03007","w":"cliche","pos":"noun","ipa":"kliːˈʃeɪ","uz":"shtamp, eskirgan ibora","ru":"клише","ex":["Try to avoid cliches."],"u":"S06U06"},{"id":"lex.03008","w":"metaphor","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmetəfɔːr","uz":"metafora","ru":"метафора","ex":["He used a farming metaphor."],"u":"S06U06"},{"id":"lex.03009","w":"style","pos":"noun","ipa":"staɪl","uz":"uslub","ru":"стиль","ex":["Her style is very direct."],"u":"S06U06"},{"id":"lex.03010","w":"grammar","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɡræmər","uz":"grammatika","ru":"грамматика","ex":["Check the grammar before sending."],"u":"S06U06"},{"id":"lex.03011","w":"punctuation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌpʌŋktʃuˈeɪʃən","uz":"tinish belgilari","ru":"пунктуация","ex":["The punctuation is wrong here."],"u":"S06U06"},{"id":"lex.03012","w":"format","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfɔːrmæt","uz":"format","ru":"формат","ex":["Send it in the usual format."],"u":"S06U06"},{"id":"lex.03013","w":"vineyard","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈvɪnjərd","uz":"uzumzor","ru":"виноградник","ex":["The vineyard has been in the family for years."],"u":"S06U06"},{"id":"lex.03014","w":"orchard","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɔːrtʃərd","uz":"mevazor","ru":"фруктовый сад","ex":["The orchard is full of apples."],"u":"S06U06"},{"id":"lex.03015","w":"pasture","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpæstʃər","uz":"yaylov","ru":"пастбище","ex":["The cows are out in the pasture."],"u":"S06U06"},{"id":"lex.03016","w":"livestock","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈlaɪvstɑːk","uz":"chorva","ru":"скот","ex":["The livestock are kept inside in winter."],"u":"S06U06"},{"id":"lex.03017","w":"access","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈækses","uz":"kirish imkoni","ru":"доступ","ex":["The village has no access to the main road in winter."],"u":"S06U07"},{"id":"lex.03018","w":"unchanged","pos":"adj","ipa":"ʌnˈtʃeɪndʒd","uz":"o'zgarmagan","ru":"неизменный","ex":["The clause was left unchanged."],"u":"S06U07"},{"id":"lex.03019","w":"stumble","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈstʌmbəl","uz":"qoqilmoq","ru":"спотыкаться","ex":["He stumbled on the step and dropped the file."],"u":"S06U07"},{"id":"lex.03020","w":"attendee","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌætenˈdiː","uz":"ishtirokchi","ru":"участник","ex":["Every attendee gets a copy."],"u":"S06U07"},{"id":"lex.03021","w":"action","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈækʃən","uz":"chora, harakat","ru":"действие","ex":["What action will you take?"],"u":"S06U07"},{"id":"lex.03022","w":"consensus","pos":"noun","ipa":"kənˈsensəs","uz":"umumiy kelishuv","ru":"консенсус","ex":["We reached a consensus at last."],"u":"S06U07"},{"id":"lex.03023","w":"objection","pos":"noun","ipa":"əbˈdʒekʃən","uz":"e'tiroz","ru":"возражение","ex":["Are there any objections?"],"u":"S06U07"},{"id":"lex.03024","w":"proposal","pos":"noun","ipa":"prəˈpoʊzəl","uz":"taklif","ru":"предложение","ex":["The proposal was accepted."],"u":"S06U07"},{"id":"lex.03025","w":"motion","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmoʊʃən","uz":"taklif (ovoz berish uchun)","ru":"предложение на голосование","ex":["The motion was carried."],"u":"S06U07"},{"id":"lex.03026","w":"quorum","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkwɔːrəm","uz":"kvorum","ru":"кворум","ex":["We do not have a quorum."],"u":"S06U07"},{"id":"lex.03027","w":"attendance","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈtendəns","uz":"qatnashish","ru":"посещаемость","ex":["Attendance was poor."],"u":"S06U07"},{"id":"lex.03028","w":"amendment","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈmendmənt","uz":"tuzatish","ru":"поправка","ex":["One amendment was accepted."],"u":"S06U07"},{"id":"lex.03029","w":"adjourn","pos":"verb","ipa":"əˈdʒɜːrn","uz":"majlisni to'xtatmoq","ru":"объявить перерыв","ex":["The meeting was adjourned until Friday."],"u":"S06U07"},{"id":"lex.03030","w":"facilitator","pos":"noun","ipa":"fəˈsɪləteɪtər","uz":"yo'naltiruvchi","ru":"фасилитатор","ex":["The facilitator kept us to time."],"u":"S06U07"},{"id":"lex.03031","w":"participant","pos":"noun","ipa":"pɑːrˈtɪsəpənt","uz":"ishtirokchi","ru":"участник","ex":["Each participant introduced themselves."],"u":"S06U07"},{"id":"lex.03032","w":"contributor","pos":"noun","ipa":"kənˈtrɪbjətər","uz":"hissa qo'shuvchi","ru":"участник, автор","ex":["She was the main contributor."],"u":"S06U07"},{"id":"lex.03033","w":"observer","pos":"noun","ipa":"əbˈzɜːrvər","uz":"kuzatuvchi","ru":"наблюдатель","ex":["Two observers attended."],"u":"S06U07"},{"id":"lex.03034","w":"conference","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkɑːnfərəns","uz":"konferensiya","ru":"конференция","ex":["The conference lasts three days."],"u":"S06U07"},{"id":"lex.03035","w":"consultation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌkɑːnsəlˈteɪʃən","uz":"maslahatlashuv","ru":"консультация","ex":["The consultation closes in May."],"u":"S06U07"},{"id":"lex.03036","w":"productive","pos":"adj","ipa":"prəˈdʌktɪv","uz":"samarali","ru":"продуктивный","ex":["It was a productive meeting."],"u":"S06U07"},{"id":"lex.03037","w":"constructive","pos":"adj","ipa":"kənˈstrʌktɪv","uz":"qurilishga xizmat qiluvchi, foydali","ru":"конструктивный","ex":["That is constructive criticism."],"u":"S06U07"},{"id":"lex.03038","w":"attentive","pos":"adj","ipa":"əˈtentɪv","uz":"diqqatli","ru":"внимательный","ex":["The audience was attentive."],"u":"S06U07"},{"id":"lex.03039","w":"attend","pos":"verb","ipa":"əˈtend","uz":"qatnashmoq","ru":"посещать","ex":["Will you attend the meeting?"],"u":"S06U07"},{"id":"lex.03040","w":"convene","pos":"verb","ipa":"kənˈviːn","uz":"chaqirmoq (majlis)","ru":"созывать","ex":["The committee convenes monthly."],"u":"S06U07"},{"id":"lex.03041","w":"reconvene","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌriːkənˈviːn","uz":"qayta yig'ilmoq","ru":"возобновить заседание","ex":["We will reconvene at two."],"u":"S06U07"},{"id":"lex.03042","w":"circulate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈsɜːrkjuleɪt","uz":"tarqatmoq","ru":"распространять","ex":["Please circulate the agenda."],"u":"S06U07"},{"id":"lex.03043","w":"distribute","pos":"verb","ipa":"dɪˈstrɪbjuːt","uz":"tarqatmoq","ru":"распределять","ex":["Copies were distributed to everyone."],"u":"S06U07"},{"id":"lex.03044","w":"timekeeping","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtaɪmkiːpɪŋ","uz":"vaqtga rioya","ru":"пунктуальность","ex":["His timekeeping has improved."],"u":"S06U07"},{"id":"lex.03045","w":"boardroom","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈbɔːrdruːm","uz":"kengash xonasi","ru":"зал заседаний","ex":["The boardroom is on the top floor."],"u":"S06U07"},{"id":"lex.03046","w":"secretary","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsekrəteri","uz":"kotib","ru":"секретарь","ex":["The secretary takes the minutes."],"u":"S06U07"},{"id":"lex.03047","w":"treasurer","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtreʒərər","uz":"g'aznachi","ru":"казначей","ex":["The treasurer reported a surplus."],"u":"S06U07"},{"id":"lex.03048","w":"proxy","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈprɑːksi","uz":"vakil","ru":"доверенное лицо","ex":["He voted by proxy."],"u":"S06U07"},{"id":"lex.03049","w":"venue","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈvenjuː","uz":"o'tkaziladigan joy","ru":"место проведения","ex":["The venue has changed."],"u":"S06U07"},{"id":"lex.03050","w":"organiser","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɔːrɡənaɪzər","uz":"tashkilotchi","ru":"организатор","ex":["The organisers did a good job."],"u":"S06U07"},{"id":"lex.03051","w":"timekeeper","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtaɪmkiːpər","uz":"vaqtni kuzatuvchi","ru":"хронометрист","ex":["We need a timekeeper."],"u":"S06U07"},{"id":"lex.03052","w":"chairperson","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtʃerpɜːrsən","uz":"rais","ru":"председатель","ex":["The chairperson opened the meeting."],"u":"S06U07"},{"id":"lex.03053","w":"roundtable","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈraʊndteɪbəl","uz":"davra suhbati","ru":"круглый стол","ex":["There is a roundtable on Thursday."],"u":"S06U07"},{"id":"lex.03054","w":"panel","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpænəl","uz":"hay'at","ru":"панель, комиссия","ex":["A panel of three interviewed me."],"u":"S06U07"},{"id":"lex.03055","w":"session","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈseʃən","uz":"sessiya","ru":"сессия","ex":["The morning session was long."],"u":"S06U07"},{"id":"lex.03056","w":"slot","pos":"noun","ipa":"slɑːt","uz":"vaqt oralig'i","ru":"слот, промежуток","ex":["I have a slot at eleven."],"u":"S06U07"},{"id":"lex.03057","w":"subcommittee","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsʌbkəmɪti","uz":"quyi qo'mita","ru":"подкомитет","ex":["A subcommittee was set up."],"u":"S06U07"},{"id":"lex.03058","w":"taskforce","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtæskfɔːrs","uz":"ishchi guruh","ru":"рабочая группа","ex":["A taskforce was formed in March."],"u":"S06U07"},{"id":"lex.03059","w":"accuse","pos":"verb","ipa":"əˈkjuːz","uz":"ayblamoq","ru":"обвинять","ex":["He accused her of hiding the letter."],"u":"S06U07"},{"id":"lex.03060","w":"learner","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈlɜrnər","uz":"o'rganuvchi","ru":"учащийся","ex":["The book is written for learners."],"u":"S06U08"},{"id":"lex.03061","w":"carelessness","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkerləsnəs","uz":"beparvolik","ru":"небрежность","ex":["The error was carelessness, not bad faith."],"u":"S06U08"},{"id":"lex.03062","w":"adaptation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌædæpˈteɪʃən","uz":"moslashuv","ru":"адаптация","ex":["Adaptation takes time."],"u":"S06U08"},{"id":"lex.03063","w":"transition","pos":"noun","ipa":"trænˈzɪʃən","uz":"o'tish davri","ru":"переход","ex":["The transition was difficult."],"u":"S06U08"},{"id":"lex.03064","w":"relocation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌriːloʊˈkeɪʃən","uz":"ko'chib o'tish","ru":"переезд","ex":["The company paid for relocation."],"u":"S06U08"},{"id":"lex.03065","w":"commute","pos":"noun","ipa":"kəˈmjuːt","uz":"ishga qatnov","ru":"поездка на работу","ex":["My commute takes an hour."],"u":"S06U08"},{"id":"lex.03066","w":"homesickness","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈhoʊmsɪknəs","uz":"uy sog'inchi","ru":"тоска по дому","ex":["Homesickness passed after a month."],"u":"S06U08"},{"id":"lex.03067","w":"integration","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌɪntɪˈɡreɪʃən","uz":"jamiyatga qo'shilish","ru":"интеграция","ex":["Integration takes more than a language."],"u":"S06U08"},{"id":"lex.03068","w":"newcomer","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈnuːkʌmər","uz":"yangi kelgan","ru":"новичок","ex":["Newcomers are welcome."],"u":"S06U08"},{"id":"lex.03069","w":"expatriate","pos":"noun","ipa":"ekˈspeɪtriət","uz":"chet elda yashovchi","ru":"экспат","ex":["There is a small expatriate community."],"u":"S06U08"},{"id":"lex.03070","w":"migrant","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmaɪɡrənt","uz":"muhojir","ru":"мигрант","ex":["Migrants make up a tenth of the workforce."],"u":"S06U08"},{"id":"lex.03071","w":"assimilation","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˌsɪməˈleɪʃən","uz":"singib ketish","ru":"ассимиляция","ex":["Assimilation is not the same as integration."],"u":"S06U08"},{"id":"lex.03072","w":"identity","pos":"noun","ipa":"aɪˈdentəti","uz":"o'ziga xoslik","ru":"идентичность","ex":["She kept her cultural identity."],"u":"S06U08"},{"id":"lex.03073","w":"familiarity","pos":"noun","ipa":"fəˌmɪliˈærəti","uz":"tanishlik","ru":"знакомство","ex":["Familiarity came slowly."],"u":"S06U08"},{"id":"lex.03074","w":"unfamiliar","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌʌnfəˈmɪliər","uz":"notanish","ru":"незнакомый","ex":["Everything was unfamiliar at first."],"u":"S06U08"},{"id":"lex.03075","w":"strange","pos":"adj","ipa":"streɪndʒ","uz":"g'alati","ru":"странный","ex":["It felt strange at first."],"u":"S06U08"},{"id":"lex.03076","w":"alien","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈeɪliən","uz":"begona","ru":"чуждый","ex":["The customs felt alien to him."],"u":"S06U08"},{"id":"lex.03077","w":"overseas","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌoʊvərˈsiːz","uz":"chet eldagi","ru":"зарубежный","ex":["She has an overseas posting."],"u":"S06U08"},{"id":"lex.03078","w":"regional","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈriːdʒənəl","uz":"mintaqaviy","ru":"региональный","ex":["There are regional differences."],"u":"S06U08"},{"id":"lex.03079","w":"national","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈnæʃənəl","uz":"milliy","ru":"национальный","ex":["It made the national news."],"u":"S06U08"},{"id":"lex.03080","w":"international","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌɪntərˈnæʃənəl","uz":"xalqaro","ru":"международный","ex":["She works for an international firm."],"u":"S06U08"},{"id":"lex.03081","w":"global","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈɡloʊbəl","uz":"global","ru":"глобальный","ex":["It is a global problem."],"u":"S06U08"},{"id":"lex.03082","w":"multicultural","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌmʌltiˈkʌltʃərəl","uz":"ko'pmadaniyatli","ru":"мультикультурный","ex":["It is a multicultural city."],"u":"S06U08"},{"id":"lex.03083","w":"diverse","pos":"adj","ipa":"daɪˈvɜːrs","uz":"rang-barang","ru":"разнообразный","ex":["The team is very diverse."],"u":"S06U08"},{"id":"lex.03084","w":"minority","pos":"noun","ipa":"maɪˈnɔːrəti","uz":"ozchilik","ru":"меньшинство","ex":["Only a minority disagreed."],"u":"S06U08"},{"id":"lex.03085","w":"majority","pos":"noun","ipa":"məˈdʒɔːrəti","uz":"ko'pchilik","ru":"большинство","ex":["The majority voted in favour."],"u":"S06U08"},{"id":"lex.03086","w":"familiarise","pos":"verb","ipa":"fəˈmɪliəraɪz","uz":"tanishtirmoq","ru":"ознакомить","ex":["Familiarise yourself with the rules."],"u":"S06U08"},{"id":"lex.03087","w":"integrate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈɪntɪɡreɪt","uz":"qo'shilmoq, birlashtirmoq","ru":"интегрировать","ex":["They integrated quickly."],"u":"S06U08"},{"id":"lex.03088","w":"relocate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌriːloʊˈkeɪt","uz":"ko'chib o'tmoq","ru":"переезжать","ex":["The family relocated to Nukus."],"u":"S06U08"},{"id":"lex.03089","w":"reside","pos":"verb","ipa":"rɪˈzaɪd","uz":"yashamoq","ru":"проживать","ex":["He resides in Tashkent."],"u":"S06U08"},{"id":"lex.03090","w":"inhabit","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪnˈhæbɪt","uz":"yashamoq (hudud)","ru":"населять","ex":["Few people inhabit the valley."],"u":"S06U08"},{"id":"lex.03091","w":"dwell","pos":"verb","ipa":"dwel","uz":"istiqomat qilmoq","ru":"обитать","ex":["They dwell in the mountains."],"u":"S06U08"},{"id":"lex.03092","w":"adapt","pos":"verb","ipa":"əˈdæpt","uz":"moslashmoq","ru":"адаптироваться","ex":["Children adapt quickly."],"u":"S06U08"},{"id":"lex.03093","w":"etiquette","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈetɪkət","uz":"odob qoidalari","ru":"этикет","ex":["Office etiquette varies by country."],"u":"S06U08"},{"id":"lex.03094","w":"norms","pos":"noun","ipa":"nɔːrmz","uz":"me'yorlar","ru":"нормы","ex":["Social norms differ here."],"u":"S06U08"},{"id":"lex.03095","w":"outlook","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈaʊtlʊk","uz":"dunyoqarash","ru":"взгляды","ex":["She has a positive outlook."],"u":"S06U08"},{"id":"lex.03096","w":"mindset","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmaɪndset","uz":"fikrlash tarzi","ru":"мышление","ex":["It requires a different mindset."],"u":"S06U08"},{"id":"lex.03097","w":"residency","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈrezɪdənsi","uz":"yashash huquqi","ru":"вид на жительство","ex":["She applied for residency."],"u":"S06U08"},{"id":"lex.03098","w":"sponsor","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈspɑːnsər","uz":"homiy","ru":"спонсор","ex":["He needs a sponsor for the visa."],"u":"S06U08"},{"id":"lex.03099","w":"settler","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsetlər","uz":"ko'chib kelgan aholi","ru":"поселенец","ex":["The first settlers arrived in 1890."],"u":"S06U08"},{"id":"lex.03100","w":"homecoming","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈhoʊmkʌmɪŋ","uz":"vatanga qaytish","ru":"возвращение домой","ex":["It was an emotional homecoming."],"u":"S06U08"},{"id":"lex.03101","w":"whatever","pos":"pron","ipa":"wʌtˈevər","uz":"nima bo'lsa ham","ru":"что бы ни","ex":["Take whatever you need."],"u":"S06U09"},{"id":"lex.03102","w":"whoever","pos":"pron","ipa":"huːˈevər","uz":"kim bo'lsa ham","ru":"кто бы ни","ex":["Whoever wrote this knew the road well."],"u":"S06U09"},{"id":"lex.03103","w":"whichever","pos":"pron","ipa":"wɪtʃˈevər","uz":"qaysi biri bo'lsa ham","ru":"какой бы ни","ex":["Take whichever is nearest."],"u":"S06U09"},{"id":"lex.03104","w":"duplication","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌduːplɪˈkeɪʃən","uz":"takrorlanish","ru":"дублирование","ex":["There was a lot of duplication in the two reports."],"u":"S06U09"},{"id":"lex.03105","w":"bottleneck","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈbɑːtlnek","uz":"tirband joy","ru":"узкое место","ex":["The old printer is the bottleneck."],"u":"S06U09"},{"id":"lex.03106","w":"backlog","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈbæklɔːɡ","uz":"yig'ilib qolgan ish","ru":"накопившиеся дела","ex":["There is a backlog of forty orders."],"u":"S06U09"},{"id":"lex.03107","w":"streamline","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈstriːmlaɪn","uz":"soddalashtirmoq","ru":"оптимизировать","ex":["They streamlined the whole process."],"u":"S06U09"},{"id":"lex.03108","w":"automate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈɔːtəmeɪt","uz":"avtomatlashtirmoq","ru":"автоматизировать","ex":["The company automated the checks."],"u":"S06U09"},{"id":"lex.03109","w":"simplify","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈsɪmplɪfaɪ","uz":"soddalashtirmoq","ru":"упрощать","ex":["Please simplify the instructions."],"u":"S06U09"},{"id":"lex.03110","w":"reduce","pos":"verb","ipa":"rɪˈduːs","uz":"kamaytirmoq","ru":"сокращать","ex":["They reduced the price by half."],"u":"S06U09"},{"id":"lex.03111","w":"eliminate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪˈlɪmɪneɪt","uz":"yo'q qilmoq","ru":"устранять","ex":["The new system eliminates the paper forms."],"u":"S06U09"},{"id":"lex.03112","w":"prioritize","pos":"verb","ipa":"praɪˈɔːrətaɪz","uz":"ustuvorlik bermoq","ru":"расставлять приоритеты","ex":["You have to prioritize the urgent cases."],"u":"S06U09"},{"id":"lex.03113","w":"productivity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌproʊdʌkˈtɪvəti","uz":"unumdorlik","ru":"производительность","ex":["Productivity rose after the change."],"u":"S06U09"},{"id":"lex.03114","w":"capacity","pos":"noun","ipa":"kəˈpæsəti","uz":"sig'im, quvvat","ru":"вместимость","ex":["The hall has a capacity of three hundred."],"u":"S06U09"},{"id":"lex.03115","w":"margin","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmɑːrdʒɪn","uz":"farq, chekka","ru":"запас; поле","ex":["They won by a small margin."],"u":"S06U09"},{"id":"lex.03116","w":"surplus","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsɜːrpləs","uz":"ortiqcha qism","ru":"излишек","ex":["We have a surplus of chairs."],"u":"S06U09"},{"id":"lex.03117","w":"shortage","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈʃɔːrtɪdʒ","uz":"tanqislik","ru":"нехватка","ex":["There is a shortage of nurses."],"u":"S06U09"},{"id":"lex.03118","w":"allocate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈæləkeɪt","uz":"taqsimlamoq","ru":"выделять","ex":["They allocated two rooms to us."],"u":"S06U09"},{"id":"lex.03119","w":"allocation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌæləˈkeɪʃən","uz":"taqsimot","ru":"распределение","ex":["The allocation of seats was fair."],"u":"S06U09"},{"id":"lex.03120","w":"distribution","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌdɪstrɪˈbjuːʃən","uz":"tarqatish","ru":"распределение","ex":["The distribution of food began at noon."],"u":"S06U09"},{"id":"lex.03121","w":"logistics","pos":"noun","ipa":"ləˈdʒɪstɪks","uz":"logistika","ru":"логистика","ex":["The logistics of the move were difficult."],"u":"S06U09"},{"id":"lex.03122","w":"approach","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈproʊtʃ","uz":"yondashuv","ru":"подход","ex":["We tried a different approach."],"u":"S06U09"},{"id":"lex.03123","w":"tactic","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtæktɪk","uz":"taktika","ru":"тактика","ex":["That tactic did not work."],"u":"S06U09"},{"id":"lex.03124","w":"protocol","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈproʊtəkɔːl","uz":"tartib-qoida","ru":"протокол","ex":["Follow the safety protocol."],"u":"S06U09"},{"id":"lex.03125","w":"efficient","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪˈfɪʃənt","uz":"unumli, tejamkor","ru":"эффективный (экономный)","ex":["The new machine is more efficient."],"u":"S06U09"},{"id":"lex.03126","w":"inefficient","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌɪnɪˈfɪʃənt","uz":"unumsiz","ru":"неэффективный","ex":["The old system was inefficient."],"u":"S06U09"},{"id":"lex.03127","w":"effective","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪˈfektɪv","uz":"natija beruvchi","ru":"действенный","ex":["The medicine is very effective."],"u":"S06U09"},{"id":"lex.03128","w":"effectively","pos":"adv","ipa":"ɪˈfektɪvli","uz":"samarali tarzda","ru":"эффективно","ex":["He dealt with it effectively."],"u":"S06U09"},{"id":"lex.03129","w":"economical","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌekəˈnɑːmɪkəl","uz":"tejamkor","ru":"экономичный","ex":["A small car is more economical."],"u":"S06U09"},{"id":"lex.03130","w":"optimize","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈɑːptɪmaɪz","uz":"eng yaxshi holatga keltirmoq","ru":"оптимизировать","ex":["They optimized the delivery route."],"u":"S06U09"},{"id":"lex.03131","w":"maximize","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈmæksɪmaɪz","uz":"maksimal darajaga yetkazmoq","ru":"максимизировать","ex":["They want to maximize the profit."],"u":"S06U09"},{"id":"lex.03132","w":"minimize","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈmɪnɪmaɪz","uz":"eng kam darajaga tushirmoq","ru":"минимизировать","ex":["We must minimize the risk."],"u":"S06U09"},{"id":"lex.03133","w":"conserve","pos":"verb","ipa":"kənˈsɜːrv","uz":"tejamoq, asramoq","ru":"сберегать","ex":["Turn the lights off to conserve energy."],"u":"S06U09"},{"id":"lex.03134","w":"consume","pos":"verb","ipa":"kənˈsuːm","uz":"iste'mol qilmoq","ru":"потреблять","ex":["The old heater consumes a lot of power."],"u":"S06U09"},{"id":"lex.03135","w":"downtime","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdaʊntaɪm","uz":"to'xtab qolgan vaqt","ru":"простой","ex":["The downtime cost them a day."],"u":"S06U09"},{"id":"lex.03136","w":"understaffed","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌʌndərˈstæft","uz":"xodimlari yetishmaydigan","ru":"недоукомплектованный","ex":["The hospital is understaffed."],"u":"S06U09"},{"id":"lex.03137","w":"machinery","pos":"noun","ipa":"məˈʃiːnəri","uz":"mashina-uskunalar","ru":"оборудование","ex":["The machinery is checked every month."],"u":"S06U09"},{"id":"lex.03138","w":"unnecessary","pos":"adj","ipa":"ʌnˈnesəseri","uz":"keraksiz","ru":"ненужный","ex":["That was an unnecessary trip."],"u":"S06U09"},{"id":"lex.03139","w":"pointless","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈpɔɪntləs","uz":"befoyda","ru":"бессмысленный","ex":["It is pointless to argue with him."],"u":"S06U09"},{"id":"lex.03140","w":"hassle","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈhæsəl","uz":"ovora bo'lish","ru":"морока","ex":["Getting the visa was a real hassle."],"u":"S06U09"},{"id":"lex.03141","w":"part","pos":"noun","ipa":"pɑːrt","uz":"qism","ru":"часть","ex":["This part of the town is quiet."],"u":"S06U09"},{"id":"lex.03142","w":"life","pos":"noun","ipa":"laɪf","uz":"hayot","ru":"жизнь","ex":["City life is not for everyone."],"u":"S06U09"},{"id":"lex.03143","w":"skip","pos":"verb","ipa":"skɪp","uz":"tashlab ketmoq","ru":"пропускать","ex":["Skip the first two pages."],"u":"S06U10"},{"id":"lex.03144","w":"accusation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌækjəˈzeɪʃən","uz":"ayblov","ru":"обвинение","ex":["The accusation was never put in writing."],"u":"S06U10"},{"id":"lex.03145","w":"peak","pos":"noun","ipa":"piːk","uz":"eng yuqori nuqta","ru":"пик","ex":["Sales reached a peak in June."],"u":"S06U10"},{"id":"lex.03146","w":"plateau","pos":"noun","ipa":"plæˈtoʊ","uz":"barqaror daraja","ru":"плато","ex":["Prices reached a plateau in March."],"u":"S06U10"},{"id":"lex.03147","w":"fluctuation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌflʌktʃuˈeɪʃən","uz":"o'zgarib turish","ru":"колебание","ex":["There were small fluctuations all year."],"u":"S06U10"},{"id":"lex.03148","w":"proportion","pos":"noun","ipa":"prəˈpɔːrʃən","uz":"ulush, nisbat","ru":"доля","ex":["A large proportion of students work."],"u":"S06U10"},{"id":"lex.03149","w":"ratio","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈreɪʃioʊ","uz":"nisbat","ru":"соотношение","ex":["The ratio is two to one."],"u":"S06U10"},{"id":"lex.03150","w":"statistic","pos":"noun","ipa":"stəˈtɪstɪk","uz":"statistik ko'rsatkich","ru":"статистический показатель","ex":["That statistic surprised everyone."],"u":"S06U10"},{"id":"lex.03151","w":"indicator","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɪndɪkeɪtər","uz":"ko'rsatkich","ru":"показатель","ex":["Income is one indicator of health."],"u":"S06U10"},{"id":"lex.03152","w":"correlation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌkɔːrəˈleɪʃən","uz":"bog'liqlik","ru":"связь, корреляция","ex":["There is a clear correlation between the two."],"u":"S06U10"},{"id":"lex.03153","w":"rise","pos":"verb","ipa":"raɪz","uz":"ko'tarilmoq","ru":"расти","ex":["Prices rose again last month."],"u":"S06U10"},{"id":"lex.03154","w":"halve","pos":"verb","ipa":"hæv","uz":"ikki baravar kamaytirmoq","ru":"уменьшать вдвое","ex":["They halved the price."],"u":"S06U10"},{"id":"lex.03155","w":"triple","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈtrɪpəl","uz":"uch baravar oshmoq","ru":"утраивать","ex":["The number of users has tripled."],"u":"S06U10"},{"id":"lex.03156","w":"exceed","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪkˈsiːd","uz":"oshib ketmoq","ru":"превышать","ex":["The cost exceeded our budget."],"u":"S06U10"},{"id":"lex.03157","w":"reach","pos":"verb","ipa":"riːtʃ","uz":"yetib bormoq","ru":"достигать","ex":["Sales reached a record in May."],"u":"S06U10"},{"id":"lex.03158","w":"measurable","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈmeʒərəbəl","uz":"o'lchash mumkin bo'lgan","ru":"измеримый","ex":["There was a measurable improvement."],"u":"S06U10"},{"id":"lex.03159","w":"comparable","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈkɑːmpərəbəl","uz":"taqqoslash mumkin bo'lgan","ru":"сопоставимый","ex":["The two towns are comparable in size."],"u":"S06U10"},{"id":"lex.03160","w":"considerable","pos":"adj","ipa":"kənˈsɪdərəbəl","uz":"sezilarli","ru":"значительный","ex":["It took a considerable amount of time."],"u":"S06U10"},{"id":"lex.03161","w":"considerably","pos":"adv","ipa":"kənˈsɪdərəbli","uz":"ancha","ru":"значительно","ex":["Prices have risen considerably."],"u":"S06U10"},{"id":"lex.03162","w":"significant","pos":"adj","ipa":"sɪɡˈnɪfɪkənt","uz":"muhim, sezilarli","ru":"значительный","ex":["There was a significant change in July."],"u":"S06U10"},{"id":"lex.03163","w":"significantly","pos":"adv","ipa":"sɪɡˈnɪfɪkəntli","uz":"sezilarli darajada","ru":"значительно","ex":["Costs fell significantly."],"u":"S06U10"},{"id":"lex.03164","w":"axis","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈæksɪs","uz":"o'q (grafikda)","ru":"ось","ex":["Time is shown on the bottom axis."],"u":"S06U10"},{"id":"lex.03165","w":"scale","pos":"noun","ipa":"skeɪl","uz":"miqyos, shkala","ru":"масштаб; шкала","ex":["The scale goes from one to ten."],"u":"S06U10"},{"id":"lex.03166","w":"interval","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɪntərvəl","uz":"oraliq","ru":"интервал","ex":["Take the medicine at four-hour intervals."],"u":"S06U10"},{"id":"lex.03167","w":"frequency","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfriːkwənsi","uz":"takrorlanish darajasi","ru":"частота","ex":["The frequency of the buses has fallen."],"u":"S06U10"},{"id":"lex.03168","w":"range","pos":"noun","ipa":"reɪndʒ","uz":"diapazon, tanlov","ru":"диапазон","ex":["The shop has a wide range of shoes."],"u":"S06U10"},{"id":"lex.03169","w":"span","pos":"noun","ipa":"spæn","uz":"davomiylik oralig'i","ru":"промежуток","ex":["It happened over a span of ten years."],"u":"S06U10"},{"id":"lex.03170","w":"upward","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈʌpwərd","uz":"yuqoriga qarab","ru":"вверх","ex":["The line moved upward all year."],"u":"S06U10"},{"id":"lex.03171","w":"downward","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈdaʊnwərd","uz":"pastga qarab","ru":"вниз","ex":["The curve turned downward in April."],"u":"S06U10"},{"id":"lex.03172","w":"sharp","pos":"adj","ipa":"ʃɑːrp","uz":"keskin","ru":"резкий","ex":["There was a sharp fall in May."],"u":"S06U10"},{"id":"lex.03173","w":"slight","pos":"adj","ipa":"slaɪt","uz":"ozgina","ru":"незначительный","ex":["There was a slight rise in June."],"u":"S06U10"},{"id":"lex.03174","w":"marginal","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈmɑːrdʒɪnəl","uz":"juda kichik","ru":"незначительный","ex":["The gain was marginal."],"u":"S06U10"},{"id":"lex.03175","w":"annual","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈænjuəl","uz":"yillik","ru":"ежегодный","ex":["The annual report comes out in March."],"u":"S06U10"},{"id":"lex.03176","w":"net","pos":"adj","ipa":"net","uz":"sof (soliqdan keyin)","ru":"чистый (нетто)","ex":["Her net pay is lower than that."],"u":"S06U10"},{"id":"lex.03177","w":"gross","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɡroʊs","uz":"yalpi (soliqgacha)","ru":"валовой (брутто)","ex":["The gross figure is before tax."],"u":"S06U10"},{"id":"lex.03178","w":"downturn","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdaʊntɜːrn","uz":"pasayish davri","ru":"спад","ex":["The downturn began two years ago."],"u":"S06U10"},{"id":"lex.03179","w":"slump","pos":"noun","ipa":"slʌmp","uz":"keskin pasayish","ru":"резкий спад","ex":["There was a slump in house prices."],"u":"S06U10"},{"id":"lex.03180","w":"boom","pos":"noun","ipa":"buːm","uz":"keskin o'sish","ru":"бум","ex":["The building boom ended in 2019."],"u":"S06U10"},{"id":"lex.03181","w":"overall","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˌoʊvərˈɔːl","uz":"umuman olganda","ru":"в целом","ex":["Overall, the year was good."],"u":"S06U10"},{"id":"lex.03182","w":"altogether","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˌɔːltəˈɡeðər","uz":"jami; butunlay","ru":"в общей сложности","ex":["That comes to fifty altogether."],"u":"S06U10"},{"id":"lex.03183","w":"roughly","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈrʌfli","uz":"taxminan","ru":"примерно","ex":["It costs roughly thirty pounds."],"u":"S06U10"},{"id":"lex.03184","w":"approximately","pos":"adv","ipa":"əˈprɑːksɪmətli","uz":"taxminan","ru":"приблизительно","ex":["The trip takes approximately two hours."],"u":"S06U10"},{"id":"lex.03185","w":"real","pos":"adj","ipa":"riːl","uz":"haqiqiy","ru":"настоящий","ex":["Is that a real diamond?"],"u":"S06U10"},{"id":"lex.03186","w":"main","pos":"adj","ipa":"meɪn","uz":"asosiy","ru":"главный","ex":["The main road is closed."],"u":"S06U10"},{"id":"lex.03187","w":"defence","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˈfens","uz":"himoya","ru":"защита","ex":["He offered no defence at all."],"u":"S06U11"},{"id":"lex.03188","w":"focus","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈfoʊkəs","uz":"diqqatni qaratmoq","ru":"сосредоточиться","ex":["Let us focus on the first problem."],"u":"S06U11"},{"id":"lex.03189","w":"underline","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌʌndərˈlaɪn","uz":"tagiga chizmoq; ta'kidlamoq","ru":"подчёркивать","ex":["Underline the key word."],"u":"S06U11"},{"id":"lex.03190","w":"highlight","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈhaɪlaɪt","uz":"ajratib ko'rsatmoq","ru":"выделять","ex":["The report highlights three problems."],"u":"S06U11"},{"id":"lex.03191","w":"downplay","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌdaʊnˈpleɪ","uz":"ahamiyatini kamaytirmoq","ru":"преуменьшать","ex":["He downplayed the cost."],"u":"S06U11"},{"id":"lex.03192","w":"exaggerate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪɡˈzædʒəreɪt","uz":"bo'rttirmoq","ru":"преувеличивать","ex":["He always exaggerates."],"u":"S06U11"},{"id":"lex.03193","w":"assertion","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈsɜːrʃən","uz":"qat'iy da'vo","ru":"утверждение","ex":["That assertion needs evidence."],"u":"S06U11"},{"id":"lex.03194","w":"precisely","pos":"adv","ipa":"prɪˈsaɪsli","uz":"aniq","ru":"точно","ex":["Tell me precisely what she said."],"u":"S06U11"},{"id":"lex.03195","w":"accurately","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈækjərətli","uz":"to'g'ri, xatosiz","ru":"точно","ex":["The clock keeps time accurately."],"u":"S06U11"},{"id":"lex.03196","w":"reinforce","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌriːɪnˈfɔːrs","uz":"mustahkamlamoq","ru":"подкреплять","ex":["The figures reinforce her argument."],"u":"S06U11"},{"id":"lex.03197","w":"illustrate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈɪləstreɪt","uz":"misol bilan ko'rsatmoq","ru":"иллюстрировать","ex":["Let me illustrate that with an example."],"u":"S06U11"},{"id":"lex.03198","w":"demonstrate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈdemənstreɪt","uz":"isbotlab ko'rsatmoq","ru":"демонстрировать","ex":["The test demonstrates that it is safe."],"u":"S06U11"},{"id":"lex.03199","w":"suggestion","pos":"noun","ipa":"səˈdʒestʃən","uz":"taklif","ru":"предложение","ex":["That is a useful suggestion."],"u":"S06U11"},{"id":"lex.03200","w":"paraphrase","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈpærəfreɪz","uz":"boshqa so'zlar bilan aytmoq","ru":"перефразировать","ex":["Paraphrase the sentence in your own words."],"u":"S06U11"},{"id":"lex.03201","w":"core","pos":"noun","ipa":"kɔːr","uz":"asosiy qism, o'zak","ru":"суть, ядро","ex":["That is the core of the problem."],"u":"S06U11"},{"id":"lex.03202","w":"emphasize","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈemfəsaɪz","uz":"ta'kidlamoq","ru":"подчёркивать","ex":["She emphasized the word 'never'."],"u":"S06U11"},{"id":"lex.03203","w":"deliberately","pos":"adv","ipa":"dɪˈlɪbərətli","uz":"ataylab","ru":"намеренно","ex":["He did it deliberately."],"u":"S06U11"},{"id":"lex.03204","w":"intentionally","pos":"adv","ipa":"ɪnˈtenʃənəli","uz":"qasddan","ru":"умышленно","ex":["I did not do it intentionally."],"u":"S06U11"},{"id":"lex.03205","w":"namely","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈneɪmli","uz":"ya'ni","ru":"а именно","ex":["One thing is missing, namely the date."],"u":"S06U11"},{"id":"lex.03206","w":"specifically","pos":"adv","ipa":"spəˈsɪfɪkli","uz":"aynan","ru":"конкретно","ex":["I asked specifically for a window seat."],"u":"S06U11"},{"id":"lex.03207","w":"mainly","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈmeɪnli","uz":"asosan","ru":"главным образом","ex":["The class is mainly women."],"u":"S06U11"},{"id":"lex.03208","w":"largely","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈlɑːrdʒli","uz":"asosan, ko'p jihatdan","ru":"в значительной степени","ex":["The plan was largely successful."],"u":"S06U11"},{"id":"lex.03209","w":"partly","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈpɑːrtli","uz":"qisman","ru":"отчасти","ex":["It is partly my fault."],"u":"S06U11"},{"id":"lex.03210","w":"entirely","pos":"adv","ipa":"ɪnˈtaɪərli","uz":"butunlay","ru":"полностью","ex":["That is entirely up to you."],"u":"S06U11"},{"id":"lex.03211","w":"absolutely","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˌæbsəˈluːtli","uz":"mutlaqo","ru":"абсолютно","ex":["You are absolutely right."],"u":"S06U11"},{"id":"lex.03212","w":"indeed","pos":"adv","ipa":"ɪnˈdiːd","uz":"haqiqatan ham","ru":"действительно","ex":["It was indeed a long day."],"u":"S06U11"},{"id":"lex.03213","w":"frankly","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈfræŋkli","uz":"ochig'ini aytganda","ru":"откровенно говоря","ex":["Frankly, I do not agree."],"u":"S06U11"},{"id":"lex.03214","w":"honestly","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈɑːnɪstli","uz":"rostini aytsam","ru":"честно говоря","ex":["Honestly, I had forgotten."],"u":"S06U11"},{"id":"lex.03215","w":"personally","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈpɜːrsənəli","uz":"shaxsan men","ru":"лично","ex":["Personally, I prefer the train."],"u":"S06U11"},{"id":"lex.03216","w":"diagnosis","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌdaɪəɡˈnoʊsɪs","uz":"tashxis","ru":"диагноз","ex":["The diagnosis took two weeks."],"u":"S06U11"},{"id":"lex.03217","w":"outbreak","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈaʊtbreɪk","uz":"kasallik avj olishi","ru":"вспышка","ex":["There was an outbreak of flu."],"u":"S06U11"},{"id":"lex.03218","w":"epidemic","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌepɪˈdemɪk","uz":"epidemiya","ru":"эпидемия","ex":["The epidemic lasted a year."],"u":"S06U11"},{"id":"lex.03219","w":"vaccine","pos":"noun","ipa":"vækˈsiːn","uz":"vaksina","ru":"вакцина","ex":["The vaccine is free for children."],"u":"S06U11"},{"id":"lex.03220","w":"hygiene","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈhaɪdʒiːn","uz":"gigiyena","ru":"гигиена","ex":["Hygiene is important in a kitchen."],"u":"S06U11"},{"id":"lex.03221","w":"sanitation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌsænɪˈteɪʃən","uz":"sanitariya","ru":"санитария","ex":["Sanitation has improved in the village."],"u":"S06U11"},{"id":"lex.03222","w":"simple","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈsɪmpəl","uz":"oddiy","ru":"простой","ex":["The answer is simple."],"u":"S06U11"},{"id":"lex.03223","w":"though","pos":"conj","ipa":"ðoʊ","uz":"garchi; lekin","ru":"хотя","ex":["It was cold, though the sun was out."],"u":"S06U11"},{"id":"lex.03224","w":"bare","pos":"adj","ipa":"ber","uz":"yalang'och, quruq","ru":"голый, пустой","ex":["The walls were bare and the room was cold."],"u":"S06U12"},{"id":"lex.03225","w":"accelerate","pos":"verb","ipa":"əkˈseləreɪt","uz":"tezlashtirmoq","ru":"ускорять","ex":["The plan accelerated after the meeting."],"u":"S06U12"},{"id":"lex.03226","w":"overlap","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌoʊvərˈlæp","uz":"ustma-ust tushmoq","ru":"накладываться","ex":["The two meetings overlap."],"u":"S06U12"},{"id":"lex.03227","w":"simultaneous","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌsaɪməlˈteɪniəs","uz":"bir vaqtda bo'ladigan","ru":"одновременный","ex":["There was simultaneous translation."],"u":"S06U12"},{"id":"lex.03228","w":"simultaneously","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˌsaɪməlˈteɪniəsli","uz":"bir vaqtning o'zida","ru":"одновременно","ex":["Both phones rang simultaneously."],"u":"S06U12"},{"id":"lex.03229","w":"consecutive","pos":"adj","ipa":"kənˈsekjətɪv","uz":"ketma-ket","ru":"подряд идущий","ex":["It rained for five consecutive days."],"u":"S06U12"},{"id":"lex.03230","w":"punctual","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈpʌŋktʃuəl","uz":"vaqtida keladigan","ru":"пунктуальный","ex":["He is always punctual."],"u":"S06U12"},{"id":"lex.03231","w":"punctually","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈpʌŋktʃuəli","uz":"aniq vaqtida","ru":"точно в срок","ex":["The train left punctually at six."],"u":"S06U12"},{"id":"lex.03232","w":"timely","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈtaɪmli","uz":"o'z vaqtidagi","ru":"своевременный","ex":["Thank you for your timely warning."],"u":"S06U12"},{"id":"lex.03233","w":"immediate","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪˈmiːdiət","uz":"darhol bo'ladigan","ru":"немедленный","ex":["We need an immediate answer."],"u":"S06U12"},{"id":"lex.03234","w":"occasionally","pos":"adv","ipa":"əˈkeɪʒənəli","uz":"ba'zan","ru":"иногда","ex":["We occasionally eat out."],"u":"S06U12"},{"id":"lex.03235","w":"subsequently","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈsʌbsɪkwəntli","uz":"keyinchalik","ru":"впоследствии","ex":["He subsequently changed his mind."],"u":"S06U12"},{"id":"lex.03236","w":"formerly","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈfɔːrmərli","uz":"ilgari","ru":"ранее","ex":["The building was formerly a school."],"u":"S06U12"},{"id":"lex.03237","w":"currently","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈkɜːrəntli","uz":"hozirda","ru":"в настоящее время","ex":["He is currently living abroad."],"u":"S06U12"},{"id":"lex.03238","w":"tentative","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈtentətɪv","uz":"dastlabki, aniq bo'lmagan","ru":"предварительный","ex":["We have a tentative date for June."],"u":"S06U12"},{"id":"lex.03239","w":"final","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈfaɪnəl","uz":"oxirgi, qat'iy","ru":"окончательный","ex":["That is my final answer."],"u":"S06U12"},{"id":"lex.03240","w":"postponement","pos":"noun","ipa":"poʊstˈpoʊnmənt","uz":"keyinga surish","ru":"отсрочка","ex":["The postponement was announced on Monday."],"u":"S06U12"},{"id":"lex.03241","w":"promptly","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈprɑːmptli","uz":"darhol","ru":"незамедлительно","ex":["She replied promptly."],"u":"S06U12"},{"id":"lex.03242","w":"shortly","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈʃɔːrtli","uz":"tez orada","ru":"вскоре","ex":["The doctor will see you shortly."],"u":"S06U12"},{"id":"lex.03243","w":"fortnight","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfɔːrtnaɪt","uz":"ikki hafta","ru":"две недели","ex":["We stayed for a fortnight."],"u":"S06U12"},{"id":"lex.03244","w":"duration","pos":"noun","ipa":"dʊˈreɪʃən","uz":"davomiylik","ru":"продолжительность","ex":["The duration of the course is ten weeks."],"u":"S06U12"},{"id":"lex.03245","w":"periodically","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˌpɪriˈɑːdɪkli","uz":"vaqti-vaqti bilan","ru":"периодически","ex":["The machine is checked periodically."],"u":"S06U12"},{"id":"lex.03246","w":"routinely","pos":"adv","ipa":"ruːˈtiːnli","uz":"odatdagidek muntazam","ru":"регулярно","ex":["Bags are routinely checked here."],"u":"S06U12"},{"id":"lex.03247","w":"continually","pos":"adv","ipa":"kənˈtɪnjuəli","uz":"doimiy ravishda","ru":"постоянно","ex":["The phone rang continually all morning."],"u":"S06U12"},{"id":"lex.03248","w":"briefly","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈbriːfli","uz":"qisqacha","ru":"кратко","ex":["She spoke briefly about the plan."],"u":"S06U12"},{"id":"lex.03249","w":"overdue","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌoʊvərˈduː","uz":"muddati o'tgan","ru":"просроченный","ex":["The payment is two weeks overdue."],"u":"S06U12"},{"id":"lex.03250","w":"harvest","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈhɑːrvɪst","uz":"hosil","ru":"урожай","ex":["The harvest was good this year."],"u":"S06U12"},{"id":"lex.03251","w":"sow","pos":"verb","ipa":"soʊ","uz":"urug' ekmoq","ru":"сеять","ex":["They sow wheat in the autumn."],"u":"S06U12"},{"id":"lex.03252","w":"irrigation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌɪrɪˈɡeɪʃən","uz":"sug'orish","ru":"орошение","ex":["Irrigation brought water to the fields."],"u":"S06U12"},{"id":"lex.03253","w":"fertilizer","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfɜːrtəlaɪzər","uz":"o'g'it","ru":"удобрение","ex":["They put fertilizer on the field."],"u":"S06U12"},{"id":"lex.03254","w":"ahead","pos":"adv","ipa":"əˈhed","uz":"oldinda, oldinga","ru":"впереди","ex":["We are two days ahead of the plan."],"u":"S06U12"},{"id":"lex.03255","w":"ultimately","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈʌltɪmətli","uz":"oxir-oqibat","ru":"в конечном счёте","ex":["Ultimately, it is your decision."],"u":"S06U12"},{"id":"lex.03256","w":"typically","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈtɪpɪkli","uz":"odatda","ru":"обычно","ex":["The journey typically takes an hour."],"u":"S06U12"},{"id":"lex.03257","w":"generally","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈdʒenərəli","uz":"umuman","ru":"в целом","ex":["Generally, the food here is good."],"u":"S06U12"},{"id":"lex.03258","w":"general","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈdʒenərəl","uz":"umumiy","ru":"общий","ex":["The general feeling was positive."],"u":"S06U12"},{"id":"lex.03259","w":"normal","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈnɔːrməl","uz":"oddiy, me'yordagi","ru":"нормальный","ex":["That is quite normal here."],"u":"S06U12"},{"id":"lex.03260","w":"plenty","pos":"det","ipa":"ˈplenti","uz":"yetarlicha ko'p","ru":"много, вдоволь","ex":["There is plenty of time."],"u":"S06U12"},{"id":"lex.03261","w":"counterargument","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkaʊntərˌɑːrɡjəmənt","uz":"qarshi dalil","ru":"контраргумент","ex":["She had a strong counterargument."],"u":"S06U13"},{"id":"lex.03262","w":"statistical","pos":"adj","ipa":"stəˈtɪstɪkəl","uz":"statistik","ru":"статистический","ex":["The report gives statistical evidence."],"u":"S06U13"},{"id":"lex.03263","w":"theoretical","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌθiːəˈretɪkəl","uz":"nazariy","ru":"теоретический","ex":["That is a theoretical problem, not a real one."],"u":"S06U13"},{"id":"lex.03264","w":"hypothetical","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌhaɪpəˈθetɪkəl","uz":"faraziy","ru":"гипотетический","ex":["Let me give a hypothetical example."],"u":"S06U13"},{"id":"lex.03265","w":"hypothesis","pos":"noun","ipa":"haɪˈpɑːθəsɪs","uz":"faraz","ru":"гипотеза","ex":["Her hypothesis turned out to be right."],"u":"S06U13"},{"id":"lex.03266","w":"factual","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈfæktʃuəl","uz":"faktlarga asoslangan","ru":"фактический","ex":["The report is factual and short."],"u":"S06U13"},{"id":"lex.03267","w":"arguable","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈɑːrɡjuəbəl","uz":"bahsli","ru":"спорный","ex":["That point is arguable."],"u":"S06U13"},{"id":"lex.03268","w":"arguably","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈɑːrɡjuəbli","uz":"ehtimol, aytish mumkinki","ru":"пожалуй","ex":["This is arguably the best answer."],"u":"S06U13"},{"id":"lex.03269","w":"conclusive","pos":"adj","ipa":"kənˈkluːsɪv","uz":"yakuniy, ishonarli","ru":"убедительный","ex":["The evidence is not conclusive."],"u":"S06U13"},{"id":"lex.03270","w":"convincingly","pos":"adv","ipa":"kənˈvɪnsɪŋli","uz":"ishonarli tarzda","ru":"убедительно","ex":["She argued convincingly."],"u":"S06U13"},{"id":"lex.03271","w":"contradict","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌkɑːntrəˈdɪkt","uz":"zid bo'lmoq","ru":"противоречить","ex":["The two reports contradict each other."],"u":"S06U13"},{"id":"lex.03272","w":"validate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈvælɪdeɪt","uz":"tasdiqlamoq","ru":"подтверждать","ex":["The results validate her hypothesis."],"u":"S06U13"},{"id":"lex.03273","w":"foundation","pos":"noun","ipa":"faʊnˈdeɪʃən","uz":"asos, poydevor","ru":"основа","ex":["The argument has no foundation."],"u":"S06U13"},{"id":"lex.03274","w":"examination","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪɡˌzæmɪˈneɪʃən","uz":"tekshiruv","ru":"осмотр, изучение","ex":["A close examination showed the fault."],"u":"S06U13"},{"id":"lex.03275","w":"inspection","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪnˈspekʃən","uz":"nazorat ko'rigi","ru":"проверка","ex":["The inspection is on Monday."],"u":"S06U13"},{"id":"lex.03276","w":"analysis","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈnæləsɪs","uz":"tahlil","ru":"анализ","ex":["Her analysis was careful."],"u":"S06U13"},{"id":"lex.03277","w":"audit","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɔːdɪt","uz":"moliyaviy tekshiruv","ru":"аудит","ex":["The audit found nothing wrong."],"u":"S06U13"},{"id":"lex.03278","w":"query","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkwɪri","uz":"so'rov, savol","ru":"запрос","ex":["I have one query about the bill."],"u":"S06U13"},{"id":"lex.03279","w":"deduction","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˈdʌkʃən","uz":"mantiqiy xulosa","ru":"вывод","ex":["That was a clever deduction."],"u":"S06U13"},{"id":"lex.03280","w":"flaw","pos":"noun","ipa":"flɔː","uz":"kamchilik, nuqson","ru":"изъян","ex":["There is one flaw in the argument."],"u":"S06U13"},{"id":"lex.03281","w":"custody","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkʌstədi","uz":"qamoqda saqlash; vasiylik","ru":"заключение; опека","ex":["He was held in custody for a day."],"u":"S06U13"},{"id":"lex.03282","w":"ward","pos":"noun","ipa":"wɔːrd","uz":"kasalxona bo'limi","ru":"палата","ex":["She works on the children's ward."],"u":"S06U13"},{"id":"lex.03283","w":"jury","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdʒʊri","uz":"hakamlar hay'ati","ru":"присяжные","ex":["The jury heard all the evidence."],"u":"S06U13"},{"id":"lex.03284","w":"regardless","pos":"adv","ipa":"rɪˈɡɑːrdləs","uz":"qaramasdan","ru":"несмотря ни на что","ex":["He went out regardless of the rain."],"u":"S06U13"},{"id":"lex.03285","w":"nonetheless","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˌnʌnðəˈles","uz":"shunga qaramay","ru":"тем не менее","ex":["It was late; nonetheless, we started."],"u":"S06U13"},{"id":"lex.03286","w":"likewise","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈlaɪkwaɪz","uz":"xuddi shunday","ru":"точно так же","ex":["The staff agreed; the students likewise."],"u":"S06U13"},{"id":"lex.03287","w":"conversely","pos":"adv","ipa":"kənˈvɜːrsli","uz":"aksincha","ru":"наоборот","ex":["Small towns are cheap; conversely, jobs are few."],"u":"S06U13"},{"id":"lex.03288","w":"on the contrary","pos":"phrase","ipa":"ɑːn ðə ˈkɑːntreri","uz":"aksincha","ru":"напротив","ex":["It was not boring; on the contrary, I loved it."],"u":"S06U13"},{"id":"lex.03289","w":"obviously","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈɑːbviəsli","uz":"ko'rinib turibdiki","ru":"очевидно","ex":["Obviously, we cannot pay that."],"u":"S06U13"},{"id":"lex.03290","w":"essentially","pos":"adv","ipa":"ɪˈsenʃəli","uz":"mohiyatan","ru":"по сути","ex":["The two plans are essentially the same."],"u":"S06U13"},{"id":"lex.03291","w":"basically","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈbeɪsɪkli","uz":"asosan, qisqasi","ru":"в основном","ex":["Basically, we ran out of time."],"u":"S06U13"},{"id":"lex.03292","w":"primarily","pos":"adv","ipa":"praɪˈmerəli","uz":"birinchi navbatda","ru":"прежде всего","ex":["The course is primarily for beginners."],"u":"S06U13"},{"id":"lex.03293","w":"intern","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɪntɜːrn","uz":"amaliyotchi","ru":"стажёр","ex":["The intern stayed for three months."],"u":"S06U13"},{"id":"lex.03294","w":"exhaust","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪɡˈzɔst","uz":"tugatmoq, holdan toydirmoq","ru":"исчерпывать, изматывать","ex":["The fund was exhausted by August."],"u":"S06U14"},{"id":"lex.03295","w":"ministry","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmɪnɪstri","uz":"vazirlik","ru":"министерство","ex":["She works at the Ministry of Health."],"u":"S06U14"},{"id":"lex.03296","w":"agency","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈeɪdʒənsi","uz":"agentlik","ru":"агентство","ex":["A travel agency booked the flights."],"u":"S06U14"},{"id":"lex.03297","w":"committee","pos":"noun","ipa":"kəˈmɪti","uz":"qo'mita","ru":"комитет","ex":["The committee meets on Fridays."],"u":"S06U14"},{"id":"lex.03298","w":"board","pos":"noun","ipa":"bɔːrd","uz":"kengash","ru":"совет (директоров)","ex":["The board approved the plan."],"u":"S06U14"},{"id":"lex.03299","w":"legislation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌledʒɪsˈleɪʃən","uz":"qonunchilik","ru":"законодательство","ex":["New legislation came in last year."],"u":"S06U14"},{"id":"lex.03300","w":"accountability","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˌkaʊntəˈbɪləti","uz":"javobgarlik","ru":"подотчётность","ex":["There is little accountability here."],"u":"S06U14"},{"id":"lex.03301","w":"transparency","pos":"noun","ipa":"trænsˈperənsi","uz":"shaffoflik","ru":"прозрачность","ex":["They promised greater transparency."],"u":"S06U14"},{"id":"lex.03302","w":"corruption","pos":"noun","ipa":"kəˈrʌpʃən","uz":"korrupsiya","ru":"коррупция","ex":["Corruption slows the whole system."],"u":"S06U14"},{"id":"lex.03303","w":"bureaucracy","pos":"noun","ipa":"bjʊˈrɑːkrəsi","uz":"byurokratiya","ru":"бюрократия","ex":["The bureaucracy is slow."],"u":"S06U14"},{"id":"lex.03304","w":"state","pos":"noun","ipa":"steɪt","uz":"davlat","ru":"государство","ex":["The state pays for the schools."],"u":"S06U14"},{"id":"lex.03305","w":"sector","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsektər","uz":"soha","ru":"сектор","ex":["She works in the public sector."],"u":"S06U14"},{"id":"lex.03306","w":"commerce","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkɑːmɜːrs","uz":"savdo","ru":"торговля","ex":["The city grew through commerce."],"u":"S06U14"},{"id":"lex.03307","w":"governmental","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌɡʌvərnˈmentəl","uz":"hukumatga oid","ru":"правительственный","ex":["It is a governmental body."],"u":"S06U14"},{"id":"lex.03308","w":"legally","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈliːɡəli","uz":"qonuniy ravishda","ru":"законно","ex":["He is legally allowed to work here."],"u":"S06U14"},{"id":"lex.03309","w":"illegally","pos":"adv","ipa":"ɪˈliːɡəli","uz":"noqonuniy ravishda","ru":"незаконно","ex":["The car was parked illegally."],"u":"S06U14"},{"id":"lex.03310","w":"officially","pos":"adv","ipa":"əˈfɪʃəli","uz":"rasmiy ravishda","ru":"официально","ex":["The road officially opens tomorrow."],"u":"S06U14"},{"id":"lex.03311","w":"municipal","pos":"adj","ipa":"mjuːˈnɪsɪpəl","uz":"shahar hokimiyatiga oid","ru":"муниципальный","ex":["The municipal pool is free on Sundays."],"u":"S06U14"},{"id":"lex.03312","w":"federal","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈfedərəl","uz":"federal","ru":"федеральный","ex":["It is a federal law."],"u":"S06U14"},{"id":"lex.03313","w":"civic","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈsɪvɪk","uz":"fuqarolik","ru":"гражданский","ex":["Voting is a civic duty."],"u":"S06U14"},{"id":"lex.03314","w":"administrative","pos":"adj","ipa":"ədˈmɪnɪstreɪtɪv","uz":"ma'muriy","ru":"административный","ex":["She has an administrative job."],"u":"S06U14"},{"id":"lex.03315","w":"commission","pos":"noun","ipa":"kəˈmɪʃən","uz":"komissiya","ru":"комиссия","ex":["A commission looked into the accident."],"u":"S06U14"},{"id":"lex.03316","w":"regulator","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈreɡjəleɪtər","uz":"nazorat organi","ru":"регулятор","ex":["The regulator fined the company."],"u":"S06U14"},{"id":"lex.03317","w":"constitution","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌkɑːnstɪˈtuːʃən","uz":"konstitutsiya","ru":"конституция","ex":["The constitution was written in 1992."],"u":"S06U14"},{"id":"lex.03318","w":"treaty","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtriːti","uz":"shartnoma (davlatlararo)","ru":"договор","ex":["The two countries signed a treaty."],"u":"S06U14"},{"id":"lex.03319","w":"referendum","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌrefəˈrendəm","uz":"referendum","ru":"референдум","ex":["A referendum was held in May."],"u":"S06U14"},{"id":"lex.03320","w":"railway","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈreɪlweɪ","uz":"temir yo'l","ru":"железная дорога","ex":["The railway reached the town in 1899."],"u":"S06U14"},{"id":"lex.03321","w":"motorway","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmoʊtərweɪ","uz":"avtomagistral","ru":"автомагистраль","ex":["The motorway was closed for hours."],"u":"S06U14"},{"id":"lex.03322","w":"junction","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdʒʌŋkʃən","uz":"chorraha","ru":"перекрёсток","ex":["Turn left at the next junction."],"u":"S06U14"},{"id":"lex.03323","w":"tunnel","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtʌnəl","uz":"tunnel","ru":"туннель","ex":["The tunnel is two kilometres long."],"u":"S06U14"},{"id":"lex.03324","w":"roundabout","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈraʊndəbaʊt","uz":"aylanma yo'l","ru":"круговой перекрёсток","ex":["Go straight on at the roundabout."],"u":"S06U14"},{"id":"lex.03325","w":"power","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpaʊər","uz":"quvvat; hokimiyat","ru":"энергия; власть","ex":["The power went off for an hour."],"u":"S06U14"},{"id":"lex.03326","w":"generator","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdʒenəreɪtər","uz":"generator","ru":"генератор","ex":["The hospital has its own generator."],"u":"S06U14"},{"id":"lex.03327","w":"turbine","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtɜːrbaɪn","uz":"turbina","ru":"турбина","ex":["The wind turbines are on the hill."],"u":"S06U14"},{"id":"lex.03328","w":"volcano","pos":"noun","ipa":"vɑːlˈkeɪnoʊ","uz":"vulqon","ru":"вулкан","ex":["The volcano has been quiet for years."],"u":"S06U14"},{"id":"lex.03329","w":"earthquake","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɜːrθkweɪk","uz":"zilzila","ru":"землетрясение","ex":["The earthquake damaged two schools."],"u":"S06U14"},{"id":"lex.03330","w":"glacier","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɡleɪʃər","uz":"muzlik","ru":"ледник","ex":["The glacier is getting smaller."],"u":"S06U14"},{"id":"lex.03331","w":"rainforest","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈreɪnfɔːrɪst","uz":"tropik o'rmon","ru":"тропический лес","ex":["The rainforest is being cut down."],"u":"S06U14"},{"id":"lex.03332","w":"surgeon","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsɜːrdʒən","uz":"jarroh","ru":"хирург","ex":["The surgeon spoke to the family."],"u":"S06U14"},{"id":"lex.03333","w":"consumption","pos":"noun","ipa":"kənˈsʌmpʃən","uz":"iste'mol","ru":"потребление","ex":["Water consumption rises in summer."],"u":"S06U14"},{"id":"lex.03334","w":"embassy","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈembəsi","uz":"elchixona","ru":"посольство","ex":["The embassy opens at nine."],"u":"S06U14"},{"id":"lex.03335","w":"petition","pos":"noun","ipa":"pəˈtɪʃən","uz":"murojaat, imzolar to'plami","ru":"петиция","ex":["Two thousand people signed the petition."],"u":"S06U14"},{"id":"lex.03336","w":"domestic","pos":"adj","ipa":"dəˈmestɪk","uz":"ichki, mahalliy","ru":"внутренний","ex":["Domestic flights leave from Terminal 1."],"u":"S06U14"},{"id":"lex.03337","w":"contest","pos":"verb","ipa":"kənˈtest","uz":"e'tiroz bildirmoq, da'vo qilmoq","ru":"обжаловать, оспаривать в инстанции","ex":["The district contested the ruling and lost."],"u":"S06U15"},{"id":"lex.03338","w":"correspondence","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌkɔːrəˈspɑːndəns","uz":"yozishmalar","ru":"переписка","ex":["Keep all the correspondence in one file."],"u":"S06U15"},{"id":"lex.03339","w":"attachment","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈtætʃmənt","uz":"biriktirilgan fayl","ru":"вложение","ex":["The attachment did not open."],"u":"S06U15"},{"id":"lex.03340","w":"recipient","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈsɪpiənt","uz":"qabul qiluvchi","ru":"получатель","ex":["The recipient never got the letter."],"u":"S06U15"},{"id":"lex.03341","w":"sender","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsendər","uz":"jo'natuvchi","ru":"отправитель","ex":["The sender forgot to sign it."],"u":"S06U15"},{"id":"lex.03342","w":"formality","pos":"noun","ipa":"fɔːrˈmæləti","uz":"rasmiylik","ru":"формальность","ex":["The level of formality depends on the reader."],"u":"S06U15"},{"id":"lex.03343","w":"template","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtemplət","uz":"namuna, shablon","ru":"шаблон","ex":["Use the office template for letters."],"u":"S06U15"},{"id":"lex.03344","w":"politely","pos":"adv","ipa":"pəˈlaɪtli","uz":"xushmuomalalik bilan","ru":"вежливо","ex":["She politely refused."],"u":"S06U15"},{"id":"lex.03345","w":"respectfully","pos":"adv","ipa":"rɪˈspektfəli","uz":"hurmat bilan","ru":"уважительно","ex":["He answered respectfully."],"u":"S06U15"},{"id":"lex.03346","w":"sincerely","pos":"adv","ipa":"sɪnˈsɪrli","uz":"samimiy ravishda","ru":"искренне","ex":["Yours sincerely, Dilnoza Karimova."],"u":"S06U15"},{"id":"lex.03347","w":"faithfully","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈfeɪθfəli","uz":"sadoqat bilan","ru":"с уважением (в письме)","ex":["Yours faithfully, D. Karimova."],"u":"S06U15"},{"id":"lex.03348","w":"regards","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈɡɑːrdz","uz":"salomlar (xat oxirida)","ru":"с уважением","ex":["Best regards, Bobur."],"u":"S06U15"},{"id":"lex.03349","w":"enclose","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪnˈkloʊz","uz":"ilova qilmoq","ru":"прилагать","ex":["I enclose a copy of the bill."],"u":"S06U15"},{"id":"lex.03350","w":"forward","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈfɔːrwərd","uz":"yo'naltirmoq (xatni)","ru":"пересылать","ex":["Could you forward the email to me?"],"u":"S06U15"},{"id":"lex.03351","w":"inbox","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɪnbɑːks","uz":"kiruvchi xatlar","ru":"входящие","ex":["My inbox is full."],"u":"S06U15"},{"id":"lex.03352","w":"filter","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfɪltər","uz":"filtr","ru":"фильтр","ex":["The filter moved it to another folder."],"u":"S06U15"},{"id":"lex.03353","w":"spam","pos":"noun","ipa":"spæm","uz":"keraksiz xatlar","ru":"спам","ex":["Most of it was spam."],"u":"S06U15"},{"id":"lex.03354","w":"stationery","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsteɪʃəneri","uz":"kanselyariya buyumlari","ru":"канцтовары","ex":["We order stationery once a month."],"u":"S06U15"},{"id":"lex.03355","w":"dispatch","pos":"verb","ipa":"dɪˈspætʃ","uz":"jo'natmoq","ru":"отправлять","ex":["The goods were dispatched on Monday."],"u":"S06U15"},{"id":"lex.03356","w":"notification","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌnoʊtɪfɪˈkeɪʃən","uz":"bildirishnoma","ru":"уведомление","ex":["You will get a notification by email."],"u":"S06U15"},{"id":"lex.03357","w":"inquiry","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɪnkwəri","uz":"so'rov, murojaat","ru":"запрос","ex":["We had an inquiry about the job."],"u":"S06U15"},{"id":"lex.03358","w":"salutation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌsæljuˈteɪʃən","uz":"murojaat shakli (xat boshida)","ru":"приветствие в письме","ex":["The salutation was too informal."],"u":"S06U15"},{"id":"lex.03359","w":"pipeline","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpaɪplaɪn","uz":"quvur yo'li","ru":"трубопровод","ex":["The pipeline carries gas to the city."],"u":"S06U15"},{"id":"lex.03360","w":"network","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈnetwɜːrk","uz":"tarmoq","ru":"сеть","ex":["The network is down again."],"u":"S06U15"},{"id":"lex.03361","w":"look forward to","pos":"verb","ipa":"lʊk ˈfɔːrwərd tuː","uz":"intiqlik bilan kutmoq","ru":"с нетерпением ждать","ex":["I look forward to hearing from you."],"u":"S06U15"},{"id":"lex.03362","w":"get on with","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɡet ˈɑːn wɪð","uz":"chiqishib ketmoq; davom ettirmoq","ru":"ладить; продолжать","ex":["She gets on with everyone."],"u":"S06U15"},{"id":"lex.03363","w":"put up with","pos":"verb","ipa":"pʊt ˈʌp wɪð","uz":"chidamoq","ru":"мириться с","ex":["I cannot put up with the noise."],"u":"S06U15"},{"id":"lex.03364","w":"come up with","pos":"verb","ipa":"kʌm ˈʌp wɪð","uz":"o'ylab topmoq","ru":"придумать","ex":["He came up with a better plan."],"u":"S06U15"},{"id":"lex.03365","w":"catch up with","pos":"verb","ipa":"kætʃ ˈʌp wɪð","uz":"yetib olmoq","ru":"догнать","ex":["Go on; I will catch up with you."],"u":"S06U15"},{"id":"lex.03366","w":"run out of","pos":"verb","ipa":"rʌn ˈaʊt əv","uz":"tugab qolmoq","ru":"закончиться (о запасе)","ex":["We have run out of paper."],"u":"S06U15"},{"id":"lex.03367","w":"keep up with","pos":"verb","ipa":"kiːp ˈʌp wɪð","uz":"tenglashib bormoq","ru":"успевать за","ex":["I cannot keep up with the news."],"u":"S06U15"},{"id":"lex.03368","w":"cut down on","pos":"verb","ipa":"kʌt ˈdaʊn ɑːn","uz":"kamaytirmoq","ru":"сократить потребление","ex":["I am cutting down on sugar."],"u":"S06U15"},{"id":"lex.03369","w":"look up to","pos":"verb","ipa":"lʊk ˈʌp tuː","uz":"hurmat qilmoq","ru":"уважать, брать пример","ex":["The younger players look up to her."],"u":"S06U15"},{"id":"lex.03370","w":"face up to","pos":"verb","ipa":"feɪs ˈʌp tuː","uz":"tan olib qarshi turmoq","ru":"смириться и признать","ex":["You must face up to the problem."],"u":"S06U15"},{"id":"lex.03371","w":"spelling","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈspelɪŋ","uz":"imlo","ru":"правописание","ex":["Check the spelling before you send it."],"u":"S06U15"},{"id":"lex.03372","w":"comma","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkɑːmə","uz":"vergul","ru":"запятая","ex":["You need a comma after 'however'."],"u":"S06U15"},{"id":"lex.03373","w":"abbreviation","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˌbriːviˈeɪʃən","uz":"qisqartma","ru":"сокращение","ex":["Do not use abbreviations in a formal letter."],"u":"S06U15"},{"id":"lex.03374","w":"courteous","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈkɜːrtiəs","uz":"odobli","ru":"учтивый","ex":["The staff were courteous and quick."],"u":"S06U15"},{"id":"lex.03375","w":"supply","pos":"noun","ipa":"səˈplaɪ","uz":"ta'minot, zaxira","ru":"запас, поставка","ex":["The water supply was cut off."],"u":"S06U15"},{"id":"lex.03376","w":"investment","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪnˈvestmənt","uz":"sarmoya","ru":"инвестиция","ex":["It was a good investment."],"u":"S06U15"},{"id":"lex.03377","w":"savings","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈseɪvɪŋz","uz":"jamg'arma","ru":"сбережения","ex":["She spent all her savings on the car."],"u":"S06U15"},{"id":"lex.03378","w":"dear","pos":"adj","ipa":"dɪr","uz":"hurmatli (xat boshida)","ru":"уважаемый","ex":["Dear Mr Karimov, thank you for your letter."],"u":"S06U15"},{"id":"lex.03379","w":"sir","pos":"noun","ipa":"sɜːr","uz":"janob","ru":"господин","ex":["Dear Sir, I am writing about the order."],"u":"S06U15"},{"id":"lex.03380","w":"reaction","pos":"noun","ipa":"riˈækʃən","uz":"munosabat, javob","ru":"реакция","ex":["What was her reaction?"],"u":"S06U16"},{"id":"lex.03381","w":"react","pos":"verb","ipa":"riˈækt","uz":"munosabat bildirmoq","ru":"реагировать","ex":["He reacted badly to the news."],"u":"S06U16"},{"id":"lex.03382","w":"attention","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈtenʃən","uz":"diqqat","ru":"внимание","ex":["Thank you for your attention."],"u":"S06U16"},{"id":"lex.03383","w":"mediation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌmiːdiˈeɪʃən","uz":"vositachilik","ru":"посредничество","ex":["The case was settled by mediation."],"u":"S06U16"},{"id":"lex.03384","w":"anecdote","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈænɪkdoʊt","uz":"qiziqarli hikoya","ru":"история из жизни","ex":["She told a funny anecdote about her first job."],"u":"S06U16"},{"id":"lex.03385","w":"responsive","pos":"adj","ipa":"rɪˈspɑːnsɪv","uz":"javob beruvchi","ru":"отзывчивый","ex":["The class was responsive today."],"u":"S06U16"},{"id":"lex.03386","w":"unresponsive","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌʌnrɪˈspɑːnsɪv","uz":"javob bermaydigan","ru":"не реагирующий","ex":["The office has been unresponsive."],"u":"S06U16"},{"id":"lex.03387","w":"expressive","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪkˈspresɪv","uz":"ifodali","ru":"выразительный","ex":["She has a very expressive face."],"u":"S06U16"},{"id":"lex.03388","w":"communicative","pos":"adj","ipa":"kəˈmjuːnɪkətɪv","uz":"muloqotchan","ru":"общительный","ex":["He is not very communicative in the mornings."],"u":"S06U16"},{"id":"lex.03389","w":"observe","pos":"verb","ipa":"əbˈzɜːrv","uz":"kuzatmoq","ru":"наблюдать","ex":["She observed the class for an hour."],"u":"S06U16"},{"id":"lex.03390","w":"small talk","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsmɔːl tɔːk","uz":"yengil suhbat","ru":"светская беседа","ex":["He is not good at small talk."],"u":"S06U16"},{"id":"lex.03391","w":"icebreaker","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈaɪsbreɪkər","uz":"muz yorar savol","ru":"вопрос для знакомства","ex":["The teacher started with an icebreaker."],"u":"S06U16"},{"id":"lex.03392","w":"gap","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɡæp","uz":"bo'shliq, tanaffus","ru":"пробел, промежуток","ex":["There was a long gap in the conversation."],"u":"S06U16"},{"id":"lex.03393","w":"mumble","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈmʌmbəl","uz":"g'o'ldiramoq","ru":"бормотать","ex":["Do not mumble; speak clearly."],"u":"S06U16"},{"id":"lex.03394","w":"encourage","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪnˈkɜːrɪdʒ","uz":"dalda bermoq","ru":"поощрять","ex":["Her parents encouraged her to apply."],"u":"S06U16"},{"id":"lex.03395","w":"apologize","pos":"verb","ipa":"əˈpɑːlədʒaɪz","uz":"uzr so'ramoq","ru":"извиняться","ex":["He apologized for being late."],"u":"S06U16"},{"id":"lex.03396","w":"diplomatic","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌdɪpləˈmætɪk","uz":"vaziyatni yumshata oladigan","ru":"дипломатичный","ex":["That was a diplomatic answer."],"u":"S06U16"},{"id":"lex.03397","w":"assertive","pos":"adj","ipa":"əˈsɜːrtɪv","uz":"o'z fikrini qat'iy aytadigan","ru":"напористый","ex":["You need to be more assertive."],"u":"S06U16"},{"id":"lex.03398","w":"hesitant","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈhezɪtənt","uz":"ikkilanuvchi","ru":"нерешительный","ex":["He was hesitant about the offer."],"u":"S06U16"},{"id":"lex.03399","w":"reluctant","pos":"adj","ipa":"rɪˈlʌktənt","uz":"istamaydigan","ru":"неохотный","ex":["She was reluctant to speak."],"u":"S06U16"},{"id":"lex.03400","w":"willing","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈwɪlɪŋ","uz":"roziligi bor","ru":"готовый, охотный","ex":["He is willing to help."],"u":"S06U16"},{"id":"lex.03401","w":"enthusiastic","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪnˌθuːziˈæstɪk","uz":"ishtiyoqli","ru":"восторженный","ex":["The class was enthusiastic about the trip."],"u":"S06U16"},{"id":"lex.03402","w":"whatsoever","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˌwʌtsoʊˈevər","uz":"umuman (inkor bilan)","ru":"вообще никакой","ex":["There is no reason whatsoever to worry."],"u":"S06U16"},{"id":"lex.03403","w":"body language","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈbɑːdi ˌlæŋɡwɪdʒ","uz":"tana tili","ru":"язык тела","ex":["His body language said he was bored."],"u":"S06U16"},{"id":"lex.03404","w":"eye contact","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈaɪ ˌkɑːntækt","uz":"ko'z bilan aloqa","ru":"зрительный контакт","ex":["Make eye contact when you speak."],"u":"S06U16"},{"id":"lex.03405","w":"go along with","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɡoʊ əˈlɔːŋ wɪð","uz":"rozi bo'lmoq","ru":"соглашаться с","ex":["I will go along with whatever you decide."],"u":"S06U16"},{"id":"lex.03406","w":"curriculum","pos":"noun","ipa":"kəˈrɪkjələm","uz":"o'quv dasturi","ru":"учебная программа","ex":["Music is part of the curriculum."],"u":"S06U16"},{"id":"lex.03407","w":"continent","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkɑːntɪnənt","uz":"qit'a","ru":"континент","ex":["Africa is a large continent."],"u":"S06U16"},{"id":"lex.03408","w":"crop","pos":"noun","ipa":"krɑːp","uz":"ekin","ru":"урожай, культура","ex":["Cotton is the main crop here."],"u":"S06U16"},{"id":"lex.03409","w":"plantation","pos":"noun","ipa":"plænˈteɪʃən","uz":"plantatsiya","ru":"плантация","ex":["He worked on a tea plantation."],"u":"S06U16"},{"id":"lex.03410","w":"cattle","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkætəl","uz":"qoramol","ru":"крупный рогатый скот","ex":["The cattle were in the field."],"u":"S06U16"},{"id":"lex.03411","w":"poultry","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpoʊltri","uz":"parranda","ru":"домашняя птица","ex":["The farm keeps poultry."],"u":"S06U16"},{"id":"lex.03412","w":"famine","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfæmɪn","uz":"ocharchilik","ru":"голод (массовый)","ex":["The famine lasted two years."],"u":"S06U16"},{"id":"lex.03413","w":"premise","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpremɪs","uz":"dastlabki qoida","ru":"посылка","ex":["The argument rests on a false premise."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03414","w":"inference","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɪnfərəns","uz":"xulosa chiqarish","ru":"умозаключение","ex":["That is an inference, not a fact."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03415","w":"documentation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌdɑːkjəmenˈteɪʃən","uz":"hujjatlar to'plami","ru":"документация","ex":["Send the documentation with the claim."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03416","w":"substantiate","pos":"verb","ipa":"səbˈstænʃieɪt","uz":"dalil bilan tasdiqlamoq","ru":"подтверждать доказательствами","ex":["He could not substantiate the figure."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03417","w":"corroborate","pos":"verb","ipa":"kəˈrɑːbəreɪt","uz":"boshqa dalil bilan quvvatlamoq","ru":"подкреплять","ex":["Two witnesses corroborated her account."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03418","w":"establish","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪˈstæblɪʃ","uz":"aniqlab, isbotlab qo'ymoq","ru":"устанавливать","ex":["The inquiry established the cause."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03419","w":"attest","pos":"verb","ipa":"əˈtest","uz":"rasman tasdiqlamoq","ru":"свидетельствовать","ex":["Three colleagues attested to her honesty."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03420","w":"affirm","pos":"verb","ipa":"əˈfɜːrm","uz":"qat'iy tasdiqlamoq","ru":"утверждать","ex":["She affirmed that the letter was hers."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03421","w":"allege","pos":"verb","ipa":"əˈledʒ","uz":"isbotsiz da'vo qilmoq","ru":"утверждать (без доказательств)","ex":["The report alleges that money went missing."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03422","w":"contend","pos":"verb","ipa":"kənˈtend","uz":"da'vo qilib bahslashmoq","ru":"утверждать в споре","ex":["The author contends that the data are wrong."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03423","w":"cite","pos":"verb","ipa":"saɪt","uz":"manba keltirmoq","ru":"ссылаться, цитировать","ex":["She cited three studies."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03424","w":"citation","pos":"noun","ipa":"saɪˈteɪʃən","uz":"iqtibos havolasi","ru":"ссылка на источник","ex":["Every citation must give a page number."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03425","w":"exhibit","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪɡˈzɪbɪt","uz":"dalil ashyosi","ru":"вещественное доказательство","ex":["The letter was marked as exhibit four."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03426","w":"sworn","pos":"adj","ipa":"swɔːrn","uz":"qasamyod bilan berilgan","ru":"данный под присягой","ex":["This is a sworn statement."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03427","w":"incontrovertible","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌɪnkɑːntrəˈvɜːrtəbəl","uz":"inkor etib bo'lmaydigan","ru":"неопровержимый","ex":["The evidence is incontrovertible."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03428","w":"undeniable","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌʌndɪˈnaɪəbəl","uz":"rad etib bo'lmaydigan","ru":"неоспоримый","ex":["The delay is undeniable."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03429","w":"indisputable","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌɪndɪˈspjuːtəbəl","uz":"bahssiz","ru":"бесспорный","ex":["That much is indisputable."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03430","w":"demonstrable","pos":"adj","ipa":"dɪˈmɑːnstrəbəl","uz":"isbotlanadigan","ru":"доказуемый","ex":["There is a demonstrable link."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03431","w":"verifiable","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈverɪfaɪəbəl","uz":"tekshirib ko'rish mumkin bo'lgan","ru":"поддающийся проверке","ex":["Give me a verifiable figure."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03432","w":"unsubstantiated","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌʌnsəbˈstænʃieɪtɪd","uz":"dalilsiz","ru":"необоснованный","ex":["The accusation remains unsubstantiated."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03433","w":"unfounded","pos":"adj","ipa":"ʌnˈfaʊndɪd","uz":"asossiz","ru":"беспочвенный","ex":["The fears proved unfounded."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03434","w":"groundless","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈɡraʊndləs","uz":"hech qanday asosi yo'q","ru":"необоснованный","ex":["The complaint was groundless."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03435","w":"hearsay","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈhɪrseɪ","uz":"eshitilgan gap","ru":"слухи, показания с чужих слов","ex":["That is hearsay, not evidence."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03436","w":"anecdotal","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌænɪkˈdoʊtəl","uz":"alohida hikoyalarga asoslangan","ru":"основанный на отдельных случаях","ex":["The evidence is only anecdotal."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03437","w":"empirical","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪmˈpɪrɪkəl","uz":"tajribaga asoslangan","ru":"эмпирический","ex":["We need empirical evidence."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03438","w":"rebuttal","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈbʌtəl","uz":"rad javobi","ru":"опровержение","ex":["His rebuttal took one paragraph."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03439","w":"refute","pos":"verb","ipa":"rɪˈfjuːt","uz":"rad etib isbotlamoq","ru":"опровергать","ex":["The study refutes the earlier finding."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03440","w":"counterpoint","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkaʊntərpɔɪnt","uz":"qarshi fikr","ru":"контраргумент","ex":["Her counterpoint was the stronger one."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03441","w":"corollary","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkɔːrəleri","uz":"kelib chiquvchi natija","ru":"следствие","ex":["Higher pay is the corollary of higher output."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03442","w":"scrutiny","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈskruːtəni","uz":"sinchkov tekshiruv","ru":"тщательная проверка","ex":["The plan did not survive scrutiny."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03443","w":"rigorous","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈrɪɡərəs","uz":"qat'iy va puxta","ru":"строгий, тщательный","ex":["The testing was rigorous."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03444","w":"robust","pos":"adj","ipa":"roʊˈbʌst","uz":"mustahkam, sinovga bardoshli","ru":"надёжный, устойчивый","ex":["The finding is robust."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03445","w":"flawed","pos":"adj","ipa":"flɔːd","uz":"nuqsonli","ru":"ошибочный","ex":["The method was flawed."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03446","w":"compelling","pos":"adj","ipa":"kəmˈpelɪŋ","uz":"ishontiruvchi, e'tiborni tortadigan","ru":"убедительный","ex":["She made a compelling case."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03447","w":"cogent","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈkoʊdʒənt","uz":"mantiqan asosli","ru":"убедительный, логичный","ex":["He gave a cogent reason."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03448","w":"flimsy","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈflɪmzi","uz":"puch, ishonchsiz","ru":"неубедительный","ex":["That is a flimsy excuse."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03449","w":"tenuous","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈtenjuəs","uz":"juda zaif, nozik","ru":"шаткий","ex":["The link is tenuous at best."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03450","w":"stark","pos":"adj","ipa":"stɑːrk","uz":"keskin, yalang'och","ru":"резкий, неприкрашенный","ex":["The contrast is stark."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03451","w":"striking","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈstraɪkɪŋ","uz":"diqqatni tortadigan","ru":"поразительный","ex":["There is a striking difference."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03452","w":"glaring","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈɡlerɪŋ","uz":"yaqqol ko'zga tashlanadigan (kamchilik)","ru":"вопиющий","ex":["There is a glaring error on page two."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03453","w":"prominent","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈprɑːmɪnənt","uz":"taniqli, ko'zga ko'ringan","ru":"видный","ex":["She is a prominent lawyer."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03454","w":"undermine","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌʌndərˈmaɪn","uz":"asta-sekin zaiflashtirmoq","ru":"подрывать","ex":["The error undermines the whole study."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03455","w":"underpin","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌʌndərˈpɪn","uz":"asos bo'lib turmoq","ru":"лежать в основе","ex":["Three studies underpin the argument."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03456","w":"bolster","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈboʊlstər","uz":"kuchaytirmoq","ru":"подкреплять","ex":["The figures bolster her case."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03457","w":"uphold","pos":"verb","ipa":"ʌpˈhoʊld","uz":"kuchida qoldirmoq","ru":"поддерживать, оставлять в силе","ex":["The court upheld the fine."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03458","w":"put forward","pos":"verb","ipa":"pʊt ˈfɔːrwərd","uz":"taklif sifatida ilgari surmoq","ru":"выдвигать","ex":["She put forward a simpler plan."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03459","w":"rule out","pos":"verb","ipa":"ruːl ˈaʊt","uz":"istisno qilmoq","ru":"исключать","ex":["We can rule out the weather."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03460","w":"weigh up","pos":"verb","ipa":"weɪ ˈʌp","uz":"tarozida o'lchab ko'rmoq","ru":"взвешивать","ex":["Weigh up the risks first."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03461","w":"account for","pos":"verb","ipa":"əˈkaʊnt fər","uz":"izohlab bermoq; ulushini tashkil qilmoq","ru":"объяснять; составлять долю","ex":["That accounts for the delay."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03462","w":"credence","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkriːdəns","uz":"ishonch, e'tibor","ru":"доверие (к утверждению)","ex":["The new data lend credence to her theory."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03463","w":"veracity","pos":"noun","ipa":"vəˈræsəti","uz":"haqiqiylik, rostgo'ylik","ru":"достоверность","ex":["Nobody doubted the veracity of the letter."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03464","w":"annex","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈæneks","uz":"ilova bo'lim","ru":"приложение","ex":["The figures are in annex B."],"u":"S07U01"},{"id":"lex.03465","w":"front","pos":"verb","ipa":"frʌnt","uz":"gap boshiga chiqarmoq","ru":"выносить в начало","ex":["The object has been fronted for emphasis."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03466","w":"provision","pos":"noun","ipa":"prəˈvɪʒən","uz":"shartnomadagi band","ru":"положение (в договоре)","ex":["The provision on delay is unclear."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03467","w":"stipulation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌstɪpjəˈleɪʃən","uz":"qat'iy shart","ru":"оговорка, условие","ex":["There is one stipulation: it must be in writing."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03468","w":"stipulate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈstɪpjəleɪt","uz":"shart qilib qo'ymoq","ru":"оговаривать","ex":["The contract stipulates a two-week notice."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03469","w":"covenant","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkʌvənənt","uz":"yozma majburiyat","ru":"ковенант, обязательство","ex":["The lease contains a covenant about noise."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03470","w":"undertaking","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌʌndərˈteɪkɪŋ","uz":"zimmaga olingan majburiyat","ru":"обязательство","ex":["They gave a written undertaking."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03471","w":"undertake","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌʌndərˈteɪk","uz":"zimmasiga olmoq","ru":"браться, обязываться","ex":["She undertook to finish by June."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03472","w":"indemnity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪnˈdemnəti","uz":"zarar qoplash kafolati","ru":"гарантия возмещения","ex":["The clause offers full indemnity."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03473","w":"waiver","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈweɪvər","uz":"huquqdan voz kechish hujjati","ru":"отказ от права","ex":["Sign the waiver before you start."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03474","w":"waive","pos":"verb","ipa":"weɪv","uz":"huquqdan voz kechmoq","ru":"отказываться от права","ex":["The bank waived the fee."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03475","w":"default","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˈfɔːlt","uz":"majburiyatni bajarmaslik","ru":"неисполнение, дефолт","ex":["Three months in default and the lease ends."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03476","w":"termination","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌtɜːrmɪˈneɪʃən","uz":"shartnomani bekor qilish","ru":"прекращение, расторжение","ex":["Termination requires written notice."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03477","w":"terminate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈtɜːrmɪneɪt","uz":"bekor qilmoq","ru":"расторгать","ex":["Either side may terminate the contract."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03478","w":"addendum","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈdendəm","uz":"qo'shimcha hujjat","ru":"дополнение","ex":["The prices are in an addendum."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03479","w":"signatory","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsɪɡnətɔːri","uz":"imzo chekkan tomon","ru":"подписавшая сторона","ex":["All signatories must be notified."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03480","w":"counterparty","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkaʊntərpɑːrti","uz":"shartnomadagi qarshi tomon","ru":"контрагент","ex":["Inform the counterparty in writing."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03481","w":"binding","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈbaɪndɪŋ","uz":"majburiy kuchga ega","ru":"обязывающий","ex":["The agreement is binding on both sides."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03482","w":"enforceable","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪnˈfɔːrsəbəl","uz":"majburan bajartirish mumkin","ru":"подлежащий принудительному исполнению","ex":["The clause is not enforceable here."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03483","w":"void","pos":"adj","ipa":"vɔɪd","uz":"haqiqiy emas, bekor","ru":"недействительный","ex":["The contract is void."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03484","w":"contingent","pos":"adj","ipa":"kənˈtɪndʒənt","uz":"boshqa shartga bog'liq","ru":"зависящий от условия","ex":["Payment is contingent on delivery."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03485","w":"unconditional","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌʌnkənˈdɪʃənəl","uz":"shartsiz","ru":"безусловный","ex":["We want an unconditional apology."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03486","w":"rescind","pos":"verb","ipa":"rɪˈsɪnd","uz":"rasman bekor qilmoq","ru":"аннулировать","ex":["The board rescinded the decision."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03487","w":"comply","pos":"verb","ipa":"kəmˈplaɪ","uz":"qoidaga rioya qilmoq","ru":"соблюдать","ex":["The building does not comply with the code."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03488","w":"adhere","pos":"verb","ipa":"ədˈhɪr","uz":"qat'iy amal qilmoq","ru":"придерживаться","ex":["Staff must adhere to the guidelines."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03489","w":"honor","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈɑːnər","uz":"va'dasini bajarmoq","ru":"выполнять (обязательство)","ex":["They honored the contract in full."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03490","w":"forfeit","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈfɔːrfɪt","uz":"jarima sifatida yo'qotmoq","ru":"лишаться, терять","ex":["You forfeit the deposit if you cancel."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03491","w":"jurisdiction","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌdʒʊrɪsˈdɪkʃən","uz":"yurisdiksiya, vakolat doirasi","ru":"юрисдикция","ex":["That is outside our jurisdiction."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03492","w":"loophole","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈluːphoʊl","uz":"qonundagi bo'shliq","ru":"лазейка","ex":["They found a loophole in the wording."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03493","w":"proviso","pos":"noun","ipa":"prəˈvaɪzoʊ","uz":"shart, izoh","ru":"оговорка","ex":["I agree, with one proviso."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03494","w":"caveat","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkæviæt","uz":"ogohlantiruvchi izoh","ru":"оговорка, предостережение","ex":["One caveat: the data are old."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03495","w":"remit","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈriːmɪt","uz":"vakolat doirasi","ru":"круг полномочий","ex":["Housing is outside our remit."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03496","w":"purview","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpɜːrvjuː","uz":"e'tibor va vakolat doirasi","ru":"сфера компетенции","ex":["That falls within the purview of the court."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03497","w":"arrears","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈrɪrz","uz":"qarzdorlik","ru":"задолженность","ex":["The tenant is in arrears."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03498","w":"collateral","pos":"noun","ipa":"kəˈlætərəl","uz":"garov mulki","ru":"залог","ex":["The house is the collateral."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03499","w":"premium","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpriːmiəm","uz":"sug'urta to'lovi; ustama","ru":"страховой взнос; надбавка","ex":["The premium rose by a fifth."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03500","w":"norm","pos":"noun","ipa":"nɔːrm","uz":"odatiy me'yor","ru":"норма","ex":["Late payment has become the norm."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03501","w":"convention","pos":"noun","ipa":"kənˈvenʃən","uz":"an'anaviy tartib; xalqaro konvensiya","ru":"обычай; конвенция","ex":["By convention, the chair speaks last."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03502","w":"tenure","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtenjər","uz":"lavozimda turish muddati","ru":"срок пребывания в должности","ex":["During her tenure the school grew."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03503","w":"subject to","pos":"phrase","ipa":"ˈsʌbdʒɪkt tuː","uz":"shu shart bilan","ru":"при условии","ex":["The plan is subject to approval."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03504","w":"prior to","pos":"phrase","ipa":"ˈpraɪər tuː","uz":"dan oldin (rasmiy)","ru":"до, прежде","ex":["Prior to signing, read clause four."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03505","w":"owing to","pos":"phrase","ipa":"ˈoʊɪŋ tuː","uz":"sababli","ru":"вследствие","ex":["Owing to the delay, the date moved."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03506","w":"in the event of","pos":"phrase","ipa":"ɪn ði ɪˈvent əv","uz":"bo'lgan taqdirda","ru":"в случае","ex":["In the event of a fire, use the stairs."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03507","w":"on the grounds that","pos":"phrase","ipa":"ɑːn ðə ˈɡraʊndz ðæt","uz":"shu asosga ko'ra","ru":"на том основании, что","ex":["The claim was refused on the grounds that it was late."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03508","w":"with a view to","pos":"phrase","ipa":"wɪð ə ˈvjuː tuː","uz":"shu maqsadda","ru":"с целью","ex":["We met with a view to settling it."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03509","w":"by virtue of","pos":"phrase","ipa":"baɪ ˈvɜːrtʃuː əv","uz":"shu sababli, shu asosda","ru":"в силу","ex":["She chairs it by virtue of her post."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03510","w":"at the expense of","pos":"phrase","ipa":"ət ði ɪkˈspens əv","uz":"boshqasini qurbon qilib","ru":"за счёт","ex":["Speed came at the expense of accuracy."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03511","w":"on the basis of","pos":"phrase","ipa":"ɑːn ðə ˈbeɪsɪs əv","uz":"shunga asoslanib","ru":"на основании","ex":["They decided on the basis of one report."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03512","w":"draw up","pos":"verb","ipa":"drɔː ˈʌp","uz":"hujjat tayyorlamoq","ru":"составлять (документ)","ex":["A lawyer drew up the contract."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03513","w":"lay down","pos":"verb","ipa":"leɪ ˈdaʊn","uz":"qoida qilib belgilamoq","ru":"устанавливать (правило)","ex":["The law lays down a minimum age."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03514","w":"redress","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈdres","uz":"huquqni tiklash, tovon","ru":"возмещение, удовлетворение","ex":["Customers have a right to redress."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03515","w":"registrar","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈredʒɪstrɑːr","uz":"qayd etuvchi mansabdor","ru":"регистратор","ex":["Take the form to the registrar."],"u":"S07U02"},{"id":"lex.03516","w":"evasive","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪˈveɪsɪv","uz":"qochirimli","ru":"уклончивый","ex":["His answers were evasive."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03517","w":"exactness","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪɡˈzæktnəs","uz":"aniqlik","ru":"точность","ex":["The exactness of the copy impressed us."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03518","w":"vagueness","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈveɪɡnəs","uz":"noaniqlik","ru":"расплывчатость","ex":["The vagueness of the answer worried me."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03519","w":"imprecision","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌɪmprɪˈsɪʒən","uz":"aniqsizlik","ru":"неточность","ex":["Imprecision in the figures cost us a day."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03520","w":"equivocation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪˌkwɪvəˈkeɪʃən","uz":"ikki ma'noli, qochirimli gap","ru":"уклончивость","ex":["Answer without equivocation, please."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03521","w":"generality","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌdʒenəˈræləti","uz":"umumiy gap","ru":"общая фраза","ex":["The speech was a string of generalities."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03522","w":"specificity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌspesɪˈfɪsəti","uz":"aniq belgilanganlik","ru":"конкретность","ex":["The clause lacks specificity."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03523","w":"definition","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌdefɪˈnɪʃən","uz":"ta'rif","ru":"определение","ex":["We need a definition of 'urgent'."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03524","w":"delineation","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˌlɪniˈeɪʃən","uz":"chegaralarni aniq belgilash","ru":"разграничение","ex":["The delineation of duties is unclear."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03525","w":"delineate","pos":"verb","ipa":"dɪˈlɪnieɪt","uz":"aniq chegaralab bermoq","ru":"очерчивать","ex":["The contract delineates each role."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03526","w":"demarcation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌdiːmɑːrˈkeɪʃən","uz":"chegara ajratish","ru":"размежевание","ex":["The demarcation between the teams is blurred."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03527","w":"criterion","pos":"noun","ipa":"kraɪˈtɪriən","uz":"mezon","ru":"критерий","ex":["Cost is only one criterion."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03528","w":"yardstick","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈjɑːrdstɪk","uz":"o'lchov mezoni","ru":"мерило","ex":["Profit is a poor yardstick for a school."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03529","w":"specify","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈspesɪfaɪ","uz":"aniq ko'rsatib aytmoq","ru":"указывать точно","ex":["The order did not specify a colour."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03530","w":"pinpoint","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈpɪnpɔɪnt","uz":"aniq topib ko'rsatmoq","ru":"точно определить","ex":["We cannot pinpoint the cause."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03531","w":"broaden","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈbrɔːdən","uz":"kengaytirmoq","ru":"расширять","ex":["They broadened the search."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03532","w":"obscure","pos":"verb","ipa":"əbˈskjʊr","uz":"xiralashtirmoq, yashirmoq","ru":"затемнять, скрывать","ex":["The summary obscures the real problem."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03533","w":"muddle","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈmʌdəl","uz":"chalkashtirib yubormoq","ru":"путать","ex":["You have muddled the two cases."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03534","w":"conflate","pos":"verb","ipa":"kənˈfleɪt","uz":"ikki narsani bir deb qo'shib yubormoq","ru":"смешивать, объединять","ex":["The article conflates cost and value."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03535","w":"distinguish","pos":"verb","ipa":"dɪˈstɪŋɡwɪʃ","uz":"farqlamoq","ru":"различать","ex":["Distinguish between the two claims."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03536","w":"differentiate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌdɪfəˈrenʃieɪt","uz":"farqini ko'rsatmoq","ru":"разграничивать","ex":["The law differentiates between the two cases."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03537","w":"discern","pos":"verb","ipa":"dɪˈsɜːrn","uz":"ilg'ab olmoq","ru":"различать, улавливать","ex":["I can discern no pattern here."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03538","w":"equate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪˈkweɪt","uz":"tenglashtirmoq","ru":"приравнивать","ex":["Do not equate price with quality."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03539","w":"imprecise","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌɪmprɪˈsaɪs","uz":"aniq emas","ru":"неточный","ex":["The instructions are imprecise."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03540","w":"exact","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪɡˈzækt","uz":"aniq","ru":"точный","ex":["Give me the exact figure."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03541","w":"approximate","pos":"adj","ipa":"əˈprɑːksɪmət","uz":"taxminiy","ru":"приблизительный","ex":["That is an approximate cost."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03542","w":"verbatim","pos":"adv","ipa":"vərˈbeɪtɪm","uz":"so'zma-so'z","ru":"дословно","ex":["She quoted him verbatim."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03543","w":"literal","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈlɪtərəl","uz":"so'zma-so'z, tom ma'noda","ru":"буквальный","ex":["That is the literal meaning."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03544","w":"figurative","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈfɪɡjərətɪv","uz":"ko'chma ma'nodagi","ru":"переносный","ex":["'Cold' here is figurative."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03545","w":"loosely","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈluːsli","uz":"taxminan, erkin","ru":"нестрого","ex":["Loosely speaking, it is the same."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03546","w":"strictly","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈstrɪktli","uz":"qat'iy ma'noda","ru":"строго","ex":["Strictly, that is not a refund."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03547","w":"narrowly","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈnæroʊli","uz":"arang; tor ma'noda","ru":"едва; узко","ex":["The bill passed narrowly."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03548","w":"broadly","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈbrɔːdli","uz":"umumiy tarzda","ru":"в общих чертах","ex":["Broadly, I agree."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03549","w":"nuance","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈnuːɑːns","uz":"ma'no nozikligi","ru":"нюанс","ex":["The translation loses the nuance."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03550","w":"subtlety","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsʌtəlti","uz":"nozik jihat","ru":"тонкость","ex":["The subtlety escaped me."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03551","w":"distinction","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˈstɪŋkʃən","uz":"muhim farq","ru":"различие","ex":["The distinction is important here."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03552","w":"dichotomy","pos":"noun","ipa":"daɪˈkɑːtəmi","uz":"ikkiga keskin bo'linish","ru":"дихотомия","ex":["The old dichotomy no longer holds."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03553","w":"spectrum","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈspektrəm","uz":"keng doira, spektr","ru":"спектр","ex":["Opinion covers the whole spectrum."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03554","w":"continuum","pos":"noun","ipa":"kənˈtɪnjuəm","uz":"uzluksiz shkala","ru":"континуум","ex":["Formality is a continuum, not two boxes."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03555","w":"threshold","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈθreʃhoʊld","uz":"chegara, ostona","ru":"порог","ex":["Above that threshold, tax applies."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03556","w":"euphemism","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈjuːfəmɪzəm","uz":"yumshatilgan ifoda","ru":"эвфемизм","ex":["'Let go' is a euphemism for 'sacked'."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03557","w":"understatement","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌʌndərˈsteɪtmənt","uz":"kam aytish","ru":"преуменьшение","ex":["'A bit damp' was an understatement."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03558","w":"overstatement","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌoʊvərˈsteɪtmənt","uz":"bo'rttirib aytish","ru":"преувеличение","ex":["That is an overstatement of the risk."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03559","w":"hyperbole","pos":"noun","ipa":"haɪˈpɜːrbəli","uz":"giperbola, mubolag'a","ru":"гипербола","ex":["'I have told you a million times' is hyperbole."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03560","w":"analogy","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈnælədʒi","uz":"o'xshatish, analogiya","ru":"аналогия","ex":["He explained it by analogy with a river."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03561","w":"simile","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsɪməli","uz":"o'xshatish (like/as bilan)","ru":"сравнение","ex":["'As cold as stone' is a simile."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03562","w":"pin down","pos":"verb","ipa":"pɪn ˈdaʊn","uz":"aniq belgilab olmoq","ru":"точно установить","ex":["We could not pin down the date."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03563","w":"touch on","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈtʌtʃ ɑːn","uz":"qisqacha tegib o'tmoq","ru":"коснуться (темы)","ex":["She touched on the cost but moved on."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03564","w":"single out","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈsɪŋɡəl ˈaʊt","uz":"alohida ajratib ko'rsatmoq","ru":"выделять","ex":["The report singles out one department."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03565","w":"spell out","pos":"verb","ipa":"spel ˈaʊt","uz":"batafsil tushuntirib bermoq","ru":"разъяснять подробно","ex":["Spell out what you want us to do."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03566","w":"explicit","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪkˈsplɪsɪt","uz":"ochiq aytilgan","ru":"явный, прямо выраженный","ex":["The instructions were explicit."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03567","w":"implicit","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪmˈplɪsɪt","uz":"oshkor aytilmagan, ichki","ru":"подразумеваемый","ex":["There is an implicit threat in that letter."],"u":"S07U03"},{"id":"lex.03568","w":"rewrite","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌriːˈraɪt","uz":"qayta yozmoq","ru":"переписывать","ex":["She rewrote the opening four times."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03569","w":"current","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈkɜrənt","uz":"joriy, hozirgi","ru":"текущий, нынешний","ex":["The current figures are on page two."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03570","w":"submission","pos":"noun","ipa":"səbˈmɪʃən","uz":"rasman taqdim etilgan hujjat","ru":"представленный документ","ex":["Submissions close on Friday."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03571","w":"memorandum","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌmeməˈrændəm","uz":"xizmat yozuvi","ru":"служебная записка","ex":["A memorandum went to all staff."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03572","w":"directive","pos":"noun","ipa":"dəˈrektɪv","uz":"ko'rsatma","ru":"директива","ex":["The directive takes effect in June."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03573","w":"endorsement","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪnˈdɔːrsmənt","uz":"qo'llab-quvvatlash","ru":"одобрение, поддержка","ex":["The plan won her endorsement."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03574","w":"endorse","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪnˈdɔːrs","uz":"ochiq qo'llab-quvvatlamoq","ru":"поддерживать, одобрять","ex":["The union endorsed the deal."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03575","w":"ratification","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌrætɪfɪˈkeɪʃən","uz":"ratifikatsiya, tasdiqlash","ru":"ратификация","ex":["Ratification took two years."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03576","w":"ratify","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈrætɪfaɪ","uz":"rasman tasdiqlamoq","ru":"ратифицировать","ex":["Parliament ratified the treaty."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03577","w":"implementation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌɪmplɪmenˈteɪʃən","uz":"amalga oshirish","ru":"внедрение","ex":["Implementation starts in March."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03578","w":"implement","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈɪmplɪment","uz":"amalga oshirmoq","ru":"осуществлять","ex":["The rule was implemented last year."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03579","w":"rollout","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈroʊlaʊt","uz":"bosqichma-bosqich joriy etish","ru":"поэтапный запуск","ex":["The rollout begins in the north."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03580","w":"feasibility","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌfiːzəˈbɪləti","uz":"amalga oshirish imkoniyati","ru":"осуществимость","ex":["They ran a feasibility study."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03581","w":"propose","pos":"verb","ipa":"prəˈpoʊz","uz":"taklif qilmoq","ru":"предлагать","ex":["I propose that we wait."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03582","w":"authorize","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈɔːθəraɪz","uz":"rasman ruxsat bermoq","ru":"санкционировать","ex":["Only the director can authorize it."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03583","w":"sanction","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈsæŋkʃən","uz":"rasman ma'qullamoq","ru":"санкционировать","ex":["The board sanctioned the spending."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03584","w":"defer","pos":"verb","ipa":"dɪˈfɜːr","uz":"keyinga qoldirmoq","ru":"откладывать","ex":["The committee deferred the decision."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03585","w":"refer","pos":"verb","ipa":"rɪˈfɜːr","uz":"boshqa idoraga yo'llamoq","ru":"передавать на рассмотрение","ex":["The case was referred to the tribunal."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03586","w":"deliberation","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˌlɪbəˈreɪʃən","uz":"muhokama va mulohaza","ru":"обсуждение","ex":["After long deliberation they agreed."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03587","w":"advisable","pos":"adj","ipa":"ədˈvaɪzəbəl","uz":"maqsadga muvofiq","ru":"целесообразный","ex":["It is advisable to book early."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03588","w":"inadvisable","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌɪnədˈvaɪzəbəl","uz":"maqsadga muvofiq emas","ru":"нежелательный","ex":["Travelling alone is inadvisable there."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03589","w":"prudent","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈpruːdənt","uz":"ehtiyotkor, oqilona","ru":"благоразумный","ex":["A prudent manager keeps a reserve."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03590","w":"imprudent","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪmˈpruːdənt","uz":"beparvo, o'ylamasdan qilingan","ru":"неосмотрительный","ex":["It was imprudent to sign so fast."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03591","w":"warranted","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈwɔːrəntɪd","uz":"asosli","ru":"оправданный","ex":["The caution was warranted."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03592","w":"unwarranted","pos":"adj","ipa":"ʌnˈwɔːrəntɪd","uz":"asossiz","ru":"неоправданный","ex":["The criticism was unwarranted."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03593","w":"provisional","pos":"adj","ipa":"prəˈvɪʒənəl","uz":"vaqtinchalik, dastlabki","ru":"предварительный","ex":["These are provisional figures."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03594","w":"interim","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈɪntərɪm","uz":"oraliq, vaqtinchalik","ru":"промежуточный","ex":["She is the interim director."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03595","w":"advisory","pos":"adj","ipa":"ədˈvaɪzəri","uz":"maslahat beruvchi","ru":"консультативный","ex":["The panel is advisory only."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03596","w":"mandatory","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈmændətɔːri","uz":"majburiy","ru":"обязательный","ex":["Helmets are mandatory on site."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03597","w":"discretionary","pos":"adj","ipa":"dɪˈskreʃəneri","uz":"ixtiyoriy, qaroriga bog'liq","ru":"дискреционный","ex":["The bonus is discretionary."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03598","w":"blueprint","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈbluːprɪnt","uz":"batafsil reja, andoza","ru":"план, чертёж","ex":["The report is a blueprint for reform."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03599","w":"prototype","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈproʊtətaɪp","uz":"dastlabki namuna","ru":"прототип","ex":["The prototype worked first time."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03600","w":"rationale","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌræʃəˈnæl","uz":"asoslash mantiqi","ru":"обоснование","ex":["Explain the rationale for the change."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03601","w":"motive","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmoʊtɪv","uz":"sabab, maqsad","ru":"мотив","ex":["Nobody could find a motive."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03602","w":"pretext","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpriːtekst","uz":"bahona","ru":"предлог","ex":["He left on the pretext of a phone call."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03603","w":"vindication","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌvɪndɪˈkeɪʃən","uz":"haqligini isbotlash","ru":"оправдание правоты","ex":["The result was a vindication of her method."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03604","w":"veto","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈviːtoʊ","uz":"veto huquqi","ru":"вето","ex":["Each member has a veto."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03605","w":"overturn","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌoʊvərˈtɜːrn","uz":"bekor qilmoq, o'zgartirmoq","ru":"отменять (решение)","ex":["The appeal court overturned the fine."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03606","w":"preside","pos":"verb","ipa":"prɪˈzaɪd","uz":"raislik qilmoq","ru":"председательствовать","ex":["The deputy presided in her absence."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03607","w":"manifesto","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌmænɪˈfestoʊ","uz":"dastur, manifest","ru":"манифест, программа","ex":["The promise was in their manifesto."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03608","w":"pledge","pos":"noun","ipa":"pledʒ","uz":"va'da, majburiyat","ru":"обещание, обязательство","ex":["They broke the pledge within a year."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03609","w":"coalition","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌkoʊəˈlɪʃən","uz":"koalitsiya, ittifoq","ru":"коалиция","ex":["A coalition of charities wrote to the minister."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03610","w":"ballot","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈbælət","uz":"yashirin ovoz berish","ru":"голосование, бюллетень","ex":["Members voted by ballot."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03611","w":"turnout","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtɜːrnaʊt","uz":"qatnashganlar soni","ru":"явка","ex":["Turnout was under half."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03612","w":"constituency","pos":"noun","ipa":"kənˈstɪtʃuənsi","uz":"saylov okrugi","ru":"избирательный округ","ex":["She holds a rural constituency."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03613","w":"incumbency","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪnˈkʌmbənsi","uz":"lavozimni egallab turish davri","ru":"пребывание в должности","ex":["Her incumbency lasted eight years."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03614","w":"filibuster","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfɪlɪbʌstər","uz":"vaqtni cho'zuvchi uzun nutq","ru":"затягивание прений","ex":["The filibuster lasted nine hours."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03615","w":"backbench","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈbækbentʃ","uz":"oddiy deputatlarga oid","ru":"рядовой (о депутатах)","ex":["A backbench revolt stopped the bill."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03616","w":"mandate","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmændeɪt","uz":"vakolat, mandat","ru":"мандат, полномочие","ex":["The vote gave them a clear mandate."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03617","w":"set out","pos":"verb","ipa":"set ˈaʊt","uz":"bayon qilib yozmoq","ru":"излагать","ex":["The letter sets out three options."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03618","w":"call for","pos":"verb","ipa":"kɔːl ˈfɔːr","uz":"talab qilmoq","ru":"призывать; требовать","ex":["The union called for a pay rise."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03619","w":"carry out","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈkæri ˈaʊt","uz":"bajarmoq","ru":"выполнять","ex":["They carried out the repairs in a day."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03620","w":"recommendation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌrekəmenˈdeɪʃən","uz":"tavsiya","ru":"рекомендация","ex":["The report ends with three recommendations."],"u":"S07U04"},{"id":"lex.03621","w":"pretense","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpriːtens","uz":"o'zini go'yo shunday ko'rsatish","ru":"притворство","ex":["He dropped the pretense of calm."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03622","w":"facade","pos":"noun","ipa":"fəˈsɑːd","uz":"tashqi ko'rinish, pardaposh","ru":"фасад, видимость","ex":["Behind the facade the company was failing."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03623","w":"veneer","pos":"noun","ipa":"vəˈnɪr","uz":"yupqa qoplama, ko'rinish","ru":"внешний лоск","ex":["A veneer of politeness covered real anger."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03624","w":"semblance","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsembləns","uz":"ko'rinish, o'xshashlik","ru":"видимость, подобие","ex":["Order was restored, or some semblance of it."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03625","w":"guise","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɡaɪz","uz":"niqob, ko'rinish","ru":"личина, вид","ex":["The tax returned under a new guise."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03626","w":"charade","pos":"noun","ipa":"ʃəˈreɪd","uz":"soxta tomosha","ru":"фарс","ex":["The consultation was a charade."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03627","w":"demeanor","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˈmiːnər","uz":"o'zini tutishi","ru":"поведение, манера держаться","ex":["His demeanor never changed."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03628","w":"bearing","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈberɪŋ","uz":"qomat, o'zini tutishi","ru":"осанка, манера","ex":["She has the bearing of a soldier."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03629","w":"composure","pos":"noun","ipa":"kəmˈpoʊʒər","uz":"vazminlik","ru":"самообладание","ex":["He lost his composure at the end."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03630","w":"poise","pos":"noun","ipa":"pɔɪz","uz":"xotirjam ishonch","ru":"уверенность, собранность","ex":["She handled the questions with poise."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03631","w":"affectation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌæfekˈteɪʃən","uz":"sun'iy xatti-harakat","ru":"манерность","ex":["The accent is an affectation."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03632","w":"insincerity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌɪnsɪnˈserəti","uz":"samimiyatsizlik","ru":"неискренность","ex":["The insincerity was obvious."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03633","w":"hypocrisy","pos":"noun","ipa":"hɪˈpɑːkrəsi","uz":"ikkiyuzlamachilik","ru":"лицемерие","ex":["The hypocrisy of it angered people."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03634","w":"sincerity","pos":"noun","ipa":"sɪnˈserəti","uz":"samimiylik","ru":"искренность","ex":["I do not doubt her sincerity."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03635","w":"pretend","pos":"verb","ipa":"prɪˈtend","uz":"o'zini go'yo ... qilib ko'rsatmoq","ru":"притворяться","ex":["He pretended not to hear."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03636","w":"feign","pos":"verb","ipa":"feɪn","uz":"o'zini ... qilib ko'rsatmoq","ru":"симулировать","ex":["She feigned surprise."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03637","w":"simulate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈsɪmjəleɪt","uz":"taqlidan yaratmoq","ru":"имитировать","ex":["The program simulates a real flight."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03638","w":"mask","pos":"verb","ipa":"mæsk","uz":"niqoblamoq","ru":"маскировать","ex":["The figures mask a real fall."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03639","w":"betray","pos":"verb","ipa":"bɪˈtreɪ","uz":"beixtiyor oshkor qilib qo'ymoq","ru":"выдавать (чувство)","ex":["Her voice betrayed her nerves."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03640","w":"belie","pos":"verb","ipa":"bɪˈlaɪ","uz":"yolg'on taassurot bermoq","ru":"противоречить, не соответствовать","ex":["His calm voice belied his anger."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03641","w":"ostensible","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɑːˈstensəbəl","uz":"ko'rinishdagi, aytilgan (sabab)","ru":"мнимый, показной","ex":["The ostensible reason was cost."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03642","w":"ostensibly","pos":"adv","ipa":"ɑːˈstensəbli","uz":"ko'rinishidan, aytilishicha","ru":"якобы","ex":["He left ostensibly to make a call."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03643","w":"outward","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈaʊtwərd","uz":"tashqi","ru":"внешний","ex":["There was no outward sign of trouble."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03644","w":"outwardly","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈaʊtwərdli","uz":"tashqi tomondan","ru":"внешне","ex":["Outwardly he agreed; privately he did not."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03645","w":"superficial","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌsuːpərˈfɪʃəl","uz":"yuzaki","ru":"поверхностный","ex":["The damage is superficial."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03646","w":"genuine","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈdʒenjuɪn","uz":"haqiqiy, chin","ru":"подлинный, искренний","ex":["Her surprise was genuine."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03647","w":"authentic","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɔːˈθentɪk","uz":"asl, ishonchli","ru":"аутентичный","ex":["The letter is authentic."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03648","w":"contrived","pos":"adj","ipa":"kənˈtraɪvd","uz":"sun'iy, uydirma","ru":"надуманный","ex":["The ending felt contrived."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03649","w":"staged","pos":"adj","ipa":"steɪdʒd","uz":"oldindan uyushtirilgan","ru":"постановочный","ex":["The photograph was staged."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03650","w":"supposedly","pos":"adv","ipa":"səˈpoʊzɪdli","uz":"go'yoki","ru":"якобы","ex":["He is supposedly an expert."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03651","w":"stigma","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈstɪɡmə","uz":"jamiyatdagi salbiy tamg'a","ru":"стигма, клеймо","ex":["There is still a stigma around debt."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03652","w":"notoriety","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌnoʊtəˈraɪəti","uz":"yomon nom chiqarish","ru":"дурная слава","ex":["The case brought him notoriety."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03653","w":"prestige","pos":"noun","ipa":"preˈstiːʒ","uz":"obro'","ru":"престиж","ex":["The prize carries real prestige."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03654","w":"duplicity","pos":"noun","ipa":"duːˈplɪsəti","uz":"ikkiyuzlamachilik, aldov","ru":"двуличие","ex":["The duplicity cost him his job."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03655","w":"integrity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪnˈteɡrəti","uz":"halollik, printsipiallik","ru":"честность, цельность","ex":["Her integrity was never in doubt."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03656","w":"complacency","pos":"noun","ipa":"kəmˈpleɪsənsi","uz":"xotirjamlik, beparvolik","ru":"самоуспокоенность","ex":["Success bred complacency."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03657","w":"diligence","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdɪlɪdʒəns","uz":"tirishqoqlik","ru":"усердие","ex":["She works with great diligence."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03658","w":"negligence","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈneɡlɪdʒəns","uz":"e'tiborsizlik, beparvolik","ru":"халатность","ex":["The fire was caused by negligence."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03659","w":"cynicism","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsɪnɪsɪzəm","uz":"hamma narsaga shubha bilan qarash","ru":"цинизм","ex":["Years in politics bred cynicism."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03660","w":"skepticism","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈskeptɪsɪzəm","uz":"shubhali yondashuv","ru":"скептицизм","ex":["She met the claim with skepticism."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03661","w":"optimism","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɑːptɪmɪzəm","uz":"nekbinlik","ru":"оптимизм","ex":["There is cautious optimism about the talks."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03662","w":"pessimism","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpesɪmɪzəm","uz":"badbinlik","ru":"пессимизм","ex":["The mood is one of pessimism."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03663","w":"idealism","pos":"noun","ipa":"aɪˈdiːəlɪzəm","uz":"ideallarga sodiqlik","ru":"идеализм","ex":["Her idealism survived the job."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03664","w":"pragmatism","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpræɡmətɪzəm","uz":"amaliy yondashuv","ru":"прагматизм","ex":["Pragmatism won in the end."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03665","w":"indignation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌɪndɪɡˈneɪʃən","uz":"g'azab, norozilik","ru":"негодование","ex":["The letter caused real indignation."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03666","w":"contempt","pos":"noun","ipa":"kənˈtempt","uz":"nafrat, mensimaslik","ru":"презрение","ex":["He treated the question with contempt."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03667","w":"disdain","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪsˈdeɪn","uz":"mensimaslik","ru":"пренебрежение","ex":["She looked at the offer with disdain."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03668","w":"reverence","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈrevərəns","uz":"chuqur hurmat","ru":"благоговение","ex":["They speak of her with reverence."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03669","w":"come across","pos":"verb","ipa":"kʌm əˈkrɔːs","uz":"taassurot qoldirmoq","ru":"производить впечатление","ex":["He comes across as arrogant."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03670","w":"live up to","pos":"verb","ipa":"lɪv ˈʌp tuː","uz":"umidni oqlamoq","ru":"оправдывать (ожидания)","ex":["The film did not live up to the reviews."],"u":"S07U05"},{"id":"lex.03671","w":"aloud","pos":"adv","ipa":"əˈlaʊd","uz":"ovoz chiqarib","ru":"вслух","ex":["Read the sentence aloud."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03672","w":"drift","pos":"verb","ipa":"drɪft","uz":"suzib ketmoq, og'ib ketmoq","ru":"дрейфовать, сбиваться","ex":["The paragraph drifts between past and present."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03673","w":"trigger","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈtrɪɡər","uz":"qo'zg'atmoq, sabab bo'lmoq","ru":"вызывать, запускать","ex":["The report triggered an inquiry."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03674","w":"catalyst","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkætəlɪst","uz":"turtki, katalizator","ru":"катализатор","ex":["The strike was the catalyst for reform."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03675","w":"precursor","pos":"noun","ipa":"prɪˈkɜːrsər","uz":"kelgusi voqeaning belgisi","ru":"предвестник","ex":["The protests were a precursor to the strike."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03676","w":"antecedent","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌæntɪˈsiːdənt","uz":"oldingi o'xshash hodisa","ru":"предшествующее","ex":["The law has a clear antecedent."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03677","w":"ramification","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌræmɪfɪˈkeɪʃən","uz":"keyingi oqibat","ru":"последствие","ex":["The ramifications are still unclear."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03678","w":"odds","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɑːdz","uz":"ehtimollik nisbati","ru":"шансы","ex":["The odds are against us."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03679","w":"contingency","pos":"noun","ipa":"kənˈtɪndʒənsi","uz":"kutilmagan holat","ru":"непредвиденный случай","ex":["We have a contingency for that."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03680","w":"eventuality","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪˌventʃuˈæləti","uz":"yuz berishi mumkin bo'lgan holat","ru":"возможный случай","ex":["We must prepare for that eventuality."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03681","w":"scenario","pos":"noun","ipa":"səˈnærioʊ","uz":"voqealar rivoji varianti","ru":"сценарий","ex":["The worst-case scenario is a full closure."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03682","w":"precipitate","pos":"verb","ipa":"prɪˈsɪpɪteɪt","uz":"tezlashtirib yubormoq","ru":"ускорять, провоцировать","ex":["The letter precipitated a crisis."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03683","w":"provoke","pos":"verb","ipa":"prəˈvoʊk","uz":"qo'zg'atmoq, keltirib chiqarmoq","ru":"провоцировать, вызывать","ex":["The remark provoked an outcry."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03684","w":"induce","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪnˈduːs","uz":"keltirib chiqarmoq; ko'ndirmoq","ru":"вызывать; побуждать","ex":["The drug induces sleep."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03685","w":"prompt","pos":"verb","ipa":"prɑːmpt","uz":"turtki bo'lmoq","ru":"побуждать","ex":["The fall in sales prompted a review."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03686","w":"attribute","pos":"verb","ipa":"əˈtrɪbjuːt","uz":"biror narsaga bog'lamoq","ru":"приписывать","ex":["They attribute the rise to the weather."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03687","w":"ascribe","pos":"verb","ipa":"əˈskraɪb","uz":"nisbat bermoq","ru":"приписывать","ex":["He ascribes the success to luck."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03688","w":"causation","pos":"noun","ipa":"kɔːˈzeɪʃən","uz":"sabab-oqibat bog'liqligi","ru":"причинность","ex":["Correlation is not causation."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03689","w":"correlate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈkɔːrəleɪt","uz":"o'zaro bog'liq bo'lmoq","ru":"коррелировать","ex":["Income correlates with health."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03690","w":"determinant","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˈtɜːrmɪnənt","uz":"belgilovchi omil","ru":"определяющий фактор","ex":["Housing is the main determinant of health here."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03691","w":"culprit","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkʌlprɪt","uz":"aybdor, sababchi","ru":"виновник","ex":["Damp was the culprit."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03692","w":"onset","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɑːnset","uz":"boshlanishi","ru":"начало (болезни, зимы)","ex":["The onset of winter was early."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03693","w":"impetus","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɪmpɪtəs","uz":"turtki kuchi","ru":"импульс, толчок","ex":["The grant gave the project fresh impetus."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03694","w":"inertia","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪˈnɜːrʃə","uz":"harakatsizlik, inertsiya","ru":"инерция","ex":["Institutional inertia blocked the change."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03695","w":"probable","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈprɑːbəbəl","uz":"ehtimoli yuqori","ru":"вероятный","ex":["A delay is probable."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03696","w":"implausible","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪmˈplɔːzəbəl","uz":"ishonarsiz","ru":"неправдоподобный","ex":["The excuse sounds implausible."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03697","w":"conceivable","pos":"adj","ipa":"kənˈsiːvəbəl","uz":"tasavvur qilsa bo'ladigan","ru":"мыслимый","ex":["It is conceivable that he forgot."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03698","w":"inconceivable","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌɪnkənˈsiːvəbəl","uz":"tasavvur qilib bo'lmaydigan","ru":"немыслимый","ex":["It is inconceivable that nobody noticed."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03699","w":"symptomatic","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌsɪmptəˈmætɪk","uz":"kengroq muammoning belgisi","ru":"симптоматичный","ex":["The delay is symptomatic of poor planning."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03700","w":"indicative","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪnˈdɪkətɪv","uz":"ishora qiluvchi","ru":"показательный","ex":["The result is indicative, not final."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03701","w":"attributable","pos":"adj","ipa":"əˈtrɪbjətəbəl","uz":"shu sababga bog'lash mumkin","ru":"объяснимый (чем-л.)","ex":["Half the rise is attributable to fuel."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03702","w":"liable","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈlaɪəbəl","uz":"moyil; javobgar","ru":"склонный; ответственный","ex":["The roof is liable to leak."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03703","w":"prone","pos":"adj","ipa":"proʊn","uz":"moyil","ru":"подверженный","ex":["The area is prone to flooding."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03704","w":"susceptible","pos":"adj","ipa":"səˈseptəbəl","uz":"ta'sirga beriluvchan","ru":"восприимчивый","ex":["Older trees are susceptible to the disease."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03705","w":"vulnerable","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈvʌlnərəbəl","uz":"himoyasiz, zaif","ru":"уязвимый","ex":["The system is vulnerable to attack."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03706","w":"knock-on","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈnɑːk ɑːn","uz":"zanjirli ta'sirdagi","ru":"побочный, цепной","ex":["There was a knock-on effect on prices."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03707","w":"spillover","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈspɪloʊvər","uz":"boshqa sohaga o'tgan ta'sir","ru":"побочный эффект","ex":["There was a spillover into the local economy."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03708","w":"fallout","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfɔːlaʊt","uz":"salbiy oqibatlar","ru":"последствия","ex":["The political fallout lasted months."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03709","w":"backlash","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈbæklæʃ","uz":"keskin qarshi munosabat","ru":"негативная реакция","ex":["The decision caused a backlash."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03710","w":"outcry","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈaʊtkraɪ","uz":"ommaviy norozilik","ru":"общественное возмущение","ex":["There was an outcry over the closure."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03711","w":"uproar","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈʌprɔːr","uz":"shov-shuv, g'alva","ru":"шум, возмущение","ex":["The hall was in uproar."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03712","w":"precondition","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌpriːkənˈdɪʃən","uz":"dastlabki shart","ru":"предварительное условие","ex":["Peace is a precondition for trade."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03713","w":"prerequisite","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌpriːˈrekwəzɪt","uz":"zarur shart","ru":"необходимое условие","ex":["A degree is a prerequisite for the course."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03714","w":"variable","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈveriəbəl","uz":"o'zgaruvchi omil","ru":"переменная","ex":["Too many variables were left free."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03715","w":"offset","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌɔːfˈset","uz":"qoplab ketmoq","ru":"компенсировать","ex":["The savings offset the cost."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03716","w":"give rise to","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɡɪv ˈraɪz tuː","uz":"keltirib chiqarmoq","ru":"порождать","ex":["The delay gave rise to rumours."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03717","w":"stem from","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈstem frəm","uz":"kelib chiqmoq","ru":"проистекать из","ex":["The problem stems from poor wiring."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03718","w":"bring about","pos":"verb","ipa":"brɪŋ əˈbaʊt","uz":"amalga oshirmoq, keltirib chiqarmoq","ru":"вызывать, осуществлять","ex":["The war brought about huge change."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03719","w":"underlying","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌʌndərˈlaɪɪŋ","uz":"asosdagi, chuqurdagi","ru":"лежащий в основе","ex":["The underlying cause was never treated."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03720","w":"pivotal","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈpɪvətəl","uz":"hal qiluvchi","ru":"ключевой","ex":["Her evidence was pivotal."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03721","w":"engender","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪnˈdʒendər","uz":"yuzaga keltirmoq","ru":"порождать","ex":["The delay engendered mistrust."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03722","w":"contributory","pos":"adj","ipa":"kənˈtrɪbjətɔːri","uz":"hissa qo'shuvchi (sabab)","ru":"способствующий","ex":["Speed was a contributory factor."],"u":"S07U06"},{"id":"lex.03723","w":"passive","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpæsɪv","uz":"majhul nisbat","ru":"страдательный залог","ex":["The whole letter is written in the passive."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03724","w":"vetting","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈvetɪŋ","uz":"tekshiruvdan o'tkazish","ru":"проверка (кандидата)","ex":["Vetting takes about a month."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03725","w":"vet","pos":"verb","ipa":"vet","uz":"sinchiklab tekshirmoq","ru":"проверять","ex":["All applicants are vetted."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03726","w":"screening","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈskriːnɪŋ","uz":"dastlabki saralash","ru":"предварительный отбор","ex":["Screening removes half the forms."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03727","w":"eligibility","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌelɪdʒəˈbɪləti","uz":"huquqqa egalik","ru":"право на получение","ex":["Eligibility is checked first."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03728","w":"eligible","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈelɪdʒəbəl","uz":"huquqqa ega","ru":"имеющий право","ex":["You are eligible for the grant."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03729","w":"ineligible","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪnˈelɪdʒəbəl","uz":"huquqqa ega emas","ru":"не имеющий права","ex":["Part-time staff are ineligible."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03730","w":"entitled","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪnˈtaɪtəld","uz":"huquqli","ru":"имеющий право","ex":["You are entitled to a refund."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03731","w":"dispensation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌdɪspenˈseɪʃən","uz":"qoidadan ozod etish","ru":"особое разрешение","ex":["She was given a special dispensation."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03732","w":"exemption","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪɡˈzempʃən","uz":"ozod qilinish","ru":"освобождение (от обязанности)","ex":["Charities claim an exemption."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03733","w":"tribunal","pos":"noun","ipa":"traɪˈbjuːnəl","uz":"maxsus sud organi","ru":"трибунал, комиссия","ex":["The case went to a tribunal."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03734","w":"ruling","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈruːlɪŋ","uz":"rasmiy qaror","ru":"постановление","ex":["The ruling takes effect at once."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03735","w":"adjudicate","pos":"verb","ipa":"əˈdʒuːdɪkeɪt","uz":"hal qilib hukm chiqarmoq","ru":"выносить решение","ex":["An independent body adjudicates."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03736","w":"arbitrate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈɑːrbɪtreɪt","uz":"hakamlik qilmoq","ru":"выступать арбитром","ex":["A lawyer arbitrated between them."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03737","w":"expedite","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈekspɪdaɪt","uz":"jarayonni tezlashtirmoq","ru":"ускорять (процесс)","ex":["The letter expedited the claim."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03738","w":"scrutinize","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈskruːtɪnaɪz","uz":"sinchiklab o'rganmoq","ru":"тщательно изучать","ex":["Every claim is scrutinized."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03739","w":"reinstate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌriːɪnˈsteɪt","uz":"avvalgi holatiga qaytarmoq","ru":"восстанавливать (в должности)","ex":["The tribunal reinstated her."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03740","w":"suspend","pos":"verb","ipa":"səˈspend","uz":"vaqtincha to'xtatmoq","ru":"приостанавливать; отстранять","ex":["Services were suspended for a week."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03741","w":"revoke","pos":"verb","ipa":"rɪˈvoʊk","uz":"bekor qilmoq (ruxsatnomani)","ru":"отзывать, аннулировать","ex":["His licence was revoked."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03742","w":"deem","pos":"verb","ipa":"diːm","uz":"deb hisoblamoq","ru":"считать, признавать","ex":["The building was deemed unsafe."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03743","w":"outstanding","pos":"adj","ipa":"aʊtˈstændɪŋ","uz":"hali hal qilinmagan","ru":"неоплаченный, нерешённый","ex":["Two invoices are still outstanding."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03744","w":"claimant","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkleɪmənt","uz":"da'vogar, ariza beruvchi","ru":"заявитель, истец","ex":["The claimant must provide proof."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03745","w":"respondent","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈspɑːndənt","uz":"javob beruvchi tomon","ru":"ответчик; респондент","ex":["The respondent has 28 days to reply."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03746","w":"appellant","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈpelənt","uz":"apellyatsiya beruvchi","ru":"податель апелляции","ex":["The appellant won on one point."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03747","w":"custodian","pos":"noun","ipa":"kʌˈstoʊdiən","uz":"saqlovchi, mas'ul shaxs","ru":"хранитель","ex":["The library is the custodian of the archive."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03748","w":"intake","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɪnteɪk","uz":"qabul qilinganlar guruhi","ru":"набор, приём","ex":["This year's intake is larger."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03749","w":"caseload","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkeɪsloʊd","uz":"ish yuki (ishlar soni)","ru":"рабочая нагрузка (число дел)","ex":["Her caseload has doubled."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03750","w":"triage","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtriːɑːʒ","uz":"shoshilinchlik bo'yicha saralash","ru":"сортировка по срочности","ex":["Triage happens at the door."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03751","w":"referral","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈfɜːrəl","uz":"yo'llanma","ru":"направление","ex":["You need a referral from your doctor."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03752","w":"discharge","pos":"verb","ipa":"dɪsˈtʃɑːrdʒ","uz":"rasman ozod qilmoq, javob bermoq","ru":"выписывать; освобождать","ex":["She was discharged on Tuesday."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03753","w":"admission","pos":"noun","ipa":"ədˈmɪʃən","uz":"qabul qilinish","ru":"приём, госпитализация","ex":["Admission is free on Sundays."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03754","w":"disclosure","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪsˈkloʊʒər","uz":"ma'lumotni oshkor qilish","ru":"раскрытие информации","ex":["Full disclosure is required."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03755","w":"confidentiality","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌkɑːnfɪdenʃiˈæləti","uz":"maxfiylikni saqlash","ru":"конфиденциальность","ex":["Confidentiality applies to every file."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03756","w":"anonymity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌænəˈnɪməti","uz":"anonimlik","ru":"анонимность","ex":["Witnesses were promised anonymity."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03757","w":"safeguarding","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈseɪfɡɑːrdɪŋ","uz":"himoya choralari","ru":"защита уязвимых лиц","ex":["Safeguarding is everyone's responsibility."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03758","w":"statutory","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈstætʃətɔːri","uz":"qonunda belgilangan","ru":"установленный законом","ex":["There is a statutory minimum."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03759","w":"voluntary","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈvɑːlənteri","uz":"ixtiyoriy","ru":"добровольный","ex":["The scheme is voluntary."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03760","w":"bureaucratic","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌbjʊrəˈkrætɪk","uz":"byurokratik","ru":"бюрократический","ex":["The process is needlessly bureaucratic."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03761","w":"procedural","pos":"adj","ipa":"prəˈsiːdʒərəl","uz":"tartib-qoidaga oid","ru":"процедурный","ex":["The appeal failed on procedural grounds."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03762","w":"accreditation","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˌkredɪˈteɪʃən","uz":"akkreditatsiya","ru":"аккредитация","ex":["The college lost its accreditation."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03763","w":"accredit","pos":"verb","ipa":"əˈkredɪt","uz":"rasman tan olmoq","ru":"аккредитовать","ex":["Only accredited centres may test."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03764","w":"certify","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈsɜːrtɪfaɪ","uz":"rasman tasdiqlamoq","ru":"удостоверять","ex":["A doctor must certify the cause."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03765","w":"obligatory","pos":"adj","ipa":"əˈblɪɡətɔːri","uz":"majburiy","ru":"обязательный","ex":["Attendance is obligatory."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03766","w":"ombudsman","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɑːmbʊdzmən","uz":"ombudsman","ru":"омбудсмен","ex":["Take it to the ombudsman."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03767","w":"watchdog","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈwɑːtʃdɔːɡ","uz":"nazorat qiluvchi tashkilot","ru":"надзорный орган","ex":["The watchdog fined two firms."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03768","w":"inspectorate","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪnˈspektərət","uz":"inspeksiya organi","ru":"инспекция","ex":["The inspectorate visits every three years."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03769","w":"enroll","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪnˈroʊl","uz":"ro'yxatdan o'tmoq","ru":"записываться, зачислять","ex":["Two hundred students enrolled."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03770","w":"lodge","pos":"verb","ipa":"lɑːdʒ","uz":"rasman taqdim etmoq (shikoyat)","ru":"подавать (жалобу)","ex":["She lodged an appeal the same day."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03771","w":"look into","pos":"verb","ipa":"lʊk ˈɪntuː","uz":"tekshirib ko'rmoq","ru":"разбираться, изучать","ex":["We will look into the complaint."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03772","w":"follow up","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈfɑːloʊ ˈʌp","uz":"keyingi choralarni ko'rmoq","ru":"принимать дальнейшие меры","ex":["Nobody followed up the letter."],"u":"S07U07"},{"id":"lex.03773","w":"stack","pos":"verb","ipa":"stæk","uz":"ustma-ust qo'ymoq","ru":"складывать стопкой","ex":["Five nouns stacked together make an unreadable phrase."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03774","w":"chronology","pos":"noun","ipa":"krəˈnɑːlədʒi","uz":"voqealar ketma-ketligi","ru":"хронология","ex":["The chronology is set out in the appendix."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03775","w":"juncture","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdʒʌŋktʃər","uz":"hal qiluvchi payt","ru":"момент, этап","ex":["At this juncture, nothing is decided."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03776","w":"outset","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈaʊtset","uz":"boshlanish, ibtido","ru":"начало","ex":["We said so at the outset."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03777","w":"culmination","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌkʌlmɪˈneɪʃən","uz":"eng yuqori cho'qqisi","ru":"кульминация","ex":["The prize was the culmination of her career."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03778","w":"culminate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈkʌlmɪneɪt","uz":"avjiga chiqmoq","ru":"завершаться, достигать кульминации","ex":["The week culminates in a concert."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03779","w":"prelude","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpreljuːd","uz":"muqaddima, boshlanma","ru":"прелюдия, преддверие","ex":["The protests were a prelude to the strike."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03780","w":"backdrop","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈbækdrɑːp","uz":"voqealar fonida turgan sharoit","ru":"фон, обстановка","ex":["The vote came against a backdrop of strikes."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03781","w":"precede","pos":"verb","ipa":"prɪˈsiːd","uz":"oldin kelmoq","ru":"предшествовать","ex":["A short speech preceded the vote."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03782","w":"ensue","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪnˈsuː","uz":"ortidan kelib chiqmoq","ru":"последовать","ex":["A long argument ensued."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03783","w":"elapse","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪˈlæps","uz":"o'tmoq (vaqt haqida)","ru":"проходить (о времени)","ex":["Six months elapsed before a reply came."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03784","w":"unfold","pos":"verb","ipa":"ʌnˈfoʊld","uz":"asta-sekin ochilib bormoq","ru":"разворачиваться","ex":["The story unfolded over a week."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03785","w":"intervene","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌɪntərˈviːn","uz":"aralashmoq","ru":"вмешиваться","ex":["The manager intervened at once."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03786","w":"preceding","pos":"adj","ipa":"prɪˈsiːdɪŋ","uz":"oldingi","ru":"предшествующий","ex":["See the preceding paragraph."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03787","w":"subsequent","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈsʌbsɪkwənt","uz":"keyingi","ru":"последующий","ex":["Subsequent checks found nothing."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03788","w":"concurrent","pos":"adj","ipa":"kənˈkɜːrənt","uz":"bir vaqtda kechayotgan","ru":"одновременный","ex":["The two inquiries were concurrent."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03789","w":"intervening","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌɪntərˈviːnɪŋ","uz":"oradagi","ru":"промежуточный","ex":["In the intervening years she moved twice."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03790","w":"thereafter","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˌðerˈæftər","uz":"shundan keyin","ru":"после этого","ex":["Thereafter the rule applied to everyone."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03791","w":"hitherto","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˌhɪðərˈtuː","uz":"shu paytgacha","ru":"до сих пор","ex":["A hitherto unknown letter has appeared."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03792","w":"henceforth","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˌhensˈfɔːrθ","uz":"bundan buyon","ru":"впредь","ex":["Henceforth all requests must be written."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03793","w":"momentarily","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˌmoʊmənˈterəli","uz":"bir lahzaga","ru":"на мгновение","ex":["He paused momentarily."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03794","w":"abruptly","pos":"adv","ipa":"əˈbrʌptli","uz":"birdaniga","ru":"резко, внезапно","ex":["The meeting ended abruptly."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03795","w":"retrospect","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈretrəspekt","uz":"orqaga nazar","ru":"взгляд назад","ex":["In retrospect, we were lucky."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03796","w":"retrospective","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌretrəˈspektɪv","uz":"orqaga qaytarib qo'llanadigan","ru":"имеющий обратную силу","ex":["The rule is retrospective."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03797","w":"prospective","pos":"adj","ipa":"prəˈspektɪv","uz":"bo'lg'usi","ru":"будущий, потенциальный","ex":["Prospective buyers may view it on Sunday."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03798","w":"watershed","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈwɔːtərʃed","uz":"burilish nuqtasi","ru":"переломный момент","ex":["The vote was a watershed."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03799","w":"interlude","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɪntərluːd","uz":"oraliq davr","ru":"промежуток, интерлюдия","ex":["After a brief interlude the talks resumed."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03800","w":"epoch","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈepək","uz":"davr, epoxa","ru":"эпоха","ex":["It opened a new epoch in travel."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03801","w":"lapse","pos":"noun","ipa":"læps","uz":"e'tibordan chetda qolish, xato","ru":"промах, упущение","ex":["It was a lapse of concentration."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03802","w":"forthcoming","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌfɔːrθˈkʌmɪŋ","uz":"yaqinda bo'ladigan","ru":"предстоящий","ex":["See the forthcoming issue."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03803","w":"imminent","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈɪmɪnənt","uz":"yaqinlashib qolgan","ru":"неминуемый, близкий","ex":["A decision is imminent."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03804","w":"impending","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪmˈpendɪŋ","uz":"yaqinlashayotgan (yoqimsiz)","ru":"надвигающийся","ex":["They spoke of the impending closure."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03805","w":"successive","pos":"adj","ipa":"səkˈsesɪv","uz":"ketma-ket keladigan","ru":"последовательный","ex":["Three successive governments tried."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03806","w":"chronological","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌkrɑːnəˈlɑːdʒɪkəl","uz":"vaqt tartibida","ru":"хронологический","ex":["Keep the entries chronological."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03807","w":"belated","pos":"adj","ipa":"bɪˈleɪtɪd","uz":"kechikkan","ru":"запоздалый","ex":["A belated apology arrived."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03808","w":"premature","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌpriːməˈtʃʊr","uz":"muddatidan oldingi","ru":"преждевременный","ex":["The announcement was premature."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03809","w":"protracted","pos":"adj","ipa":"proʊˈtræktɪd","uz":"cho'zilib ketgan","ru":"затянувшийся","ex":["After protracted talks they signed."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03810","w":"fleeting","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈfliːtɪŋ","uz":"bir lahzalik","ru":"мимолётный","ex":["She caught a fleeting glimpse of him."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03811","w":"transient","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈtrænʃənt","uz":"o'tkinchi","ru":"преходящий","ex":["The effect is transient."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03812","w":"enduring","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪnˈdʊrɪŋ","uz":"uzoq davom etuvchi","ru":"прочный","ex":["The book has an enduring appeal."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03813","w":"perpetual","pos":"adj","ipa":"pərˈpetʃuəl","uz":"to'xtovsiz, doimiy","ru":"постоянный, вечный","ex":["He lives in perpetual motion."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03814","w":"intermittent","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌɪntərˈmɪtənt","uz":"uzuq-yuluq","ru":"прерывистый","ex":["There was intermittent rain all day."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03815","w":"sporadic","pos":"adj","ipa":"spəˈrædɪk","uz":"vaqti-vaqti bilan uchraydigan","ru":"эпизодический","ex":["There were sporadic protests."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03816","w":"recurrent","pos":"adj","ipa":"rɪˈkɜːrənt","uz":"takrorlanuvchi","ru":"повторяющийся","ex":["It is a recurrent problem."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03817","w":"cyclical","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈsɪklɪkəl","uz":"davriy takrorlanuvchi","ru":"циклический","ex":["The trade is cyclical."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03818","w":"staggered","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈstæɡərd","uz":"bosqichma-bosqich taqsimlangan","ru":"разнесённый по времени","ex":["We use staggered start times."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03819","w":"turning point","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtɜːrnɪŋ pɔɪnt","uz":"burilish nuqtasi","ru":"поворотный момент","ex":["The letter was the turning point."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03820","w":"in the wake of","pos":"phrase","ipa":"ɪn ðə ˈweɪk əv","uz":"ortidan, oqibatida","ru":"вслед за, в результате","ex":["In the wake of the report, two resigned."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03821","w":"bear in mind","pos":"verb","ipa":"ber ɪn ˈmaɪnd","uz":"yodda tutmoq","ru":"иметь в виду","ex":["Bear in mind that the data are old."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03822","w":"take into account","pos":"verb","ipa":"teɪk ɪntuː əˈkaʊnt","uz":"hisobga olmoq","ru":"принимать во внимание","ex":["Take the delay into account."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03823","w":"provenance","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈprɑːvənəns","uz":"kelib chiqish tarixi","ru":"происхождение","ex":["The painting has a clear provenance."],"u":"S07U08"},{"id":"lex.03824","w":"methodology","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌmeθəˈdɑːlədʒi","uz":"tadqiqot metodikasi","ru":"методология","ex":["The methodology is described in chapter two."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03825","w":"dataset","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdeɪtəset","uz":"ma'lumotlar to'plami","ru":"набор данных","ex":["The dataset covers ten years."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03826","w":"literature","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈlɪtərətʃər","uz":"mavzu bo'yicha adabiyot","ru":"литература (по теме)","ex":["The literature on this is thin."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03827","w":"findings","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfaɪndɪŋz","uz":"tadqiqot natijalari","ru":"выводы, результаты","ex":["The findings were published in June."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03828","w":"abstract","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈæbstrækt","uz":"annotatsiya","ru":"аннотация","ex":["Read the abstract first."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03829","w":"dissertation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌdɪsərˈteɪʃən","uz":"dissertatsiya","ru":"диссертация","ex":["Her dissertation ran to 200 pages."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03830","w":"thesis","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈθiːsɪs","uz":"asosiy tezis","ru":"тезис","ex":["State your thesis in the first paragraph."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03831","w":"peer","pos":"noun","ipa":"pɪr","uz":"tengdosh mutaxassis","ru":"коллега равного статуса","ex":["The paper was read by her peers."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03832","w":"plagiarism","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpleɪdʒərɪzəm","uz":"plagiat","ru":"плагиат","ex":["Plagiarism means an automatic fail."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03833","w":"synthesize","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈsɪnθəsaɪz","uz":"umumlashtirib birlashtirmoq","ru":"синтезировать","ex":["The review synthesizes forty studies."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03834","w":"replicate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈreplɪkeɪt","uz":"takroran o'tkazmoq","ru":"воспроизводить (исследование)","ex":["Nobody has replicated the result."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03835","w":"falsify","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈfɔːlsɪfaɪ","uz":"rad etib ko'rsatmoq; qalbakilashtirmoq","ru":"опровергать; фальсифицировать","ex":["A single case can falsify the rule."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03836","w":"conceptual","pos":"adj","ipa":"kənˈseptʃuəl","uz":"tushunchaviy","ru":"концептуальный","ex":["The problem is conceptual, not technical."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03837","w":"quantitative","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈkwɑːntɪteɪtɪv","uz":"miqdoriy","ru":"количественный","ex":["This is a quantitative study."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03838","w":"qualitative","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈkwɑːlɪteɪtɪv","uz":"sifatiy","ru":"качественный","ex":["They ran qualitative interviews."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03839","w":"longitudinal","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌlɑːndʒəˈtuːdɪnəl","uz":"uzoq muddatli kuzatuvli","ru":"лонгитюдный","ex":["It is a longitudinal study of 5,000 children."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03840","w":"monograph","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmɑːnəɡræf","uz":"monografiya","ru":"монография","ex":["She published a monograph on the topic."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03841","w":"anthology","pos":"noun","ipa":"ænˈθɑːlədʒi","uz":"antologiya, to'plam","ru":"антология","ex":["Her poem is in the new anthology."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03842","w":"corpus","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkɔːrpəs","uz":"til korpusi","ru":"корпус текстов","ex":["The corpus holds a billion words."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03843","w":"repository","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈpɑːzətɔːri","uz":"saqlash ombori","ru":"хранилище, репозиторий","ex":["The papers are in an online repository."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03844","w":"fieldwork","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfiːldwɜːrk","uz":"dala tadqiqoti","ru":"полевая работа","ex":["She spent a year doing fieldwork."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03845","w":"laboratory","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈlæbrətɔːri","uz":"laboratoriya","ru":"лаборатория","ex":["The samples went to the laboratory."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03846","w":"specimen","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈspesɪmən","uz":"namuna","ru":"образец","ex":["The specimen was damaged."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03847","w":"sampling","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsæmplɪŋ","uz":"namuna tanlash usuli","ru":"выборка, отбор","ex":["Random sampling avoids bias."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03848","w":"calibration","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌkælɪˈbreɪʃən","uz":"kalibrlash, sozlash","ru":"калибровка","ex":["The calibration was out by two degrees."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03849","w":"significance","pos":"noun","ipa":"sɪɡˈnɪfɪkəns","uz":"ahamiyat; statistik ishonchlilik","ru":"значимость","ex":["The difference has no statistical significance."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03850","w":"regression","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈɡreʃən","uz":"regressiya tahlili","ru":"регрессия","ex":["The regression shows a weak link."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03851","w":"variance","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈveriəns","uz":"tarqoqlik darajasi","ru":"дисперсия","ex":["The variance is high."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03852","w":"deviation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌdiːviˈeɪʃən","uz":"chetlanish","ru":"отклонение","ex":["Any deviation must be recorded."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03853","w":"outlier","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈaʊtlaɪər","uz":"keskin ajralib turgan qiymat","ru":"выброс, аномальное значение","ex":["One outlier skewed the average."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03854","w":"histogram","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈhɪstəɡræm","uz":"gistogramma","ru":"гистограмма","ex":["The histogram shows two peaks."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03855","w":"annotate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈænəteɪt","uz":"izohlar bilan to'ldirmoq","ru":"аннотировать","ex":["She annotated the whole draft."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03856","w":"endnote","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈendnoʊt","uz":"matn oxiridagi izoh","ru":"концевая сноска","ex":["The sources are in the endnotes."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03857","w":"glossary","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɡlɑːsəri","uz":"atamalar lug'ati","ru":"глоссарий","ex":["There is a glossary at the back."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03858","w":"preface","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈprefəs","uz":"so'zboshi","ru":"предисловие","ex":["The preface explains the method."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03859","w":"foreword","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfɔːrwɜːrd","uz":"boshqa muallif yozgan so'zboshi","ru":"предисловие (не автора)","ex":["The foreword is by her teacher."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03860","w":"postscript","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpoʊstskrɪpt","uz":"qo'shimcha izoh (oxirida)","ru":"постскриптум","ex":["She added a postscript in pencil."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03861","w":"rigor","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈrɪɡər","uz":"qat'iylik, puxtalik","ru":"строгость (метода)","ex":["The study lacks rigor."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03862","w":"interdisciplinary","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌɪntərˈdɪsəplɪneri","uz":"fanlararo","ru":"междисциплинарный","ex":["It is an interdisciplinary team."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03863","w":"attribution","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌætrɪˈbjuːʃən","uz":"muallifni ko'rsatish","ru":"атрибуция, указание авторства","ex":["Use the quote with attribution."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03864","w":"abstraction","pos":"noun","ipa":"æbˈstrækʃən","uz":"mavhumlashtirish","ru":"абстракция","ex":["Justice is an abstraction until somebody is wronged."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03865","w":"generalize","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈdʒenərəlaɪz","uz":"umumlashtirmoq","ru":"обобщать","ex":["You cannot generalize from one case."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03866","w":"extrapolation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪkˌstræpəˈleɪʃən","uz":"mavjud ma'lumotdan kelib chiqib bashorat","ru":"экстраполяция","ex":["That figure is an extrapolation."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03867","w":"axiom","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈæksiəm","uz":"aksioma","ru":"аксиома","ex":["The proof rests on two axioms."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03868","w":"postulate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈpɑːstʃəleɪt","uz":"faraz sifatida ilgari surmoq","ru":"постулировать","ex":["He postulates a third factor."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03869","w":"draw on","pos":"verb","ipa":"drɔː ˈɑːn","uz":"manba sifatida foydalanmoq","ru":"опираться на, использовать","ex":["The book draws on forty interviews."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03870","w":"in the light of","pos":"phrase","ipa":"ɪn ðə ˈlaɪt əv","uz":"shuni hisobga olib","ru":"в свете (чего-л.)","ex":["In the light of the new data, we revised the figure."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03871","w":"paradigm","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpærədaɪm","uz":"ilmiy paradigma","ru":"парадигма","ex":["The finding broke the old paradigm."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03872","w":"tenet","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtenɪt","uz":"asosiy qoida","ru":"принцип, постулат","ex":["It is a central tenet of the theory."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03873","w":"seminal","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈsemɪnəl","uz":"asos solgan, muhim","ru":"основополагающий","ex":["It is a seminal paper."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03874","w":"treatise","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtriːtɪs","uz":"ilmiy risola","ru":"трактат","ex":["He wrote a treatise on taxation."],"u":"S07U09"},{"id":"lex.03875","w":"marker","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmɑrkər","uz":"belgi, ko'rsatkich","ru":"маркер, указатель","ex":["'However' is a discourse marker."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03876","w":"improbable","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪmˈprɑːbəbəl","uz":"ehtimoldan uzoq","ru":"маловероятный","ex":["It is improbable but not impossible."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03877","w":"uncertainty","pos":"noun","ipa":"ʌnˈsɜːrtənti","uz":"noaniqlik","ru":"неопределённость","ex":["There is real uncertainty about the date."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03878","w":"conviction","pos":"noun","ipa":"kənˈvɪkʃən","uz":"qat'iy ishonch","ru":"убеждение","ex":["She spoke with conviction."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03879","w":"misgiving","pos":"noun","ipa":"mɪsˈɡɪvɪŋ","uz":"shubha, xavotir","ru":"опасение","ex":["I had misgivings from the start."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03880","w":"qualm","pos":"noun","ipa":"kwɑːm","uz":"vijdon azobi, ikkilanish","ru":"сомнение, угрызение","ex":["He had no qualms about asking."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03881","w":"approximation","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˌprɑːksɪˈmeɪʃən","uz":"taxminiy qiymat","ru":"приближение","ex":["Treat it as an approximation."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03882","w":"extrapolate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪkˈstræpəleɪt","uz":"mavjud ma'lumotdan kelib chiqib chamalamoq","ru":"экстраполировать","ex":["Do not extrapolate from one year."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03883","w":"presume","pos":"verb","ipa":"prɪˈzuːm","uz":"deb faraz qilmoq","ru":"предполагать","ex":["I presume the office is shut."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03884","w":"surmise","pos":"verb","ipa":"sərˈmaɪz","uz":"taxmin qilmoq","ru":"предполагать, догадываться","ex":["I surmised as much from her face."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03885","w":"guarded","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈɡɑːrdɪd","uz":"ehtiyotkor, o'ziga yopiq","ru":"сдержанный, осторожный","ex":["The reply was guarded."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03886","w":"categorical","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌkætəˈɡɔːrɪkəl","uz":"qat'iy, so'zsiz","ru":"категорический","ex":["He gave a categorical denial."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03887","w":"unequivocal","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌʌnɪˈkwɪvəkəl","uz":"bir ma'noli, shubhasiz","ru":"недвусмысленный","ex":["The evidence is unequivocal."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03888","w":"equivocal","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪˈkwɪvəkəl","uz":"ikki ma'noli","ru":"двусмысленный","ex":["The results were equivocal."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03889","w":"definitive","pos":"adj","ipa":"dɪˈfɪnətɪv","uz":"yakuniy, eng to'liq","ru":"окончательный","ex":["This is the definitive edition."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03890","w":"authoritative","pos":"adj","ipa":"əˈθɔːrəteɪtɪv","uz":"nufuzli, ishonchli","ru":"авторитетный","ex":["It is the authoritative account."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03891","w":"speculative","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈspekjələtɪv","uz":"taxminiy","ru":"спекулятивный, предположительный","ex":["That figure is speculative."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03892","w":"unverified","pos":"adj","ipa":"ʌnˈverɪfaɪd","uz":"tekshirilmagan","ru":"непроверенный","ex":["The figure is unverified."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03893","w":"unconfirmed","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌʌnkənˈfɜːrmd","uz":"tasdiqlanmagan","ru":"неподтверждённый","ex":["Unconfirmed reports speak of two injuries."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03894","w":"purported","pos":"adj","ipa":"pərˈpɔːrtɪd","uz":"go'yoki shunday deyilgan","ru":"предполагаемый, якобы","ex":["The purported letter has not been seen."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03895","w":"circumspect","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈsɜːrkəmspekt","uz":"har tomonlama ehtiyotkor","ru":"осмотрительный","ex":["She is circumspect in public."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03896","w":"wary","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈweri","uz":"ehtiyot bo'lgan","ru":"настороженный","ex":["Be wary of easy answers."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03897","w":"dubious","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈduːbiəs","uz":"shubhali","ru":"сомнительный","ex":["I am dubious about the figures."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03898","w":"presumably","pos":"adv","ipa":"prɪˈzuːməbli","uz":"ehtimol, chamasi","ru":"предположительно","ex":["Presumably they have been told."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03899","w":"conceivably","pos":"adv","ipa":"kənˈsiːvəbli","uz":"ehtimoldan xoli emas","ru":"возможно","ex":["It could conceivably take a year."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03900","w":"reputedly","pos":"adv","ipa":"rɪˈpjuːtɪdli","uz":"aytishlaricha","ru":"по слухам","ex":["He is reputedly the richest man here."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03901","w":"notionally","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈnoʊʃənəli","uz":"nazariy jihatdan","ru":"номинально, теоретически","ex":["She is notionally in charge."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03902","w":"nominally","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈnɑːmɪnəli","uz":"faqat nomigagina","ru":"номинально","ex":["He is nominally the owner."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03903","w":"tentatively","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈtentətɪvli","uz":"dastlabki tarzda","ru":"предварительно","ex":["We have tentatively agreed on June."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03904","w":"provisionally","pos":"adv","ipa":"prəˈvɪʒənəli","uz":"vaqtinchalik","ru":"предварительно","ex":["The date is provisionally set."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03905","w":"demonstrably","pos":"adv","ipa":"dɪˈmɑːnstrəbli","uz":"isbotlanadigan darajada","ru":"доказуемо","ex":["The claim is demonstrably false."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03906","w":"inevitably","pos":"adv","ipa":"ɪnˈevɪtəbli","uz":"muqarrar ravishda","ru":"неизбежно","ex":["Inevitably, some were disappointed."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03907","w":"invariably","pos":"adv","ipa":"ɪnˈveriəbli","uz":"doim, istisnosiz","ru":"неизменно","ex":["He is invariably late."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03908","w":"markedly","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈmɑːrkɪdli","uz":"sezilarli darajada","ru":"заметно","ex":["Attitudes have changed markedly."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03909","w":"appreciably","pos":"adv","ipa":"əˈpriːʃəbli","uz":"sezilarli miqdorda","ru":"ощутимо","ex":["Costs fell appreciably."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03910","w":"hedge","pos":"verb","ipa":"hedʒ","uz":"aniq javobdan qochmoq","ru":"уклоняться от прямого ответа","ex":["Stop hedging and give me a number."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03911","w":"qualifier","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkwɑːlɪfaɪər","uz":"cheklovchi so'z","ru":"уточняющее слово","ex":["Notice the qualifier 'usually'."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03912","w":"disclaimer","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪsˈkleɪmər","uz":"javobgarlikdan voz kechish izohi","ru":"оговорка об ответственности","ex":["There is a disclaimer at the bottom."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03913","w":"assurance","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈʃʊrəns","uz":"kafolatli va'da","ru":"заверение","ex":["We were given written assurances."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03914","w":"leeway","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈliːweɪ","uz":"erkinlik chegarasi","ru":"свобода действий","ex":["The rule allows some leeway."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03915","w":"latitude","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈlætɪtuːd","uz":"ixtiyor doirasi","ru":"свобода усмотрения","ex":["Staff are given wide latitude."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03916","w":"margin of error","pos":"phrase","ipa":"ˈmɑːrdʒɪn əv ˈerər","uz":"xatolik chegarasi","ru":"погрешность","ex":["The margin of error is three points."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03917","w":"rule of thumb","pos":"phrase","ipa":"ruːl əv ˈθʌm","uz":"amaliy qo'pol qoida","ru":"практическое правило","ex":["As a rule of thumb, allow two hours."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03918","w":"to some extent","pos":"phrase","ipa":"tuː səm ɪkˈstent","uz":"ma'lum darajada","ru":"в некоторой степени","ex":["To some extent I agree."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03919","w":"by and large","pos":"phrase","ipa":"baɪ ənd ˈlɑːrdʒ","uz":"umuman olganda","ru":"в целом","ex":["By and large the system works."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03920","w":"as a rule","pos":"phrase","ipa":"əz ə ˈruːl","uz":"odatda","ru":"как правило","ex":["As a rule we reply within a day."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03921","w":"more often than not","pos":"phrase","ipa":"mɔːr ˈɔːfən ðən nɑːt","uz":"ko'p hollarda","ru":"чаще всего","ex":["More often than not, she is right."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03922","w":"it would appear","pos":"phrase","ipa":"ɪt wʊd əˈpɪr","uz":"ko'rinishidan shunday","ru":"по-видимому","ex":["It would appear that nobody was told."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03923","w":"allow for","pos":"verb","ipa":"əˈlaʊ fər","uz":"hisobga olib zaxira qoldirmoq","ru":"учитывать, предусматривать","ex":["Allow for traffic on the way back."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03924","w":"hold back","pos":"verb","ipa":"hoʊld ˈbæk","uz":"aytmay turmoq, ushlab turmoq","ru":"придерживать; сдерживаться","ex":["She held back the last figure."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03925","w":"come to terms with","pos":"verb","ipa":"kʌm tuː ˈtɜːrmz wɪð","uz":"ko'nikmoq, qabul qilmoq","ru":"смириться с","ex":["He never came to terms with the loss."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03926","w":"conjecture","pos":"noun","ipa":"kənˈdʒektʃər","uz":"faraz, taxmin","ru":"догадка, предположение","ex":["That is pure conjecture."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03927","w":"prudence","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpruːdəns","uz":"ehtiyotkorlik, oqillik","ru":"благоразумие","ex":["Prudence suggests waiting a week."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03928","w":"tendency","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtendənsi","uz":"moyillik","ru":"тенденция, склонность","ex":["There is a tendency to overstate the risk."],"u":"S07U10"},{"id":"lex.03929","w":"smuggle","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈsmʌɡəl","uz":"yashirincha o'tkazmoq","ru":"провозить тайно, протаскивать","ex":["The clause smuggles a new duty into an old section."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03930","w":"refutation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌrefjuˈteɪʃən","uz":"rad etish, inkor","ru":"опровержение","ex":["The refutation took two pages."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03931","w":"digression","pos":"noun","ipa":"daɪˈɡreʃən","uz":"mavzudan chetga chiqish","ru":"отступление","ex":["Forgive the digression."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03932","w":"tangent","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtændʒənt","uz":"boshqa yo'nalishga o'tish","ru":"уход в сторону","ex":["She went off on a tangent."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03933","w":"signpost","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈsaɪnpoʊst","uz":"oldindan yo'l ko'rsatmoq","ru":"обозначать структуру","ex":["Signpost each section clearly."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03934","w":"recap","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈriːkæp","uz":"qisqacha takrorlab o'tmoq","ru":"кратко повторить","ex":["Let me recap the main points."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03935","w":"reiterate","pos":"verb","ipa":"riˈɪtəreɪt","uz":"qaytadan ta'kidlamoq","ru":"повторять, подчёркивать","ex":["Let me reiterate the deadline."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03936","w":"expound","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪkˈspaʊnd","uz":"batafsil bayon qilmoq","ru":"излагать подробно","ex":["He expounded his theory for an hour."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03937","w":"rambling","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈræmblɪŋ","uz":"chala-chulpa, uzundan-uzoq","ru":"бессвязный, многословный","ex":["It was a rambling answer."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03938","w":"succinct","pos":"adj","ipa":"səkˈsɪŋkt","uz":"lo'nda","ru":"лаконичный","ex":["Her summary was succinct."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03939","w":"verbose","pos":"adj","ipa":"vərˈboʊs","uz":"ortiqcha so'zli","ru":"многословный","ex":["The style is verbose."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03940","w":"pithy","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈpɪθi","uz":"qisqa va ta'sirchan","ru":"ёмкий, меткий","ex":["He gave a pithy reply."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03941","w":"terse","pos":"adj","ipa":"tɜːrs","uz":"keskin qisqa","ru":"сухой, краткий","ex":["The answer was terse."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03942","w":"crux","pos":"noun","ipa":"krʌks","uz":"gapning mag'zi","ru":"суть, ключевой момент","ex":["That is the crux of the matter."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03943","w":"gist","pos":"noun","ipa":"dʒɪst","uz":"asosiy mazmun","ru":"суть, общий смысл","ex":["I got the gist of it."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03944","w":"upshot","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈʌpʃɑːt","uz":"pirovard natija","ru":"итог","ex":["The upshot was that nobody went."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03945","w":"preamble","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpriːæmbəl","uz":"kirish qismi","ru":"преамбула","ex":["After a long preamble he came to the point."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03946","w":"aside","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈsaɪd","uz":"yo'l-yo'lakay aytilgan gap","ru":"замечание вскользь","ex":["He said it as an aside."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03947","w":"thrust","pos":"noun","ipa":"θrʌst","uz":"asosiy yo'nalish","ru":"основная мысль","ex":["The thrust of the paper is clear."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03948","w":"tenor","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtenər","uz":"umumiy ruh, ohang","ru":"общий характер, тон","ex":["The tenor of the meeting was hostile."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03949","w":"rhetoric","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈretərɪk","uz":"notiqlik san'ati; quruq gap","ru":"риторика","ex":["Strip away the rhetoric and little is left."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03950","w":"oratory","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɔːrətɔːri","uz":"notiqlik","ru":"ораторское искусство","ex":["His oratory filled the hall."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03951","w":"eloquence","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈeləkwəns","uz":"so'zga chechanlik","ru":"красноречие","ex":["She spoke with great eloquence."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03952","w":"verbosity","pos":"noun","ipa":"vərˈbɑːsəti","uz":"ortiqcha so'zamollik","ru":"многословие","ex":["The verbosity hides a thin argument."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03953","w":"polemic","pos":"noun","ipa":"pəˈlemɪk","uz":"keskin tanqidiy chiqish","ru":"полемика","ex":["The book is a polemic, not a study."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03954","w":"discourse","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdɪskɔːrs","uz":"muhokama, nutq","ru":"дискурс, рассуждение","ex":["Public discourse has coarsened."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03955","w":"exposition","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌekspəˈzɪʃən","uz":"izchil bayon","ru":"изложение","ex":["The exposition is admirably clear."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03956","w":"summation","pos":"noun","ipa":"səˈmeɪʃən","uz":"yakuniy xulosa","ru":"подведение итогов","ex":["Her summation lasted four minutes."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03957","w":"correspondingly","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˌkɔːrəˈspɑːndɪŋli","uz":"shunga mos ravishda","ru":"соответственно","ex":["Costs rose, and prices correspondingly."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03958","w":"accordingly","pos":"adv","ipa":"əˈkɔːrdɪŋli","uz":"shunga ko'ra","ru":"соответственно, поэтому","ex":["The rules changed; we acted accordingly."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03959","w":"alternatively","pos":"adv","ipa":"ɔːlˈtɜːrnətɪvli","uz":"yoki bo'lmasa","ru":"как вариант","ex":["Alternatively, we could postpone."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03960","w":"incidentally","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˌɪnsɪˈdentəli","uz":"aytgancha","ru":"кстати","ex":["Incidentally, the office moves in June."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03961","w":"admittedly","pos":"adv","ipa":"ədˈmɪtɪdli","uz":"tan olish kerakki","ru":"надо признать","ex":["Admittedly, the cost is high."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03962","w":"firstly","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈfɜːrstli","uz":"birinchidan","ru":"во-первых","ex":["Firstly, the cost. Secondly, the time."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03963","w":"secondly","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈsekəndli","uz":"ikkinchidan","ru":"во-вторых","ex":["Secondly, nobody was told."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03964","w":"lastly","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈlæstli","uz":"nihoyat, oxirgi bo'lib","ru":"наконец","ex":["Lastly, I want to thank the team."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03965","w":"notably","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈnoʊtəbli","uz":"ayniqsa","ru":"особенно","ex":["Several countries, notably Japan, disagreed."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03966","w":"cohesion","pos":"noun","ipa":"koʊˈhiːʒən","uz":"matn bog'lamlari","ru":"когезия, связность текста","ex":["Linkers give a text cohesion."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03967","w":"segue","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈseɡweɪ","uz":"silliq o'tish","ru":"плавный переход","ex":["That is a neat segue."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03968","w":"with regard to","pos":"phrase","ipa":"wɪð rɪˈɡɑːrd tuː","uz":"borasida","ru":"относительно","ex":["With regard to the delay, we apologise."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03969","w":"in terms of","pos":"phrase","ipa":"ɪn ˈtɜːrmz əv","uz":"shu jihatdan","ru":"с точки зрения","ex":["In terms of cost, it works."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03970","w":"as for","pos":"phrase","ipa":"əz ˈfɔːr","uz":"ga kelsak","ru":"что касается","ex":["As for the money, we will discuss it later."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03971","w":"for the sake of","pos":"phrase","ipa":"fər ðə ˈseɪk əv","uz":"uchun, xotirasi uchun","ru":"ради","ex":["For the sake of clarity, I will repeat it."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03972","w":"lose sight of","pos":"verb","ipa":"luːz ˈsaɪt əv","uz":"ko'zdan qochirmoq","ru":"упускать из виду","ex":["Do not lose sight of the main aim."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03973","w":"go over","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɡoʊ ˈoʊvər","uz":"qaytadan ko'rib chiqmoq","ru":"разбирать, повторять","ex":["Let us go over the figures once more."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03974","w":"sum up","pos":"verb","ipa":"sʌm ˈʌp","uz":"yakunlab xulosa qilmoq","ru":"подводить итог","ex":["To sum up, we need more time."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03975","w":"elucidate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪˈluːsɪdeɪt","uz":"yoritib bermoq","ru":"разъяснять","ex":["The footnote elucidates the term."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03976","w":"synopsis","pos":"noun","ipa":"sɪˈnɑːpsɪs","uz":"qisqacha bayon","ru":"краткое изложение","ex":["Send a one-page synopsis."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03977","w":"parenthesis","pos":"noun","ipa":"pəˈrenθəsɪs","uz":"qistirma","ru":"вводное замечание","ex":["The date is given in parenthesis."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03978","w":"rejoinder","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈdʒɔɪndər","uz":"keskin javob","ru":"резкий ответ","ex":["Her rejoinder silenced the room."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03979","w":"retort","pos":"verb","ipa":"rɪˈtɔːrt","uz":"keskin javob qaytarmoq","ru":"резко возразить","ex":["'Prove it,' he retorted."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03980","w":"cohesive","pos":"adj","ipa":"koʊˈhiːsɪv","uz":"bir-biriga bog'langan","ru":"связный, целостный","ex":["The argument is not cohesive."],"u":"S07U11"},{"id":"lex.03981","w":"accommodation","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˌkɑːməˈdeɪʃən","uz":"murosaga kelish","ru":"компромиссное решение","ex":["They reached an accommodation."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.03982","w":"accommodate","pos":"verb","ipa":"əˈkɑːmədeɪt","uz":"hisobga olib moslashmoq","ru":"идти навстречу","ex":["We can accommodate a later date."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.03983","w":"reciprocity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌresɪˈprɑːsəti","uz":"o'zaro javob berish","ru":"взаимность","ex":["The agreement rests on reciprocity."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.03984","w":"reciprocate","pos":"verb","ipa":"rɪˈsɪprəkeɪt","uz":"javoban shunday qilmoq","ru":"отвечать тем же","ex":["They reciprocated the gesture."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.03985","w":"diplomacy","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˈploʊməsi","uz":"diplomatiya, muomala san'ati","ru":"дипломатия","ex":["It took real diplomacy to settle it."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.03986","w":"tact","pos":"noun","ipa":"tækt","uz":"nazokat","ru":"такт","ex":["She handled it with tact."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.03987","w":"relent","pos":"verb","ipa":"rɪˈlent","uz":"yon bermoq","ru":"смягчиться, уступить","ex":["In the end the manager relented."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.03988","w":"yield","pos":"verb","ipa":"jiːld","uz":"taslim bo'lmoq, yon bermoq","ru":"уступать","ex":["Neither side would yield."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.03989","w":"conciliatory","pos":"adj","ipa":"kənˈsɪliətɔːri","uz":"murosaga chorlovchi","ru":"примирительный","ex":["He struck a conciliatory tone."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.03990","w":"intransigent","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪnˈtrænsɪdʒənt","uz":"murosasiz","ru":"непримиримый","ex":["The union remained intransigent."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.03991","w":"uncompromising","pos":"adj","ipa":"ʌnˈkɑːmprəmaɪzɪŋ","uz":"murosasiz, qat'iy","ru":"бескомпромиссный","ex":["She is uncompromising about safety."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.03992","w":"obstinate","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈɑːbstɪnət","uz":"o'jar","ru":"упрямый","ex":["He is obstinate about small things."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.03993","w":"deference","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdefərəns","uz":"hurmat bilan yon berish","ru":"почтительность","ex":["In deference to her age, they waited."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.03994","w":"cordial","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈkɔːrdʒəl","uz":"samimiy va xushmuomala","ru":"сердечный, тёплый","ex":["Relations remain cordial."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.03995","w":"amicable","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈæmɪkəbəl","uz":"do'stona, kelishuvli","ru":"полюбовный","ex":["They reached an amicable settlement."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.03996","w":"gracious","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈɡreɪʃəs","uz":"olijanob, iltifotli","ru":"любезный, великодушный","ex":["She was gracious in defeat."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.03997","w":"magnanimous","pos":"adj","ipa":"mæɡˈnænɪməs","uz":"kechirimli, saxovatli","ru":"великодушный","ex":["He was magnanimous about the mistake."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.03998","w":"grudging","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈɡrʌdʒɪŋ","uz":"istamaygina berilgan","ru":"неохотный","ex":["He gave grudging approval."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.03999","w":"wholehearted","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌhoʊlˈhɑːrtɪd","uz":"chin ko'ngildan","ru":"искренний, безоговорочный","ex":["You have my wholehearted support."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.04000","w":"olive branch","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɑːlɪv bræntʃ","uz":"yarashuv taklifi","ru":"оливковая ветвь","ex":["She held out an olive branch."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.04001","w":"mediate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈmiːdieɪt","uz":"vositachilik qilmoq","ru":"быть посредником","ex":["A colleague mediated between them."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.04002","w":"partisan","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈpɑːrtɪzən","uz":"bir tomonni qo'llovchi","ru":"пристрастный","ex":["The coverage was openly partisan."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.04003","w":"neutrality","pos":"noun","ipa":"nuːˈtræləti","uz":"betaraflik","ru":"нейтралитет","ex":["The country kept its neutrality."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.04004","w":"stalemate","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsteɪlmeɪt","uz":"boshi berk vaziyat","ru":"тупик, патовая ситуация","ex":["The talks ended in stalemate."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.04005","w":"deadlock","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdedlɑːk","uz":"tanglik, kelishmovchilik","ru":"тупик","ex":["The deadlock lasted three weeks."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.04006","w":"impasse","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɪmpæs","uz":"chiqib bo'lmas holat","ru":"безвыходное положение","ex":["They have reached an impasse."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.04007","w":"breakthrough","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈbreɪkθruː","uz":"keskin yutuq","ru":"прорыв","ex":["The breakthrough came on Friday."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.04008","w":"leverage","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈlevərɪdʒ","uz":"ta'sir o'tkazish kuchi","ru":"рычаг влияния","ex":["We have no leverage here."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.04009","w":"clout","pos":"noun","ipa":"klaʊt","uz":"ta'sir, nufuz","ru":"влияние, вес","ex":["She has real clout in the ministry."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.04010","w":"sway","pos":"noun","ipa":"sweɪ","uz":"ta'sir kuchi","ru":"влияние","ex":["He holds great sway on the board."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.04011","w":"notwithstanding","pos":"prep","ipa":"ˌnɑːtwɪθˈstændɪŋ","uz":"ga qaramasdan","ru":"несмотря на","ex":["Notwithstanding the cost, they went ahead."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.04012","w":"albeit","pos":"conj","ipa":"ɔːlˈbiːɪt","uz":"garchi, bo'lsa-da","ru":"хотя и","ex":["He agreed, albeit reluctantly."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.04013","w":"whereby","pos":"adv","ipa":"werˈbaɪ","uz":"shu yo'l bilan","ru":"посредством чего","ex":["A system whereby staff rotate every year."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.04014","w":"insofar","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˌɪnsoʊˈfɑːr","uz":"qay darajada bo'lsa, shu darajada","ru":"постольку, поскольку","ex":["I agree insofar as the cost is concerned."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.04015","w":"concur","pos":"verb","ipa":"kənˈkɜːr","uz":"rozi bo'lmoq (rasmiy)","ru":"соглашаться","ex":["The committee concurs with the finding."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.04016","w":"dissent","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˈsent","uz":"qarshi fikr","ru":"несогласие","ex":["There was one note of dissent."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.04017","w":"acquiesce","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌækwiˈes","uz":"indamay rozi bo'lmoq","ru":"молча соглашаться","ex":["She acquiesced in the decision."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.04018","w":"capitulate","pos":"verb","ipa":"kəˈpɪtʃəleɪt","uz":"taslim bo'lmoq","ru":"капитулировать","ex":["The company capitulated after a month."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.04019","w":"much as","pos":"phrase","ipa":"ˈmʌtʃ əz","uz":"qanchalik ... bo'lsa ham","ru":"как бы ни","ex":["Much as I admire her, I disagree."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.04020","w":"in fairness","pos":"phrase","ipa":"ɪn ˈfernəs","uz":"adolat yuzasidan aytganda","ru":"справедливости ради","ex":["In fairness, she was never told."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.04021","w":"up to a point","pos":"phrase","ipa":"ʌp tuː ə ˈpɔɪnt","uz":"ma'lum darajada","ru":"до определённой степени","ex":["I agree up to a point."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.04022","w":"give and take","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɡɪv ənd ˈteɪk","uz":"o'zaro yon berish","ru":"взаимные уступки","ex":["Any deal needs give and take."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.04023","w":"meet halfway","pos":"verb","ipa":"miːt ˈhæfweɪ","uz":"yarim yo'lda uchrashmoq","ru":"пойти на взаимные уступки","ex":["Let us meet halfway on the price."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.04024","w":"back down","pos":"verb","ipa":"bæk ˈdaʊn","uz":"orqaga chekinmoq","ru":"отступать, идти на попятную","ex":["Neither side would back down."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.04025","w":"go back on","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɡoʊ ˈbæk ɑːn","uz":"va'dasidan qaytmoq","ru":"нарушать (обещание)","ex":["They went back on the agreement."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.04026","w":"make up for","pos":"verb","ipa":"meɪk ˈʌp fər","uz":"o'rnini qoplamoq","ru":"компенсировать","ex":["Nothing can make up for the delay."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.04027","w":"truce","pos":"noun","ipa":"truːs","uz":"sulh","ru":"перемирие","ex":["A truce was agreed on Friday."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.04028","w":"overture","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈoʊvərtʃər","uz":"dastlabki taklif","ru":"первый шаг, предложение","ex":["They made overtures to the union."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.04029","w":"reconcile","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈrekənsaɪl","uz":"yarashtirmoq; muvofiqlashtirmoq","ru":"примирять; согласовывать","ex":["It is hard to reconcile the two accounts."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.04030","w":"arbiter","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɑːrbɪtər","uz":"hakam","ru":"арбитр","ex":["The court is the final arbiter."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.04031","w":"rapport","pos":"noun","ipa":"ræˈpɔːr","uz":"o'zaro til topishish","ru":"взаимопонимание","ex":["She built a rapport with the team quickly."],"u":"S07U12"},{"id":"lex.04032","w":"modify","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈmɑdɪfaɪ","uz":"o'zgartirmoq, aniqlamoq","ru":"изменять, определять","ex":["The design was modified twice before building began."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04033","w":"census","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsensəs","uz":"aholini ro'yxatga olish","ru":"перепись","ex":["The census is taken every ten years."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04034","w":"demographic","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌdeməˈɡræfɪk","uz":"aholi guruhi","ru":"демографическая группа","ex":["The paper targets an older demographic."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04035","w":"cohort","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkoʊhɔːrt","uz":"kuzatilayotgan guruh","ru":"когорта","ex":["The 1990 cohort was the largest."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04036","w":"canvass","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈkænvəs","uz":"so'rab chiqmoq","ru":"опрашивать, агитировать","ex":["They canvassed the whole street."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04037","w":"tabulate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈtæbjəleɪt","uz":"jadvalga joylashtirmoq","ru":"сводить в таблицу","ex":["The results are tabulated on page nine."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04038","w":"collate","pos":"verb","ipa":"kəˈleɪt","uz":"to'plab tartibga solmoq","ru":"сопоставлять, сводить","ex":["She collated the replies."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04039","w":"compile","pos":"verb","ipa":"kəmˈpaɪl","uz":"tuzib chiqmoq","ru":"составлять","ex":["He compiled the list from four sources."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04040","w":"enumerate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪˈnuːməreɪt","uz":"birma-bir sanab o'tmoq","ru":"перечислять","ex":["He enumerated five objections."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04041","w":"aggregate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈæɡrɪɡeɪt","uz":"jamlab birlashtirmoq","ru":"агрегировать, суммировать","ex":["The scores are aggregated at the end."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04042","w":"disaggregate","pos":"verb","ipa":"dɪsˈæɡrɪɡeɪt","uz":"tarkibiy qismlarga ajratmoq","ru":"разбивать на составляющие","ex":["Disaggregate the figure by age."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04043","w":"representative","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌreprɪˈzentətɪv","uz":"vakillik qiladigan","ru":"репрезентативный","ex":["The sample is representative."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04044","w":"unrepresentative","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌʌnreprɪˈzentətɪv","uz":"vakillik qilmaydigan","ru":"нерепрезентативный","ex":["The sample was unrepresentative."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04045","w":"random","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈrændəm","uz":"tasodifiy","ru":"случайный","ex":["We took a random sample."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04046","w":"skewed","pos":"adj","ipa":"skjuːd","uz":"bir tomonga og'gan","ru":"смещённый, искажённый","ex":["The results are skewed towards the young."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04047","w":"weighted","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈweɪtɪd","uz":"og'irlik berilgan","ru":"взвешенный","ex":["The figures are weighted by population."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04048","w":"weighting","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈweɪtɪŋ","uz":"og'irlik koeffitsienti","ru":"весовой коэффициент","ex":["The weighting is explained in the notes."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04049","w":"subset","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsʌbset","uz":"kichik guruh","ru":"подмножество","ex":["Only a subset answered."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04050","w":"segment","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈseɡmənt","uz":"bo'lak, segment","ru":"сегмент","ex":["The younger segment is growing."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04051","w":"stratum","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈstreɪtəm","uz":"ijtimoiy qatlam","ru":"слой, страта","ex":["Every stratum was sampled."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04052","w":"pollster","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpoʊlstər","uz":"so'rov o'tkazuvchi mutaxassis","ru":"социолог-опросник","ex":["The pollsters got it wrong again."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04053","w":"nonresponse","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌnɑːnrɪˈspɑːns","uz":"javob bermaslik","ru":"отсутствие ответов","ex":["Nonresponse was forty per cent."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04054","w":"oversample","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌoʊvərˈsæmpəl","uz":"ataylab ko'proq tanlab olmoq","ru":"делать избыточную выборку","ex":["Rural areas were oversampled."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04055","w":"tally","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtæli","uz":"hisob, sanoq","ru":"подсчёт","ex":["Keep a tally of the replies."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04056","w":"mean","pos":"noun","ipa":"miːn","uz":"o'rtacha qiymat","ru":"среднее значение","ex":["The mean is pulled up by one outlier."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04057","w":"per capita","pos":"phrase","ipa":"pər ˈkæpɪtə","uz":"jon boshiga","ru":"на душу населения","ex":["Income per capita has doubled."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04058","w":"cross-section","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkrɔːs sekʃən","uz":"kesma namuna","ru":"срез, выборка","ex":["We interviewed a cross-section of staff."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04059","w":"sample size","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsæmpəl saɪz","uz":"tanlanma hajmi","ru":"размер выборки","ex":["The sample size was only forty."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04060","w":"response rate","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈspɑːns reɪt","uz":"javob berish darajasi","ru":"доля ответивших","ex":["The response rate was thirty per cent."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04061","w":"self-reported","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌself rɪˈpɔːrtɪd","uz":"o'zi aytgan (ma'lumot)","ru":"самоотчётный","ex":["The heights were self-reported."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04062","w":"disproportionate","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌdɪsprəˈpɔːrʃənət","uz":"nomutanosib","ru":"непропорциональный","ex":["A disproportionate number came from one city."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04063","w":"proportionate","pos":"adj","ipa":"prəˈpɔːrʃənət","uz":"mutanosib","ru":"соразмерный","ex":["The penalty should be proportionate."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04064","w":"prevalence","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈprevələns","uz":"tarqalganlik darajasi","ru":"распространённость","ex":["The prevalence of the illness has fallen."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04065","w":"incidence","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɪnsɪdəns","uz":"yangi hodisalar chastotasi","ru":"заболеваемость, частота","ex":["The incidence of theft rose in winter."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04066","w":"pervasive","pos":"adj","ipa":"pərˈveɪsɪv","uz":"hamma joyga yoyilgan","ru":"повсеместный","ex":["The problem is pervasive."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04067","w":"rampant","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈræmpənt","uz":"avj olgan","ru":"безудержный","ex":["Inflation was rampant."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04068","w":"endemic","pos":"adj","ipa":"enˈdemɪk","uz":"doimiy mavjud","ru":"эндемичный, укоренившийся","ex":["Corruption was endemic in the system."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04069","w":"isolated","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈaɪsəleɪtɪd","uz":"yakka, alohida holat","ru":"единичный","ex":["It was an isolated incident."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04070","w":"which of whom","pos":"phrase","ipa":"wɪtʃ əv ˈhuːm","uz":"ularning qaysi biri","ru":"из которых","ex":["Forty staff replied, most of whom were part-time."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04071","w":"at random","pos":"phrase","ipa":"ət ˈrændəm","uz":"tavakkaliga","ru":"наугад","ex":["Names were drawn at random."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04072","w":"on average","pos":"phrase","ipa":"ɑːn ˈævərɪdʒ","uz":"o'rtacha hisobda","ru":"в среднем","ex":["On average, replies take three days."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04073","w":"the vast majority","pos":"phrase","ipa":"ðə væst məˈdʒɔːrəti","uz":"aksariyat ko'pchilik","ru":"подавляющее большинство","ex":["The vast majority never complain."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04074","w":"a handful of","pos":"phrase","ipa":"ə ˈhændfʊl əv","uz":"bir nechta, sanoqli","ru":"горстка, несколько","ex":["Only a handful of people came."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04075","w":"a great deal of","pos":"phrase","ipa":"ə ɡreɪt ˈdiːl əv","uz":"juda ko'p miqdorda","ru":"очень много","ex":["It took a great deal of time."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04076","w":"account for","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈkaʊnt fɔːr","uz":"ulushni tashkil qilish","ru":"составлять долю","ex":["Exports account for a third of income."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04077","w":"break down","pos":"verb","ipa":"breɪk ˈdaʊn","uz":"qismlarga ajratib ko'rsatmoq","ru":"разбивать (на части)","ex":["Break the figure down by region."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04078","w":"add up","pos":"verb","ipa":"æd ˈʌp","uz":"mantiqan to'g'ri chiqmoq","ru":"сходиться, иметь смысл","ex":["The numbers do not add up."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04079","w":"even out","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈiːvən ˈaʊt","uz":"tenglashib bormoq","ru":"выравниваться","ex":["The differences even out over a year."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04080","w":"percentile","pos":"noun","ipa":"pərˈsentaɪl","uz":"protsentil","ru":"процентиль","ex":["She is in the ninetieth percentile."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04081","w":"quartile","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkwɔːrtaɪl","uz":"chorak guruh","ru":"квартиль","ex":["The top quartile earns twice as much."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04082","w":"causal","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈkɔːzəl","uz":"sababiy","ru":"причинный","ex":["No causal link has been shown."],"u":"S07U13"},{"id":"lex.04083","w":"widespread","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈwaɪdspred","uz":"keng tarqalgan","ru":"широко распространённый","ex":["There is widespread support for the plan."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04084","w":"magnitude","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmæɡnɪtuːd","uz":"kattalik, miqyos","ru":"величина, масштаб","ex":["Nobody grasped the magnitude of the problem."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04085","w":"intensity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪnˈtensəti","uz":"kuchlilik darajasi","ru":"интенсивность","ex":["The intensity of the storm surprised them."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04086","w":"severity","pos":"noun","ipa":"sɪˈverəti","uz":"og'irlik darajasi","ru":"тяжесть, суровость","ex":["The severity of the penalty shocked people."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04087","w":"gravity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɡrævəti","uz":"jiddiylik","ru":"серьёзность","ex":["He did not grasp the gravity of it."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04088","w":"scope","pos":"noun","ipa":"skoʊp","uz":"qamrov; imkoniyat","ru":"охват; возможность","ex":["That is outside the scope of the report."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04089","w":"escalate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈeskəleɪt","uz":"keskinlashmoq; yuqoriga ko'tarmoq","ru":"обостряться; передавать выше","ex":["The dispute escalated quickly."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04090","w":"exacerbate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪɡˈzæsərbeɪt","uz":"battar yomonlashtirmoq","ru":"усугублять","ex":["The delay exacerbated the shortage."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04091","w":"alleviate","pos":"verb","ipa":"əˈliːvieɪt","uz":"yengillashtirmoq","ru":"облегчать","ex":["The grant alleviated the worst of it."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04092","w":"mitigate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈmɪtɪɡeɪt","uz":"zararini kamaytirmoq","ru":"смягчать","ex":["Steps were taken to mitigate the risk."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04093","w":"compound","pos":"verb","ipa":"kəmˈpaʊnd","uz":"ustiga-ustak og'irlashtirmoq","ru":"усугублять","ex":["The rain compounded the delay."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04094","w":"magnify","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈmæɡnɪfaɪ","uz":"kattalashtirmoq","ru":"увеличивать","ex":["The press magnified a small quarrel."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04095","w":"amplify","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈæmplɪfaɪ","uz":"kuchaytirmoq","ru":"усиливать","ex":["Social media amplified the story."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04096","w":"acute","pos":"adj","ipa":"əˈkjuːt","uz":"o'tkir, keskin","ru":"острый","ex":["There is an acute shortage of nurses."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04097","w":"profound","pos":"adj","ipa":"prəˈfaʊnd","uz":"chuqur, jiddiy","ru":"глубокий","ex":["The change had a profound effect."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04098","w":"far-reaching","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌfɑːr ˈriːtʃɪŋ","uz":"keng qamrovli","ru":"далеко идущий","ex":["The reforms are far-reaching."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04099","w":"negligible","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈneɡlɪdʒəbəl","uz":"arzimas darajada kichik","ru":"ничтожный","ex":["The difference is negligible."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04100","w":"trivial","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈtrɪviəl","uz":"arzimas","ru":"пустяковый","ex":["It is a trivial objection."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04101","w":"substantial","pos":"adj","ipa":"səbˈstænʃəl","uz":"salmoqli","ru":"существенный","ex":["There was a substantial rise."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04102","w":"drastic","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈdræstɪk","uz":"keskin chora sifatidagi","ru":"решительный, радикальный","ex":["Drastic action was needed."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04103","w":"radical","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈrædɪkəl","uz":"tubdan o'zgartiruvchi","ru":"радикальный","ex":["They proposed a radical rethink."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04104","w":"sweeping","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈswiːpɪŋ","uz":"keng qamrovli, umumiy","ru":"всеобъемлющий","ex":["Sweeping changes were announced."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04105","w":"incremental","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌɪnkrəˈmentəl","uz":"bosqichma-bosqich","ru":"постепенный","ex":["The gains were incremental."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04106","w":"cumulative","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈkjuːmjələtɪv","uz":"to'planib boruvchi","ru":"накопительный","ex":["The cumulative effect is serious."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04107","w":"adverse","pos":"adj","ipa":"ædˈvɜːrs","uz":"salbiy, noqulay","ru":"неблагоприятный","ex":["There were no adverse effects."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04108","w":"beneficial","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌbenɪˈfɪʃəl","uz":"foydali","ru":"благотворный","ex":["The change proved beneficial."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04109","w":"detriment","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdetrɪmənt","uz":"zarar","ru":"ущерб, вред","ex":["He worked long hours, to the detriment of his health."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04110","w":"cascade","pos":"noun","ipa":"kæˈskeɪd","uz":"zanjirli ketma-ketlik","ru":"каскад, цепь последствий","ex":["One failure set off a cascade."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04111","w":"snowball","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈsnoʊbɔːl","uz":"tobora kattalashib bormoq","ru":"нарастать как снежный ком","ex":["The campaign snowballed."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04112","w":"tipping point","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtɪpɪŋ pɔɪnt","uz":"burilish chegarasi","ru":"переломная точка","ex":["We may have passed the tipping point."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04113","w":"thereby","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˌðerˈbaɪ","uz":"shu bilan","ru":"тем самым","ex":["The deadline moved, thereby giving us a week."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04114","w":"thus","pos":"adv","ipa":"ðʌs","uz":"shu tariqa","ru":"таким образом","ex":["The wall was unsafe; thus the school closed."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04115","w":"hence","pos":"adv","ipa":"hens","uz":"shu sababli","ru":"отсюда, поэтому","ex":["The road was closed, hence the delay."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04116","w":"ensuing","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪnˈsuːɪŋ","uz":"ortidan kelgan","ru":"последовавший","ex":["In the ensuing confusion, two forms were lost."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04117","w":"resultant","pos":"adj","ipa":"rɪˈzʌltənt","uz":"natijada yuzaga kelgan","ru":"возникший в результате","ex":["The strike and the resultant shortage hurt sales."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04118","w":"so much so that","pos":"phrase","ipa":"soʊ mʌtʃ ˈsoʊ ðæt","uz":"shunchalikki","ru":"настолько, что","ex":["The hall was crowded, so much so that we stood."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04119","w":"to the extent that","pos":"phrase","ipa":"tuː ði ɪkˈstent ðæt","uz":"shu darajadaki","ru":"в той мере, в какой","ex":["I agree to the extent that costs matter."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04120","w":"with the result that","pos":"phrase","ipa":"wɪð ðə rɪˈzʌlt ðæt","uz":"natijada","ru":"в результате чего","ex":["The bridge closed, with the result that traffic doubled."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04121","w":"knock on","pos":"verb","ipa":"nɑːk ˈɑːn","uz":"keyingisiga ta'sir o'tkazmoq","ru":"отражаться на следующем","ex":["The delay knocked on to every later flight."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04122","w":"spiral","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈspaɪrəl","uz":"nazoratdan chiqib ketmoq","ru":"стремительно расти/падать","ex":["Costs spiralled after the first year."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04123","w":"curb","pos":"verb","ipa":"kɜːrb","uz":"jilovlamoq","ru":"сдерживать","ex":["The rules curb excessive spending."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04124","w":"stem","pos":"verb","ipa":"stem","uz":"to'xtatmoq, oldini olmoq","ru":"остановить, пресечь","ex":["Nothing could stem the losses."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04125","w":"offset","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɔːfset","uz":"qoplovchi omil","ru":"компенсация","ex":["The grant is an offset against the loss."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04126","w":"threshold effect","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈθreʃhoʊld ɪˈfekt","uz":"ostona ta'siri","ru":"пороговый эффект","ex":["There is a threshold effect at twenty degrees."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04127","w":"backfire","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈbækfaɪər","uz":"teskari natija bermoq","ru":"давать обратный эффект","ex":["The campaign backfired badly."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04128","w":"take its toll","pos":"verb","ipa":"teɪk ɪts ˈtoʊl","uz":"asta-sekin zarar yetkazmoq","ru":"сказываться, изматывать","ex":["The long hours took their toll."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04129","w":"wear down","pos":"verb","ipa":"wer ˈdaʊn","uz":"asta-sekin holdan toydirmoq","ru":"изматывать","ex":["The delays wore down their patience."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04130","w":"build up","pos":"verb","ipa":"bɪld ˈʌp","uz":"to'planib bormoq","ru":"накапливаться","ex":["Pressure built up over months."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04131","w":"neglect","pos":"verb","ipa":"nɪˈɡlekt","uz":"e'tiborsiz qoldirmoq","ru":"пренебрегать, запускать","ex":["The building has been neglected for years."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04132","w":"disregard","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌdɪsrɪˈɡɑːrd","uz":"e'tiborga olmaslik","ru":"игнорировать","ex":["Disregard the last paragraph."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04133","w":"confound","pos":"verb","ipa":"kənˈfaʊnd","uz":"chalkashtirib yubormoq; kutilmaganda rad etmoq","ru":"смешивать; опровергать","ex":["Age confounds the result."],"u":"S07U14"},{"id":"lex.04134","w":"endeavor","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪnˈdevər","uz":"jiddiy urinish","ru":"попытка, старание","ex":["It was a brave endeavor."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04135","w":"venture","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈventʃər","uz":"tavakkal ish","ru":"рискованное предприятие","ex":["The venture failed in its first year."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04136","w":"recollect","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌrekəˈlekt","uz":"eslamoq","ru":"припоминать","ex":["I do not recollect saying that."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04137","w":"intend","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪnˈtend","uz":"niyat qilmoq","ru":"намереваться","ex":["I intend to write this week."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04138","w":"inadvertent","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌɪnədˈvɜːrtənt","uz":"beixtiyor","ru":"непреднамеренный","ex":["It was an inadvertent omission."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04139","w":"inadvertently","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˌɪnədˈvɜːrtəntli","uz":"beixtiyor ravishda","ru":"непреднамеренно","ex":["She inadvertently deleted the file."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04140","w":"unintentional","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌʌnɪnˈtenʃənəl","uz":"qasddan qilinmagan","ru":"непреднамеренный","ex":["Any offence was unintentional."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04141","w":"premeditated","pos":"adj","ipa":"priˈmedɪteɪtɪd","uz":"oldindan o'ylangan","ru":"преднамеренный","ex":["The attack was premeditated."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04142","w":"spontaneous","pos":"adj","ipa":"spɑːnˈteɪniəs","uz":"o'z-o'zidan bo'lgan","ru":"спонтанный","ex":["There was spontaneous applause."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04143","w":"impulsive","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪmˈpʌlsɪv","uz":"o'ylamasdan ish tutadigan","ru":"импульсивный","ex":["It was an impulsive purchase."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04144","w":"instinctive","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪnˈstɪŋktɪv","uz":"ichki tuyg'u bilan qilingan","ru":"инстинктивный","ex":["Her reaction was instinctive."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04145","w":"conscious","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈkɑːnʃəs","uz":"ongli, bilib turib qilingan","ru":"осознанный","ex":["It was a conscious decision."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04146","w":"unconscious","pos":"adj","ipa":"ʌnˈkɑːnʃəs","uz":"ongsiz, bexabar","ru":"бессознательный","ex":["There is an unconscious bias here."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04147","w":"subconscious","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌsʌbˈkɑːnʃəs","uz":"ong osti","ru":"подсознательный","ex":["There may be a subconscious motive."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04148","w":"awareness","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈwernəs","uz":"xabardorlik","ru":"осведомлённость","ex":["Awareness of the risk is low."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04149","w":"oblivious","pos":"adj","ipa":"əˈblɪviəs","uz":"hech narsadan bexabar","ru":"не замечающий","ex":["He was oblivious to the noise."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04150","w":"engrossed","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪnˈɡroʊst","uz":"butunlay berilib ketgan","ru":"поглощённый","ex":["She was engrossed in the report."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04151","w":"preoccupied","pos":"adj","ipa":"priˈɑːkjəpaɪd","uz":"boshqa narsa bilan band","ru":"озабоченный, поглощённый","ex":["He seemed preoccupied all morning."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04152","w":"observant","pos":"adj","ipa":"əbˈzɜːrvənt","uz":"sinchkov","ru":"наблюдательный","ex":["An observant neighbour called the police."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04153","w":"perceptive","pos":"adj","ipa":"pərˈseptɪv","uz":"zukko, sezgir","ru":"проницательный","ex":["That is a perceptive question."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04154","w":"perceive","pos":"verb","ipa":"pərˈsiːv","uz":"sezmoq; shunday deb qabul qilmoq","ru":"воспринимать","ex":["He perceived a change in her tone."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04155","w":"perception","pos":"noun","ipa":"pərˈsepʃən","uz":"idrok, tasavvur","ru":"восприятие","ex":["Perception matters as much as reality here."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04156","w":"glimpse","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɡlɪmps","uz":"bir ko'z tashlash","ru":"мимолётный взгляд","ex":["She caught a glimpse of him."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04157","w":"overhear","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌoʊvərˈhɪr","uz":"beixtiyor eshitib qolmoq","ru":"случайно услышать","ex":["I overheard them in the corridor."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04158","w":"discernible","pos":"adj","ipa":"dɪˈsɜːrnəbəl","uz":"arang sezilarli","ru":"различимый","ex":["There is no discernible pattern."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04159","w":"imperceptible","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌɪmpərˈseptəbəl","uz":"sezilmaydigan","ru":"незаметный","ex":["The change was almost imperceptible."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04160","w":"regret","pos":"verb","ipa":"rɪˈɡret","uz":"afsuslanmoq","ru":"сожалеть","ex":["I regret not asking sooner."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04161","w":"witness","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈwɪtnəs","uz":"guvoh bo'lmoq","ru":"быть свидетелем","ex":["Two people witnessed the accident."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04162","w":"testify","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈtestɪfaɪ","uz":"guvohlik bermoq","ru":"давать показания","ex":["He refused to testify."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04163","w":"attempt","pos":"verb","ipa":"əˈtempt","uz":"urinib ko'rmoq","ru":"пытаться","ex":["Do not attempt the last question."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04164","w":"endeavor","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪnˈdevər","uz":"harakat qilmoq (rasmiy)","ru":"стараться","ex":["We endeavor to reply within a day."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04165","w":"strive","pos":"verb","ipa":"straɪv","uz":"intilmoq","ru":"стремиться","ex":["They strive for accuracy above all."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04166","w":"go on","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɡoʊ ˈɑːn","uz":"davom etmoq; keyin o'tmoq","ru":"продолжать; перейти к","ex":["She went on writing until midnight."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04167","w":"take up","pos":"verb","ipa":"teɪk ˈʌp","uz":"shug'ullana boshlamoq","ru":"начать заниматься","ex":["He took up running last year."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04168","w":"take on","pos":"verb","ipa":"teɪk ˈɑːn","uz":"zimmasiga olmoq","ru":"брать на себя","ex":["She took on the whole project."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04169","w":"work out","pos":"verb","ipa":"wɜːrk ˈaʊt","uz":"hisoblab topmoq; yaxshi yakunlanmoq","ru":"выяснять; сложиться удачно","ex":["I worked out the cost."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04170","w":"go through with","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɡoʊ ˈθruː wɪð","uz":"oxirigacha bajarmoq","ru":"довести до конца","ex":["She went through with the interview."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04171","w":"retention","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈtenʃən","uz":"saqlab qolish","ru":"удержание, сохранение","ex":["Retention of new words improves with sleep."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04172","w":"retrieval","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈtriːvəl","uz":"qayta chaqirib olish","ru":"извлечение, поиск","ex":["Retrieval is harder than recognition."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04173","w":"vivid","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈvɪvɪd","uz":"yorqin, aniq","ru":"яркий, живой","ex":["I have a vivid memory of that day."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04174","w":"hazy","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈheɪzi","uz":"xira, noaniq","ru":"смутный","ex":["My memory of it is hazy."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04175","w":"recount","pos":"verb","ipa":"rɪˈkaʊnt","uz":"hikoya qilib bermoq","ru":"рассказывать","ex":["She recounted the whole evening."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04176","w":"depict","pos":"verb","ipa":"dɪˈpɪkt","uz":"tasvirlamoq","ru":"изображать","ex":["The report depicts a service under strain."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04177","w":"evoke","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪˈvoʊk","uz":"uyg'otmoq (xotirani)","ru":"вызывать (воспоминание)","ex":["The smell evoked her childhood."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04178","w":"perseverance","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌpɜːrsəˈvɪrəns","uz":"sabot, matonat","ru":"упорство","ex":["It took perseverance to finish."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04179","w":"tenacity","pos":"noun","ipa":"təˈnæsəti","uz":"qat'iyat","ru":"упорство, цепкость","ex":["She argued with real tenacity."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04180","w":"falter","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈfɔːltər","uz":"ikkilanib qolmoq","ru":"дрогнуть, запнуться","ex":["Her voice faltered."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04181","w":"waver","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈweɪvər","uz":"ikkilanmoq","ru":"колебаться","ex":["He wavered for a week."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04182","w":"procrastinate","pos":"verb","ipa":"proʊˈkræstɪneɪt","uz":"ishni orqaga surib yurmoq","ru":"откладывать, тянуть","ex":["Stop procrastinating and write it."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04183","w":"shirk","pos":"verb","ipa":"ʃɜːrk","uz":"mas'uliyatdan qochmoq","ru":"уклоняться","ex":["Nobody here shirks the difficult jobs."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04184","w":"inclination","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌɪnklɪˈneɪʃən","uz":"moyillik","ru":"склонность","ex":["I have no inclination to argue."],"u":"S07U15"},{"id":"lex.04185","w":"haggle","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈhæɡəl","uz":"narx ustida savdolashmoq","ru":"торговаться","ex":["They haggled for twenty minutes."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04186","w":"budge","pos":"verb","ipa":"bʌdʒ","uz":"qimirlamoq, yon bermoq","ru":"сдвинуться, уступить","ex":["He would not budge on the date."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04187","w":"stall","pos":"verb","ipa":"stɔːl","uz":"vaqt yutish uchun cho'zmoq","ru":"тянуть время","ex":["They stalled for a fortnight."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04188","w":"amenable","pos":"adj","ipa":"əˈmiːnəbəl","uz":"ko'ndirish oson","ru":"сговорчивый","ex":["He is amenable to a later date."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04189","w":"receptive","pos":"adj","ipa":"rɪˈseptɪv","uz":"yangilikka ochiq","ru":"восприимчивый","ex":["The board was receptive to the plan."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04190","w":"mutually","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈmjuːtʃuəli","uz":"o'zaro","ru":"взаимно","ex":["We reached a mutually acceptable figure."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04191","w":"reciprocally","pos":"adv","ipa":"rɪˈsɪprəkli","uz":"o'zaro javoban","ru":"взаимно, обоюдно","ex":["The two countries reciprocally recognise the licence."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04192","w":"jointly","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈdʒɔɪntli","uz":"birgalikda","ru":"совместно","ex":["The report was written jointly."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04193","w":"unilaterally","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˌjuːnɪˈlætərəli","uz":"bir tomonlama","ru":"в одностороннем порядке","ex":["They changed the terms unilaterally."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04194","w":"bilaterally","pos":"adv","ipa":"baɪˈlætərəli","uz":"ikki tomonlama","ru":"двусторонне","ex":["The dispute was settled bilaterally."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04195","w":"counteroffer","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkaʊntərɔːfər","uz":"qarshi taklif","ru":"встречное предложение","ex":["Her counteroffer was accepted."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04196","w":"ultimatum","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌʌltɪˈmeɪtəm","uz":"so'nggi talab","ru":"ультиматум","ex":["They issued an ultimatum."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04197","w":"sweetener","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈswiːtənər","uz":"qo'shimcha rag'bat","ru":"подсластитель, бонус","ex":["They threw in a sweetener."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04198","w":"inducement","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪnˈduːsmənt","uz":"rag'batlantiruvchi taklif","ru":"побудительный стимул","ex":["No inducement would change her mind."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04199","w":"rebate","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈriːbeɪt","uz":"qaytariladigan to'lov","ru":"возврат, скидка","ex":["You may claim a tax rebate."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04200","w":"barter","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈbɑːrtər","uz":"ayirboshlamoq","ru":"менять, обменивать","ex":["They bartered wheat for fuel."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04201","w":"trade-off","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtreɪd ɔːf","uz":"murosaviy tanlov","ru":"компромисс, размен","ex":["There is a trade-off between speed and cost."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04202","w":"auction","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɔːkʃən","uz":"kim oshdi savdosi","ru":"аукцион","ex":["The painting went to auction."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04203","w":"bidder","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈbɪdər","uz":"taklif qiluvchi","ru":"участник торгов","ex":["The highest bidder takes it."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04204","w":"broker","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈbroʊkər","uz":"vositachi, broker","ru":"брокер, посредник","ex":["An insurance broker found a cheaper policy."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04205","w":"intermediary","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌɪntərˈmiːdieri","uz":"vositachi","ru":"посредник","ex":["They spoke through an intermediary."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04206","w":"brokerage","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈbroʊkərɪdʒ","uz":"vositachilik xizmati","ru":"брокерские услуги","ex":["Brokerage is two per cent."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04207","w":"retainer","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈteɪnər","uz":"doimiy xizmat haqi","ru":"гонорар за постоянные услуги","ex":["The lawyer is on a retainer."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04208","w":"lessee","pos":"noun","ipa":"leˈsiː","uz":"ijaraga oluvchi","ru":"арендатор","ex":["The lessee pays for repairs."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04209","w":"lessor","pos":"noun","ipa":"leˈsɔːr","uz":"ijaraga beruvchi","ru":"арендодатель","ex":["The lessor keeps the deposit."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04210","w":"concurrence","pos":"noun","ipa":"kənˈkɜːrəns","uz":"rozilik bildirish","ru":"согласие","ex":["The plan has the board's concurrence."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04211","w":"renegotiate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌriːnɪˈɡoʊʃieɪt","uz":"shartlarni qayta muhokama qilmoq","ru":"пересматривать условия","ex":["They renegotiated the rent."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04212","w":"so do I","pos":"phrase","ipa":"ˈsoʊ duː aɪ","uz":"men ham shundayman","ru":"и я тоже","ex":["'I think it is too expensive.' 'So do I.'"],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04213","w":"neither do I","pos":"phrase","ipa":"ˈniːðər duː aɪ","uz":"men ham yo'q","ru":"и я тоже нет","ex":["'I do not agree.' 'Neither do I.'"],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04214","w":"nor have they","pos":"phrase","ipa":"ˈnɔːr hæv ðeɪ","uz":"ular ham qilmagan","ru":"и они тоже не","ex":["We have not been told, nor have they."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04215","w":"I would rather not","pos":"phrase","ipa":"aɪ wʊd ˈræðər nɑːt","uz":"istamayman (xushmuomala rad)","ru":"я предпочёл бы не","ex":["'Shall I mention it?' 'I would rather not.'"],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04216","w":"I am afraid not","pos":"phrase","ipa":"aɪ əm əˈfreɪd nɑːt","uz":"afsuski, yo'q","ru":"боюсь, что нет","ex":["'Is there any left?' 'I am afraid not.'"],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04217","w":"if not","pos":"phrase","ipa":"ɪf ˈnɑːt","uz":"bo'lmasa; hatto","ru":"если не; а то и","ex":["It will take weeks, if not months."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04218","w":"I hope so","pos":"phrase","ipa":"aɪ ˈhoʊp soʊ","uz":"umid qilaman shunday bo'ladi","ru":"надеюсь, что да","ex":["'Will they agree?' 'I hope so.'"],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04219","w":"do so","pos":"verb","ipa":"duː ˈsoʊ","uz":"shunday qilmoq","ru":"сделать это","ex":["Anyone wishing to object may do so in writing."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04220","w":"split the difference","pos":"verb","ipa":"splɪt ðə ˈdɪfrəns","uz":"farqni teng bo'lishmoq","ru":"сойтись на середине","ex":["Let us split the difference."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04221","w":"strike a deal","pos":"verb","ipa":"straɪk ə ˈdiːl","uz":"kelishuvga erishmoq","ru":"заключить сделку","ex":["They struck a deal at midnight."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04222","w":"hold out for","pos":"verb","ipa":"hoʊld ˈaʊt fər","uz":"talabida turib olmoq","ru":"настаивать, добиваться","ex":["She held out for a written promise."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04223","w":"settle for","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈsetəl fər","uz":"roziga ko'nmoq","ru":"довольствоваться","ex":["We settled for half."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04224","w":"talk round","pos":"verb","ipa":"tɔːk ˈraʊnd","uz":"ko'ndirmoq","ru":"переубедить","ex":["She talked him round in an hour."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04225","w":"push for","pos":"verb","ipa":"pʊʃ ˈfɔːr","uz":"qat'iy talab qilmoq","ru":"добиваться","ex":["The union pushed for a review."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04226","w":"call off","pos":"verb","ipa":"kɔːl ˈɔːf","uz":"bekor qilmoq","ru":"отменять","ex":["The talks were called off."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04227","w":"iron out","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈaɪərn ˈaʊt","uz":"mayda muammolarni hal qilmoq","ru":"утрясти, урегулировать","ex":["We still have details to iron out."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04228","w":"clinch","pos":"verb","ipa":"klɪntʃ","uz":"yakuniy kelishuvni mustahkamlamoq","ru":"окончательно заключить","ex":["The offer clinched it."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04229","w":"concede ground","pos":"verb","ipa":"kənˈsiːd ˈɡraʊnd","uz":"mavqeidan yon bermoq","ru":"сдавать позиции","ex":["Neither side would concede ground."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04230","w":"in principle","pos":"phrase","ipa":"ɪn ˈprɪnsəpəl","uz":"prinsip jihatdan","ru":"в принципе","ex":["We agree in principle."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04231","w":"accord","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈkɔːrd","uz":"kelishuv, bitim","ru":"соглашение","ex":["The two sides signed an accord."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04232","w":"pact","pos":"noun","ipa":"pækt","uz":"shartnoma, ahd","ru":"пакт, договор","ex":["They made a pact not to undercut each other."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04233","w":"relinquish","pos":"verb","ipa":"rɪˈlɪŋkwɪʃ","uz":"voz kechmoq","ru":"отказываться от, уступать","ex":["She relinquished the claim."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04234","w":"forfeiture","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfɔːrfɪtʃər","uz":"jarima tariqasida yo'qotish","ru":"утрата, конфискация","ex":["Late payment means forfeiture of the deposit."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04235","w":"whether","pos":"conj","ipa":"ˈweðər","uz":"mi, yoki yo'qmi","ru":"ли","ex":["She asked whether the office was open."],"u":"S07U16"},{"id":"lex.04236","w":"enquire","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪnˈkwaɪər","uz":"so'rab bilmoq","ru":"справляться, запрашивать","ex":["She enquired about the deadline."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04237","w":"appraise","pos":"verb","ipa":"əˈpreɪz","uz":"baholamoq","ru":"оценивать","ex":["Managers appraise staff every year."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04238","w":"critique","pos":"noun","ipa":"krɪˈtiːk","uz":"tanqidiy tahlil","ru":"критический разбор","ex":["She wrote a critique of the method."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04239","w":"commend","pos":"verb","ipa":"kəˈmend","uz":"rasman maqtamoq","ru":"хвалить, отмечать","ex":["The panel commended her work."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04240","w":"commendation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌkɑːmenˈdeɪʃən","uz":"rasmiy tahsin","ru":"поощрение, похвала","ex":["She received a commendation."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04241","w":"reprimand","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈreprɪmænd","uz":"rasman tanbeh bermoq","ru":"делать выговор","ex":["He was reprimanded for lateness."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04242","w":"rebuke","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈbjuːk","uz":"qattiq tanbeh","ru":"упрёк, порицание","ex":["The letter was a public rebuke."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04243","w":"censure","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsenʃər","uz":"rasmiy qoralash","ru":"порицание","ex":["The report was a censure of the whole board."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04244","w":"candid","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈkændɪd","uz":"ochiq, samimiy","ru":"откровенный","ex":["She gave a candid assessment."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04245","w":"forthright","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈfɔːrθraɪt","uz":"to'g'riso'z","ru":"прямолинейный","ex":["He is forthright about the risks."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04246","w":"scathing","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈskeɪðɪŋ","uz":"achchiq tanqidiy","ru":"уничтожающий","ex":["The review was scathing."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04247","w":"damning","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈdæmɪŋ","uz":"ayblovchi, fosh qiluvchi","ru":"изобличающий","ex":["The report is damning."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04248","w":"glowing","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈɡloʊɪŋ","uz":"maqtovga to'la","ru":"восторженный","ex":["She got a glowing reference."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04249","w":"lukewarm","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈluːkwɔːrm","uz":"sovuqqon, ilimiq","ru":"прохладный, вялый","ex":["The response was lukewarm."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04250","w":"perfunctory","pos":"adj","ipa":"pərˈfʌŋktəri","uz":"shunchaki qilingan","ru":"поверхностный, формальный","ex":["He gave a perfunctory nod."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04251","w":"cursory","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈkɜːrsəri","uz":"yuzaki, shoshib qilingan","ru":"беглый","ex":["A cursory glance showed the error."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04252","w":"painstaking","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈpeɪnzteɪkɪŋ","uz":"puxta va mashaqqatli","ru":"кропотливый","ex":["It was painstaking work."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04253","w":"meticulous","pos":"adj","ipa":"məˈtɪkjələs","uz":"nihoyatda sinchkov","ru":"дотошный","ex":["His notes are meticulous."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04254","w":"slapdash","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈslæpdæʃ","uz":"shoshma-shosharlik bilan qilingan","ru":"небрежный","ex":["The work was slapdash."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04255","w":"probing","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈproʊbɪŋ","uz":"chuqur kirib boruvchi","ru":"дотошный, зондирующий","ex":["She asked probing questions."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04256","w":"leading","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈliːdɪŋ","uz":"javobni ishora qiluvchi","ru":"наводящий","ex":["That is a leading question."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04257","w":"loaded","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈloʊdɪd","uz":"yashirin da'vosi bor","ru":"с подвохом","ex":["'Why did you lie?' is a loaded question."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04258","w":"open-ended","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌoʊpən ˈendɪd","uz":"erkin javobli","ru":"открытый (о вопросе)","ex":["Ask an open-ended question."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04259","w":"debrief","pos":"verb","ipa":"diːˈbriːf","uz":"yakuniy suhbat o'tkazmoq","ru":"проводить разбор","ex":["The team was debriefed on Monday."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04260","w":"solicit","pos":"verb","ipa":"səˈlɪsɪt","uz":"rasman so'ramoq","ru":"запрашивать","ex":["We solicited views from all staff."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04261","w":"elicit","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪˈlɪsɪt","uz":"javob chiqarib olmoq","ru":"вызывать, добиваться (ответа)","ex":["The question elicited no answer."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04262","w":"substantiated","pos":"adj","ipa":"səbˈstænʃieɪtɪd","uz":"dalil bilan tasdiqlangan","ru":"подтверждённый","ex":["Only substantiated complaints are recorded."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04263","w":"actionable","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈækʃənəbəl","uz":"amalda bajarish mumkin","ru":"пригодный для действия","ex":["Give actionable feedback, not vague praise."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04264","w":"hereby","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˌhɪrˈbaɪ","uz":"shu hujjat bilan","ru":"настоящим","ex":["I hereby confirm receipt."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04265","w":"herewith","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˌhɪrˈwɪð","uz":"shu xat bilan birga","ru":"при сём","ex":["I enclose herewith the signed form."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04266","w":"pertaining","pos":"adj","ipa":"pərˈteɪnɪŋ","uz":"tegishli bo'lgan","ru":"относящийся","ex":["Send all papers pertaining to the case."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04267","w":"at your earliest convenience","pos":"phrase","ipa":"ət jɔːr ˈɜːrliəst kənˈviːniəns","uz":"imkon qadar tezroq (rasmiy)","ru":"при первой возможности","ex":["Please reply at your earliest convenience."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04268","w":"should you require","pos":"phrase","ipa":"ʃʊd juː rɪˈkwaɪər","uz":"agar kerak bo'lsa (rasmiy)","ru":"если вам потребуется","ex":["Should you require further information, please write."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04269","w":"I would be grateful if","pos":"phrase","ipa":"aɪ wʊd biː ˈɡreɪtfəl ɪf","uz":"iltimos qilsam (rasmiy)","ru":"я был бы признателен, если","ex":["I would be grateful if you could confirm."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04270","w":"do not hesitate to","pos":"phrase","ipa":"duː nɑːt ˈhezɪteɪt tuː","uz":"tortinmasdan murojaat qiling","ru":"не стесняйтесь","ex":["Do not hesitate to contact me."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04271","w":"point taken","pos":"phrase","ipa":"ˈpɔɪnt ˈteɪkən","uz":"fikringiz tushunarli","ru":"принято, согласен","ex":["'You did not check.' 'Point taken.'"],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04272","w":"fair enough","pos":"phrase","ipa":"fer ɪˈnʌf","uz":"mayli, to'g'ri","ru":"справедливо, ладно","ex":["'I was busy.' 'Fair enough.'"],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04273","w":"with respect","pos":"phrase","ipa":"wɪð rɪˈspekt","uz":"hurmat bilan aytaman-ki","ru":"при всём уважении","ex":["With respect, that does not match the figures."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04274","w":"follow up on","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈfɑːloʊ ˈʌp ɑːn","uz":"davomini olib bormoq","ru":"прорабатывать дальше","ex":["Nobody followed up on the complaint."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04275","w":"get back to","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɡet ˈbæk tuː","uz":"keyinroq javob bermoq","ru":"связаться позже","ex":["I will get back to you on Friday."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04276","w":"check up on","pos":"verb","ipa":"tʃek ˈʌp ɑːn","uz":"tekshirib turmoq","ru":"проверять","ex":["She checks up on every claim."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04277","w":"put across","pos":"verb","ipa":"pʊt əˈkrɔːs","uz":"tushuntirib yetkaza olmoq","ru":"донести (мысль)","ex":["She put her case across well."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04278","w":"gloss over","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɡlɔːs ˈoʊvər","uz":"yuzaki o'tib ketmoq","ru":"замалчивать, сглаживать","ex":["The report glosses over the cost."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04279","w":"own up to","pos":"verb","ipa":"oʊn ˈʌp tuː","uz":"aybini bo'yniga olmoq","ru":"признаваться в","ex":["He owned up to the mistake."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04280","w":"restate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌriːˈsteɪt","uz":"boshqacha qilib qayta aytmoq","ru":"переформулировать","ex":["Let me restate the question."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04281","w":"probe","pos":"verb","ipa":"proʊb","uz":"chuqur so'rab bilmoq","ru":"выяснять, зондировать","ex":["The panel probed for detail."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04282","w":"notify","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈnoʊtɪfaɪ","uz":"rasman xabardor qilmoq","ru":"уведомлять","ex":["Notify the office in writing."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04283","w":"expand on","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪkˈspænd ɑːn","uz":"kengaytirib tushuntirmoq","ru":"развить мысль","ex":["Could you expand on that?"],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04284","w":"inattentive","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌɪnəˈtentɪv","uz":"e'tiborsiz","ru":"невнимательный","ex":["An inattentive driver caused it."],"u":"S07U17"},{"id":"lex.04285","w":"fraction","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfrækʃən","uz":"kichik ulush","ru":"доля, часть","ex":["Only a fraction of the money was spent."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04286","w":"bulk","pos":"noun","ipa":"bʌlk","uz":"asosiy qismi","ru":"основная часть","ex":["The bulk of the work is done."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04287","w":"remainder","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈmeɪndər","uz":"qolgan qismi","ru":"остаток","ex":["The remainder will be paid in June."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04288","w":"deficit","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdefɪsɪt","uz":"taqchillik, kamomad","ru":"дефицит","ex":["The deficit has doubled."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04289","w":"multitude","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmʌltɪtuːd","uz":"son-sanoqsiz ko'plik","ru":"множество","ex":["A multitude of small faults."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04290","w":"plethora","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpleθərə","uz":"haddan ziyod ko'plik","ru":"избыток","ex":["There is a plethora of guidance."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04291","w":"paucity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpɔːsəti","uz":"kamlik, tanqislik","ru":"нехватка","ex":["There is a paucity of evidence."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04292","w":"dearth","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɜːrθ","uz":"keskin yetishmovchilik","ru":"недостаток, нехватка","ex":["There is a dearth of trained staff."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04293","w":"glut","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɡlʌt","uz":"haddan ortiq taklif","ru":"избыток предложения","ex":["There is a glut of apples this year."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04294","w":"excess","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪkˈses","uz":"ortiqcha miqdor","ru":"избыток, превышение","ex":["Anything in excess of ten kilos costs more."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04295","w":"modicum","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmɑːdɪkəm","uz":"ozgina miqdor","ru":"толика","ex":["A modicum of care would have prevented it."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04296","w":"smattering","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsmætərɪŋ","uz":"ozgina bilim","ru":"поверхностное знание","ex":["He has a smattering of Russian."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04297","w":"trickle","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtrɪkəl","uz":"sizib oqish","ru":"струйка, тонкий ручеёк","ex":["Applications slowed to a trickle."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04298","w":"torrent","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtɔːrənt","uz":"sel, oqim","ru":"поток","ex":["A torrent of complaints followed."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04299","w":"swathe","pos":"noun","ipa":"swɑːð","uz":"katta qism, keng maydon","ru":"полоса, значительная часть","ex":["Whole swathes of the city lost power."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04300","w":"tranche","pos":"noun","ipa":"trɑːnʃ","uz":"bo'lib beriladigan qism","ru":"транш, часть","ex":["The first tranche is paid in April."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04301","w":"allotment","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈlɑːtmənt","uz":"ajratilgan ulush","ru":"выделенная доля","ex":["Each office has its own allotment."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04302","w":"ration","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈræʃən","uz":"belgilangan me'yor","ru":"паёк, норма","ex":["The daily ration was two litres."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04303","w":"quantify","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈkwɑːntɪfaɪ","uz":"raqamda ifodalamoq","ru":"измерять количественно","ex":["The benefit is hard to quantify."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04304","w":"accumulate","pos":"verb","ipa":"əˈkjuːmjəleɪt","uz":"to'planib bormoq","ru":"накапливать(ся)","ex":["Interest accumulates monthly."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04305","w":"dwindle","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈdwɪndəl","uz":"asta-sekin kamayib bormoq","ru":"убывать, иссякать","ex":["Numbers dwindled over the winter."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04306","w":"ample","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈæmpəl","uz":"yetarlicha ko'p","ru":"достаточный, обильный","ex":["There is ample time."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04307","w":"scant","pos":"adj","ipa":"skænt","uz":"juda oz","ru":"скудный","ex":["There is scant evidence for that."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04308","w":"meager","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈmiːɡər","uz":"juda kam, arzimas","ru":"скудный","ex":["The pay is meager."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04309","w":"copious","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈkoʊpiəs","uz":"mo'l-ko'l","ru":"обильный","ex":["She took copious notes."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04310","w":"colloquial","pos":"adj","ipa":"kəˈloʊkwiəl","uz":"so'zlashuvga oid","ru":"разговорный","ex":["'Kids' is colloquial."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04311","w":"idiomatic","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌɪdiəˈmætɪk","uz":"tabiiy, tilga xos","ru":"идиоматичный","ex":["The translation is correct but not idiomatic."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04312","w":"vernacular","pos":"noun","ipa":"vərˈnækjələr","uz":"xalq tili","ru":"просторечие, местный язык","ex":["He wrote in the vernacular."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04313","w":"stilted","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈstɪltɪd","uz":"sun'iy va qotib qolgan","ru":"неестественный, натянутый","ex":["The dialogue is stilted."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04314","w":"chatty","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈtʃæti","uz":"erkin suhbat uslubidagi","ru":"непринуждённый","ex":["The email was chatty and warm."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04315","w":"pompous","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈpɑːmpəs","uz":"dabdabali, manman","ru":"напыщенный","ex":["The speech was pompous."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04316","w":"understated","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌʌndərˈsteɪtɪd","uz":"kamtarona ifodalangan","ru":"сдержанный","ex":["The design is understated."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04317","w":"register","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈredʒɪstər","uz":"nutq uslubi darajasi","ru":"регистр (речи)","ex":["The register is too informal for a contract."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04318","w":"informality","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌɪnfɔːrˈmæləti","uz":"norasmiylik","ru":"неформальность","ex":["The informality surprised the visitors."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04319","w":"put off","pos":"verb","ipa":"pʊt ˈɔːf","uz":"keyinga qoldirmoq (so'zlashuv)","ru":"откладывать (разг.)","ex":["We put the meeting off till Thursday."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04320","w":"ascertain","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌæsərˈteɪn","uz":"aniqlab olmoq (rasmiy)","ru":"выяснять, устанавливать","ex":["We could not ascertain the cause."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04321","w":"tolerate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈtɑːləreɪt","uz":"chidamoq, toqat qilmoq","ru":"терпеть","ex":["We will not tolerate that language here."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04322","w":"curtail","pos":"verb","ipa":"kərˈteɪl","uz":"qisqartirmoq","ru":"сокращать, урезать","ex":["The visit was curtailed."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04323","w":"commence","pos":"verb","ipa":"kəˈmens","uz":"boshlanmoq (rasmiy)","ru":"начинать(ся)","ex":["Work commences on Monday."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04324","w":"endeavor to","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪnˈdevər tuː","uz":"harakat qilmoq (rasmiy)","ru":"стараться (офиц.)","ex":["We endeavor to reply within one day."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04325","w":"in excess of","pos":"phrase","ipa":"ɪn ɪkˈses əv","uz":"dan ortiq","ru":"свыше","ex":["Costs in excess of a thousand need approval."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04326","w":"the bulk of","pos":"phrase","ipa":"ðə ˈbʌlk əv","uz":"asosiy qismi","ru":"большая часть","ex":["The bulk of the cost is staff."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04327","w":"a fraction of","pos":"phrase","ipa":"ə ˈfrækʃən əv","uz":"kichik bir qismi","ru":"малая часть","ex":["It costs a fraction of the original price."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04328","w":"few and far between","pos":"phrase","ipa":"ˈfjuː ənd fɑːr bɪˈtwiːn","uz":"juda kam uchraydigan","ru":"редкие, наперечёт","ex":["Good candidates are few and far between."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04329","w":"next to nothing","pos":"phrase","ipa":"nekst tuː ˈnʌθɪŋ","uz":"deyarli hech narsa","ru":"почти ничего","ex":["We know next to nothing about it."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04330","w":"all but","pos":"phrase","ipa":"ˈɔːl bʌt","uz":"deyarli","ru":"почти","ex":["The species is all but extinct."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04331","w":"if anything","pos":"phrase","ipa":"ɪf ˈeniθɪŋ","uz":"aksincha bo'lsa ham","ru":"скорее уж наоборот","ex":["It is not worse; if anything it is better."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04332","w":"obtain","pos":"verb","ipa":"əbˈteɪn","uz":"olmoq (rasmiy)","ru":"получать, приобретать","ex":["Permission must be obtained in advance."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04333","w":"assist","pos":"verb","ipa":"əˈsɪst","uz":"yordam bermoq (rasmiy)","ru":"оказывать помощь","ex":["Staff will assist you at the door."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04334","w":"utilize","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈjuːtəlaɪz","uz":"foydalanmoq (rasmiy)","ru":"использовать","ex":["The space is fully utilized."],"u":"S07U18"},{"id":"lex.04335","w":"delimit","pos":"verb","ipa":"dɪˈlɪmɪt","uz":"chegaralamoq","ru":"ограничивать, очерчивать","ex":["The chapter delimits the period under study."],"u":"S08U01"},{"id":"lex.04336","w":"demarcate","pos":"verb","ipa":"dɪˈmɑrkeɪt","uz":"chegara belgilamoq","ru":"разграничивать","ex":["The river demarcates the two provinces."],"u":"S08U01"},{"id":"lex.04337","w":"circumscribe","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈsɜrkəmskraɪb","uz":"cheklab qo'ymoq","ru":"ограничивать","ex":["The law circumscribes the minister's power."],"u":"S08U01"},{"id":"lex.04338","w":"denote","pos":"verb","ipa":"dɪˈnoʊt","uz":"anglatmoq, bildirmoq","ru":"обозначать","ex":["In this table an asterisk denotes an estimate."],"u":"S08U01"},{"id":"lex.04339","w":"connote","pos":"verb","ipa":"kəˈnoʊt","uz":"qo'shimcha ma'no bermoq","ru":"подразумевать","ex":["The word 'cheap' connotes poor quality."],"u":"S08U01"},{"id":"lex.04340","w":"designate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈdezɪɡneɪt","uz":"tayinlamoq, deb belgilamoq","ru":"назначать, обозначать","ex":["The area was designated a national park."],"u":"S08U01"},{"id":"lex.04341","w":"construe","pos":"verb","ipa":"kənˈstruː","uz":"talqin qilmoq","ru":"истолковывать","ex":["The silence was construed as agreement."],"u":"S08U01"},{"id":"lex.04342","w":"posit","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈpɑzɪt","uz":"farazni ilgari surmoq","ru":"постулировать, выдвигать","ex":["The paper posits three causes."],"u":"S08U01"},{"id":"lex.04343","w":"essence","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈesəns","uz":"mohiyat","ru":"сущность","ex":["The essence of the argument is simple."],"u":"S08U01"},{"id":"lex.04344","w":"substance","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsʌbstəns","uz":"mazmun, asos","ru":"суть, содержание","ex":["There is little substance to the complaint."],"u":"S08U01"},{"id":"lex.04345","w":"property","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈprɑpərti","uz":"xossa, xususiyat","ru":"свойство","ex":["Salt has two useful properties."],"u":"S08U01"},{"id":"lex.04346","w":"entity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈentɪti","uz":"yaxlit narsa, sub'ekt","ru":"сущность, единица","ex":["The two companies remain separate entities."],"u":"S08U01"},{"id":"lex.04347","w":"phenomenon","pos":"noun","ipa":"fəˈnɑmɪnən","uz":"hodisa","ru":"явление","ex":["The phenomenon was first recorded in 1920."],"u":"S08U01"},{"id":"lex.04348","w":"construct","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkɑnstrʌkt","uz":"sun'iy tushuncha","ru":"конструкт","ex":["Race is often described as a social construct."],"u":"S08U01"},{"id":"lex.04349","w":"concept","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkɑnsept","uz":"tushuncha","ru":"понятие","ex":["The concept is easier to state than to apply."],"u":"S08U01"},{"id":"lex.04350","w":"notion","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈnoʊʃən","uz":"tasavvur, fikr","ru":"представление","ex":["He rejected the notion that progress is automatic."],"u":"S08U01"},{"id":"lex.04351","w":"category","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkætəɡɔri","uz":"toifa","ru":"категория","ex":["The report uses four categories."],"u":"S08U01"},{"id":"lex.04352","w":"classification","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌklæsɪfɪˈkeɪʃən","uz":"tasniflash","ru":"классификация","ex":["The classification has changed twice."],"u":"S08U01"},{"id":"lex.04353","w":"taxonomy","pos":"noun","ipa":"tækˈsɑnəmi","uz":"tasnif tizimi","ru":"таксономия","ex":["He proposed a taxonomy of errors."],"u":"S08U01"},{"id":"lex.04354","w":"generalisation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌdʒenərəlaɪˈzeɪʃən","uz":"umumlashtirish","ru":"обобщение","ex":["That is a generalisation the evidence will not carry."],"u":"S08U01"},{"id":"lex.04355","w":"particularity","pos":"noun","ipa":"pərˌtɪkjəˈlærɪti","uz":"xususiylik","ru":"особенность, частность","ex":["The study loses the particularity of each village."],"u":"S08U01"},{"id":"lex.04356","w":"universality","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌjuːnɪvərˈsælɪti","uz":"umumiylik","ru":"универсальность","ex":["The claim's universality is doubtful."],"u":"S08U01"},{"id":"lex.04357","w":"necessity","pos":"noun","ipa":"nɪˈsesɪti","uz":"zarurat","ru":"необходимость","ex":["Water is a necessity, not a luxury."],"u":"S08U01"},{"id":"lex.04358","w":"proposition","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌprɑpəˈzɪʃən","uz":"mulohaza","ru":"утверждение, положение","ex":["The proposition is easy to test."],"u":"S08U01"},{"id":"lex.04359","w":"predicate","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpredɪkət","uz":"kesim","ru":"сказуемое","ex":["Every clause needs a predicate."],"u":"S08U01"},{"id":"lex.04360","w":"nominal","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈnɑmɪnəl","uz":"nomigagina","ru":"номинальный","ex":["He is the nominal head of the firm."],"u":"S08U01"},{"id":"lex.04361","w":"notional","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈnoʊʃənəl","uz":"shartli, tasavvurdagi","ru":"условный","ex":["The boundary is notional, not physical."],"u":"S08U01"},{"id":"lex.04362","w":"substantive","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈsʌbstəntɪv","uz":"mazmunan muhim","ru":"существенный","ex":["There was no substantive change to the text."],"u":"S08U01"},{"id":"lex.04363","w":"intrinsic","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪnˈtrɪnzɪk","uz":"ichki, tabiiy","ru":"внутренне присущий","ex":["The work has intrinsic value."],"u":"S08U01"},{"id":"lex.04364","w":"extrinsic","pos":"adj","ipa":"ekˈstrɪnzɪk","uz":"tashqi","ru":"внешний","ex":["Pay is an extrinsic reward."],"u":"S08U01"},{"id":"lex.04365","w":"inherent","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪnˈhɪrənt","uz":"ajralmas, xos","ru":"присущий","ex":["There is an inherent risk in the design."],"u":"S08U01"},{"id":"lex.04366","w":"incidental","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌɪnsɪˈdentəl","uz":"tasodifiy, ikkilamchi","ru":"побочный","ex":["The damage was incidental to the repair."],"u":"S08U01"},{"id":"lex.04367","w":"tacit","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈtæsɪt","uz":"aytilmagan, pinhona","ru":"молчаливый, негласный","ex":["They had a tacit agreement."],"u":"S08U01"},{"id":"lex.04368","w":"manifest","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈmænɪfest","uz":"yaqqol","ru":"очевидный","ex":["The error is manifest."],"u":"S08U01"},{"id":"lex.04369","w":"latent","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈleɪtənt","uz":"yashirin, uyg'onmagan","ru":"скрытый","ex":["The talent was latent until she was twenty."],"u":"S08U01"},{"id":"lex.04370","w":"salient","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈseɪliənt","uz":"eng muhim, ko'zga tashlanadigan","ru":"существенный, заметный","ex":["Let me repeat the salient points."],"u":"S08U01"},{"id":"lex.04371","w":"overt","pos":"adj","ipa":"oʊˈvɜrt","uz":"oshkora","ru":"открытый, явный","ex":["There was no overt pressure."],"u":"S08U02"},{"id":"lex.04372","w":"ambit","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈæmbɪt","uz":"qamrov doirasi","ru":"сфера действия","ex":["That falls outside the ambit of this report."],"u":"S08U02"},{"id":"lex.04373","w":"extent","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪkˈstent","uz":"darajasi, ko'lami","ru":"степень, масштаб","ex":["The extent of the damage is still unknown."],"u":"S08U02"},{"id":"lex.04374","w":"applicability","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˌplɪkəˈbɪlɪti","uz":"qo'llanilish imkoni","ru":"применимость","ex":["The applicability of the model is limited."],"u":"S08U02"},{"id":"lex.04375","w":"relevance","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈreləvəns","uz":"aloqadorlik","ru":"уместность, релевантность","ex":["I cannot see the relevance of that question."],"u":"S08U02"},{"id":"lex.04376","w":"footing","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfʊtɪŋ","uz":"asos, poydevor","ru":"основа, положение","ex":["The agreement puts both sides on an equal footing."],"u":"S08U02"},{"id":"lex.04377","w":"pretence","pos":"noun","ipa":"prɪˈtens","uz":"bahona, ko'zbo'yamachilik","ru":"притворство, предлог","ex":["He entered under the pretence of an inspection."],"u":"S08U02"},{"id":"lex.04378","w":"contention","pos":"noun","ipa":"kənˈtenʃən","uz":"da'vo, fikr","ru":"утверждение, довод","ex":["It is his contention that the rule was never applied."],"u":"S08U02"},{"id":"lex.04379","w":"corroboration","pos":"noun","ipa":"kəˌrɑbəˈreɪʃən","uz":"tasdiq, dalillash","ru":"подтверждение","ex":["The account needs corroboration from a second source."],"u":"S08U02"},{"id":"lex.04380","w":"verification","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌverɪfɪˈkeɪʃən","uz":"tekshirib tasdiqlash","ru":"проверка, верификация","ex":["Every claim is sent for verification."],"u":"S08U02"},{"id":"lex.04381","w":"evaluation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪˌvæljuˈeɪʃən","uz":"baholash","ru":"оценка","ex":["The evaluation runs for two years."],"u":"S08U02"},{"id":"lex.04382","w":"monitoring","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmɑnɪtərɪŋ","uz":"kuzatib borish","ru":"мониторинг","ex":["Monitoring continued through the winter."],"u":"S08U02"},{"id":"lex.04383","w":"surveillance","pos":"noun","ipa":"sərˈveɪləns","uz":"nazorat, kuzatuv","ru":"слежка, наблюдение","ex":["The building was under surveillance for a month."],"u":"S08U02"},{"id":"lex.04384","w":"metric","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmetrɪk","uz":"o'lchov ko'rsatkichi","ru":"метрика, показатель","ex":["We need a better metric than page views."],"u":"S08U02"},{"id":"lex.04385","w":"gradient","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɡreɪdiənt","uz":"o'zgarish darajasi","ru":"градиент, уклон","ex":["There is a clear gradient from north to south."],"u":"S08U02"},{"id":"lex.04386","w":"typology","pos":"noun","ipa":"taɪˈpɑlədʒi","uz":"tiplar tizimi","ru":"типология","ex":["The chapter sets out a typology of protest."],"u":"S08U02"},{"id":"lex.04387","w":"instantiation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪnˌstænʃiˈeɪʃən","uz":"aniq ko'rinish","ru":"конкретное воплощение","ex":["Each instantiation looks slightly different."],"u":"S08U02"},{"id":"lex.04388","w":"exemplification","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪɡˌzemplɪfɪˈkeɪʃən","uz":"misol keltirish","ru":"иллюстрирование примерами","ex":["The section is heavy on exemplification."],"u":"S08U02"},{"id":"lex.04389","w":"surrogate","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsɜrəɡət","uz":"o'rinbosar","ru":"суррогат, замена","ex":["Income is a poor surrogate for wellbeing."],"u":"S08U02"},{"id":"lex.04390","w":"analogue","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈænəlɔɡ","uz":"o'xshash narsa","ru":"аналог","ex":["The 1970s are often treated as an analogue for today."],"u":"S08U02"},{"id":"lex.04391","w":"equivalent","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪˈkwɪvələnt","uz":"ekvivalent","ru":"эквивалент","ex":["There is no French equivalent of the word."],"u":"S08U02"},{"id":"lex.04392","w":"parameter","pos":"noun","ipa":"pəˈræmɪtər","uz":"parametr, shart","ru":"параметр","ex":["We agreed the parameters of the review."],"u":"S08U02"},{"id":"lex.04393","w":"dimension","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˈmenʃən","uz":"jihat, o'lcham","ru":"измерение, аспект","ex":["The problem has a political dimension too."],"u":"S08U02"},{"id":"lex.04394","w":"experiment","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪkˈsperɪmənt","uz":"tajriba","ru":"эксперимент","ex":["The experiment was run twice."],"u":"S08U02"},{"id":"lex.04395","w":"control","pos":"noun","ipa":"kənˈtroʊl","uz":"nazorat guruhi","ru":"контрольная группа","ex":["The control received no medicine at all."],"u":"S08U02"},{"id":"lex.04396","w":"placebo","pos":"noun","ipa":"pləˈsiːboʊ","uz":"platsebo","ru":"плацебо","ex":["Half the group were given a placebo."],"u":"S08U02"},{"id":"lex.04397","w":"replication","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌreplɪˈkeɪʃən","uz":"takroriy tadqiqot","ru":"репликация, повторение","ex":["Replication is slow and rarely funded."],"u":"S08U02"},{"id":"lex.04398","w":"reproducibility","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌriːprəduːsəˈbɪlɪti","uz":"takrorlanuvchanlik","ru":"воспроизводимость","ex":["Reproducibility is the test of a method."],"u":"S08U02"},{"id":"lex.04399","w":"cluster","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈklʌstər","uz":"to'plam, guruh","ru":"кластер, скопление","ex":["A cluster of cases appeared in one street."],"u":"S08U02"},{"id":"lex.04400","w":"attrition","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈtrɪʃən","uz":"asta-sekin kamayish","ru":"убыль, отсев","ex":["Attrition over five years was forty per cent."],"u":"S08U02"},{"id":"lex.04401","w":"ethnographic","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌeθnəˈɡræfɪk","uz":"etnografik","ru":"этнографический","ex":["She spent two years on ethnographic work."],"u":"S08U02"},{"id":"lex.04402","w":"hierarchy","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈhaɪərɑrki","uz":"ierarxiya","ru":"иерархия","ex":["The hierarchy of evidence puts trials at the top."],"u":"S08U02"},{"id":"lex.04403","w":"purportedly","pos":"adv","ipa":"pərˈpɔrtɪdli","uz":"go'yoki","ru":"якобы","ex":["The letter was purportedly written in 1890."],"u":"S08U02"},{"id":"lex.04404","w":"aforementioned","pos":"adj","ipa":"əˌfɔrˈmenʃənd","uz":"yuqorida aytilgan","ru":"вышеупомянутый","ex":["The aforementioned clause applies here too."],"u":"S08U02"},{"id":"lex.04405","w":"brief","pos":"noun","ipa":"briːf","uz":"topshiriq, vazifa bayoni","ru":"техническое задание","ex":["The brief was two pages long."],"u":"S08U02"},{"id":"lex.04406","w":"plausibly","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈplɔzəbli","uz":"ishonarli tarzda","ru":"правдоподобно","ex":["He can plausibly claim he was not told."],"u":"S08U02"},{"id":"lex.04407","w":"relation","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈleɪʃən","uz":"munosabat, bog'liqlik","ru":"отношение, связь","ex":["The relation between the two figures is not explained."],"u":"S08U03"},{"id":"lex.04408","w":"conjectural","pos":"adj","ipa":"kənˈdʒektʃərəl","uz":"faraziy","ru":"предположительный","ex":["The dates are conjectural."],"u":"S08U03"},{"id":"lex.04409","w":"axiomatic","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌæksiəˈmætɪk","uz":"aksiomatik","ru":"аксиоматический","ex":["It is axiomatic that a court must hear both sides."],"u":"S08U03"},{"id":"lex.04410","w":"putative","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈpjuːtətɪv","uz":"taxminiy","ru":"предполагаемый","ex":["The putative author died in 1612."],"u":"S08U03"},{"id":"lex.04411","w":"commensurate","pos":"adj","ipa":"kəˈmenʃərət","uz":"mutanosib","ru":"соразмерный","ex":["The pay is commensurate with the risk."],"u":"S08U03"},{"id":"lex.04412","w":"concomitant","pos":"adj","ipa":"kənˈkɑmɪtənt","uz":"hamroh, birga yuruvchi","ru":"сопутствующий","ex":["Growth brought concomitant pressure on housing."],"u":"S08U03"},{"id":"lex.04413","w":"attendant","pos":"adj","ipa":"əˈtendənt","uz":"hamrohlik qiluvchi","ru":"сопровождающий","ex":["The move carries attendant risks."],"u":"S08U03"},{"id":"lex.04414","w":"consequent","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈkɑnsɪkwent","uz":"natijaviy","ru":"вытекающий, последующий","ex":["The drought and the consequent loss of crops ruined them."],"u":"S08U03"},{"id":"lex.04415","w":"requisite","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈrekwɪzɪt","uz":"talab qilinadigan","ru":"необходимый, требуемый","ex":["She lacks the requisite experience."],"u":"S08U03"},{"id":"lex.04416","w":"indispensable","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌɪndɪˈspensəbəl","uz":"almashtirib bo'lmaydigan","ru":"незаменимый","ex":["Her notes proved indispensable."],"u":"S08U03"},{"id":"lex.04417","w":"dispensable","pos":"adj","ipa":"dɪˈspensəbəl","uz":"voz kechish mumkin bo'lgan","ru":"необязательный","ex":["The second chapter is dispensable."],"u":"S08U03"},{"id":"lex.04418","w":"expendable","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪkˈspendəbəl","uz":"qurbon qilsa bo'ladigan","ru":"расходный, которым можно пожертвовать","ex":["The older machines were expendable."],"u":"S08U03"},{"id":"lex.04419","w":"susceptibility","pos":"noun","ipa":"səˌseptəˈbɪlɪti","uz":"moyillik, ta'sirchanlik","ru":"восприимчивость","ex":["Age increases susceptibility to infection."],"u":"S08U03"},{"id":"lex.04420","w":"propensity","pos":"noun","ipa":"prəˈpensɪti","uz":"moyillik","ru":"склонность","ex":["He has a propensity to exaggerate."],"u":"S08U03"},{"id":"lex.04421","w":"disposition","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌdɪspəˈzɪʃən","uz":"tabiat, mayl","ru":"склад характера, склонность","ex":["She has a cheerful disposition."],"u":"S08U03"},{"id":"lex.04422","w":"willingness","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈwɪlɪŋnəs","uz":"tayyorlik, xohish","ru":"готовность, желание","ex":["Their willingness to listen surprised us."],"u":"S08U03"},{"id":"lex.04423","w":"reluctance","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈlʌktəns","uz":"istamaslik","ru":"нежелание","ex":["He agreed, but with obvious reluctance."],"u":"S08U03"},{"id":"lex.04424","w":"readiness","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈredinəs","uz":"shaylik","ru":"готовность","ex":["The crews were kept in readiness all night."],"u":"S08U03"},{"id":"lex.04425","w":"deterrent","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˈterənt","uz":"to'sqinlik qiluvchi omil","ru":"сдерживающее средство","ex":["A fine is a weak deterrent here."],"u":"S08U03"},{"id":"lex.04426","w":"incentive","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪnˈsentɪv","uz":"rag'bat","ru":"стимул","ex":["The tax break is a strong incentive."],"u":"S08U03"},{"id":"lex.04427","w":"disincentive","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌdɪsɪnˈsentɪv","uz":"qaytaruvchi omil","ru":"антистимул","ex":["The charge acts as a disincentive to travel."],"u":"S08U03"},{"id":"lex.04428","w":"constraint","pos":"noun","ipa":"kənˈstreɪnt","uz":"cheklov","ru":"ограничение","ex":["Time was the main constraint."],"u":"S08U03"},{"id":"lex.04429","w":"limitation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌlɪmɪˈteɪʃən","uz":"cheklanganlik","ru":"ограниченность","ex":["The method has two known limitations."],"u":"S08U03"},{"id":"lex.04430","w":"shortcoming","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈʃɔrtkʌmɪŋ","uz":"kamchilik","ru":"недостаток","ex":["The report lists three shortcomings."],"u":"S08U03"},{"id":"lex.04431","w":"vulnerability","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌvʌlnərəˈbɪlɪti","uz":"zaiflik","ru":"уязвимость","ex":["The flood showed the vulnerability of the old bridge."],"u":"S08U03"},{"id":"lex.04432","w":"mitigation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌmɪtɪˈɡeɪʃən","uz":"yumshatish chorasi","ru":"смягчение последствий","ex":["Mitigation is cheaper than repair."],"u":"S08U03"},{"id":"lex.04433","w":"fluctuate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈflʌktʃueɪt","uz":"o'zgarib turmoq","ru":"колебаться","ex":["Prices fluctuated all summer."],"u":"S08U03"},{"id":"lex.04434","w":"oscillate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈɑsɪleɪt","uz":"tebranmoq","ru":"совершать колебания","ex":["The needle oscillates once a second."],"u":"S08U03"},{"id":"lex.04435","w":"converge","pos":"verb","ipa":"kənˈvɜrdʒ","uz":"yaqinlashmoq","ru":"сходиться","ex":["The two estimates converge after 1990."],"u":"S08U03"},{"id":"lex.04436","w":"diverge","pos":"verb","ipa":"daɪˈvɜrdʒ","uz":"ajralib ketmoq","ru":"расходиться","ex":["The accounts diverge on one point."],"u":"S08U03"},{"id":"lex.04437","w":"coincide","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌkoʊɪnˈsaɪd","uz":"bir vaqtga to'g'ri kelmoq","ru":"совпадать","ex":["The visit coincided with the harvest."],"u":"S08U03"},{"id":"lex.04438","w":"stabilise","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈsteɪbɪlaɪz","uz":"barqarorlashtirmoq","ru":"стабилизировать","ex":["Prices stabilised in June."],"u":"S08U03"},{"id":"lex.04439","w":"equilibrium","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌiːkwɪˈlɪbriəm","uz":"muvozanat","ru":"равновесие","ex":["The market reached equilibrium by autumn."],"u":"S08U03"},{"id":"lex.04440","w":"robustness","pos":"noun","ipa":"roʊˈbʌstnəs","uz":"mustahkamlik","ru":"устойчивость, надёжность","ex":["The robustness of the finding was checked three ways."],"u":"S08U03"},{"id":"lex.04441","w":"fragility","pos":"noun","ipa":"frəˈdʒɪlɪti","uz":"mo'rtlik","ru":"хрупкость","ex":["The fragility of the supply chain was exposed."],"u":"S08U03"},{"id":"lex.04442","w":"durability","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌdʊrəˈbɪlɪti","uz":"chidamlilik","ru":"долговечность","ex":["Durability was the only test that mattered."],"u":"S08U03"},{"id":"lex.04443","w":"viability","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌvaɪəˈbɪlɪti","uz":"hayotiyligi","ru":"жизнеспособность","ex":["The viability of the plan depends on the loan."],"u":"S08U03"},{"id":"lex.04444","w":"lexicon","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈleksɪkɑn","uz":"lug'at boyligi","ru":"лексикон, словарный запас","ex":["The word entered the lexicon in the 1990s."],"u":"S08U04"},{"id":"lex.04445","w":"syntax","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsɪntæks","uz":"sintaksis","ru":"синтаксис","ex":["The syntax of the sentence is faulty."],"u":"S08U04"},{"id":"lex.04446","w":"semantics","pos":"noun","ipa":"sɪˈmæntɪks","uz":"semantika","ru":"семантика","ex":["That is a question of semantics, not of fact."],"u":"S08U04"},{"id":"lex.04447","w":"pragmatics","pos":"noun","ipa":"præɡˈmætɪks","uz":"pragmatika","ru":"прагматика","ex":["Politeness belongs to pragmatics."],"u":"S08U04"},{"id":"lex.04448","w":"morphology","pos":"noun","ipa":"mɔrˈfɑlədʒi","uz":"morfologiya","ru":"морфология","ex":["English morphology is simple compared with Russian."],"u":"S08U04"},{"id":"lex.04449","w":"phonology","pos":"noun","ipa":"fəˈnɑlədʒi","uz":"fonologiya","ru":"фонология","ex":["The phonology of the dialect has eight vowels."],"u":"S08U04"},{"id":"lex.04450","w":"orthography","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɔrˈθɑɡrəfi","uz":"imlo","ru":"орфография","ex":["The orthography was reformed in 1940."],"u":"S08U04"},{"id":"lex.04451","w":"dialect","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdaɪəlekt","uz":"sheva","ru":"диалект","ex":["She writes in her own dialect."],"u":"S08U04"},{"id":"lex.04452","w":"connotation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌkɑnəˈteɪʃən","uz":"qo'shimcha ma'no","ru":"коннотация","ex":["The word has unpleasant connotations."],"u":"S08U04"},{"id":"lex.04453","w":"denotation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌdiːnoʊˈteɪʃən","uz":"asosiy ma'no","ru":"денотация","ex":["Its denotation is simply 'a small house'."],"u":"S08U04"},{"id":"lex.04454","w":"connotative","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈkɑnəteɪtɪv","uz":"konnotativ","ru":"коннотативный","ex":["The difference is connotative, not factual."],"u":"S08U04"},{"id":"lex.04455","w":"denotative","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈdiːnoʊteɪtɪv","uz":"denotativ","ru":"денотативный","ex":["The two words share a denotative meaning."],"u":"S08U04"},{"id":"lex.04456","w":"colloquialism","pos":"noun","ipa":"kəˈloʊkwiəlɪzəm","uz":"so'zlashuv ifodasi","ru":"разговорное выражение","ex":["Cut the colloquialisms from the report."],"u":"S08U04"},{"id":"lex.04457","w":"circumlocution","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌsɜrkəmləˈkjuːʃən","uz":"cho'zilgan ifoda","ru":"многословие","ex":["The paragraph is pure circumlocution."],"u":"S08U04"},{"id":"lex.04458","w":"concision","pos":"noun","ipa":"kənˈsɪʒən","uz":"ixchamlik","ru":"краткость, сжатость","ex":["The editor praised her concision."],"u":"S08U04"},{"id":"lex.04459","w":"tautology","pos":"noun","ipa":"tɔˈtɑlədʒi","uz":"takror ifoda","ru":"тавтология","ex":["'Free gift' is a tautology."],"u":"S08U04"},{"id":"lex.04460","w":"gloss","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɡlɔs","uz":"izoh","ru":"глосса, пояснение","ex":["A gloss in the margin explains the term."],"u":"S08U04"},{"id":"lex.04461","w":"platitude","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈplætɪtuːd","uz":"quruq gap","ru":"банальность","ex":["The speech was a string of platitudes."],"u":"S08U04"},{"id":"lex.04462","w":"truism","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtruːɪzəm","uz":"ayon haqiqat","ru":"трюизм","ex":["It is a truism that prices rise."],"u":"S08U04"},{"id":"lex.04463","w":"maxim","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmæksɪm","uz":"hikmatli qoida","ru":"максима","ex":["He lived by one maxim: check twice."],"u":"S08U04"},{"id":"lex.04464","w":"aphorism","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈæfərɪzəm","uz":"aforizm","ru":"афоризм","ex":["The essay ends on an aphorism."],"u":"S08U04"},{"id":"lex.04465","w":"adage","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈædɪdʒ","uz":"maqol","ru":"поговорка","ex":["The old adage is right again."],"u":"S08U04"},{"id":"lex.04466","w":"proverb","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈprɑvɜrb","uz":"xalq maqoli","ru":"пословица","ex":["Every proverb loses something in translation."],"u":"S08U04"},{"id":"lex.04467","w":"dictum","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdɪktəm","uz":"hukm, e'lon qilingan fikr","ru":"изречение, сентенция","ex":["The judge's dictum is quoted to this day."],"u":"S08U04"},{"id":"lex.04468","w":"precis","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpreɪsiː","uz":"qisqacha bayon","ru":"краткое изложение","ex":["Write a precis of the chapter in 200 words."],"u":"S08U04"},{"id":"lex.04469","w":"recapitulation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌriːkəpɪtʃəˈleɪʃən","uz":"qisqacha takrorlash","ru":"повторение, резюме","ex":["The last page is pure recapitulation."],"u":"S08U04"},{"id":"lex.04470","w":"paragraphing","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpærəɡræfɪŋ","uz":"xatboshilarga bo'lish","ru":"разбивка на абзацы","ex":["The paragraphing makes the argument easy to follow."],"u":"S08U04"},{"id":"lex.04471","w":"indentation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌɪndenˈteɪʃən","uz":"chekinish","ru":"отступ","ex":["Use indentation, not a blank line."],"u":"S08U04"},{"id":"lex.04472","w":"italics","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪˈtælɪks","uz":"kursiv","ru":"курсив","ex":["Book titles go in italics."],"u":"S08U04"},{"id":"lex.04473","w":"afterword","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈæftərwɜrd","uz":"so'nggi so'z","ru":"послесловие","ex":["The afterword was added in 1998."],"u":"S08U04"},{"id":"lex.04474","w":"antithesis","pos":"noun","ipa":"ænˈtɪθəsɪs","uz":"qarama-qarshilik","ru":"противоположность, антитеза","ex":["His style is the antithesis of hers."],"u":"S08U04"},{"id":"lex.04475","w":"therein","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˌðerˈɪn","uz":"unda, o'sha yerda","ru":"в нём, там","ex":["The contract and the duties set out therein remain in force."],"u":"S08U04"},{"id":"lex.04476","w":"thereupon","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˌðerəˈpɑn","uz":"shundan so'ng darhol","ru":"вслед за тем","ex":["He signed, and thereupon left the room."],"u":"S08U04"},{"id":"lex.04477","w":"whereupon","pos":"conj","ipa":"ˌwerəˈpɑn","uz":"shu zahoti","ru":"после чего","ex":["She named the sum, whereupon the room fell silent."],"u":"S08U04"},{"id":"lex.04478","w":"herein","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˌhɪrˈɪn","uz":"ushbu hujjatda","ru":"в настоящем документе","ex":["The terms defined herein apply throughout."],"u":"S08U04"},{"id":"lex.04479","w":"narrative","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈnærətɪv","uz":"hikoya, bayon","ru":"повествование, нарратив","ex":["Two rival narratives grew up around the fire."],"u":"S08U04"},{"id":"lex.04480","w":"cognition","pos":"noun","ipa":"kɑɡˈnɪʃən","uz":"idrok, bilish","ru":"познание, когниция","ex":["Sleep affects cognition the next day."],"u":"S08U05"},{"id":"lex.04481","w":"intuition","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌɪntuˈɪʃən","uz":"sezgi, ichki his","ru":"интуиция","ex":["Her intuition turned out to be right."],"u":"S08U05"},{"id":"lex.04482","w":"heuristic","pos":"noun","ipa":"hjuˈrɪstɪk","uz":"taxminiy qoida","ru":"эвристика","ex":["Doctors use a simple heuristic to sort cases."],"u":"S08U05"},{"id":"lex.04483","w":"reinforcement","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌriːɪnˈfɔrsmənt","uz":"mustahkamlash","ru":"подкрепление","ex":["Praise works as reinforcement."],"u":"S08U05"},{"id":"lex.04484","w":"conditioning","pos":"noun","ipa":"kənˈdɪʃənɪŋ","uz":"shartli o'rgatish","ru":"выработка условного рефлекса","ex":["The response is the result of conditioning."],"u":"S08U05"},{"id":"lex.04485","w":"habituation","pos":"noun","ipa":"həˌbɪtʃuˈeɪʃən","uz":"ko'nikish","ru":"привыкание","ex":["Habituation to noise happens within days."],"u":"S08U05"},{"id":"lex.04486","w":"objectivity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌɑbdʒekˈtɪvɪti","uz":"xolislik","ru":"объективность","ex":["Complete objectivity is impossible, but it is worth aiming at."],"u":"S08U05"},{"id":"lex.04487","w":"subjectivity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌsʌbdʒekˈtɪvɪti","uz":"sub'ektivlik","ru":"субъективность","ex":["The method reduces subjectivity in marking."],"u":"S08U05"},{"id":"lex.04488","w":"relativism","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈrelətɪvɪzəm","uz":"relyativizm","ru":"релятивизм","ex":["He accuses her of moral relativism."],"u":"S08U05"},{"id":"lex.04489","w":"absolutism","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈæbsəluːtɪzəm","uz":"absolyutizm","ru":"абсолютизм","ex":["Neither absolutism nor relativism helps here."],"u":"S08U05"},{"id":"lex.04490","w":"determinism","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˈtɜrmɪnɪzəm","uz":"determinizm","ru":"детерминизм","ex":["The chapter argues against economic determinism."],"u":"S08U05"},{"id":"lex.04491","w":"epistemology","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪˌpɪstəˈmɑlədʒi","uz":"bilish nazariyasi","ru":"эпистемология","ex":["The dispute is really about epistemology."],"u":"S08U05"},{"id":"lex.04492","w":"ontology","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɑnˈtɑlədʒi","uz":"ontologiya","ru":"онтология","ex":["Their ontology admits no such objects."],"u":"S08U05"},{"id":"lex.04493","w":"consistency","pos":"noun","ipa":"kənˈsɪstənsi","uz":"izchillik","ru":"последовательность","ex":["Consistency is the least we can ask of a theory."],"u":"S08U05"},{"id":"lex.04494","w":"contradiction","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌkɑntrəˈdɪkʃən","uz":"ziddiyat","ru":"противоречие","ex":["There is a contradiction in paragraph four."],"u":"S08U05"},{"id":"lex.04495","w":"tension","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtenʃən","uz":"ziddiyat, taranglik","ru":"напряжение, противоречие","ex":["There is a tension between speed and accuracy."],"u":"S08U05"},{"id":"lex.04496","w":"paradox","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpærədɑks","uz":"paradoks","ru":"парадокс","ex":["It is a paradox that the safer road is the slower one."],"u":"S08U05"},{"id":"lex.04497","w":"entailment","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪnˈteɪlmənt","uz":"mantiqiy natija","ru":"логическое следствие","ex":["The entailment is obvious once you see it."],"u":"S08U05"},{"id":"lex.04498","w":"presupposition","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌpriːsʌpəˈzɪʃən","uz":"dastlabki faraz","ru":"презумпция, предпосылка","ex":["The question carries a presupposition."],"u":"S08U05"},{"id":"lex.04499","w":"validity","pos":"noun","ipa":"vəˈlɪdɪti","uz":"asoslilik","ru":"обоснованность, валидность","ex":["The validity of the argument is not in question."],"u":"S08U05"},{"id":"lex.04500","w":"soundness","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsaʊndnəs","uz":"puxtalik","ru":"состоятельность","ex":["Nobody has tested the soundness of the method."],"u":"S08U05"},{"id":"lex.04501","w":"fallacy","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfæləsi","uz":"mantiqiy xato","ru":"логическая ошибка","ex":["That is a well-known fallacy."],"u":"S08U05"},{"id":"lex.04502","w":"circularity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌsɜrkjəˈlærɪti","uz":"aylanma dalil","ru":"порочный круг","ex":["The definition suffers from circularity."],"u":"S08U05"},{"id":"lex.04503","w":"infer","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪnˈfɜr","uz":"xulosa chiqarmoq","ru":"выводить, заключать","ex":["We can infer the date from the stamp."],"u":"S08U05"},{"id":"lex.04504","w":"deduce","pos":"verb","ipa":"dɪˈduːs","uz":"mantiqan kelib chiqarmoq","ru":"дедуцировать, выводить","ex":["From the tracks she deduced the time."],"u":"S08U05"},{"id":"lex.04505","w":"rebut","pos":"verb","ipa":"rɪˈbʌt","uz":"rad etmoq","ru":"опровергать","ex":["He rebutted the charge point by point."],"u":"S08U05"},{"id":"lex.04506","w":"specious","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈspiːʃəs","uz":"aldamchi ishonarli","ru":"благовидный, обманчивый","ex":["It is a specious argument."],"u":"S08U05"},{"id":"lex.04507","w":"spurious","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈspjʊriəs","uz":"soxta","ru":"ложный, мнимый","ex":["The link turned out to be spurious."],"u":"S08U05"},{"id":"lex.04508","w":"untenable","pos":"adj","ipa":"ʌnˈtenəbəl","uz":"himoya qilib bo'lmaydigan","ru":"несостоятельный","ex":["His position became untenable."],"u":"S08U05"},{"id":"lex.04509","w":"defensible","pos":"adj","ipa":"dɪˈfensəbəl","uz":"asoslash mumkin bo'lgan","ru":"обоснованный","ex":["The decision is defensible, if not popular."],"u":"S08U05"},{"id":"lex.04510","w":"arise","pos":"verb","ipa":"əˈraɪz","uz":"yuzaga kelmoq","ru":"возникать","ex":["The question arises again in chapter six."],"u":"S08U05"},{"id":"lex.04511","w":"pertain","pos":"verb","ipa":"pərˈteɪn","uz":"taalluqli bo'lmoq","ru":"относиться, касаться","ex":["The rule pertains only to imported goods."],"u":"S08U05"},{"id":"lex.04512","w":"relate","pos":"verb","ipa":"rɪˈleɪt","uz":"bog'liq bo'lmoq","ru":"относиться, связывать","ex":["The first chapter relates to method only."],"u":"S08U05"},{"id":"lex.04513","w":"render","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈrendər","uz":"qilib qo'ymoq","ru":"приводить в состояние, делать","ex":["The flood rendered the road useless."],"u":"S08U05"},{"id":"lex.04514","w":"confer","pos":"verb","ipa":"kənˈfɜr","uz":"bermoq, taqdim etmoq","ru":"присваивать, наделять","ex":["The degree was conferred in June."],"u":"S08U05"},{"id":"lex.04515","w":"hinge","pos":"verb","ipa":"hɪndʒ","uz":"butunlay bog'liq bo'lmoq","ru":"зависеть от","ex":["The case hinges on one letter."],"u":"S08U05"},{"id":"lex.04516","w":"negate","pos":"verb","ipa":"nɪˈɡeɪt","uz":"bekor qilmoq","ru":"сводить на нет","ex":["The extra cost negates the saving."],"u":"S08U06"},{"id":"lex.04517","w":"nullify","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈnʌlɪfaɪ","uz":"haqiqiy emas deb topmoq","ru":"аннулировать","ex":["The court nullified the election."],"u":"S08U06"},{"id":"lex.04518","w":"invalidate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪnˈvælɪdeɪt","uz":"kuchsiz qilmoq","ru":"делать недействительным","ex":["One counter-example invalidates the rule."],"u":"S08U06"},{"id":"lex.04519","w":"preclude","pos":"verb","ipa":"prɪˈkluːd","uz":"imkonsiz qilmoq","ru":"исключать, препятствовать","ex":["The wording precludes any appeal."],"u":"S08U06"},{"id":"lex.04520","w":"obviate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈɑbvieɪt","uz":"ehtiyojni yo'q qilmoq","ru":"устранять необходимость","ex":["The new road obviates the long detour."],"u":"S08U06"},{"id":"lex.04521","w":"contravene","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌkɑntrəˈviːn","uz":"qoidani buzmoq","ru":"нарушать","ex":["The advertisement contravenes the code."],"u":"S08U06"},{"id":"lex.04522","w":"transgress","pos":"verb","ipa":"trænsˈɡres","uz":"chegaradan chiqmoq","ru":"преступать","ex":["He transgressed an unwritten rule."],"u":"S08U06"},{"id":"lex.04523","w":"infringe","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪnˈfrɪndʒ","uz":"huquqni buzmoq","ru":"нарушать, посягать","ex":["The design infringes an existing patent."],"u":"S08U06"},{"id":"lex.04524","w":"violate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈvaɪəleɪt","uz":"buzmoq","ru":"открыто нарушать","ex":["The company violated the agreement twice."],"u":"S08U06"},{"id":"lex.04525","w":"abstention","pos":"noun","ipa":"æbˈstenʃən","uz":"betaraf qolish","ru":"воздержание при голосовании","ex":["There were two abstentions."],"u":"S08U06"},{"id":"lex.04526","w":"assent","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈsent","uz":"rozilik","ru":"согласие","ex":["The bill received royal assent in May."],"u":"S08U06"},{"id":"lex.04527","w":"injunction","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪnˈdʒʌŋkʃən","uz":"sud taqiqi","ru":"судебный запрет","ex":["They obtained an injunction against the paper."],"u":"S08U06"},{"id":"lex.04528","w":"moratorium","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌmɔrəˈtɔriəm","uz":"vaqtincha to'xtatish","ru":"мораторий","ex":["A five-year moratorium on building was agreed."],"u":"S08U06"},{"id":"lex.04529","w":"embargo","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪmˈbɑrɡoʊ","uz":"embargo, taqiq","ru":"эмбарго","ex":["The embargo lasted eleven years."],"u":"S08U06"},{"id":"lex.04530","w":"restrict","pos":"verb","ipa":"rɪˈstrɪkt","uz":"cheklamoq","ru":"ограничивать рамками","ex":["Entry is restricted to members."],"u":"S08U06"},{"id":"lex.04531","w":"hinder","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈhɪndər","uz":"to'sqinlik qilmoq","ru":"мешать, препятствовать","ex":["Snow hindered the search."],"u":"S08U06"},{"id":"lex.04532","w":"impede","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪmˈpiːd","uz":"to'smoq","ru":"затруднять, препятствовать","ex":["Roadworks impeded the traffic all week."],"u":"S08U06"},{"id":"lex.04533","w":"facilitate","pos":"verb","ipa":"fəˈsɪlɪteɪt","uz":"osonlashtirmoq","ru":"облегчать, способствовать","ex":["The grant facilitated the move."],"u":"S08U06"},{"id":"lex.04534","w":"sidestep","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈsaɪdstep","uz":"chetlab o'tmoq","ru":"обходить стороной","ex":["He sidestepped the question twice."],"u":"S08U06"},{"id":"lex.04535","w":"buttress","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈbʌtrəs","uz":"mustahkamlamoq","ru":"подкреплять","ex":["Two new studies buttress the claim."],"u":"S08U06"},{"id":"lex.04536","w":"overstate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌoʊvərˈsteɪt","uz":"bo'rttirib ko'rsatmoq","ru":"преувеличивать","ex":["It is hard to overstate the damage."],"u":"S08U06"},{"id":"lex.04537","w":"understate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌʌndərˈsteɪt","uz":"kamaytirib ko'rsatmoq","ru":"преуменьшать","ex":["The figure understates the true cost."],"u":"S08U06"},{"id":"lex.04538","w":"deserve","pos":"verb","ipa":"dɪˈzɜrv","uz":"loyiq bo'lmoq","ru":"заслуживать","ex":["The idea deserves a proper hearing."],"u":"S08U06"},{"id":"lex.04539","w":"warrant","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈwɔrənt","uz":"asos bo'lmoq","ru":"оправдывать, давать основание","ex":["The evidence does not warrant an arrest."],"u":"S08U06"},{"id":"lex.04540","w":"legitimise","pos":"verb","ipa":"lɪˈdʒɪtɪmaɪz","uz":"qonuniylashtirmoq","ru":"узаконивать","ex":["The vote legitimised the new government."],"u":"S08U06"},{"id":"lex.04541","w":"vindicate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈvɪndɪkeɪt","uz":"oqlamoq","ru":"оправдывать, подтверждать правоту","ex":["The inquiry vindicated her completely."],"u":"S08U06"},{"id":"lex.04542","w":"authenticate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɔˈθentɪkeɪt","uz":"haqiqiyligini tasdiqlamoq","ru":"удостоверять подлинность","ex":["Two experts authenticated the letter."],"u":"S08U06"},{"id":"lex.04543","w":"outright","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈaʊtraɪt","uz":"butunlay, ochiqdan-ochiq","ru":"полностью, прямо","ex":["They rejected the offer outright."],"u":"S08U06"},{"id":"lex.04544","w":"absolute","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈæbsəluːt","uz":"mutlaq","ru":"абсолютный","ex":["The ban is absolute."],"u":"S08U06"},{"id":"lex.04545","w":"unequivocally","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˌʌnɪˈkwɪvəkli","uz":"so'zsiz, aniq qilib","ru":"недвусмысленно","ex":["The minister unequivocally denied it."],"u":"S08U06"},{"id":"lex.04546","w":"categorically","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˌkætəˈɡɔrɪkli","uz":"qat'iy ravishda","ru":"категорически","ex":["She categorically refused."],"u":"S08U06"},{"id":"lex.04547","w":"emphatically","pos":"adv","ipa":"ɪmˈfætɪkli","uz":"qat'iyat bilan","ru":"решительно, настойчиво","ex":["They emphatically rejected the charge."],"u":"S08U06"},{"id":"lex.04548","w":"conditionally","pos":"adv","ipa":"kənˈdɪʃənəli","uz":"shartli ravishda","ru":"условно","ex":["The offer was accepted conditionally."],"u":"S08U06"},{"id":"lex.04549","w":"negligibly","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈneɡlɪdʒəbli","uz":"arzimas darajada","ru":"ничтожно мало","ex":["Costs rose only negligibly."],"u":"S08U06"},{"id":"lex.04550","w":"marginally","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈmɑrdʒɪnəli","uz":"biroz","ru":"незначительно","ex":["Sales were marginally higher."],"u":"S08U06"},{"id":"lex.04551","w":"inexorably","pos":"adv","ipa":"ɪnˈeksərəbli","uz":"muqarrar ravishda","ru":"неумолимо","ex":["Costs rose inexorably through the decade."],"u":"S08U06"},{"id":"lex.04552","w":"covert","pos":"adj","ipa":"koʊˈvɜrt","uz":"maxfiy","ru":"тайный, скрытый","ex":["The operation was entirely covert."],"u":"S08U07"},{"id":"lex.04553","w":"substantially","pos":"adv","ipa":"səbˈstænʃəli","uz":"sezilarli darajada","ru":"существенно","ex":["Costs fell substantially after 2010."],"u":"S08U07"},{"id":"lex.04554","w":"profoundly","pos":"adv","ipa":"prəˈfaʊndli","uz":"chuqur, tubdan","ru":"глубоко","ex":["The war changed the country profoundly."],"u":"S08U07"},{"id":"lex.04555","w":"stringent","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈstrɪndʒənt","uz":"qat'iy","ru":"строгий, жёсткий","ex":["The new rules are more stringent."],"u":"S08U07"},{"id":"lex.04556","w":"lax","pos":"adj","ipa":"læks","uz":"bo'sh, talabchan emas","ru":"нестрогий, небрежный","ex":["Security at the gate was lax."],"u":"S08U07"},{"id":"lex.04557","w":"arbitrary","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈɑrbɪtreri","uz":"o'zboshimcha, tasodifiy","ru":"произвольный","ex":["The cut-off point is arbitrary."],"u":"S08U07"},{"id":"lex.04558","w":"systematic","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌsɪstəˈmætɪk","uz":"tizimli","ru":"систематический","ex":["They made a systematic search of the floor."],"u":"S08U07"},{"id":"lex.04559","w":"germane","pos":"adj","ipa":"dʒərˈmeɪn","uz":"bevosita aloqador","ru":"уместный, относящийся к делу","ex":["That detail is not germane to the question."],"u":"S08U07"},{"id":"lex.04560","w":"pertinent","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈpɜrtɪnənt","uz":"o'rinli","ru":"уместный","ex":["She asked a pertinent question."],"u":"S08U07"},{"id":"lex.04561","w":"tangential","pos":"adj","ipa":"tænˈdʒenʃəl","uz":"chetdan, yuzaki bog'liq","ru":"побочный, косвенный","ex":["The remark was tangential."],"u":"S08U07"},{"id":"lex.04562","w":"extraneous","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪkˈstreɪniəs","uz":"begona, ortiqcha","ru":"посторонний","ex":["Strip out the extraneous detail."],"u":"S08U07"},{"id":"lex.04563","w":"superfluous","pos":"adj","ipa":"suːˈpɜrfluəs","uz":"ortiqcha","ru":"излишний","ex":["The last paragraph is superfluous."],"u":"S08U07"},{"id":"lex.04564","w":"nuanced","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈnuːɑːnst","uz":"nozik farqlarni hisobga olgan","ru":"нюансированный, тонкий","ex":["Her account is more nuanced than his."],"u":"S08U07"},{"id":"lex.04565","w":"simplistic","pos":"adj","ipa":"sɪmˈplɪstɪk","uz":"soddalashtirilgan","ru":"упрощённый","ex":["That is a simplistic reading of the data."],"u":"S08U07"},{"id":"lex.04566","w":"reductive","pos":"adj","ipa":"rɪˈdʌktɪv","uz":"haddan tashqari soddalashtiruvchi","ru":"редукционистский","ex":["The summary is reductive."],"u":"S08U07"},{"id":"lex.04567","w":"ubiquitous","pos":"adj","ipa":"juːˈbɪkwɪtəs","uz":"hamma joyda uchraydigan","ru":"повсеместный","ex":["Plastic is now ubiquitous."],"u":"S08U07"},{"id":"lex.04568","w":"prevalent","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈprevələnt","uz":"keng tarqalgan","ru":"распространённый","ex":["The disease is most prevalent in the south."],"u":"S08U07"},{"id":"lex.04569","w":"scarce","pos":"adj","ipa":"skers","uz":"kam, taqchil","ru":"скудный, дефицитный","ex":["Water became scarce by August."],"u":"S08U07"},{"id":"lex.04570","w":"canonical","pos":"adj","ipa":"kəˈnɑnɪkəl","uz":"me'yoriy, tan olingan","ru":"канонический","ex":["This is the canonical text."],"u":"S08U07"},{"id":"lex.04571","w":"peripheral","pos":"adj","ipa":"pəˈrɪfərəl","uz":"chekka, ikkinchi darajali","ru":"периферийный, второстепенный","ex":["The issue is peripheral to the main argument."],"u":"S08U07"},{"id":"lex.04572","w":"comprehensive","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌkɑmprɪˈhensɪv","uz":"to'liq qamrovli","ru":"всесторонний","ex":["The survey is comprehensive."],"u":"S08U07"},{"id":"lex.04573","w":"exhaustive","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪɡˈzɔstɪv","uz":"tugal, batafsil","ru":"исчерпывающий","ex":["The list is not exhaustive."],"u":"S08U07"},{"id":"lex.04574","w":"partial","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈpɑrʃəl","uz":"qisman","ru":"частичный","ex":["We have only a partial record."],"u":"S08U07"},{"id":"lex.04575","w":"fragmentary","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈfræɡmənteri","uz":"parcha-parcha","ru":"отрывочный","ex":["The evidence is fragmentary."],"u":"S08U07"},{"id":"lex.04576","w":"disjointed","pos":"adj","ipa":"dɪsˈdʒɔɪntɪd","uz":"uzuq-yuluq","ru":"бессвязный","ex":["The argument is disjointed."],"u":"S08U07"},{"id":"lex.04577","w":"fragmented","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈfræɡmentɪd","uz":"bo'lak-bo'lak bo'lgan","ru":"раздробленный","ex":["The market is fragmented."],"u":"S08U07"},{"id":"lex.04578","w":"randomness","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈrændəmnəs","uz":"tasodifiylik","ru":"случайность","ex":["Some randomness is built into the test."],"u":"S08U07"},{"id":"lex.04579","w":"attenuate","pos":"verb","ipa":"əˈtenjueɪt","uz":"susaytirmoq","ru":"ослаблять","ex":["Distance attenuates the signal."],"u":"S08U07"},{"id":"lex.04580","w":"attenuation","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˌtenjuˈeɪʃən","uz":"susayish","ru":"затухание, ослабление","ex":["Attenuation increases with depth."],"u":"S08U07"},{"id":"lex.04581","w":"amplification","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌæmplɪfɪˈkeɪʃən","uz":"kuchaytirish","ru":"усиление","ex":["The hall needs no amplification."],"u":"S08U07"},{"id":"lex.04582","w":"distortion","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˈstɔrʃən","uz":"buzib ko'rsatish","ru":"искажение","ex":["The map contains a known distortion."],"u":"S08U07"},{"id":"lex.04583","w":"surge","pos":"noun","ipa":"sɜrdʒ","uz":"keskin o'sish","ru":"резкий рост","ex":["A surge in demand emptied the shelves."],"u":"S08U07"},{"id":"lex.04584","w":"shortfall","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈʃɔrtfɔl","uz":"yetishmovchilik","ru":"нехватка, дефицит","ex":["There is a shortfall of two million."],"u":"S08U07"},{"id":"lex.04585","w":"disparity","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˈspærɪti","uz":"tengsizlik","ru":"неравенство, разрыв","ex":["The disparity between the regions is growing."],"u":"S08U07"},{"id":"lex.04586","w":"discrepancy","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˈskrepənsi","uz":"nomuvofiqlik","ru":"расхождение","ex":["There is a discrepancy of ten pounds."],"u":"S08U07"},{"id":"lex.04587","w":"divergence","pos":"noun","ipa":"daɪˈvɜrdʒəns","uz":"farqlanish","ru":"расхождение, дивергенция","ex":["A sharp divergence opened after 1990."],"u":"S08U07"},{"id":"lex.04588","w":"consistent","pos":"adj","ipa":"kənˈsɪstənt","uz":"mos keladigan, ziddiyatsiz","ru":"согласующийся, последовательный","ex":["The result is consistent with the earlier study."],"u":"S08U08"},{"id":"lex.04589","w":"genome","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdʒiːnoʊm","uz":"genom","ru":"геном","ex":["The wheat genome was published in 2018."],"u":"S08U08"},{"id":"lex.04590","w":"chromosome","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkroʊməsoʊm","uz":"xromosoma","ru":"хромосома","ex":["Humans have forty-six chromosomes."],"u":"S08U08"},{"id":"lex.04591","w":"enzyme","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈenzaɪm","uz":"ferment","ru":"фермент","ex":["The enzyme breaks down starch."],"u":"S08U08"},{"id":"lex.04592","w":"molecule","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmɑlɪkjuːl","uz":"molekula","ru":"молекула","ex":["A water molecule has three atoms."],"u":"S08U08"},{"id":"lex.04593","w":"atom","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈætəm","uz":"atom","ru":"атом","ex":["Carbon atoms form long chains."],"u":"S08U08"},{"id":"lex.04594","w":"particle","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpɑrtɪkəl","uz":"zarra","ru":"частица","ex":["Dust particles block the filter."],"u":"S08U08"},{"id":"lex.04595","w":"telescope","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtelɪskoʊp","uz":"teleskop","ru":"телескоп","ex":["The telescope was built on a mountain."],"u":"S08U08"},{"id":"lex.04596","w":"microscope","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmaɪkrəskoʊp","uz":"mikroskop","ru":"микроскоп","ex":["Under the microscope the edge is rough."],"u":"S08U08"},{"id":"lex.04597","w":"satellite","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsætəlaɪt","uz":"sun'iy yo'ldosh","ru":"спутник","ex":["The satellite sends images every hour."],"u":"S08U08"},{"id":"lex.04598","w":"rover","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈroʊvər","uz":"sayyora aravasi","ru":"планетоход","ex":["The rover travelled eleven kilometres."],"u":"S08U08"},{"id":"lex.04599","w":"orbit","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɔrbɪt","uz":"orbita","ru":"орбита","ex":["The station completes an orbit every ninety minutes."],"u":"S08U08"},{"id":"lex.04600","w":"algorithm","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈælɡərɪðəm","uz":"algoritm","ru":"алгоритм","ex":["The algorithm ranks the results."],"u":"S08U08"},{"id":"lex.04601","w":"compiler","pos":"noun","ipa":"kəmˈpaɪlər","uz":"kompilyator","ru":"компилятор","ex":["The compiler caught the error."],"u":"S08U08"},{"id":"lex.04602","w":"runtime","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈrʌntaɪm","uz":"ishlash vaqti","ru":"время выполнения","ex":["The fault only appears at runtime."],"u":"S08U08"},{"id":"lex.04603","w":"cache","pos":"noun","ipa":"kæʃ","uz":"kesh","ru":"кеш","ex":["Clear the cache and try again."],"u":"S08U08"},{"id":"lex.04604","w":"latency","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈleɪtənsi","uz":"kechikish","ru":"задержка","ex":["Latency rises at peak hours."],"u":"S08U08"},{"id":"lex.04605","w":"bandwidth","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈbændwɪdθ","uz":"o'tkazuvchanlik","ru":"пропускная способность","ex":["The village has very little bandwidth."],"u":"S08U08"},{"id":"lex.04606","w":"encryption","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪnˈkrɪpʃən","uz":"shifrlash","ru":"шифрование","ex":["Messages use end-to-end encryption."],"u":"S08U08"},{"id":"lex.04607","w":"authentication","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɔˌθentɪˈkeɪʃən","uz":"shaxsni tasdiqlash","ru":"аутентификация","ex":["Two-factor authentication is required."],"u":"S08U08"},{"id":"lex.04608","w":"firewall","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfaɪərwɔl","uz":"tarmoq to'sig'i","ru":"межсетевой экран","ex":["The firewall blocked the request."],"u":"S08U08"},{"id":"lex.04609","w":"malware","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmælwer","uz":"zararli dastur","ru":"вредоносное ПО","ex":["The malware spread through email."],"u":"S08U08"},{"id":"lex.04610","w":"phishing","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfɪʃɪŋ","uz":"fishing, aldov xati","ru":"фишинг","ex":["The bank warns customers about phishing."],"u":"S08U08"},{"id":"lex.04611","w":"iteration","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌɪtəˈreɪʃən","uz":"bosqichma-bosqich takrorlash","ru":"итерация","ex":["The third iteration finally worked."],"u":"S08U08"},{"id":"lex.04612","w":"deployment","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˈplɔɪmənt","uz":"ishga tushirish","ru":"развёртывание","ex":["Deployment is scheduled for Friday night."],"u":"S08U08"},{"id":"lex.04613","w":"rollback","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈroʊlbæk","uz":"oldingi holatga qaytarish","ru":"откат","ex":["The rollback took four minutes."],"u":"S08U08"},{"id":"lex.04614","w":"versioning","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈvɜrʒənɪŋ","uz":"versiyalarni yuritish","ru":"версионирование","ex":["Versioning saved us after the deletion."],"u":"S08U08"},{"id":"lex.04615","w":"reactor","pos":"noun","ipa":"riˈæktər","uz":"reaktor","ru":"реактор","ex":["The reactor was shut down for repairs."],"u":"S08U08"},{"id":"lex.04616","w":"grid","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɡrɪd","uz":"elektr tarmog'i","ru":"энергосеть","ex":["The wind farm feeds the national grid."],"u":"S08U08"},{"id":"lex.04617","w":"transformer","pos":"noun","ipa":"trænsˈfɔrmər","uz":"transformator","ru":"трансформатор","ex":["The transformer burnt out in the storm."],"u":"S08U08"},{"id":"lex.04618","w":"reservoir","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈrezərvwɑr","uz":"suv ombori","ru":"водохранилище","ex":["The reservoir is at a third of capacity."],"u":"S08U08"},{"id":"lex.04619","w":"antibiotic","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌæntibaɪˈɑtɪk","uz":"antibiotik","ru":"антибиотик","ex":["She was given a week of antibiotics."],"u":"S08U08"},{"id":"lex.04620","w":"antiseptic","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌæntɪˈseptɪk","uz":"antiseptik","ru":"антисептик","ex":["Clean the cut with antiseptic."],"u":"S08U08"},{"id":"lex.04621","w":"anaesthetic","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌænəsˈθetɪk","uz":"og'riqsizlantiruvchi","ru":"анестетик","ex":["The tooth was removed under local anaesthetic."],"u":"S08U08"},{"id":"lex.04622","w":"transfusion","pos":"noun","ipa":"trænsˈfjuːʒən","uz":"qon quyish","ru":"переливание крови","ex":["He needed two transfusions."],"u":"S08U08"},{"id":"lex.04623","w":"transplant","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtrænsplænt","uz":"organ ko'chirish","ru":"трансплантация","ex":["She is waiting for a kidney transplant."],"u":"S08U08"},{"id":"lex.04624","w":"ligament","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈlɪɡəmənt","uz":"boylam","ru":"связка","ex":["He tore a ligament in his knee."],"u":"S08U08"},{"id":"lex.04625","w":"apposition","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌæpəˈzɪʃən","uz":"izohlovchi qo'shilish","ru":"приложение","ex":["'My brother, a doctor' is a noun in apposition."],"u":"S08U09"},{"id":"lex.04626","w":"ellipsis","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪˈlɪpsɪs","uz":"tushirib qoldirish","ru":"эллипсис","ex":["The second clause uses ellipsis."],"u":"S08U09"},{"id":"lex.04627","w":"colon","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkoʊlən","uz":"ikki nuqta","ru":"двоеточие","ex":["Put a colon before the list."],"u":"S08U09"},{"id":"lex.04628","w":"semicolon","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsemikoʊlən","uz":"nuqtali vergul","ru":"точка с запятой","ex":["A semicolon would be better than a full stop here."],"u":"S08U09"},{"id":"lex.04629","w":"dash","pos":"noun","ipa":"dæʃ","uz":"tire","ru":"тире","ex":["A dash is less formal than a colon."],"u":"S08U09"},{"id":"lex.04630","w":"prologue","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈproʊlɔɡ","uz":"muqaddima","ru":"пролог","ex":["The prologue is set forty years earlier."],"u":"S08U09"},{"id":"lex.04631","w":"epilogue","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈepɪlɔɡ","uz":"xotima","ru":"эпилог","ex":["The epilogue jumps to 1975."],"u":"S08U09"},{"id":"lex.04632","w":"coda","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkoʊdə","uz":"yakuniy qism","ru":"кода, заключение","ex":["The essay ends with a two-page coda."],"u":"S08U09"},{"id":"lex.04633","w":"rider","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈraɪdər","uz":"qo'shimcha shart","ru":"дополнительное условие","ex":["The committee attached a rider."],"u":"S08U09"},{"id":"lex.04634","w":"annotation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌænəˈteɪʃən","uz":"matnga yozilgan izoh","ru":"аннотация, примечание","ex":["The annotations are longer than the poem."],"u":"S08U09"},{"id":"lex.04635","w":"index","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɪndeks","uz":"ko'rsatkich","ru":"указатель","ex":["Check the index for 'harvest'."],"u":"S08U09"},{"id":"lex.04636","w":"digest","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdaɪdʒest","uz":"qisqartma nashr","ru":"дайджест","ex":["A weekly digest goes out on Fridays."],"u":"S08U09"},{"id":"lex.04637","w":"periodical","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌpɪriˈɑdɪkəl","uz":"davriy nashr","ru":"периодическое издание","ex":["The library keeps forty periodicals."],"u":"S08U09"},{"id":"lex.04638","w":"readership","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈriːdərʃɪp","uz":"o'quvchilar doirasi","ru":"читательская аудитория","ex":["The paper lost half its readership."],"u":"S08U09"},{"id":"lex.04639","w":"subscription","pos":"noun","ipa":"səbˈskrɪpʃən","uz":"obuna","ru":"подписка","ex":["My subscription runs out in June."],"u":"S08U09"},{"id":"lex.04640","w":"redraft","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌriːˈdræft","uz":"qayta yozmoq","ru":"переписывать, перерабатывать","ex":["She redrafted the opening four times."],"u":"S08U09"},{"id":"lex.04641","w":"canon","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkænən","uz":"tan olingan asarlar to'plami","ru":"канон","ex":["Her novels entered the canon late."],"u":"S08U09"},{"id":"lex.04642","w":"codex","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkoʊdeks","uz":"qadimiy qo'lyozma kitob","ru":"кодекс, рукописная книга","ex":["The codex dates from the sixth century."],"u":"S08U09"},{"id":"lex.04643","w":"papyrus","pos":"noun","ipa":"pəˈpaɪrəs","uz":"papirus","ru":"папирус","ex":["The letter is written on papyrus."],"u":"S08U09"},{"id":"lex.04644","w":"parchment","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpɑrtʃmənt","uz":"pergament","ru":"пергамент","ex":["The charter is on parchment."],"u":"S08U09"},{"id":"lex.04645","w":"archaeology","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌɑrkiˈɑlədʒi","uz":"arxeologiya","ru":"археология","ex":["She read archaeology at university."],"u":"S08U09"},{"id":"lex.04646","w":"excavation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌekskəˈveɪʃən","uz":"qazishma","ru":"раскопки","ex":["The excavation lasted three summers."],"u":"S08U09"},{"id":"lex.04647","w":"relic","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈrelɪk","uz":"yodgorlik buyum","ru":"реликвия","ex":["The cup is a relic of the old kitchen."],"u":"S08U09"},{"id":"lex.04648","w":"artefact","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɑrtɪfækt","uz":"ashyoviy topilma","ru":"артефакт","ex":["Two thousand artefacts were catalogued."],"u":"S08U09"},{"id":"lex.04649","w":"restoration","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌrestəˈreɪʃən","uz":"qayta tiklash","ru":"реставрация","ex":["Restoration of the dome took nine years."],"u":"S08U09"},{"id":"lex.04650","w":"curation","pos":"noun","ipa":"kjʊˈreɪʃən","uz":"to'plamni saqlash va tanlash","ru":"кураторство","ex":["The curation of the exhibition took two years."],"u":"S08U09"},{"id":"lex.04651","w":"patrimony","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpætrɪmoʊni","uz":"madaniy meros","ru":"культурное наследие","ex":["The site is part of the national patrimony."],"u":"S08U09"},{"id":"lex.04652","w":"schema","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈskiːmə","uz":"sxema","ru":"схема","ex":["The schema fits on one page."],"u":"S08U09"},{"id":"lex.04653","w":"archetype","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɑrkɪtaɪp","uz":"asl namuna","ru":"прообраз, архетип","ex":["He is the archetype of the reluctant hero."],"u":"S08U09"},{"id":"lex.04654","w":"lexicographer","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌleksɪˈkɑɡrəfər","uz":"lug'atshunos","ru":"лексикограф","ex":["The lexicographer records use, not rules."],"u":"S08U09"},{"id":"lex.04655","w":"etymology","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌetɪˈmɑlədʒi","uz":"etimologiya","ru":"этимология","ex":["The etymology is disputed."],"u":"S08U09"},{"id":"lex.04656","w":"cognate","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkɑɡneɪt","uz":"o'zakdosh so'z","ru":"когнат, родственное слово","ex":["'Night' and 'Nacht' are cognates."],"u":"S08U09"},{"id":"lex.04657","w":"loanword","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈloʊnwɜrd","uz":"o'zlashma so'z","ru":"заимствование","ex":["'Algebra' is a loanword from Arabic."],"u":"S08U09"},{"id":"lex.04658","w":"bilingual","pos":"adj","ipa":"baɪˈlɪŋɡwəl","uz":"ikki tilli","ru":"двуязычный","ex":["The signs are bilingual."],"u":"S08U09"},{"id":"lex.04659","w":"multilingual","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌmʌltiˈlɪŋɡwəl","uz":"ko'p tilli","ru":"многоязычный","ex":["The city has always been multilingual."],"u":"S08U09"},{"id":"lex.04660","w":"monolingual","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌmɑnoʊˈlɪŋɡwəl","uz":"bir tilli","ru":"одноязычный","ex":["A monolingual dictionary defines in English only."],"u":"S08U09"},{"id":"lex.04661","w":"simplification","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌsɪmplɪfɪˈkeɪʃən","uz":"soddalashtirish","ru":"упрощение","ex":["The map is a useful simplification."],"u":"S08U10"},{"id":"lex.04662","w":"reduction","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈdʌkʃən","uz":"kamaytirish","ru":"сокращение","ex":["A ten per cent reduction was agreed."],"u":"S08U10"},{"id":"lex.04663","w":"idealisation","pos":"noun","ipa":"aɪˌdiːəlaɪˈzeɪʃən","uz":"ideallashtirish","ru":"идеализация","ex":["The model is an idealisation, not a photograph."],"u":"S08U10"},{"id":"lex.04664","w":"decomposition","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌdiːkɑmpəˈzɪʃən","uz":"tarkibiy qismlarga ajratish","ru":"разложение","ex":["The decomposition of the total shows where the money went."],"u":"S08U10"},{"id":"lex.04665","w":"aggregation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌæɡrɪˈɡeɪʃən","uz":"jamlash","ru":"агрегирование","ex":["Aggregation hides the regional differences."],"u":"S08U10"},{"id":"lex.04666","w":"synthesis","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsɪnθəsɪs","uz":"sintez, umumlashma","ru":"синтез","ex":["The last chapter offers a synthesis."],"u":"S08U10"},{"id":"lex.04667","w":"omission","pos":"noun","ipa":"oʊˈmɪʃən","uz":"tushib qolgan joy","ru":"пропуск, упущение","ex":["The omission of her name was deliberate."],"u":"S08U10"},{"id":"lex.04668","w":"anomaly","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈnɑməli","uz":"g'ayrioddiy hodisa","ru":"аномалия","ex":["The reading is an anomaly."],"u":"S08U10"},{"id":"lex.04669","w":"merit","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmerɪt","uz":"fazilat, yutuq","ru":"достоинство","ex":["The plan has one clear merit: it is cheap."],"u":"S08U10"},{"id":"lex.04670","w":"virtue","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈvɜrtʃuː","uz":"fazilat","ru":"добродетель, достоинство","ex":["Patience is the chief virtue here."],"u":"S08U10"},{"id":"lex.04671","w":"refinement","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈfaɪnmənt","uz":"takomillashtirish","ru":"усовершенствование","ex":["Two refinements doubled the speed."],"u":"S08U10"},{"id":"lex.04672","w":"overhaul","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈoʊvərhɔl","uz":"tubdan qayta ishlash","ru":"капитальный ремонт, пересмотр","ex":["The engine is due for an overhaul."],"u":"S08U10"},{"id":"lex.04673","w":"groundwork","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɡraʊndwɜrk","uz":"dastlabki tayyorgarlik","ru":"подготовительная работа","ex":["She laid the groundwork for the reform."],"u":"S08U10"},{"id":"lex.04674","w":"reversal","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈvɜrsəl","uz":"teskarisiga o'zgarish","ru":"поворот, отмена","ex":["The court ordered a reversal of the decision."],"u":"S08U10"},{"id":"lex.04675","w":"turnaround","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtɜrnəraʊnd","uz":"keskin yaxshilanish","ru":"перелом к лучшему","ex":["The turnaround took eighteen months."],"u":"S08U10"},{"id":"lex.04676","w":"inception","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪnˈsepʃən","uz":"boshlanishi","ru":"начало, возникновение","ex":["The fund has grown since its inception."],"u":"S08U10"},{"id":"lex.04677","w":"fruition","pos":"noun","ipa":"fruˈɪʃən","uz":"amalga oshish","ru":"осуществление","ex":["The idea came to fruition in 2003."],"u":"S08U10"},{"id":"lex.04678","w":"endeavour","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪnˈdevər","uz":"sa'y-harakat","ru":"начинание, старание","ex":["The whole endeavour cost a fortune."],"u":"S08U10"},{"id":"lex.04679","w":"pursuit","pos":"noun","ipa":"pərˈsuːt","uz":"intilish","ru":"стремление, погоня","ex":["The pursuit of growth crowded out everything else."],"u":"S08U10"},{"id":"lex.04680","w":"trajectory","pos":"noun","ipa":"trəˈdʒektəri","uz":"harakat yo'li","ru":"траектория","ex":["The country is on a different trajectory now."],"u":"S08U10"},{"id":"lex.04681","w":"tipping","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtɪpɪŋ","uz":"burilish nuqtasi","ru":"переломный момент","ex":["The tipping point was reached in March."],"u":"S08U10"},{"id":"lex.04682","w":"granularity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌɡrænjəˈlærɪti","uz":"detallashtirish darajasi","ru":"степень детализации","ex":["The data lack the granularity we need."],"u":"S08U10"},{"id":"lex.04683","w":"fidelity","pos":"noun","ipa":"fɪˈdelɪti","uz":"aniqlik darajasi","ru":"точность воспроизведения","ex":["The recording has remarkable fidelity."],"u":"S08U10"},{"id":"lex.04684","w":"periodicity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌpɪriəˈdɪsɪti","uz":"davriylik","ru":"периодичность","ex":["The periodicity of the floods is about eleven years."],"u":"S08U10"},{"id":"lex.04685","w":"regularity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌreɡjəˈlærɪti","uz":"muntazamlik","ru":"регулярность","ex":["The regularity of the visits surprised us."],"u":"S08U10"},{"id":"lex.04686","w":"irregularity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪˌreɡjəˈlærɪti","uz":"tartibsizlik, qoidabuzarlik","ru":"нарушение, неравномерность","ex":["Irregularities in the count were reported."],"u":"S08U10"},{"id":"lex.04687","w":"scaffolding","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈskæfəldɪŋ","uz":"iskala","ru":"строительные леса","ex":["The scaffolding came down in June."],"u":"S08U10"},{"id":"lex.04688","w":"apparatus","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌæpəˈrætəs","uz":"asbob-uskuna, tuzilma","ru":"аппарат, оборудование","ex":["The laboratory apparatus filled two rooms."],"u":"S08U10"},{"id":"lex.04689","w":"architecture","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɑrkɪtektʃər","uz":"tuzilma, me'morchilik","ru":"архитектура","ex":["The architecture of the network is simple."],"u":"S08U10"},{"id":"lex.04690","w":"ecology","pos":"noun","ipa":"iˈkɑlədʒi","uz":"ekologiya","ru":"экология","ex":["She teaches the ecology of rivers."],"u":"S08U10"},{"id":"lex.04691","w":"proliferate","pos":"verb","ipa":"prəˈlɪfəreɪt","uz":"tez ko'paymoq","ru":"быстро распространяться","ex":["Small workshops proliferated after 1991."],"u":"S08U10"},{"id":"lex.04692","w":"multiply","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈmʌltɪplaɪ","uz":"ko'paymoq","ru":"умножаться, размножаться","ex":["The difficulties multiplied."],"u":"S08U10"},{"id":"lex.04693","w":"cease","pos":"verb","ipa":"siːs","uz":"to'xtamoq","ru":"прекращать","ex":["The noise ceased at midnight."],"u":"S08U10"},{"id":"lex.04694","w":"abate","pos":"verb","ipa":"əˈbeɪt","uz":"pasaymoq","ru":"ослабевать, утихать","ex":["The storm abated towards morning."],"u":"S08U10"},{"id":"lex.04695","w":"subside","pos":"verb","ipa":"səbˈsaɪd","uz":"tinchimoq, cho'kmoq","ru":"утихать, оседать","ex":["The swelling subsided overnight."],"u":"S08U10"},{"id":"lex.04696","w":"elliptical","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪˈlɪptɪkəl","uz":"qisqartirilgan, tushirib qoldirilgan","ru":"эллиптический","ex":["His answers were elliptical."],"u":"S08U10"},{"id":"lex.04697","w":"aesthetic","pos":"adj","ipa":"esˈθetɪk","uz":"estetik","ru":"эстетический","ex":["The change was aesthetic, not practical."],"u":"S08U11"},{"id":"lex.04698","w":"sublime","pos":"adj","ipa":"səˈblaɪm","uz":"ulug'vor","ru":"возвышенный","ex":["The view from the pass is sublime."],"u":"S08U11"},{"id":"lex.04699","w":"grotesque","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɡroʊˈtesk","uz":"badbashara, g'ayritabiiy","ru":"гротескный","ex":["The carvings are deliberately grotesque."],"u":"S08U11"},{"id":"lex.04700","w":"pastiche","pos":"noun","ipa":"pæˈstiːʃ","uz":"uslubga taqlid","ru":"пастиш, подражание","ex":["The song is a pastiche of the 1960s."],"u":"S08U11"},{"id":"lex.04701","w":"parody","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpærədi","uz":"parodiya","ru":"пародия","ex":["The sketch is a parody of the evening news."],"u":"S08U11"},{"id":"lex.04702","w":"homage","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɑmɪdʒ","uz":"ehtirom ifodasi","ru":"дань уважения","ex":["The final scene is an homage to Chaplin."],"u":"S08U11"},{"id":"lex.04703","w":"modernism","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmɑdərnɪzəm","uz":"modernizm","ru":"модернизм","ex":["Modernism arrived late in the provinces."],"u":"S08U11"},{"id":"lex.04704","w":"realism","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈriːəlɪzəm","uz":"realizm","ru":"реализм","ex":["The novel is a masterpiece of realism."],"u":"S08U11"},{"id":"lex.04705","w":"romanticism","pos":"noun","ipa":"roʊˈmæntɪsɪzəm","uz":"romantizm","ru":"романтизм","ex":["Romanticism reached Russia in the 1820s."],"u":"S08U11"},{"id":"lex.04706","w":"symbolism","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsɪmbəlɪzəm","uz":"ramziylik","ru":"символизм","ex":["The symbolism of the river is obvious."],"u":"S08U11"},{"id":"lex.04707","w":"minimalism","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmɪnɪməlɪzəm","uz":"minimalizm","ru":"минимализм","ex":["The gallery is built on minimalism."],"u":"S08U11"},{"id":"lex.04708","w":"protagonist","pos":"noun","ipa":"proʊˈtæɡənɪst","uz":"bosh qahramon","ru":"главный герой","ex":["The protagonist never speaks."],"u":"S08U11"},{"id":"lex.04709","w":"antagonist","pos":"noun","ipa":"ænˈtæɡənɪst","uz":"raqib qahramon","ru":"антагонист","ex":["The antagonist is more interesting than the hero."],"u":"S08U11"},{"id":"lex.04710","w":"narrator","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈnæreɪtər","uz":"hikoyachi","ru":"рассказчик","ex":["The narrator cannot be trusted."],"u":"S08U11"},{"id":"lex.04711","w":"persona","pos":"noun","ipa":"pərˈsoʊnə","uz":"maska, ijodiy siymo","ru":"персона, образ","ex":["The stage persona is nothing like the man."],"u":"S08U11"},{"id":"lex.04712","w":"irony","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈaɪrəni","uz":"kinoya","ru":"ирония","ex":["The irony was lost on half the room."],"u":"S08U11"},{"id":"lex.04713","w":"allegory","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈæləɡɔri","uz":"allegoriya","ru":"аллегория","ex":["The play is an allegory of the occupation."],"u":"S08U11"},{"id":"lex.04714","w":"allusion","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈluːʒən","uz":"ishora","ru":"аллюзия","ex":["The title is an allusion to a psalm."],"u":"S08U11"},{"id":"lex.04715","w":"motif","pos":"noun","ipa":"moʊˈtiːf","uz":"motiv","ru":"мотив","ex":["Water is the central motif."],"u":"S08U11"},{"id":"lex.04716","w":"verse","pos":"noun","ipa":"vɜrs","uz":"she'riyat","ru":"стихи","ex":["The play is written in verse."],"u":"S08U11"},{"id":"lex.04717","w":"prose","pos":"noun","ipa":"proʊz","uz":"nasr","ru":"проза","ex":["Her prose is plain and fast."],"u":"S08U11"},{"id":"lex.04718","w":"stanza","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈstænzə","uz":"band","ru":"строфа","ex":["The second stanza changes the tense."],"u":"S08U11"},{"id":"lex.04719","w":"cadence","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkeɪdəns","uz":"ohang, ritm","ru":"каденция, ритм","ex":["You can hear her cadence in every sentence."],"u":"S08U11"},{"id":"lex.04720","w":"rhyme","pos":"noun","ipa":"raɪm","uz":"qofiya","ru":"рифма","ex":["The translation keeps the rhyme."],"u":"S08U11"},{"id":"lex.04721","w":"composition","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌkɑmpəˈzɪʃən","uz":"kompozitsiya","ru":"композиция","ex":["The composition draws the eye to the left."],"u":"S08U11"},{"id":"lex.04722","w":"fresco","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfreskoʊ","uz":"freska","ru":"фреска","ex":["The frescoes were cleaned in 1994."],"u":"S08U11"},{"id":"lex.04723","w":"mosaic","pos":"noun","ipa":"moʊˈzeɪɪk","uz":"mozaika","ru":"мозаика","ex":["The floor mosaic survived the fire."],"u":"S08U11"},{"id":"lex.04724","w":"calligraphy","pos":"noun","ipa":"kəˈlɪɡrəfi","uz":"xattotlik","ru":"каллиграфия","ex":["The calligraphy alone is worth the visit."],"u":"S08U11"},{"id":"lex.04725","w":"miniature","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmɪniətʃər","uz":"miniatyura","ru":"миниатюра","ex":["The miniatures are the finest in the collection."],"u":"S08U11"},{"id":"lex.04726","w":"illumination","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪˌluːmɪˈneɪʃən","uz":"qo'lyozma bezagi","ru":"иллюминирование","ex":["The illumination was added a century later."],"u":"S08U11"},{"id":"lex.04727","w":"ensemble","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɑnˈsɑmbəl","uz":"ansambl","ru":"ансамбль","ex":["The ensemble has eight players."],"u":"S08U11"},{"id":"lex.04728","w":"soloist","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsoʊloʊɪst","uz":"yakkaxon","ru":"солист","ex":["The soloist was twenty years old."],"u":"S08U11"},{"id":"lex.04729","w":"repertoire","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈrepərtwɑr","uz":"repertuar","ru":"репертуар","ex":["The piece entered the repertoire slowly."],"u":"S08U11"},{"id":"lex.04730","w":"libretto","pos":"noun","ipa":"lɪˈbretoʊ","uz":"libretto","ru":"либретто","ex":["The libretto is better than the music."],"u":"S08U11"},{"id":"lex.04731","w":"choreography","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌkɔriˈɑɡrəfi","uz":"xoreografiya","ru":"хореография","ex":["The choreography is over eighty years old."],"u":"S08U11"},{"id":"lex.04732","w":"improvisation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌɪmprəvaɪˈzeɪʃən","uz":"improvizatsiya","ru":"импровизация","ex":["Half the concert is improvisation."],"u":"S08U11"},{"id":"lex.04733","w":"inflation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪnˈfleɪʃən","uz":"inflyatsiya","ru":"инфляция","ex":["Inflation reached nine per cent."],"u":"S08U12"},{"id":"lex.04734","w":"deflation","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˈfleɪʃən","uz":"deflyatsiya","ru":"дефляция","ex":["Deflation sounds good and is not."],"u":"S08U12"},{"id":"lex.04735","w":"recession","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈseʃən","uz":"retsessiya, tanazzul","ru":"рецессия, спад","ex":["The recession lasted eighteen months."],"u":"S08U12"},{"id":"lex.04736","w":"stagnation","pos":"noun","ipa":"stæɡˈneɪʃən","uz":"turg'unlik","ru":"застой, стагнация","ex":["Stagnation followed the boom."],"u":"S08U12"},{"id":"lex.04737","w":"austerity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɔˈsterɪti","uz":"tejamkorlik siyosati","ru":"жёсткая экономия","ex":["Austerity closed half the libraries."],"u":"S08U12"},{"id":"lex.04738","w":"stimulus","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈstɪmjələs","uz":"rag'batlantirish chorasi","ru":"стимул, стимулирование","ex":["The stimulus was worth two billion."],"u":"S08U12"},{"id":"lex.04739","w":"liquidity","pos":"noun","ipa":"lɪˈkwɪdɪti","uz":"likvidlik","ru":"ликвидность","ex":["The bank ran out of liquidity, not of assets."],"u":"S08U12"},{"id":"lex.04740","w":"solvency","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsɑlvənsi","uz":"to'lov qobiliyati","ru":"платёжеспособность","ex":["Solvency was never in doubt."],"u":"S08U12"},{"id":"lex.04741","w":"insolvency","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪnˈsɑlvənsi","uz":"to'lovga qobiliyatsizlik","ru":"неплатёжеспособность","ex":["Insolvency was declared in April."],"u":"S08U12"},{"id":"lex.04742","w":"bankruptcy","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈbæŋkrəptsi","uz":"bankrotlik","ru":"банкротство","ex":["The firm filed for bankruptcy."],"u":"S08U12"},{"id":"lex.04743","w":"receivership","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈsiːvərʃɪp","uz":"tashqi boshqaruv","ru":"внешнее управление","ex":["The company went into receivership."],"u":"S08U12"},{"id":"lex.04744","w":"security","pos":"noun","ipa":"sɪˈkjʊrɪti","uz":"qimmatli qog'oz","ru":"ценная бумага","ex":["The fund holds government securities."],"u":"S08U12"},{"id":"lex.04745","w":"derivative","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˈrɪvətɪv","uz":"hosila moliyaviy vosita","ru":"производный инструмент","ex":["Derivatives were blamed for the crash."],"u":"S08U12"},{"id":"lex.04746","w":"dividend","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdɪvɪdend","uz":"dividend","ru":"дивиденд","ex":["The dividend was cut in half."],"u":"S08U12"},{"id":"lex.04747","w":"monopoly","pos":"noun","ipa":"məˈnɑpəli","uz":"monopoliya","ru":"монополия","ex":["The railway was a monopoly for sixty years."],"u":"S08U12"},{"id":"lex.04748","w":"oligopoly","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌɑlɪˈɡɑpəli","uz":"oligopoliya","ru":"олигополия","ex":["Three firms form an oligopoly here."],"u":"S08U12"},{"id":"lex.04749","w":"cartel","pos":"noun","ipa":"kɑrˈtel","uz":"kartel","ru":"картель","ex":["The cartel was fined heavily."],"u":"S08U12"},{"id":"lex.04750","w":"merger","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmɜrdʒər","uz":"birlashish","ru":"слияние","ex":["The merger created the largest bank in the region."],"u":"S08U12"},{"id":"lex.04751","w":"acquisition","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌækwɪˈzɪʃən","uz":"sotib olish","ru":"поглощение, приобретение","ex":["The acquisition cost four billion."],"u":"S08U12"},{"id":"lex.04752","w":"divestment","pos":"noun","ipa":"daɪˈvestmənt","uz":"aktivlarni sotish","ru":"продажа активов","ex":["Divestment from coal began in 2015."],"u":"S08U12"},{"id":"lex.04753","w":"tariff","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtærɪf","uz":"bojxona to'lovi","ru":"тариф, пошлина","ex":["A twenty per cent tariff was imposed."],"u":"S08U12"},{"id":"lex.04754","w":"subsidy","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsʌbsɪdi","uz":"subsidiya","ru":"субсидия","ex":["The bread subsidy was withdrawn."],"u":"S08U12"},{"id":"lex.04755","w":"protectionism","pos":"noun","ipa":"prəˈtekʃənɪzəm","uz":"proteksionizm","ru":"протекционизм","ex":["Protectionism returned after the crisis."],"u":"S08U12"},{"id":"lex.04756","w":"liberalisation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌlɪbərəlaɪˈzeɪʃən","uz":"liberallashtirish","ru":"либерализация","ex":["Liberalisation opened the market in 1994."],"u":"S08U12"},{"id":"lex.04757","w":"throughput","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈθruːpʊt","uz":"o'tkazish hajmi","ru":"объём пропускаемой работы","ex":["Throughput doubled after the rebuild."],"u":"S08U12"},{"id":"lex.04758","w":"utilisation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌjuːtɪlaɪˈzeɪʃən","uz":"foydalanish darajasi","ru":"использование, загрузка","ex":["Bed utilisation is at ninety per cent."],"u":"S08U12"},{"id":"lex.04759","w":"procurement","pos":"noun","ipa":"prəˈkjʊrmənt","uz":"xaridlar tizimi","ru":"закупки","ex":["Procurement rules require three bids."],"u":"S08U12"},{"id":"lex.04760","w":"inventory","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɪnvəntɔri","uz":"tovar zaxirasi","ru":"товарные запасы","ex":["Inventory was counted on the last day of the year."],"u":"S08U12"},{"id":"lex.04761","w":"indexation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌɪndekˈseɪʃən","uz":"indeksatsiya","ru":"индексация","ex":["Indexation protects pensions from inflation."],"u":"S08U12"},{"id":"lex.04762","w":"devaluation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌdiːvæljuˈeɪʃən","uz":"devalvatsiya","ru":"девальвация","ex":["The devaluation made exports cheaper."],"u":"S08U12"},{"id":"lex.04763","w":"revaluation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌriːvæljuˈeɪʃən","uz":"qayta baholash","ru":"ревальвация, переоценка","ex":["The revaluation surprised the markets."],"u":"S08U12"},{"id":"lex.04764","w":"guarantor","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌɡærənˈtɔr","uz":"kafil","ru":"поручитель","ex":["Her uncle acted as guarantor."],"u":"S08U12"},{"id":"lex.04765","w":"underwriter","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈʌndərraɪtər","uz":"riskni zimmasiga oluvchi","ru":"андеррайтер","ex":["The underwriter refused the policy."],"u":"S08U12"},{"id":"lex.04766","w":"actuary","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈæktʃueri","uz":"aktuariy","ru":"актуарий","ex":["The actuary revised the figures."],"u":"S08U12"},{"id":"lex.04767","w":"annuity","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈnuːɪti","uz":"yillik to'lov","ru":"аннуитет","ex":["She bought an annuity with the lump sum."],"u":"S08U12"},{"id":"lex.04768","w":"gratuity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɡrəˈtuːɪti","uz":"mukofot puli","ru":"вознаграждение, чаевые","ex":["A gratuity is paid after ten years' service."],"u":"S08U12"},{"id":"lex.04769","w":"governance","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɡʌvərnəns","uz":"boshqaruv tizimi","ru":"управление","ex":["The report criticises the governance of the fund."],"u":"S08U13"},{"id":"lex.04770","w":"stewardship","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈstuːərdʃɪp","uz":"omonatni asrash","ru":"попечительство, рачительное управление","ex":["Stewardship of the forest passed to the village."],"u":"S08U13"},{"id":"lex.04771","w":"sovereignty","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsɑvrɪnti","uz":"suverenitet","ru":"суверенитет","ex":["Sovereignty was restored in 1991."],"u":"S08U13"},{"id":"lex.04772","w":"autonomy","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɔˈtɑnəmi","uz":"muxtoriyat","ru":"автономия","ex":["The region was granted autonomy."],"u":"S08U13"},{"id":"lex.04773","w":"devolution","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌdevəˈluːʃən","uz":"vakolatlarni mahalliylarga berish","ru":"передача полномочий","ex":["Devolution began after the 1997 vote."],"u":"S08U13"},{"id":"lex.04774","w":"legitimacy","pos":"noun","ipa":"lɪˈdʒɪtɪməsi","uz":"qonuniylik, tan olinganlik","ru":"легитимность","ex":["The election restored some legitimacy."],"u":"S08U13"},{"id":"lex.04775","w":"patronage","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpeɪtrənɪdʒ","uz":"homiylik, tanish-bilishchilik","ru":"покровительство, патронаж","ex":["The system ran on patronage."],"u":"S08U13"},{"id":"lex.04776","w":"electorate","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪˈlektərət","uz":"saylovchilar","ru":"электорат","ex":["The electorate is older than it was."],"u":"S08U13"},{"id":"lex.04777","w":"franchise","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfræntʃaɪz","uz":"saylov huquqi","ru":"избирательное право","ex":["The franchise was extended in 1918."],"u":"S08U13"},{"id":"lex.04778","w":"suffrage","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsʌfrɪdʒ","uz":"ovoz berish huquqi","ru":"право голоса","ex":["Universal suffrage came late here."],"u":"S08U13"},{"id":"lex.04779","w":"plebiscite","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈplebɪsaɪt","uz":"umumxalq so'rovi","ru":"плебисцит","ex":["A plebiscite settled the border."],"u":"S08U13"},{"id":"lex.04780","w":"polity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpɑlɪti","uz":"siyosiy jamoa","ru":"государственное устройство","ex":["The city was a polity in its own right."],"u":"S08U13"},{"id":"lex.04781","w":"republic","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈpʌblɪk","uz":"respublika","ru":"республика","ex":["The republic was declared in 1918."],"u":"S08U13"},{"id":"lex.04782","w":"federation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌfedəˈreɪʃən","uz":"federatsiya","ru":"федерация","ex":["The federation has nine members."],"u":"S08U13"},{"id":"lex.04783","w":"confederation","pos":"noun","ipa":"kənˌfedəˈreɪʃən","uz":"konfederatsiya","ru":"конфедерация","ex":["The confederation lasted eleven years."],"u":"S08U13"},{"id":"lex.04784","w":"commonwealth","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkɑmənwelθ","uz":"hamdo'stlik","ru":"содружество","ex":["Fifty-six countries belong to the Commonwealth."],"u":"S08U13"},{"id":"lex.04785","w":"custodianship","pos":"noun","ipa":"kʌˈstoʊdiənʃɪp","uz":"qo'riqlash mas'uliyati","ru":"опека, хранение","ex":["Custodianship of the archive passed to the library."],"u":"S08U13"},{"id":"lex.04786","w":"trusteeship","pos":"noun","ipa":"trʌˈstiːʃɪp","uz":"ishonchli boshqaruv","ru":"попечительство","ex":["The territory was under trusteeship until 1962."],"u":"S08U13"},{"id":"lex.04787","w":"guardianship","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɡɑrdiənʃɪp","uz":"vasiylik","ru":"опекунство","ex":["Guardianship was granted to the grandmother."],"u":"S08U13"},{"id":"lex.04788","w":"authorship","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɔθərʃɪp","uz":"muallifik","ru":"авторство","ex":["The authorship of the letter is disputed."],"u":"S08U13"},{"id":"lex.04789","w":"philanthropy","pos":"noun","ipa":"fɪˈlænθrəpi","uz":"xayriya","ru":"благотворительность","ex":["The library was built by philanthropy."],"u":"S08U13"},{"id":"lex.04790","w":"sponsorship","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈspɑnsərʃɪp","uz":"homiylik","ru":"спонсорство","ex":["Sponsorship pays for the whole tournament."],"u":"S08U13"},{"id":"lex.04791","w":"cooperative","pos":"noun","ipa":"koʊˈɑpərətɪv","uz":"kooperativ","ru":"кооператив","ex":["The farm became a cooperative in 1960."],"u":"S08U13"},{"id":"lex.04792","w":"mutual","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈmjuːtʃuəl","uz":"o'zaro","ru":"взаимный","ex":["The respect was mutual."],"u":"S08U13"},{"id":"lex.04793","w":"subsistence","pos":"noun","ipa":"səbˈsɪstəns","uz":"tirikchilik darajasi","ru":"прожиточный минимум","ex":["Most families lived at subsistence level."],"u":"S08U13"},{"id":"lex.04794","w":"livelihood","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈlaɪvlihʊd","uz":"tirikchilik manbai","ru":"средство к существованию","ex":["The dam destroyed their livelihood."],"u":"S08U13"},{"id":"lex.04795","w":"remittance","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈmɪtəns","uz":"pul o'tkazmasi","ru":"денежный перевод","ex":["Remittances are a tenth of the economy."],"u":"S08U13"},{"id":"lex.04796","w":"microfinance","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌmaɪkroʊˈfaɪnæns","uz":"mikromoliya","ru":"микрофинансирование","ex":["Microfinance reached the village in 2004."],"u":"S08U13"},{"id":"lex.04797","w":"solidarity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌsɑlɪˈdærɪti","uz":"birdamlik","ru":"солидарность","ex":["The miners marched in solidarity."],"u":"S08U13"},{"id":"lex.04798","w":"alienation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌeɪliəˈneɪʃən","uz":"begonalashuv","ru":"отчуждение","ex":["The chapter is about alienation at work."],"u":"S08U13"},{"id":"lex.04799","w":"hegemony","pos":"noun","ipa":"hɪˈdʒeməni","uz":"gegemonlik","ru":"гегемония","ex":["Naval hegemony lasted a century."],"u":"S08U13"},{"id":"lex.04800","w":"periphery","pos":"noun","ipa":"pəˈrɪfəri","uz":"chekka hudud","ru":"периферия","ex":["The trade grew on the periphery of the empire."],"u":"S08U13"},{"id":"lex.04801","w":"modernity","pos":"noun","ipa":"məˈdɜrnɪti","uz":"zamonaviylik","ru":"современность","ex":["The railway brought modernity to the valley."],"u":"S08U13"},{"id":"lex.04802","w":"postmodernity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌpoʊstməˈdɜrnɪti","uz":"postmodernlik","ru":"постсовременность","ex":["The essay defines postmodernity in one page."],"u":"S08U13"},{"id":"lex.04803","w":"globalisation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌɡloʊbəlaɪˈzeɪʃən","uz":"globallashuv","ru":"глобализация","ex":["Globalisation moved the factory abroad."],"u":"S08U13"},{"id":"lex.04804","w":"localisation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌloʊkəlaɪˈzeɪʃən","uz":"mahalliylashtirish","ru":"локализация","ex":["Localisation of the software took six months."],"u":"S08U13"},{"id":"lex.04805","w":"symposium","pos":"noun","ipa":"sɪmˈpoʊziəm","uz":"simpozium","ru":"симпозиум","ex":["The symposium runs for two days."],"u":"S08U14"},{"id":"lex.04806","w":"keynote","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkiːnoʊt","uz":"asosiy ma'ruza","ru":"основной доклад","ex":["She gave the keynote in Almaty."],"u":"S08U14"},{"id":"lex.04807","w":"proceedings","pos":"noun","ipa":"prəˈsiːdɪŋz","uz":"to'plam, majlis bayoni","ru":"труды конференции","ex":["The proceedings appeared a year later."],"u":"S08U14"},{"id":"lex.04808","w":"persuasion","pos":"noun","ipa":"pərˈsweɪʒən","uz":"ishontirish","ru":"убеждение","ex":["The chapter is about persuasion, not proof."],"u":"S08U14"},{"id":"lex.04809","w":"diatribe","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdaɪətraɪb","uz":"keskin tanqid","ru":"резкая обличительная речь","ex":["The review turned into a diatribe."],"u":"S08U14"},{"id":"lex.04810","w":"syllabus","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsɪləbəs","uz":"o'quv dasturi","ru":"учебная программа","ex":["The syllabus changes every three years."],"u":"S08U14"},{"id":"lex.04811","w":"pedagogy","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpedəɡoʊdʒi","uz":"pedagogika","ru":"педагогика","ex":["The school changed its pedagogy, not its books."],"u":"S08U14"},{"id":"lex.04812","w":"didactic","pos":"adj","ipa":"daɪˈdæktɪk","uz":"ta'limiy, nasihatomuz","ru":"дидактический","ex":["The novel is too didactic to enjoy."],"u":"S08U14"},{"id":"lex.04813","w":"rote","pos":"noun","ipa":"roʊt","uz":"yodlash","ru":"механическое заучивание","ex":["The tables were learnt by rote."],"u":"S08U14"},{"id":"lex.04814","w":"recitation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌresɪˈteɪʃən","uz":"yoddan aytish","ru":"декламация","ex":["The lesson ended with a recitation."],"u":"S08U14"},{"id":"lex.04815","w":"numeracy","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈnuːmərəsi","uz":"hisob-kitob savodxonligi","ru":"счётная грамотность","ex":["Numeracy was tested at eleven."],"u":"S08U14"},{"id":"lex.04816","w":"attainment","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈteɪnmənt","uz":"o'zlashtirish darajasi","ru":"успеваемость, достижение","ex":["Attainment rose in every subject."],"u":"S08U14"},{"id":"lex.04817","w":"fellowship","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfeloʊʃɪp","uz":"ilmiy stipendiya","ru":"научная стипендия","ex":["She won a fellowship to Oxford."],"u":"S08U14"},{"id":"lex.04818","w":"endowment","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪnˈdaʊmənt","uz":"vaqf jamg'armasi","ru":"целевой фонд","ex":["The endowment pays four professors."],"u":"S08U14"},{"id":"lex.04819","w":"bursary","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈbɜrsəri","uz":"moddiy yordam granti","ru":"стипендия по нужде","ex":["The bursary covers her rent."],"u":"S08U14"},{"id":"lex.04820","w":"stipend","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈstaɪpend","uz":"nafaqa, stipendiya","ru":"стипендия, содержание","ex":["The stipend is modest but enough."],"u":"S08U14"},{"id":"lex.04821","w":"theorise","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈθiːəraɪz","uz":"nazariya qurmoq","ru":"теоретизировать","ex":["He theorised about the cause for years."],"u":"S08U14"},{"id":"lex.04822","w":"conceptualise","pos":"verb","ipa":"kənˈseptʃuəlaɪz","uz":"tushuncha sifatida shakllantirmoq","ru":"концептуализировать","ex":["The problem was conceptualised as a shortage."],"u":"S08U14"},{"id":"lex.04823","w":"contextualise","pos":"verb","ipa":"kənˈtekstʃuəlaɪz","uz":"kontekstga joylashtirmoq","ru":"контекстуализировать","ex":["The editor contextualises every quotation."],"u":"S08U14"},{"id":"lex.04824","w":"problematise","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈprɑbləmətaɪz","uz":"muammo sifatida qo'ymoq","ru":"проблематизировать","ex":["The article problematises the word 'skilled'."],"u":"S08U14"},{"id":"lex.04825","w":"universalise","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌjuːnɪˈvɜrsəlaɪz","uz":"umumiylashtirmoq","ru":"универсализировать","ex":["The theory universalises a European experience."],"u":"S08U14"},{"id":"lex.04826","w":"underscore","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌʌndərˈskɔr","uz":"ta'kidlamoq","ru":"подчёркивать","ex":["The figures underscore the scale of the loss."],"u":"S08U14"},{"id":"lex.04827","w":"foreground","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈfɔrɡraʊnd","uz":"birinchi o'ringa qo'ymoq","ru":"выдвигать на первый план","ex":["The chapter foregrounds the women's accounts."],"u":"S08U14"},{"id":"lex.04828","w":"subsume","pos":"verb","ipa":"səbˈsuːm","uz":"tarkibiga olmoq","ru":"включать, подводить под","ex":["The department was subsumed into the ministry."],"u":"S08U14"},{"id":"lex.04829","w":"encompass","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪnˈkʌmpəs","uz":"qamrab olmoq","ru":"охватывать","ex":["The term encompasses four quite different trades."],"u":"S08U14"},{"id":"lex.04830","w":"comprise","pos":"verb","ipa":"kəmˈpraɪz","uz":"tarkib topmoq","ru":"состоять из","ex":["The committee comprises nine members."],"u":"S08U14"},{"id":"lex.04831","w":"constitute","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈkɑnstɪtuːt","uz":"tashkil etmoq","ru":"составлять, являться","ex":["Three refusals constitute a pattern."],"u":"S08U14"},{"id":"lex.04832","w":"entail","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪnˈteɪl","uz":"talab qilmoq, keltirib chiqarmoq","ru":"влечь за собой","ex":["The move entails a change of school."],"u":"S08U14"},{"id":"lex.04833","w":"underlie","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌʌndərˈlaɪ","uz":"asosida yotmoq","ru":"лежать в основе","ex":["Fear underlies most of the objections."],"u":"S08U14"},{"id":"lex.04834","w":"depend","pos":"verb","ipa":"dɪˈpend","uz":"-ga qarab hal bo'lmoq","ru":"зависеть","ex":["Everything depends on the weather."],"u":"S08U14"},{"id":"lex.04835","w":"candour","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkændər","uz":"samimiylik","ru":"откровенность","ex":["Her candour won the room over."],"u":"S08U14"},{"id":"lex.04836","w":"frankness","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfræŋknəs","uz":"ochiqlik","ru":"прямота, откровенность","ex":["He spoke with unusual frankness."],"u":"S08U14"},{"id":"lex.04837","w":"reticence","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈretɪsəns","uz":"kamgaplik","ru":"сдержанность, немногословность","ex":["Her reticence about the years abroad is striking."],"u":"S08U14"},{"id":"lex.04838","w":"pretension","pos":"noun","ipa":"prɪˈtenʃən","uz":"da'vogarlik","ru":"претензия, претенциозность","ex":["The book has no pretension to completeness."],"u":"S08U14"},{"id":"lex.04839","w":"arrogance","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈærəɡəns","uz":"kibr","ru":"высокомерие","ex":["The arrogance of the reply lost him support."],"u":"S08U14"},{"id":"lex.04840","w":"humility","pos":"noun","ipa":"hjuːˈmɪlɪti","uz":"kamtarlik","ru":"смирение, скромность","ex":["He writes with real humility."],"u":"S08U14"},{"id":"lex.04841","w":"collocation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌkɑləˈkeɪʃən","uz":"barqaror birikma","ru":"устойчивое сочетание","ex":["'Heavy rain' is a collocation; 'strong rain' is not."],"u":"S08U15"},{"id":"lex.04842","w":"intensifier","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪnˈtensɪfaɪər","uz":"kuchaytiruvchi so'z","ru":"усилитель","ex":["'Absolutely' is an intensifier."],"u":"S08U15"},{"id":"lex.04843","w":"modifier","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmɑdɪfaɪər","uz":"aniqlovchi so'z","ru":"определяющее слово","ex":["Move the modifier next to the noun."],"u":"S08U15"},{"id":"lex.04844","w":"prognosis","pos":"noun","ipa":"prɑɡˈnoʊsɪs","uz":"kasallik bashorati","ru":"прогноз","ex":["The prognosis is good."],"u":"S08U15"},{"id":"lex.04845","w":"remission","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈmɪʃən","uz":"kasallikning tinch davri","ru":"ремиссия","ex":["She has been in remission for two years."],"u":"S08U15"},{"id":"lex.04846","w":"relapse","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈriːlæps","uz":"kasallikning qaytalanishi","ru":"рецидив","ex":["He suffered a relapse in the winter."],"u":"S08U15"},{"id":"lex.04847","w":"palliative","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈpæliətɪv","uz":"og'riqni yengillatuvchi","ru":"паллиативный","ex":["Palliative care begins at home."],"u":"S08U15"},{"id":"lex.04848","w":"epidemiology","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌepɪdiːmiˈɑlədʒi","uz":"epidemiologiya","ru":"эпидемиология","ex":["Epidemiology traced the outbreak to one well."],"u":"S08U15"},{"id":"lex.04849","w":"morbidity","pos":"noun","ipa":"mɔrˈbɪdɪti","uz":"kasallanish darajasi","ru":"заболеваемость","ex":["Morbidity fell after the clean water came."],"u":"S08U15"},{"id":"lex.04850","w":"mortality","pos":"noun","ipa":"mɔrˈtælɪti","uz":"o'lim darajasi","ru":"смертность","ex":["Infant mortality halved in twenty years."],"u":"S08U15"},{"id":"lex.04851","w":"immunity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪˈmjuːnɪti","uz":"immunitet","ru":"иммунитет","ex":["Immunity fades after about a year."],"u":"S08U15"},{"id":"lex.04852","w":"ethnicity","pos":"noun","ipa":"eθˈnɪsɪti","uz":"etnik mansublik","ru":"этническая принадлежность","ex":["The form asks for ethnicity."],"u":"S08U15"},{"id":"lex.04853","w":"diaspora","pos":"noun","ipa":"daɪˈæspərə","uz":"diaspora","ru":"диаспора","ex":["The diaspora sends money home every month."],"u":"S08U15"},{"id":"lex.04854","w":"marginalisation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌmɑrdʒɪnəlaɪˈzeɪʃən","uz":"chetlashtirish","ru":"маргинализация","ex":["The report documents their marginalisation."],"u":"S08U15"},{"id":"lex.04855","w":"stratification","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌstrætɪfɪˈkeɪʃən","uz":"qatlamlanish","ru":"стратификация","ex":["Social stratification hardened after the reform."],"u":"S08U15"},{"id":"lex.04856","w":"mobility","pos":"noun","ipa":"moʊˈbɪlɪti","uz":"harakatchanlik","ru":"мобильность","ex":["Social mobility has stalled."],"u":"S08U15"},{"id":"lex.04857","w":"deprivation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌdeprɪˈveɪʃən","uz":"muhtojlik","ru":"лишения, депривация","ex":["The index measures deprivation by district."],"u":"S08U15"},{"id":"lex.04858","w":"affluence","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈæfluəns","uz":"farovonlik","ru":"достаток, богатство","ex":["The new affluence changed the high street."],"u":"S08U15"},{"id":"lex.04859","w":"secular","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈsekjələr","uz":"dunyoviy","ru":"светский","ex":["The state is secular by constitution."],"u":"S08U15"},{"id":"lex.04860","w":"sacred","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈseɪkrɪd","uz":"muqaddas","ru":"священный","ex":["The grove is sacred to the village."],"u":"S08U15"},{"id":"lex.04861","w":"orthodoxy","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɔrθədɑksi","uz":"hukmron qarash","ru":"ортодоксия, общепринятое мнение","ex":["The new orthodoxy lasted ten years."],"u":"S08U15"},{"id":"lex.04862","w":"heresy","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈherəsi","uz":"bid'at","ru":"ересь","ex":["At the time it was heresy to say so."],"u":"S08U15"},{"id":"lex.04863","w":"fertility","pos":"noun","ipa":"fərˈtɪlɪti","uz":"tug'ilish darajasi, hosildorlik","ru":"рождаемость, плодородие","ex":["Fertility fell below replacement level."],"u":"S08U15"},{"id":"lex.04864","w":"longevity","pos":"noun","ipa":"lɑnˈdʒevɪti","uz":"uzoq umr","ru":"долголетие","ex":["Longevity has risen by ten years."],"u":"S08U15"},{"id":"lex.04865","w":"urbanisation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌɜrbənaɪˈzeɪʃən","uz":"urbanizatsiya","ru":"урбанизация","ex":["Urbanisation emptied the northern villages."],"u":"S08U15"},{"id":"lex.04866","w":"gentrification","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌdʒentrɪfɪˈkeɪʃən","uz":"jentrifikatsiya","ru":"джентрификация","ex":["Gentrification doubled the rents."],"u":"S08U15"},{"id":"lex.04867","w":"sprawl","pos":"noun","ipa":"sprɔl","uz":"tartibsiz kengayish","ru":"разрастание","ex":["The sprawl reached the old airfield."],"u":"S08U15"},{"id":"lex.04868","w":"density","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdensɪti","uz":"zichlik","ru":"плотность","ex":["Population density is highest near the river."],"u":"S08U15"},{"id":"lex.04869","w":"zoning","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈzoʊnɪŋ","uz":"hududlarga ajratish","ru":"зонирование","ex":["Zoning kept the factories out."],"u":"S08U15"},{"id":"lex.04870","w":"sustainability","pos":"noun","ipa":"səˌsteɪnəˈbɪlɪti","uz":"barqarorlik","ru":"устойчивость","ex":["Sustainability was added to every job title."],"u":"S08U15"},{"id":"lex.04871","w":"biodiversity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌbaɪoʊdaɪˈvɜrsɪti","uz":"biologik xilma-xillik","ru":"биоразнообразие","ex":["Biodiversity fell as the hedges went."],"u":"S08U15"},{"id":"lex.04872","w":"ecosystem","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈiːkoʊsɪstəm","uz":"ekotizim","ru":"экосистема","ex":["The lake is a closed ecosystem."],"u":"S08U15"},{"id":"lex.04873","w":"tendon","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtendən","uz":"pay","ru":"сухожилие","ex":["The tendon in his heel was torn."],"u":"S08U15"},{"id":"lex.04874","w":"cartilage","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkɑrtɪlɪdʒ","uz":"tog'ay","ru":"хрящ","ex":["The cartilage in the knee had worn away."],"u":"S08U15"},{"id":"lex.04875","w":"artery","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɑrtəri","uz":"arteriya","ru":"артерия","ex":["The artery was blocked."],"u":"S08U15"},{"id":"lex.04876","w":"vein","pos":"noun","ipa":"veɪn","uz":"vena","ru":"вена","ex":["The nurse found the vein at once."],"u":"S08U15"},{"id":"lex.04877","w":"hereinafter","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˌhɪrɪnˈæftər","uz":"bundan buyon ushbu hujjatda","ru":"в дальнейшем именуемый","ex":["Ergash Qodirov, hereinafter 'the Tenant', agrees to the following."],"u":"S08U16"},{"id":"lex.04878","w":"thereof","pos":"adv","ipa":"ðerˈʌv","uz":"shuning","ru":"этого, такового","ex":["The land and the buildings thereof are included."],"u":"S08U16"},{"id":"lex.04879","w":"heretofore","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˌhɪrtəˈfɔr","uz":"shu paytgacha","ru":"до настоящего времени","ex":["The duty heretofore borne by the seller passes to the buyer."],"u":"S08U16"},{"id":"lex.04880","w":"pursuant","pos":"adj","ipa":"pərˈsuːənt","uz":"asosida, muvofiq","ru":"согласно, в соответствии","ex":["Pursuant to clause 9, notice must be in writing."],"u":"S08U16"},{"id":"lex.04881","w":"thereto","pos":"adv","ipa":"ðerˈtuː","uz":"unga","ru":"к этому","ex":["The contract and the schedules thereto form one agreement."],"u":"S08U16"},{"id":"lex.04882","w":"statute","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈstætʃuːt","uz":"qonun","ru":"статут, закон","ex":["The right is protected by statute."],"u":"S08U16"},{"id":"lex.04883","w":"ordinance","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɔrdɪnəns","uz":"mahalliy qaror","ru":"постановление","ex":["A city ordinance bans parking here."],"u":"S08U16"},{"id":"lex.04884","w":"precedent","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpresɪdənt","uz":"sud amaliyoti namunasi","ru":"прецедент","ex":["The ruling sets a precedent."],"u":"S08U16"},{"id":"lex.04885","w":"jurisprudence","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌdʒʊrɪsˈpruːdəns","uz":"huquqshunoslik nazariyasi","ru":"юриспруденция","ex":["He lectures in jurisprudence."],"u":"S08U16"},{"id":"lex.04886","w":"equity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈekwɪti","uz":"adolat tamoyili","ru":"право справедливости","ex":["The claim was brought in equity."],"u":"S08U16"},{"id":"lex.04887","w":"tort","pos":"noun","ipa":"tɔrt","uz":"fuqarolik huquqbuzarligi","ru":"деликт","ex":["Negligence is the best-known tort."],"u":"S08U16"},{"id":"lex.04888","w":"indictment","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪnˈdaɪtmənt","uz":"ayblov xulosasi","ru":"обвинительное заключение","ex":["The indictment runs to forty pages."],"u":"S08U16"},{"id":"lex.04889","w":"prosecution","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌprɑsɪˈkjuːʃən","uz":"ayblov tarafi","ru":"обвинение","ex":["The prosecution called four witnesses."],"u":"S08U16"},{"id":"lex.04890","w":"acquittal","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈkwɪtəl","uz":"oqlov hukmi","ru":"оправдательный приговор","ex":["The acquittal was greeted with applause."],"u":"S08U16"},{"id":"lex.04891","w":"remand","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈmænd","uz":"sudgacha hibs","ru":"предварительное заключение","ex":["He spent four months on remand."],"u":"S08U16"},{"id":"lex.04892","w":"conciliation","pos":"noun","ipa":"kənˌsɪliˈeɪʃən","uz":"murosaga keltirish","ru":"примирение, согласительная процедура","ex":["Conciliation saved the company a year in court."],"u":"S08U16"},{"id":"lex.04893","w":"litigation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌlɪtɪˈɡeɪʃən","uz":"sud jarayoni","ru":"судебное разбирательство","ex":["Litigation lasted nine years."],"u":"S08U16"},{"id":"lex.04894","w":"freehold","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfriːhoʊld","uz":"mulk huquqi","ru":"полная собственность","ex":["They bought the freehold in 1998."],"u":"S08U16"},{"id":"lex.04895","w":"leasehold","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈliːshoʊld","uz":"ijara huquqi","ru":"право аренды","ex":["The leasehold has ninety years to run."],"u":"S08U16"},{"id":"lex.04896","w":"easement","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈiːzmənt","uz":"servitut","ru":"сервитут","ex":["An easement allows the neighbours to cross the yard."],"u":"S08U16"},{"id":"lex.04897","w":"probate","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈproʊbeɪt","uz":"vasiyatnomani tasdiqlash","ru":"утверждение завещания","ex":["Probate took eleven months."],"u":"S08U16"},{"id":"lex.04898","w":"inheritance","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪnˈherɪtəns","uz":"meros","ru":"наследство","ex":["The inheritance was divided into five parts."],"u":"S08U16"},{"id":"lex.04899","w":"bequest","pos":"noun","ipa":"bɪˈkwest","uz":"vasiyat bo'yicha hadya","ru":"завещательный отказ","ex":["The bequest paid for the new wing."],"u":"S08U16"},{"id":"lex.04900","w":"legacy","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈleɡəsi","uz":"meros, qoldiq ta'sir","ru":"наследие, наследство","ex":["The legacy of the war is still visible."],"u":"S08U16"},{"id":"lex.04901","w":"trustee","pos":"noun","ipa":"trʌˈstiː","uz":"ishonchli vakil","ru":"попечитель, доверительный управляющий","ex":["The trustees meet four times a year."],"u":"S08U16"},{"id":"lex.04902","w":"auditor","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɔdɪtər","uz":"auditor","ru":"аудитор","ex":["The auditors refused to sign the accounts."],"u":"S08U16"},{"id":"lex.04903","w":"whistleblower","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈwɪsəlˌbloʊər","uz":"qoidabuzarlik haqida xabar beruvchi","ru":"информатор о нарушениях","ex":["The whistleblower was protected by law."],"u":"S08U16"},{"id":"lex.04904","w":"informant","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪnˈfɔrmənt","uz":"ma'lumot beruvchi","ru":"информатор","ex":["The informant was never named."],"u":"S08U16"},{"id":"lex.04905","w":"inquest","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɪnkwest","uz":"o'lim sababini tekshiruv","ru":"дознание","ex":["The inquest opened on Monday."],"u":"S08U16"},{"id":"lex.04906","w":"extradition","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌekstrəˈdɪʃən","uz":"ekstraditsiya","ru":"экстрадиция","ex":["Extradition was refused."],"u":"S08U16"},{"id":"lex.04907","w":"asylum","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈsaɪləm","uz":"boshpana","ru":"убежище","ex":["She was granted asylum in 2016."],"u":"S08U16"},{"id":"lex.04908","w":"repatriation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌriːpeɪtriˈeɪʃən","uz":"vatanga qaytarish","ru":"репатриация","ex":["Repatriation began after the treaty."],"u":"S08U16"},{"id":"lex.04909","w":"deportation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌdiːpɔrˈteɪʃən","uz":"deportatsiya","ru":"депортация","ex":["The deportation was halted by the court."],"u":"S08U16"},{"id":"lex.04910","w":"adjournment","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈdʒɜrnmənt","uz":"majlisni keyinga qoldirish","ru":"перерыв, отложение","ex":["The judge granted an adjournment."],"u":"S08U16"},{"id":"lex.04911","w":"recess","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈriːses","uz":"tanaffus","ru":"перерыв в работе","ex":["Parliament rose for the summer recess."],"u":"S08U16"},{"id":"lex.04912","w":"vocation","pos":"noun","ipa":"voʊˈkeɪʃən","uz":"kasbiy da'vat","ru":"призвание","ex":["Teaching was a vocation for her."],"u":"S08U16"},{"id":"lex.04913","w":"ideology","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌaɪdiˈɑlədʒi","uz":"mafkura","ru":"идеология","ex":["The party changed its ideology twice."],"u":"S08U17"},{"id":"lex.04914","w":"doctrine","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdɑktrɪn","uz":"ta'limot","ru":"доктрина","ex":["The doctrine was settled in the fourth century."],"u":"S08U17"},{"id":"lex.04915","w":"dogma","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdɔɡmə","uz":"aqida","ru":"догма","ex":["It hardened from theory into dogma."],"u":"S08U17"},{"id":"lex.04916","w":"armistice","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɑrmɪstɪs","uz":"sulh bitimi","ru":"перемирие","ex":["The armistice was signed in a railway carriage."],"u":"S08U17"},{"id":"lex.04917","w":"ceasefire","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsiːsfaɪər","uz":"o't ochishni to'xtatish","ru":"прекращение огня","ex":["The ceasefire broke down at dawn."],"u":"S08U17"},{"id":"lex.04918","w":"reparation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌrepəˈreɪʃən","uz":"tovon","ru":"репарация, возмещение","ex":["Reparations ruined the economy."],"u":"S08U17"},{"id":"lex.04919","w":"annexation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌænekˈseɪʃən","uz":"anneksiya","ru":"аннексия","ex":["The annexation was never recognised."],"u":"S08U17"},{"id":"lex.04920","w":"secession","pos":"noun","ipa":"sɪˈseʃən","uz":"ajralib chiqish","ru":"отделение","ex":["Secession was declared in November."],"u":"S08U17"},{"id":"lex.04921","w":"insurgency","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪnˈsɜrdʒənsi","uz":"qo'zg'olon","ru":"мятеж, повстанческое движение","ex":["The insurgency lasted eleven years."],"u":"S08U17"},{"id":"lex.04922","w":"guerrilla","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɡəˈrɪlə","uz":"partizan","ru":"партизан","ex":["Guerrillas held the forest for two winters."],"u":"S08U17"},{"id":"lex.04923","w":"militia","pos":"noun","ipa":"mɪˈlɪʃə","uz":"xalq qo'shini","ru":"ополчение","ex":["The town militia guarded the bridge."],"u":"S08U17"},{"id":"lex.04924","w":"conscription","pos":"noun","ipa":"kənˈskrɪpʃən","uz":"majburiy harbiy xizmat","ru":"призыв, воинская повинность","ex":["Conscription was abolished in 1960."],"u":"S08U17"},{"id":"lex.04925","w":"mobilisation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌmoʊbɪlaɪˈzeɪʃən","uz":"safarbarlik","ru":"мобилизация","ex":["Mobilisation began the same week."],"u":"S08U17"},{"id":"lex.04926","w":"defector","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˈfektər","uz":"qochoq, tarafni o'zgartirgan","ru":"перебежчик","ex":["The defector was debriefed for a month."],"u":"S08U17"},{"id":"lex.04927","w":"dissident","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdɪsɪdənt","uz":"dissident","ru":"диссидент","ex":["The dissidents circulated typed copies."],"u":"S08U17"},{"id":"lex.04928","w":"exile","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈeɡzaɪl","uz":"surgun","ru":"изгнание, ссылка","ex":["He spent forty years in exile."],"u":"S08U17"},{"id":"lex.04929","w":"blight","pos":"noun","ipa":"blaɪt","uz":"o'simlik kasalligi, ofat","ru":"болезнь растений, упадок","ex":["Potato blight emptied whole villages."],"u":"S08U17"},{"id":"lex.04930","w":"fallow","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈfæloʊ","uz":"shudgor qilinmagan","ru":"под паром","ex":["A third of the land lay fallow each year."],"u":"S08U17"},{"id":"lex.04931","w":"nomad","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈnoʊmæd","uz":"ko'chmanchi","ru":"кочевник","ex":["The nomads crossed twice a year."],"u":"S08U17"},{"id":"lex.04932","w":"pastoral","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈpæstərəl","uz":"chorvachilikka oid","ru":"пастбищный, пасторальный","ex":["Pastoral life shaped the calendar."],"u":"S08U17"},{"id":"lex.04933","w":"bazaar","pos":"noun","ipa":"bəˈzɑr","uz":"bozor","ru":"базар","ex":["The bazaar has stood since the fifteenth century."],"u":"S08U17"},{"id":"lex.04934","w":"loom","pos":"noun","ipa":"luːm","uz":"to'quv dastgohi","ru":"ткацкий станок","ex":["Four looms stood in the front room."],"u":"S08U17"},{"id":"lex.04935","w":"dye","pos":"noun","ipa":"daɪ","uz":"bo'yoq","ru":"краситель","ex":["The dye is made from walnut shells."],"u":"S08U17"},{"id":"lex.04936","w":"embroidery","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪmˈbrɔɪdəri","uz":"kashtachilik","ru":"вышивка","ex":["The embroidery took her nine months."],"u":"S08U17"},{"id":"lex.04937","w":"ceramic","pos":"noun","ipa":"səˈræmɪk","uz":"sopol buyum","ru":"керамика","ex":["The ceramics are fired twice."],"u":"S08U17"},{"id":"lex.04938","w":"guild","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɡɪld","uz":"hunarmandlar uyushmasi","ru":"гильдия, цех","ex":["The weavers' guild set the prices."],"u":"S08U17"},{"id":"lex.04939","w":"journeyman","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdʒɜrnimən","uz":"malakali usta yordamchisi","ru":"подмастерье","ex":["He worked as a journeyman for six years."],"u":"S08U17"},{"id":"lex.04940","w":"archipelago","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌɑrkɪˈpeləɡoʊ","uz":"orollar guruhi","ru":"архипелаг","ex":["The archipelago has eleven inhabited islands."],"u":"S08U17"},{"id":"lex.04941","w":"peninsula","pos":"noun","ipa":"pəˈnɪnsələ","uz":"yarim orol","ru":"полуостров","ex":["The peninsula juts thirty kilometres into the sea."],"u":"S08U17"},{"id":"lex.04942","w":"tributary","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtrɪbjəteri","uz":"irmoq","ru":"приток","ex":["The tributary dries up in August."],"u":"S08U17"},{"id":"lex.04943","w":"estuary","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈestʃueri","uz":"daryo quyilish joyi","ru":"устье реки","ex":["Birds feed on the estuary at low tide."],"u":"S08U17"},{"id":"lex.04944","w":"delta","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdeltə","uz":"delta","ru":"дельта","ex":["The delta grows rice and cotton."],"u":"S08U17"},{"id":"lex.04945","w":"monsoon","pos":"noun","ipa":"mɑnˈsuːn","uz":"musson","ru":"муссон","ex":["The monsoon broke on the fifth of June."],"u":"S08U17"},{"id":"lex.04946","w":"typhoon","pos":"noun","ipa":"taɪˈfuːn","uz":"tayfun","ru":"тайфун","ex":["The typhoon closed the port for three days."],"u":"S08U17"},{"id":"lex.04947","w":"cyclone","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsaɪkloʊn","uz":"siklon","ru":"циклон","ex":["The cyclone came ashore at midnight."],"u":"S08U17"},{"id":"lex.04948","w":"avalanche","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈævəlæntʃ","uz":"qor ko'chkisi","ru":"лавина","ex":["An avalanche closed the pass."],"u":"S08U17"},{"id":"lex.04949","w":"consolidate","pos":"verb","ipa":"kənˈsɑlɪdeɪt","uz":"mustahkamlamoq, birlashtirmoq","ru":"укреплять, объединять","ex":["The party consolidated its hold on the north."],"u":"S08U18"},{"id":"lex.04950","w":"entrench","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪnˈtrentʃ","uz":"mustahkam o'rnashtirmoq","ru":"укоренять, закреплять","ex":["The reform entrenched the old inequalities."],"u":"S08U18"},{"id":"lex.04951","w":"institutionalise","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌɪnstɪˈtuːʃənəlaɪz","uz":"institutsional shaklga keltirmoq","ru":"институционализировать","ex":["The meeting was institutionalised as an annual event."],"u":"S08U18"},{"id":"lex.04952","w":"normalise","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈnɔrməlaɪz","uz":"odatiy holga aylantirmoq","ru":"нормализовать","ex":["Relations were normalised in 1995."],"u":"S08U18"},{"id":"lex.04953","w":"destabilise","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌdiːˈsteɪbɪlaɪz","uz":"beqarorlashtirmoq","ru":"дестабилизировать","ex":["The decision destabilised the whole region."],"u":"S08U18"},{"id":"lex.04954","w":"erode","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪˈroʊd","uz":"yemirmoq","ru":"размывать, подрывать","ex":["The river eroded the bank."],"u":"S08U18"},{"id":"lex.04955","w":"subvert","pos":"verb","ipa":"səbˈvɜrt","uz":"ichdan buzmoq","ru":"подрывать","ex":["The novel subverts the form it uses."],"u":"S08U18"},{"id":"lex.04956","w":"dismantle","pos":"verb","ipa":"dɪsˈmæntəl","uz":"qismlarga ajratmoq, bekor qilmoq","ru":"демонтировать, разбирать","ex":["The machine was dismantled and shipped."],"u":"S08U18"},{"id":"lex.04957","w":"propagate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈprɑpəɡeɪt","uz":"tarqatmoq, ko'paytirmoq","ru":"распространять, размножать","ex":["The error propagated through every copy."],"u":"S08U18"},{"id":"lex.04958","w":"disseminate","pos":"verb","ipa":"dɪˈsemɪneɪt","uz":"keng yoymoq","ru":"распространять","ex":["The findings were disseminated in three languages."],"u":"S08U18"},{"id":"lex.04959","w":"diffuse","pos":"verb","ipa":"dɪˈfjuːz","uz":"asta tarqalmoq","ru":"распространяться, рассеиваться","ex":["The technique diffused slowly from the cities."],"u":"S08U18"},{"id":"lex.04960","w":"transmit","pos":"verb","ipa":"trænzˈmɪt","uz":"uzatmoq","ru":"передавать","ex":["The signal is transmitted every six seconds."],"u":"S08U18"},{"id":"lex.04961","w":"supersede","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌsuːpərˈsiːd","uz":"o'rnini egallamoq","ru":"вытеснять, заменять","ex":["The 2019 edition supersedes all earlier ones."],"u":"S08U18"},{"id":"lex.04962","w":"displace","pos":"verb","ipa":"dɪsˈpleɪs","uz":"siqib chiqarmoq","ru":"вытеснять, перемещать","ex":["The dam displaced four thousand people."],"u":"S08U18"},{"id":"lex.04963","w":"supplant","pos":"verb","ipa":"səˈplænt","uz":"o'rnini bosmoq","ru":"вытеснять, занимать место","ex":["Cotton supplanted wheat across the valley."],"u":"S08U18"},{"id":"lex.04964","w":"eclipse","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪˈklɪps","uz":"soyada qoldirmoq","ru":"затмевать","ex":["Her later work eclipsed the first novel."],"u":"S08U18"},{"id":"lex.04965","w":"foreshadow","pos":"verb","ipa":"fɔrˈʃædoʊ","uz":"oldindan ishora qilmoq","ru":"предвещать","ex":["The first chapter foreshadows the ending."],"u":"S08U18"},{"id":"lex.04966","w":"herald","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈherəld","uz":"darak bermoq","ru":"возвещать","ex":["The law heralded a decade of change."],"u":"S08U18"},{"id":"lex.04967","w":"rationalisation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌræʃənəlaɪˈzeɪʃən","uz":"qayta tashkil etish, o'zini oqlash","ru":"рационализация","ex":["Rationalisation closed two of the four plants."],"u":"S08U18"},{"id":"lex.04968","w":"secularisation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌsekjələraɪˈzeɪʃən","uz":"dunyoviylashuv","ru":"секуляризация","ex":["Secularisation moved faster in the cities."],"u":"S08U18"},{"id":"lex.04969","w":"commodification","pos":"noun","ipa":"kəˌmɑdɪfɪˈkeɪʃən","uz":"tovarga aylantirish","ru":"коммодификация","ex":["The commodification of care worried the nurses."],"u":"S08U18"},{"id":"lex.04970","w":"financialisation","pos":"noun","ipa":"faɪˌnænʃəlaɪˈzeɪʃən","uz":"moliyaviylashuv","ru":"финансиализация","ex":["Financialisation changed what firms were run for."],"u":"S08U18"},{"id":"lex.04971","w":"privatisation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌpraɪvətaɪˈzeɪʃən","uz":"xususiylashtirish","ru":"приватизация","ex":["Privatisation of the railways began in 1994."],"u":"S08U18"},{"id":"lex.04972","w":"refraction","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈfrækʃən","uz":"sinish","ru":"преломление","ex":["Refraction makes the stick look broken."],"u":"S08U18"},{"id":"lex.04973","w":"landslide","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈlændslaɪd","uz":"yer ko'chishi","ru":"оползень","ex":["A landslide blocked the road for a week."],"u":"S08U18"},{"id":"lex.04974","w":"sediment","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsedɪmənt","uz":"cho'kindi","ru":"осадок, отложения","ex":["Sediment fills the reservoir a little each year."],"u":"S08U18"},{"id":"lex.04975","w":"nerve","pos":"noun","ipa":"nɜrv","uz":"asab tolasi","ru":"нерв","ex":["The nerve was damaged in the fall."],"u":"S08U18"},{"id":"lex.04976","w":"tissue","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtɪʃuː","uz":"to'qima","ru":"ткань","ex":["Scar tissue formed over the wound."],"u":"S08U18"},{"id":"lex.04977","w":"phoneme","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfoʊniːm","uz":"fonema","ru":"фонема","ex":["English has about forty-four phonemes."],"u":"S08U18"},{"id":"lex.04978","w":"syllable","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsɪləbəl","uz":"bo'g'in","ru":"слог","ex":["The stress falls on the second syllable."],"u":"S08U18"},{"id":"lex.04979","w":"impartiality","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌɪmpɑrʃiˈælɪti","uz":"tomon tutmaslik","ru":"беспристрастность","ex":["The chair's impartiality was never questioned."],"u":"S08U18"},{"id":"lex.04980","w":"discretion","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˈskreʃən","uz":"ixtiyor, mulohaza","ru":"усмотрение, осмотрительность","ex":["The amount is left to the judge's discretion."],"u":"S08U18"},{"id":"lex.04981","w":"restraint","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈstreɪnt","uz":"o'zini tutish","ru":"сдержанность","ex":["He answered with admirable restraint."],"u":"S08U18"},{"id":"lex.04982","w":"crucial","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈkruːʃəl","uz":"hal qiluvchi","ru":"решающий","ex":["The next two weeks are crucial."],"u":"S08U18"},{"id":"lex.04983","w":"reciprocal","pos":"adj","ipa":"rɪˈsɪprəkəl","uz":"ikki tomonlama","ru":"обоюдный","ex":["The two countries have a reciprocal agreement."],"u":"S08U18"},{"id":"lex.04984","w":"respective","pos":"adj","ipa":"rɪˈspektɪv","uz":"tegishli, o'z-o'ziga oid","ru":"соответствующий","ex":["They returned to their respective offices."],"u":"S08U18"},{"id":"lex.04985","w":"bedrock","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈbedrɑk","uz":"asos, poydevor","ru":"основа, фундамент","ex":["Consent is the bedrock of the whole agreement."],"u":"S09U01"},{"id":"lex.04986","w":"cornerstone","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkɔrnərstoʊn","uz":"tayanch nuqta","ru":"краеугольный камень","ex":["The census is the cornerstone of every later estimate."],"u":"S09U01"},{"id":"lex.04987","w":"keystone","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkiːstoʊn","uz":"kalit qism","ru":"замковый камень","ex":["That clause is the keystone; take it out and the contract falls."],"u":"S09U01"},{"id":"lex.04988","w":"linchpin","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈlɪntʃpɪn","uz":"asosiy bo'g'in","ru":"стержень, основа","ex":["She was the linchpin of the whole department."],"u":"S09U01"},{"id":"lex.04989","w":"foundational","pos":"adj","ipa":"faʊnˈdeɪʃənəl","uz":"tamal, asosiy","ru":"основополагающий","ex":["These are foundational questions, not technical ones."],"u":"S09U01"},{"id":"lex.04990","w":"formative","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈfɔrmətɪv","uz":"shakllantiruvchi","ru":"формирующий","ex":["The famine was the formative event of her generation."],"u":"S09U01"},{"id":"lex.04991","w":"causality","pos":"noun","ipa":"kɔˈzælɪti","uz":"sababiylik","ru":"причинность","ex":["The paper never establishes causality, only a pattern."],"u":"S09U01"},{"id":"lex.04992","w":"teleology","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌteliˈɑlədʒi","uz":"g'oyaviy maqsadlilik","ru":"телеология","ex":["The chapter reads history as teleology, which is its weakness."],"u":"S09U01"},{"id":"lex.04993","w":"emergence","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪˈmɜrdʒəns","uz":"paydo bo'lish","ru":"возникновение","ex":["The emergence of a market took three decades."],"u":"S09U01"},{"id":"lex.04994","w":"counterfactual","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌkaʊntərˈfæktʃuəl","uz":"aksincha faraz","ru":"контрфактическое допущение","ex":["The whole argument rests on one counterfactual."],"u":"S09U01"},{"id":"lex.04995","w":"theorem","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈθiːərəm","uz":"teorema","ru":"теорема","ex":["The theorem was proved in 1931."],"u":"S09U01"},{"id":"lex.04996","w":"formalism","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfɔrməlɪzəm","uz":"formalizm","ru":"формализм","ex":["The objection is pure formalism; the substance is agreed."],"u":"S09U01"},{"id":"lex.04997","w":"epistemic","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌepɪˈstiːmɪk","uz":"bilishga oid","ru":"эпистемический","ex":["The gap here is epistemic, not political."],"u":"S09U01"},{"id":"lex.04998","w":"modality","pos":"noun","ipa":"moʊˈdælɪti","uz":"modallik","ru":"модальность","ex":["English modality is carried by a small set of verbs."],"u":"S09U01"},{"id":"lex.04999","w":"quantity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkwɑntɪti","uz":"miqdor","ru":"количество","ex":["Quantity was never the problem; quality was."],"u":"S09U01"},{"id":"lex.05000","w":"sufficient","pos":"adj","ipa":"səˈfɪʃənt","uz":"yetarli","ru":"достаточный","ex":["One witness is necessary but not sufficient."],"u":"S09U01"},{"id":"lex.05001","w":"tenable","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈtenəbəl","uz":"asoslash mumkin","ru":"состоятельный","ex":["That position is no longer tenable."],"u":"S09U01"},{"id":"lex.05002","w":"crucially","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈkruːʃəli","uz":"hal qiluvchi darajada","ru":"решающим образом","ex":["Crucially, nobody had checked the second copy."],"u":"S09U01"},{"id":"lex.05003","w":"avowedly","pos":"adv","ipa":"əˈvaʊɪdli","uz":"o'zi tan olganicha","ru":"по собственному признанию","ex":["The paper is avowedly political."],"u":"S09U02"},{"id":"lex.05004","w":"professedly","pos":"adv","ipa":"prəˈfesɪdli","uz":"o'zini shunday deb ko'rsatgancha","ru":"якобы, по заявлению","ex":["The group is professedly neutral."],"u":"S09U02"},{"id":"lex.05005","w":"putatively","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈpjuːtətɪvli","uz":"taxminan, deb hisoblangan holda","ru":"предположительно","ex":["The letter is putatively from 1890."],"u":"S09U02"},{"id":"lex.05006","w":"tellingly","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˈtelɪŋli","uz":"ochib beruvchi tarzda","ru":"показательно","ex":["Tellingly, the annex was never circulated."],"u":"S09U02"},{"id":"lex.05007","w":"ironically","pos":"adv","ipa":"aɪˈrɑnɪkli","uz":"kinoya bilan, aksincha","ru":"по иронии","ex":["Ironically, the safety review caused the delay that caused the accident."],"u":"S09U02"},{"id":"lex.05008","w":"paradoxically","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˌpærəˈdɑksɪkli","uz":"paradoksal tarzda","ru":"парадоксальным образом","ex":["Paradoxically, the cheaper road cost more to keep open."],"u":"S09U02"},{"id":"lex.05009","w":"impute","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪmˈpjuːt","uz":"aybini yuklamoq","ru":"вменять, приписывать","ex":["The report imputes the delay to the contractor."],"u":"S09U02"},{"id":"lex.05010","w":"adduce","pos":"verb","ipa":"əˈduːs","uz":"dalil keltirmoq","ru":"приводить в качестве довода","ex":["She adduces three letters in support."],"u":"S09U02"},{"id":"lex.05011","w":"invoke","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪnˈvoʊk","uz":"asos qilib keltirmoq","ru":"ссылаться на, апеллировать","ex":["He invoked clause nine and closed the meeting."],"u":"S09U02"},{"id":"lex.05012","w":"vouch for","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈvaʊtʃ fɔr","uz":"kafolat bermoq","ru":"ручаться за","ex":["I can vouch for the first figure and not the second."],"u":"S09U02"},{"id":"lex.05013","w":"bear out","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈber aʊt","uz":"tasdiqlamoq","ru":"подтверждать","ex":["The second survey bore out the first."],"u":"S09U02"},{"id":"lex.05014","w":"dissemble","pos":"verb","ipa":"dɪˈsembəl","uz":"o'zini boshqacha ko'rsatmoq","ru":"притворяться, скрывать","ex":["He dissembled well enough to keep the post a year."],"u":"S09U02"},{"id":"lex.05015","w":"equivocate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪˈkwɪvəkeɪt","uz":"ikki ma'noli gapirmoq","ru":"говорить уклончиво","ex":["Asked twice, the minister equivocated twice."],"u":"S09U02"},{"id":"lex.05016","w":"prevaricate","pos":"verb","ipa":"prɪˈværɪkeɪt","uz":"chalg'itmoq, javobdan qochmoq","ru":"уклоняться от прямого ответа","ex":["He prevaricated until the deadline passed."],"u":"S09U02"},{"id":"lex.05017","w":"guile","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɡaɪl","uz":"ayyorlik","ru":"хитрость","ex":["He got the file by guile rather than by right."],"u":"S09U02"},{"id":"lex.05018","w":"artifice","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɑrtɪfɪs","uz":"hiyla, sun'iy mahorat","ru":"уловка, искусственность","ex":["The simplicity of the prose is pure artifice."],"u":"S09U02"},{"id":"lex.05019","w":"subterfuge","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsʌbtərfjuːdʒ","uz":"yashirin hiyla","ru":"уловка, обман","ex":["The transfer was managed by subterfuge."],"u":"S09U02"},{"id":"lex.05020","w":"unreliable","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌʌnrɪˈlaɪəbəl","uz":"ishonchsiz","ru":"ненадёжный","ex":["The narrator is unreliable, and the reader is meant to notice."],"u":"S09U02"},{"id":"lex.05021","w":"articulation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɑrˌtɪkjəˈleɪʃən","uz":"talaffuz, artikulyatsiya","ru":"артикуляция","ex":["Her articulation is clear even at speed."],"u":"S09U03"},{"id":"lex.05022","w":"conjugation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌkɑndʒəˈɡeɪʃən","uz":"tuslanish","ru":"спряжение","ex":["English has almost no conjugation left."],"u":"S09U03"},{"id":"lex.05023","w":"declension","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˈklenʃən","uz":"turlanish","ru":"склонение","ex":["Latin has five declensions."],"u":"S09U03"},{"id":"lex.05024","w":"derivation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌderɪˈveɪʃən","uz":"so'z yasalishi","ru":"словообразование","ex":["'Happiness' is formed by derivation from 'happy'."],"u":"S09U03"},{"id":"lex.05025","w":"inflection","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪnˈflekʃən","uz":"grammatik shakl o'zgarishi","ru":"словоизменение","ex":["The -s of 'walks' is inflection."],"u":"S09U03"},{"id":"lex.05026","w":"lemma","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈlemə","uz":"lug'at shakli","ru":"лемма, словарная форма","ex":["The lemma is 'go'; 'went' is one of its forms."],"u":"S09U03"},{"id":"lex.05027","w":"lexeme","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈleksiːm","uz":"leksema","ru":"лексема","ex":["'Run', 'ran' and 'running' are one lexeme."],"u":"S09U03"},{"id":"lex.05028","w":"morpheme","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmɔrfiːm","uz":"morfema","ru":"морфема","ex":["'Unhappiness' has three morphemes."],"u":"S09U03"},{"id":"lex.05029","w":"referent","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈrefərənt","uz":"ishora qilinayotgan narsa","ru":"референт","ex":["The pronoun has no clear referent in that sentence."],"u":"S09U03"},{"id":"lex.05030","w":"adjunct","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈædʒʌŋkt","uz":"ixtiyoriy bo'lak","ru":"обстоятельство, факультативный член","ex":["'On Tuesday' is an adjunct; the sentence stands without it."],"u":"S09U03"},{"id":"lex.05031","w":"subordinate","pos":"adj","ipa":"səˈbɔrdɪnət","uz":"ergash","ru":"придаточный","ex":["'Because it rained' is a subordinate clause."],"u":"S09U03"},{"id":"lex.05032","w":"coordinate","pos":"adj","ipa":"koʊˈɔrdɪnət","uz":"teng bog'langan","ru":"сочинённый","ex":["The two coordinate clauses are joined by 'and'."],"u":"S09U03"},{"id":"lex.05033","w":"variant","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈveriənt","uz":"variant","ru":"вариант","ex":["The manuscript gives a variant of the third line."],"u":"S09U03"},{"id":"lex.05034","w":"creole","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkriːoʊl","uz":"kreol til","ru":"креольский язык","ex":["The creole has its own grammar, not a simplified one."],"u":"S09U03"},{"id":"lex.05035","w":"pidgin","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpɪdʒɪn","uz":"pidjin","ru":"пиджин","ex":["A pidgin becomes a creole when children learn it first."],"u":"S09U03"},{"id":"lex.05036","w":"substitution","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌsʌbstɪˈtuːʃən","uz":"o'rin almashtirish","ru":"замещение","ex":["'So' and 'one' are the commonest substitution words."],"u":"S09U03"},{"id":"lex.05037","w":"interpolation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪnˌtɜrpəˈleɪʃən","uz":"keyin qo'shilgan qism","ru":"вставка, интерполяция","ex":["The last two lines are a later interpolation."],"u":"S09U03"},{"id":"lex.05038","w":"lacuna","pos":"noun","ipa":"ləˈkuːnə","uz":"bo'shliq","ru":"лакуна, пробел","ex":["There is a lacuna of forty years in the record."],"u":"S09U03"},{"id":"lex.05039","w":"alcove","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈælkoʊv","uz":"tokcha, kichik xona burchagi","ru":"ниша","ex":["A desk stood in the alcove by the window."],"u":"S09U04"},{"id":"lex.05040","w":"courtyard","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkɔrtjɑrd","uz":"hovli","ru":"внутренний двор","ex":["The courtyard was cool at midday."],"u":"S09U04"},{"id":"lex.05041","w":"citadel","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsɪtədəl","uz":"qal'a, ark","ru":"цитадель","ex":["The citadel stands on the only hill for miles."],"u":"S09U04"},{"id":"lex.05042","w":"copse","pos":"noun","ipa":"kɑps","uz":"kichik to'qayzor","ru":"рощица","ex":["They waited in the copse until the rain stopped."],"u":"S09U04"},{"id":"lex.05043","w":"grove","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɡroʊv","uz":"bog', daraxtzor","ru":"роща","ex":["The walnut grove has been there two hundred years."],"u":"S09U04"},{"id":"lex.05044","w":"thicket","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈθɪkɪt","uz":"chakalakzor","ru":"заросли","ex":["The path disappeared into a thicket."],"u":"S09U04"},{"id":"lex.05045","w":"heath","pos":"noun","ipa":"hiːθ","uz":"buta bosgan dala","ru":"пустошь","ex":["The heath is purple in August."],"u":"S09U04"},{"id":"lex.05046","w":"marsh","pos":"noun","ipa":"mɑrʃ","uz":"botqoqlik","ru":"болото","ex":["The marsh floods twice a year."],"u":"S09U04"},{"id":"lex.05047","w":"moor","pos":"noun","ipa":"mʊr","uz":"yaylov, tekis balandlik","ru":"вересковая пустошь","ex":["The road crosses eleven miles of moor."],"u":"S09U04"},{"id":"lex.05048","w":"meadow","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmedoʊ","uz":"o'tloq","ru":"луг","ex":["The meadow is cut once in June."],"u":"S09U04"},{"id":"lex.05049","w":"ravine","pos":"noun","ipa":"rəˈviːn","uz":"jarlik","ru":"ущелье, овраг","ex":["A ravine cuts the plateau in two."],"u":"S09U04"},{"id":"lex.05050","w":"gorge","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɡɔrdʒ","uz":"dara","ru":"каньон, теснина","ex":["The river runs through a gorge for six kilometres."],"u":"S09U04"},{"id":"lex.05051","w":"ridge","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪdʒ","uz":"tizma","ru":"хребет, гребень","ex":["The ridge above the village turned black at dusk."],"u":"S09U04"},{"id":"lex.05052","w":"spur","pos":"noun","ipa":"spɜr","uz":"tog' tarmog'i","ru":"отрог","ex":["The village sits on a spur above the valley."],"u":"S09U04"},{"id":"lex.05053","w":"brook","pos":"noun","ipa":"brʊk","uz":"soy, jilg'a","ru":"ручей","ex":["A brook runs along the bottom of the meadow."],"u":"S09U04"},{"id":"lex.05054","w":"silt","pos":"noun","ipa":"sɪlt","uz":"loyqa cho'kindi","ru":"ил","ex":["Silt has filled a third of the reservoir."],"u":"S09U04"},{"id":"lex.05055","w":"warren","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈwɔrən","uz":"chigal yo'llar","ru":"лабиринт ходов","ex":["The old quarter is a warren of alleys."],"u":"S09U04"},{"id":"lex.05056","w":"nook","pos":"noun","ipa":"nʊk","uz":"burchak, pana joy","ru":"укромный уголок","ex":["She read in the nook by the stove."],"u":"S09U04"},{"id":"lex.05057","w":"saddle","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsædəl","uz":"tog' egari","ru":"седловина","ex":["The path crosses the saddle between the two peaks."],"u":"S09U04"},{"id":"lex.05058","w":"slope","pos":"noun","ipa":"sloʊp","uz":"qiyalik","ru":"склон","ex":["The north slope holds the snow longest."],"u":"S09U04"},{"id":"lex.05059","w":"forbearance","pos":"noun","ipa":"fɔrˈberəns","uz":"sabr, kechirimlilik","ru":"сдержанность, снисхождение","ex":["The landlord's forbearance kept them in the house a year."],"u":"S09U05"},{"id":"lex.05060","w":"temperance","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtempərəns","uz":"me'yorlilik","ru":"умеренность","ex":["He wrote with a temperance the subject rarely gets."],"u":"S09U05"},{"id":"lex.05061","w":"equanimity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌekwəˈnɪmɪti","uz":"vazminlik","ru":"невозмутимость","ex":["She took the news with complete equanimity."],"u":"S09U05"},{"id":"lex.05062","w":"aplomb","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈplɑm","uz":"o'ziga ishonch","ru":"самообладание","ex":["He handled the questions with aplomb."],"u":"S09U05"},{"id":"lex.05063","w":"diffidence","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdɪfɪdəns","uz":"tortinchoqlik","ru":"застенчивость","ex":["His diffidence cost him the appointment."],"u":"S09U05"},{"id":"lex.05064","w":"compunction","pos":"noun","ipa":"kəmˈpʌŋkʃən","uz":"vijdon azobi","ru":"угрызение совести","ex":["He signed it without the slightest compunction."],"u":"S09U05"},{"id":"lex.05065","w":"scruple","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈskruːpəl","uz":"vijdoniy shubha","ru":"сомнение, щепетильность","ex":["He has no scruples about using the file."],"u":"S09U05"},{"id":"lex.05066","w":"demur","pos":"verb","ipa":"dɪˈmɜr","uz":"e'tiroz bildirmoq","ru":"возражать, колебаться","ex":["Nobody demurred when the date was moved."],"u":"S09U05"},{"id":"lex.05067","w":"concord","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkɑnkɔrd","uz":"totuvlik","ru":"согласие","ex":["Forty years of concord ended in a week."],"u":"S09U05"},{"id":"lex.05068","w":"rapprochement","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌræproʊʃˈmɑn","uz":"yaqinlashuv","ru":"сближение","ex":["The visit marked a rapprochement between the two ministries."],"u":"S09U05"},{"id":"lex.05069","w":"conciliate","pos":"verb","ipa":"kənˈsɪlieɪt","uz":"murosaga keltirmoq","ru":"примирять, склонять на свою сторону","ex":["The wording was changed to conciliate the second district."],"u":"S09U05"},{"id":"lex.05070","w":"mollify","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈmɑlɪfaɪ","uz":"yumshatmoq","ru":"смягчать, успокаивать","ex":["An apology mollified the committee."],"u":"S09U05"},{"id":"lex.05071","w":"placate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈpleɪkeɪt","uz":"ko'nglini olmoq","ru":"умиротворять","ex":["The fund was set up to placate the villages."],"u":"S09U05"},{"id":"lex.05072","w":"appease","pos":"verb","ipa":"əˈpiːz","uz":"yon bosmoq","ru":"умиротворять уступками","ex":["Appeasing one district encouraged the other two."],"u":"S09U05"},{"id":"lex.05073","w":"palliate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈpælieɪt","uz":"yengillatmoq","ru":"смягчать, паллиировать","ex":["The grant palliates the shortage; it does not end it."],"u":"S09U05"},{"id":"lex.05074","w":"abridge","pos":"verb","ipa":"əˈbrɪdʒ","uz":"qisqartirmoq","ru":"сокращать","ex":["The lecture was abridged for print."],"u":"S09U05"},{"id":"lex.05075","w":"cede","pos":"verb","ipa":"siːd","uz":"voz kechmoq, topshirmoq","ru":"уступать","ex":["The district ceded the water rights in 1961."],"u":"S09U05"},{"id":"lex.05076","w":"withhold","pos":"verb","ipa":"wɪðˈhoʊld","uz":"bermay turmoq","ru":"удерживать, не предоставлять","ex":["The ministry withheld the annex for a year."],"u":"S09U05"},{"id":"lex.05077","w":"portend","pos":"verb","ipa":"pɔrˈtend","uz":"darak bermoq","ru":"предвещать","ex":["The first two failures portended the third."],"u":"S09U06"},{"id":"lex.05078","w":"presage","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈpresɪdʒ","uz":"oldindan bildirmoq","ru":"служить предвестием","ex":["The strike presaged a much larger dispute."],"u":"S09U06"},{"id":"lex.05079","w":"prefigure","pos":"verb","ipa":"priːˈfɪɡjər","uz":"oldindan aks ettirmoq","ru":"предвосхищать","ex":["The first chapter prefigures the ending."],"u":"S09U06"},{"id":"lex.05080","w":"prescient","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈpreʃiənt","uz":"bashoratli","ru":"прозорливый","ex":["The 1998 memo now looks prescient."],"u":"S09U06"},{"id":"lex.05081","w":"prophetic","pos":"adj","ipa":"prəˈfetɪk","uz":"oldindan aytib bergan","ru":"пророческий","ex":["His warning turned out to be prophetic."],"u":"S09U06"},{"id":"lex.05082","w":"foreboding","pos":"noun","ipa":"fɔrˈboʊdɪŋ","uz":"yomon xayol, tashvish","ru":"дурное предчувствие","ex":["She read the letter with a sense of foreboding."],"u":"S09U06"},{"id":"lex.05083","w":"apprehension","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌæprɪˈhenʃən","uz":"xavotir","ru":"опасение","ex":["He waited with some apprehension."],"u":"S09U06"},{"id":"lex.05084","w":"dread","pos":"noun","ipa":"dred","uz":"vahima","ru":"страх, ужас","ex":["She felt a slow dread as the date approached."],"u":"S09U06"},{"id":"lex.05085","w":"precarious","pos":"adj","ipa":"prɪˈkeriəs","uz":"beqaror, xavfli","ru":"шаткий, ненадёжный","ex":["The finances are precarious and always have been."],"u":"S09U06"},{"id":"lex.05086","w":"brittleness","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈbrɪtəlnəs","uz":"mo'rtlik","ru":"хрупкость","ex":["The brittleness of the supply chain was never tested."],"u":"S09U06"},{"id":"lex.05087","w":"fallacious","pos":"adj","ipa":"fəˈleɪʃəs","uz":"noto'g'ri asoslangan","ru":"ошибочный, ложный","ex":["The comparison is fallacious and the conclusion rests on it."],"u":"S09U06"},{"id":"lex.05088","w":"anomalous","pos":"adj","ipa":"əˈnɑmələs","uz":"g'ayrioddiy","ru":"аномальный","ex":["One anomalous reading in a thousand is expected."],"u":"S09U06"},{"id":"lex.05089","w":"aberrant","pos":"adj","ipa":"əˈberənt","uz":"chetga chiqqan","ru":"отклоняющийся","ex":["The behaviour was aberrant, not criminal."],"u":"S09U06"},{"id":"lex.05090","w":"atypical","pos":"adj","ipa":"eɪˈtɪpɪkəl","uz":"tipik bo'lmagan","ru":"нетипичный","ex":["The village is atypical and should not be the model."],"u":"S09U06"},{"id":"lex.05091","w":"incipient","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪnˈsɪpiənt","uz":"endi boshlanayotgan","ru":"зарождающийся","ex":["An incipient crack was found in the second span."],"u":"S09U06"},{"id":"lex.05092","w":"nascent","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈnæsənt","uz":"yangi paydo bo'lgan","ru":"зарождающийся, нарождающийся","ex":["The nascent industry employed forty people."],"u":"S09U06"},{"id":"lex.05093","w":"dormant","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈdɔrmənt","uz":"uyquda, faolsiz","ru":"спящий, бездействующий","ex":["The claim lay dormant for eleven years."],"u":"S09U06"},{"id":"lex.05094","w":"coerce","pos":"verb","ipa":"koʊˈɜrs","uz":"majburlamoq","ru":"принуждать","ex":["Nobody was coerced; everybody was persuaded."],"u":"S09U07"},{"id":"lex.05095","w":"compel","pos":"verb","ipa":"kəmˈpel","uz":"majbur qilmoq","ru":"вынуждать","ex":["The statute compels disclosure within ten days."],"u":"S09U07"},{"id":"lex.05096","w":"constrain","pos":"verb","ipa":"kənˈstreɪn","uz":"cheklamoq","ru":"ограничивать, стеснять","ex":["The budget constrains everything that follows."],"u":"S09U07"},{"id":"lex.05097","w":"oblige","pos":"verb","ipa":"əˈblaɪdʒ","uz":"majbur etmoq","ru":"обязывать","ex":["The contract obliges both parties to give notice."],"u":"S09U07"},{"id":"lex.05098","w":"deter","pos":"verb","ipa":"dɪˈtɜr","uz":"qaytarmoq, to'xtatmoq","ru":"сдерживать, отпугивать","ex":["The fine deters nobody at that level."],"u":"S09U07"},{"id":"lex.05099","w":"dissuade","pos":"verb","ipa":"dɪˈsweɪd","uz":"fikridan qaytarmoq","ru":"отговаривать","ex":["She dissuaded him from resigning."],"u":"S09U07"},{"id":"lex.05100","w":"discourage","pos":"verb","ipa":"dɪˈskɜrɪdʒ","uz":"ko'nglini qoldirmoq","ru":"обескураживать, отбивать охоту","ex":["High fees discourage applications from the villages."],"u":"S09U07"},{"id":"lex.05101","w":"incite","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪnˈsaɪt","uz":"qo'zg'atmoq","ru":"подстрекать","ex":["The pamphlet was said to incite the crowd."],"u":"S09U07"},{"id":"lex.05102","w":"inflame","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪnˈfleɪm","uz":"avj oldirmoq","ru":"разжигать, обострять","ex":["The second speech inflamed a dispute that was dying."],"u":"S09U07"},{"id":"lex.05103","w":"galvanise","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈɡælvənaɪz","uz":"harakatga keltirmoq","ru":"побуждать к действию","ex":["The closure galvanised the whole village."],"u":"S09U07"},{"id":"lex.05104","w":"mobilise","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈmoʊbɪlaɪz","uz":"safarbar qilmoq","ru":"мобилизовать","ex":["They mobilised two hundred volunteers in a week."],"u":"S09U07"},{"id":"lex.05105","w":"marshal","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈmɑrʃəl","uz":"saf tortmoq, tartibga solmoq","ru":"выстраивать, приводить в порядок","ex":["She marshals the evidence better than she argues from it."],"u":"S09U07"},{"id":"lex.05106","w":"usurp","pos":"verb","ipa":"juːˈsɜrp","uz":"g'ayriqonuniy egallamoq","ru":"узурпировать","ex":["The committee usurped a power the statute gives the minister."],"u":"S09U07"},{"id":"lex.05107","w":"appropriate","pos":"verb","ipa":"əˈproʊprieɪt","uz":"o'zlashtirib olmoq","ru":"присваивать","ex":["The land was appropriated in 1948."],"u":"S09U07"},{"id":"lex.05108","w":"capture","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkæptʃər","uz":"nazoratni qo'lga olish","ru":"захват влияния","ex":["Regulatory capture explains the exemptions."],"u":"S09U07"},{"id":"lex.05109","w":"licensing","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈlaɪsənsɪŋ","uz":"litsenziyalash","ru":"лицензирование","ex":["Licensing was moved to the district in 2003."],"u":"S09U07"},{"id":"lex.05110","w":"plenary","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈpliːnəri","uz":"umumiy, to'liq","ru":"пленарный, полный","ex":["The plenary session runs on Friday afternoon."],"u":"S09U07"},{"id":"lex.05111","w":"colloquium","pos":"noun","ipa":"kəˈloʊkwiəm","uz":"ilmiy kengash","ru":"коллоквиум","ex":["The colloquium meets twice a term."],"u":"S09U07"},{"id":"lex.05112","w":"forestall","pos":"verb","ipa":"fɔrˈstɔl","uz":"oldini olmoq","ru":"предупреждать, упреждать","ex":["They published early to forestall the rumour."],"u":"S09U08"},{"id":"lex.05113","w":"stave off","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈsteɪv ɔf","uz":"vaqtincha to'xtatib turmoq","ru":"отсрочивать, отражать","ex":["The loan staved off closure for two years."],"u":"S09U08"},{"id":"lex.05114","w":"protract","pos":"verb","ipa":"proʊˈtrækt","uz":"cho'zmoq","ru":"затягивать","ex":["The dispute was protracted by both sides."],"u":"S09U08"},{"id":"lex.05115","w":"prolong","pos":"verb","ipa":"prəˈlɔŋ","uz":"uzaytirmoq","ru":"продлевать","ex":["The treatment prolonged his life by a decade."],"u":"S09U08"},{"id":"lex.05116","w":"hasten","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈheɪsən","uz":"tezlashtirmoq","ru":"ускорять","ex":["The rain hastened the collapse of the bank."],"u":"S09U08"},{"id":"lex.05117","w":"truncate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈtrʌŋkeɪt","uz":"kesib qisqartirmoq","ru":"усекать, обрывать","ex":["The visit was truncated by the weather."],"u":"S09U08"},{"id":"lex.05118","w":"lapse into","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈlæps ˌɪntuː","uz":"asta-sekin tushib qolmoq","ru":"впадать в","ex":["The room lapsed into silence."],"u":"S09U08"},{"id":"lex.05119","w":"succumb to","pos":"verb","ipa":"səˈkʌm tuː","uz":"taslim bo'lmoq","ru":"поддаться, не устоять","ex":["He succumbed to the pressure in the third week."],"u":"S09U08"},{"id":"lex.05120","w":"ride out","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈraɪd aʊt","uz":"bardosh bermoq","ru":"переждать, выстоять","ex":["The firm rode out two recessions."],"u":"S09U08"},{"id":"lex.05121","w":"tide over","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈtaɪd ˌoʊvər","uz":"vaqtincha yordam bermoq","ru":"помочь продержаться","ex":["The grant tided them over until the harvest."],"u":"S09U08"},{"id":"lex.05122","w":"run up","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈrʌn ʌp","uz":"ko'paytirib yubormoq","ru":"накопить долг","ex":["The department ran up a deficit of four million."],"u":"S09U08"},{"id":"lex.05123","w":"head off","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈhed ɔf","uz":"yo'lini to'smoq","ru":"предотвратить","ex":["A phone call headed off the whole dispute."],"u":"S09U08"},{"id":"lex.05124","w":"play down","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈpleɪ daʊn","uz":"ahamiyatini kamaytirmoq","ru":"преуменьшать значение","ex":["The ministry played down the figures for a month."],"u":"S09U08"},{"id":"lex.05125","w":"pass off","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈpæs ɔf","uz":"o'tkazib yubormoq, soxtalashtirmoq","ru":"выдавать за","ex":["The copy was passed off as an original for thirty years."],"u":"S09U08"},{"id":"lex.05126","w":"live down","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈlɪv daʊn","uz":"unuttirmoq","ru":"загладить, заставить забыть","ex":["He never lived down the second speech."],"u":"S09U08"},{"id":"lex.05127","w":"make out","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈmeɪk aʊt","uz":"zo'rg'a farqlamoq, da'vo qilmoq","ru":"разглядеть, утверждать","ex":["I could just make out a signature at the foot."],"u":"S09U08"},{"id":"lex.05128","w":"carry off","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈkæri ɔf","uz":"uddalamoq","ru":"справиться, провернуть","ex":["She carried off the whole presentation without a note."],"u":"S09U08"},{"id":"lex.05129","w":"authenticity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌɔθenˈtɪsɪti","uz":"haqiqiylik","ru":"подлинность","ex":["The authenticity of the letter has never been settled."],"u":"S09U09"},{"id":"lex.05130","w":"forgery","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfɔrdʒəri","uz":"qalbakilik","ru":"подделка","ex":["The signature is a forgery, and a poor one."],"u":"S09U09"},{"id":"lex.05131","w":"identification","pos":"noun","ipa":"aɪˌdentɪfɪˈkeɪʃən","uz":"aniqlash","ru":"установление личности, идентификация","ex":["Identification rested on a single photograph."],"u":"S09U09"},{"id":"lex.05132","w":"randomisation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌrændəmaɪˈzeɪʃən","uz":"tasodifiy taqsimlash","ru":"рандомизация","ex":["Randomisation is what makes the comparison fair."],"u":"S09U09"},{"id":"lex.05133","w":"blinding","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈblaɪndɪŋ","uz":"ko'r usul","ru":"ослепление, маскировка","ex":["Blinding was not possible in a trial of this kind."],"u":"S09U09"},{"id":"lex.05134","w":"moderator","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmɑdəreɪtər","uz":"ta'sirni o'zgartiruvchi omil","ru":"модератор, опосредующий фактор","ex":["Age is a moderator of the whole effect."],"u":"S09U09"},{"id":"lex.05135","w":"implicate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈɪmplɪkeɪt","uz":"aloqadorligini ko'rsatmoq","ru":"вовлекать, изобличать","ex":["The file implicates two officials and names neither."],"u":"S09U09"},{"id":"lex.05136","w":"incriminate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪnˈkrɪmɪneɪt","uz":"ayblovchi dalil bermoq","ru":"инкриминировать, уличать","ex":["The letter incriminates its own author."],"u":"S09U09"},{"id":"lex.05137","w":"exonerate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪɡˈzɑnəreɪt","uz":"aybdan xalos qilmoq","ru":"снимать вину, оправдывать","ex":["The inquiry exonerated the crew completely."],"u":"S09U09"},{"id":"lex.05138","w":"absolve","pos":"verb","ipa":"əbˈzɑlv","uz":"aybdan ozod qilmoq","ru":"освобождать от вины","ex":["Ignorance does not absolve anyone of the duty."],"u":"S09U09"},{"id":"lex.05139","w":"acquit","pos":"verb","ipa":"əˈkwɪt","uz":"oqlamoq","ru":"оправдывать","ex":["Both men were acquitted on the second charge."],"u":"S09U09"},{"id":"lex.05140","w":"patent","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈpeɪtənt","uz":"ko'zga tashlanib turgan","ru":"явный, очевидный","ex":["The contradiction is patent from the first page."],"u":"S09U09"},{"id":"lex.05141","w":"apposite","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈæpəzɪt","uz":"o'rinli, mos","ru":"уместный, меткий","ex":["The quotation is apposite and unattributed."],"u":"S09U09"},{"id":"lex.05142","w":"scrupulous","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈskruːpjələs","uz":"puxta, halol","ru":"скрупулёзный, щепетильный","ex":["Her footnotes are scrupulous."],"u":"S09U09"},{"id":"lex.05143","w":"exacting","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪɡˈzæktɪŋ","uz":"talabchan","ru":"взыскательный, требовательный","ex":["The standard is exacting and rarely met."],"u":"S09U09"},{"id":"lex.05144","w":"assiduous","pos":"adj","ipa":"əˈsɪdʒuəs","uz":"tirishqoq","ru":"усердный","ex":["Assiduous checking found the error in week nine."],"u":"S09U09"},{"id":"lex.05145","w":"acumen","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈkjuːmən","uz":"zukkolik","ru":"проницательность","ex":["Her political acumen saved the department twice."],"u":"S09U09"},{"id":"lex.05146","w":"discernment","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˈsɜrnmənt","uz":"farqlash qobiliyati","ru":"проницательность, разборчивость","ex":["He read with discernment and wrote without it."],"u":"S09U09"},{"id":"lex.05147","w":"accretion","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈkriːʃən","uz":"qatlam-qatlam o'sish","ru":"нарастание, наслоение","ex":["The rule grew by accretion, not by design."],"u":"S09U10"},{"id":"lex.05148","w":"decay","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˈkeɪ","uz":"chirish, yemirilish","ru":"распад, разрушение","ex":["Decay had reached the roof timbers."],"u":"S09U10"},{"id":"lex.05149","w":"degeneration","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˌdʒenəˈreɪʃən","uz":"tanazzul","ru":"вырождение, деградация","ex":["The degeneration of the service took twenty years."],"u":"S09U10"},{"id":"lex.05150","w":"decadence","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdekədəns","uz":"tanazzul, buzilish","ru":"упадок, декаданс","ex":["What one age calls decadence another calls style."],"u":"S09U10"},{"id":"lex.05151","w":"dilapidation","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˌlæpɪˈdeɪʃən","uz":"vayronalik","ru":"обветшание","ex":["The dilapidation of the school was obvious from the road."],"u":"S09U10"},{"id":"lex.05152","w":"squalor","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈskwɑlər","uz":"iflos va qashshoq holat","ru":"убожество, нищета","ex":["The report describes squalor in careful, unexcited prose."],"u":"S09U10"},{"id":"lex.05153","w":"proliferation","pos":"noun","ipa":"prəˌlɪfəˈreɪʃən","uz":"tez ko'payish","ru":"распространение, разрастание","ex":["The proliferation of small agencies confused everyone."],"u":"S09U10"},{"id":"lex.05154","w":"profusion","pos":"noun","ipa":"prəˈfjuːʒən","uz":"mo'l-ko'lchilik","ru":"изобилие","ex":["A profusion of wild flowers on the south slope."],"u":"S09U10"},{"id":"lex.05155","w":"abundance","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈbʌndəns","uz":"mo'llik","ru":"обилие, достаток","ex":["There was an abundance of evidence and no conclusion."],"u":"S09U10"},{"id":"lex.05156","w":"scarcity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈskersɪti","uz":"taqchillik","ru":"дефицит, нехватка","ex":["Scarcity of timber shaped every building here."],"u":"S09U10"},{"id":"lex.05157","w":"surfeit","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsɜrfɪt","uz":"haddan ortiqlik","ru":"избыток, пресыщение","ex":["A surfeit of detail and a shortage of point."],"u":"S09U10"},{"id":"lex.05158","w":"slack","pos":"noun","ipa":"slæk","uz":"zaxira imkoniyat","ru":"запас прочности","ex":["There is no slack in the timetable at all."],"u":"S09U10"},{"id":"lex.05159","w":"buffer","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈbʌfər","uz":"bufer, zaxira","ru":"буфер, запас","ex":["The grain buffer lasted eleven weeks."],"u":"S09U10"},{"id":"lex.05160","w":"lag","pos":"noun","ipa":"læɡ","uz":"kechikish","ru":"запаздывание","ex":["There is a two-year lag between the rule and the result."],"u":"S09U10"},{"id":"lex.05161","w":"loop","pos":"noun","ipa":"luːp","uz":"halqa, qaytar bog'lanish","ru":"петля, цикл","ex":["A feedback loop kept the price rising."],"u":"S09U10"},{"id":"lex.05162","w":"traction","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtrækʃən","uz":"ta'sir kuchi, ilashish","ru":"сцепление, продвижение","ex":["The proposal gained traction after the second failure."],"u":"S09U10"},{"id":"lex.05163","w":"contagion","pos":"noun","ipa":"kənˈteɪdʒən","uz":"yuqish, tarqalish","ru":"заражение, распространение","ex":["Financial contagion reached three countries in a week."],"u":"S09U10"},{"id":"lex.05164","w":"elegy","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈelədʒi","uz":"marsiya","ru":"элегия","ex":["The last chapter is an elegy for a vanished trade."],"u":"S09U11"},{"id":"lex.05165","w":"eulogy","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈjuːlədʒi","uz":"maqtov nutqi","ru":"панегирик, надгробная речь","ex":["Her eulogy lasted four minutes and said everything."],"u":"S09U11"},{"id":"lex.05166","w":"satire","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsætaɪr","uz":"satira","ru":"сатира","ex":["It was read as satire and written as a report."],"u":"S09U11"},{"id":"lex.05167","w":"sarcasm","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsɑrkæzəm","uz":"kinoya, zaharxanda","ru":"сарказм","ex":["The sarcasm did not survive the translation."],"u":"S09U11"},{"id":"lex.05168","w":"wit","pos":"noun","ipa":"wɪt","uz":"hozirjavoblik","ru":"остроумие","ex":["The letters are full of wit and short of warmth."],"u":"S09U11"},{"id":"lex.05169","w":"mirth","pos":"noun","ipa":"mɜrθ","uz":"quvnoqlik","ru":"веселье","ex":["The suggestion was met with mirth."],"u":"S09U11"},{"id":"lex.05170","w":"glee","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɡliː","uz":"shodlik, quvonch","ru":"ликование, злорадство","ex":["The papers reported the resignation with glee."],"u":"S09U11"},{"id":"lex.05171","w":"grief","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɡriːf","uz":"qayg'u","ru":"горе","ex":["Grief made the village quiet for a month."],"u":"S09U11"},{"id":"lex.05172","w":"anguish","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈæŋɡwɪʃ","uz":"iztirob","ru":"мука, страдание","ex":["The letters record two years of anguish."],"u":"S09U11"},{"id":"lex.05173","w":"solace","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsɑlɪs","uz":"tasalli","ru":"утешение","ex":["He found solace in the archive."],"u":"S09U11"},{"id":"lex.05174","w":"reprieve","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈpriːv","uz":"muhlat, kechirim","ru":"отсрочка, помилование","ex":["The school won a two-year reprieve."],"u":"S09U11"},{"id":"lex.05175","w":"respite","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈrespɪt","uz":"tin olish","ru":"передышка","ex":["The rain gave no respite for three days."],"u":"S09U11"},{"id":"lex.05176","w":"twilight","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtwaɪlaɪt","uz":"shafaq","ru":"сумерки","ex":["They reached the ridge at twilight."],"u":"S09U11"},{"id":"lex.05177","w":"dusk","pos":"noun","ipa":"dʌsk","uz":"qorong'i tushishi","ru":"сумерки, вечер","ex":["The bus arrives at dusk or not at all."],"u":"S09U11"},{"id":"lex.05178","w":"stillness","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈstɪlnəs","uz":"sokinlik","ru":"тишина, неподвижность","ex":["The stillness after the machines stopped was startling."],"u":"S09U11"},{"id":"lex.05179","w":"hush","pos":"noun","ipa":"hʌʃ","uz":"jimlik","ru":"тишина, затишье","ex":["A hush fell when she named the figure."],"u":"S09U11"},{"id":"lex.05180","w":"lull","pos":"noun","ipa":"lʌl","uz":"tinch oraliq","ru":"затишье","ex":["They repaired the roof in the lull between storms."],"u":"S09U11"},{"id":"lex.05181","w":"explicate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈeksplɪkeɪt","uz":"batafsil sharhlamoq","ru":"разъяснять, толковать","ex":["The commentary explicates every clause of the treaty."],"u":"S09U12"},{"id":"lex.05182","w":"obfuscate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈɑbfəskeɪt","uz":"chalkashtirmoq","ru":"запутывать","ex":["The wording obfuscates a simple duty."],"u":"S09U12"},{"id":"lex.05183","w":"intimate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈɪntɪmeɪt","uz":"ishora qilmoq","ru":"намекать","ex":["He intimated that the post might be hers."],"u":"S09U12"},{"id":"lex.05184","w":"epitomise","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪˈpɪtəmaɪz","uz":"yaqqol namunasi bo'lmoq","ru":"воплощать, олицетворять","ex":["The building epitomises everything the period valued."],"u":"S09U12"},{"id":"lex.05185","w":"exemplify","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪɡˈzemplɪfaɪ","uz":"misol bo'lmoq","ru":"служить примером","ex":["The case exemplifies a problem the law never anticipated."],"u":"S09U12"},{"id":"lex.05186","w":"typify","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈtɪpɪfaɪ","uz":"tipik bo'lmoq","ru":"быть типичным для","ex":["The house typifies the architecture of the decade."],"u":"S09U12"},{"id":"lex.05187","w":"embody","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪmˈbɑdi","uz":"gavdalantirmoq","ru":"воплощать","ex":["The statute embodies a principle older than the state."],"u":"S09U12"},{"id":"lex.05188","w":"comprehend","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌkɑmprɪˈhend","uz":"anglab yetmoq, qamrab olmoq","ru":"постигать, охватывать","ex":["Nobody at the meeting comprehended the scale of it."],"u":"S09U12"},{"id":"lex.05189","w":"synthesise","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈsɪnθəsaɪz","uz":"jamlab umumlashtirmoq","ru":"синтезировать","ex":["The review synthesises forty studies."],"u":"S09U12"},{"id":"lex.05190","w":"condense","pos":"verb","ipa":"kənˈdens","uz":"ixchamlashtirmoq","ru":"сжимать, конденсировать","ex":["Forty pages condensed to four."],"u":"S09U12"},{"id":"lex.05191","w":"distil","pos":"verb","ipa":"dɪˈstɪl","uz":"mohiyatini ajratib olmoq","ru":"извлекать суть","ex":["She distils thirty years of work into one lecture."],"u":"S09U12"},{"id":"lex.05192","w":"interpolate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪnˈtɜrpəleɪt","uz":"orasiga qo'shmoq","ru":"вставлять, интерполировать","ex":["A later hand interpolated the final paragraph."],"u":"S09U12"},{"id":"lex.05193","w":"presuppose","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌpriːsəˈpoʊz","uz":"oldindan shart qilib olmoq","ru":"предполагать заранее","ex":["The question presupposes that a record was kept."],"u":"S09U12"},{"id":"lex.05194","w":"heterodox","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈhetərədɑks","uz":"noan'anaviy qarashli","ru":"неортодоксальный","ex":["A heterodox reading that has slowly become standard."],"u":"S09U12"},{"id":"lex.05195","w":"orthodox","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈɔrθədɑks","uz":"an'anaviy, qabul qilingan","ru":"ортодоксальный, общепринятый","ex":["The orthodox explanation has survived three challenges."],"u":"S09U12"},{"id":"lex.05196","w":"trenchant","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈtrentʃənt","uz":"keskin, o'tkir","ru":"резкий, меткий","ex":["A trenchant review that ended a reputation."],"u":"S09U12"},{"id":"lex.05197","w":"incisive","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪnˈsaɪsɪv","uz":"o'tkir, aniq","ru":"проницательный, острый","ex":["Two incisive questions ended the discussion."],"u":"S09U12"},{"id":"lex.05198","w":"externality","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌekstərˈnælɪti","uz":"tashqi ta'sir","ru":"внешний эффект","ex":["Noise is the classic negative externality."],"u":"S09U13"},{"id":"lex.05199","w":"extractive","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪkˈstræktɪv","uz":"qazib oluvchi, tortib oluvchi","ru":"добывающий, извлекающий","ex":["An extractive industry leaves holes and little else."],"u":"S09U13"},{"id":"lex.05200","w":"federalism","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfedərəlɪzəm","uz":"federalizm","ru":"федерализм","ex":["Federalism was the compromise that held the state together."],"u":"S09U13"},{"id":"lex.05201","w":"populism","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpɑpjəlɪzəm","uz":"populizm","ru":"популизм","ex":["Populism is a style before it is a programme."],"u":"S09U13"},{"id":"lex.05202","w":"technocracy","pos":"noun","ipa":"tekˈnɑkrəsi","uz":"texnokratiya","ru":"технократия","ex":["The reform replaced a ministry with a technocracy."],"u":"S09U13"},{"id":"lex.05203","w":"sedentary","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈsedənteri","uz":"o'troq","ru":"оседлый, сидячий","ex":["The population became sedentary within two generations."],"u":"S09U13"},{"id":"lex.05204","w":"gerrymander","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈdʒerimændər","uz":"saylov chegaralarini o'z foydasiga o'zgartirmoq","ru":"перекраивать округа в свою пользу","ex":["The map was gerrymandered in 1974 and never redrawn."],"u":"S09U13"},{"id":"lex.05205","w":"bloc","pos":"noun","ipa":"blɑk","uz":"blok","ru":"блок","ex":["The northern bloc voted as one."],"u":"S09U13"},{"id":"lex.05206","w":"restructuring","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌriːˈstrʌktʃərɪŋ","uz":"qayta tuzish","ru":"реструктуризация","ex":["Restructuring cost four hundred jobs."],"u":"S09U13"},{"id":"lex.05207","w":"syndication","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌsɪndɪˈkeɪʃən","uz":"ko'p tarmoqqa tarqatish","ru":"синдикация","ex":["Syndication put the column in forty papers."],"u":"S09U13"},{"id":"lex.05208","w":"arbitrage","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɑrbɪtrɑʒ","uz":"narx farqidan foyda olish","ru":"арбитраж","ex":["Arbitrage closes the gap it lives on."],"u":"S09U13"},{"id":"lex.05209","w":"elasticity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪˌlæˈstɪsɪti","uz":"elastiklik","ru":"эластичность","ex":["Demand for bread has low elasticity."],"u":"S09U13"},{"id":"lex.05210","w":"multiplier","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmʌltɪplaɪər","uz":"ko'paytiruvchi omil","ru":"мультипликатор","ex":["The multiplier is smaller in a small open economy."],"u":"S09U13"},{"id":"lex.05211","w":"crowding","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkraʊdɪŋ","uz":"siqib chiqarish","ru":"вытеснение","ex":["Crowding out of private lending was the main objection."],"u":"S09U13"},{"id":"lex.05212","w":"dependence","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˈpendəns","uz":"qaramlik","ru":"зависимость","ex":["Dependence on a single crop ended badly twice."],"u":"S09U13"},{"id":"lex.05213","w":"closure","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkloʊʒər","uz":"yopilish, yakun","ru":"закрытие, завершённость","ex":["Closure of the line was announced in a footnote."],"u":"S09U13"},{"id":"lex.05214","w":"reproduction","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌriːprəˈdʌkʃən","uz":"qayta ishlab chiqarish","ru":"воспроизводство","ex":["Social reproduction happens in the home, not the school."],"u":"S09U13"},{"id":"lex.05215","w":"institutional","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌɪnstɪˈtuːʃənəl","uz":"institutsional","ru":"институциональный","ex":["This is institutional failure, not individual incompetence."],"u":"S09U13"},{"id":"lex.05216","w":"preside over","pos":"verb","ipa":"prɪˈzaɪd ˌoʊvər","uz":"raislik qilmoq","ru":"председательствовать, возглавлять","ex":["She presided over the committee for nine years."],"u":"S09U14"},{"id":"lex.05217","w":"reckon with","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈrekən wɪð","uz":"hisobga olmoq","ru":"считаться с","ex":["Any plan has to reckon with the winter."],"u":"S09U14"},{"id":"lex.05218","w":"grapple with","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈɡræpəl wɪð","uz":"olishmoq, kurashmoq","ru":"биться над, бороться с","ex":["The chapter grapples with a problem it does not solve."],"u":"S09U14"},{"id":"lex.05219","w":"enter into","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈentər ˌɪntuː","uz":"tuzmoq, kirishmoq","ru":"вступать в","ex":["The parties entered into the contract in May."],"u":"S09U14"},{"id":"lex.05220","w":"embark on","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪmˈbɑrk ɑn","uz":"kirishmoq","ru":"предпринимать, приступать","ex":["They embarked on a rebuild with no costing."],"u":"S09U14"},{"id":"lex.05221","w":"build on","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈbɪld ɑn","uz":"asosida rivojlantirmoq","ru":"опираться на, развивать","ex":["The second study builds on the first and corrects it."],"u":"S09U14"},{"id":"lex.05222","w":"bank on","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈbæŋk ɑn","uz":"umid bog'lamoq","ru":"рассчитывать на","ex":["Do not bank on the money arriving in March."],"u":"S09U14"},{"id":"lex.05223","w":"bargain for","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈbɑrɡɪn fɔr","uz":"kutmoq, hisobga olmoq","ru":"рассчитывать, ожидать","ex":["They got more attention than they bargained for."],"u":"S09U14"},{"id":"lex.05224","w":"dispense with","pos":"verb","ipa":"dɪˈspens wɪð","uz":"voz kechmoq","ru":"обходиться без","ex":["The committee dispensed with the reading of the minutes."],"u":"S09U14"},{"id":"lex.05225","w":"brush aside","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈbrʌʃ əˈsaɪd","uz":"e'tiborsiz qoldirmoq","ru":"отмахнуться от","ex":["He brushed aside the first two questions."],"u":"S09U14"},{"id":"lex.05226","w":"tamper with","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈtæmpər wɪð","uz":"o'zgartirib buzmoq","ru":"вмешиваться, подделывать","ex":["Somebody had tampered with the record."],"u":"S09U14"},{"id":"lex.05227","w":"subscribe to","pos":"verb","ipa":"səbˈskraɪb tuː","uz":"qo'llab-quvvatlamoq","ru":"разделять, придерживаться","ex":["I do not subscribe to that reading of the evidence."],"u":"S09U14"},{"id":"lex.05228","w":"resort to","pos":"verb","ipa":"rɪˈzɔrt tuː","uz":"noiloj murojaat qilmoq","ru":"прибегать к","ex":["They resorted to the courts in the eleventh year."],"u":"S09U14"},{"id":"lex.05229","w":"revolve around","pos":"verb","ipa":"rɪˈvɑlv əˈraʊnd","uz":"atrofida aylanmoq","ru":"вращаться вокруг","ex":["The whole dispute revolves around one word."],"u":"S09U14"},{"id":"lex.05230","w":"verge on","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈvɜrdʒ ɑn","uz":"yaqinlashmoq, chegarada bo'lmoq","ru":"граничить с","ex":["The tone verges on contempt."],"u":"S09U14"},{"id":"lex.05231","w":"impinge on","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪmˈpɪndʒ ɑn","uz":"ta'sir qilmoq, daxl qilmoq","ru":"затрагивать, посягать","ex":["The rule impinges on a freedom the statute protects."],"u":"S09U14"},{"id":"lex.05232","w":"encroach on","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪnˈkroʊtʃ ɑn","uz":"asta-sekin bosib kirmoq","ru":"посягать, вторгаться","ex":["The new building encroaches on the courtyard."],"u":"S09U14"},{"id":"lex.05233","w":"chance upon","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈtʃæns əˈpɑn","uz":"tasodifan duch kelmoq","ru":"случайно наткнуться на","ex":["She chanced upon the second copy in a box of receipts."],"u":"S09U15"},{"id":"lex.05234","w":"lay bare","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈleɪ ber","uz":"fosh qilmoq","ru":"обнажать, раскрывать","ex":["The audit laid bare a decade of neglect."],"u":"S09U15"},{"id":"lex.05235","w":"hinge on","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈhɪndʒ ɑn","uz":"butunlay bog'liq bo'lmoq","ru":"зависеть целиком от","ex":["The case hinges on a single letter."],"u":"S09U15"},{"id":"lex.05236","w":"hold forth","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈhoʊld fɔrθ","uz":"uzoq va dabdabali gapirmoq","ru":"разглагольствовать","ex":["He held forth on drainage for twenty minutes."],"u":"S09U15"},{"id":"lex.05237","w":"militate against","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈmɪlɪteɪt əˈɡenst","uz":"to'sqinlik qiluvchi omil bo'lmoq","ru":"препятствовать, говорить против","ex":["The cost militates against a second bridge."],"u":"S09U15"},{"id":"lex.05238","w":"partake of","pos":"verb","ipa":"pɑrˈteɪk ʌv","uz":"ulushiga ega bo'lmoq","ru":"иметь оттенок, быть причастным","ex":["The prose partakes of both the sermon and the report."],"u":"S09U15"},{"id":"lex.05239","w":"fall back on","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈfɔl ˈbæk ɑn","uz":"zaxiraga murojaat qilmoq","ru":"прибегать к запасному варианту","ex":["With no data they fell back on the 1994 estimate."],"u":"S09U15"},{"id":"lex.05240","w":"win over","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈwɪn ˈoʊvər","uz":"o'z tomoniga og'dirmoq","ru":"склонить на свою сторону","ex":["The second draft won over the two doubters."],"u":"S09U15"},{"id":"lex.05241","w":"augment","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɔɡˈment","uz":"ko'paytirmoq","ru":"увеличивать, дополнять","ex":["The grant augments a budget that was never adequate."],"u":"S09U15"},{"id":"lex.05242","w":"supplement","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈsʌplɪment","uz":"to'ldirmoq","ru":"дополнять","ex":["She supplements her teaching with evening work."],"u":"S09U15"},{"id":"lex.05243","w":"accentuate","pos":"verb","ipa":"əkˈsentʃueɪt","uz":"ta'kidlab ko'rsatmoq","ru":"подчёркивать, усиливать","ex":["The new road accentuated the gap between the two districts."],"u":"S09U15"},{"id":"lex.05244","w":"embed","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪmˈbed","uz":"ichiga singdirmoq","ru":"встраивать, укоренять","ex":["The practice is embedded in every department."],"u":"S09U15"},{"id":"lex.05245","w":"prevail","pos":"verb","ipa":"prɪˈveɪl","uz":"g'olib chiqmoq, hukm surmoq","ru":"возобладать, преобладать","ex":["The older reading prevailed after thirty years."],"u":"S09U15"},{"id":"lex.05246","w":"sap","pos":"verb","ipa":"sæp","uz":"asta-sekin kuchsizlantirmoq","ru":"подтачивать, истощать","ex":["Two years of delay sapped the whole campaign."],"u":"S09U15"},{"id":"lex.05247","w":"vitiate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈvɪʃieɪt","uz":"kuchini yo'qotmoq","ru":"обесценивать, делать недействительным","ex":["One missing signature vitiates the whole contract."],"u":"S09U15"},{"id":"lex.05248","w":"aggravate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈæɡrəveɪt","uz":"og'irlashtirmoq","ru":"усугублять","ex":["Publishing the names aggravated a dispute that was ending."],"u":"S09U15"},{"id":"lex.05249","w":"complement","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈkɑmplɪment","uz":"to'ldirib turmoq","ru":"служить дополнением","ex":["The photographs complement a text that is short on detail."],"u":"S09U15"},{"id":"lex.05250","w":"thrift","pos":"noun","ipa":"θrɪft","uz":"tejamkorlik","ru":"бережливость","ex":["Thrift kept the school open through two bad decades."],"u":"S09U16"},{"id":"lex.05251","w":"sparse","pos":"adj","ipa":"spɑrs","uz":"siyrak","ru":"редкий, скудный","ex":["The evidence for the early period is sparse."],"u":"S09U16"},{"id":"lex.05252","w":"disparate","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈdɪspərət","uz":"turli-tuman, mos kelmaydigan","ru":"несопоставимый, разнородный","ex":["Three disparate sources, and they agree on the date."],"u":"S09U16"},{"id":"lex.05253","w":"heterogeneous","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌhetəroʊˈdʒiːniəs","uz":"turdosh bo'lmagan","ru":"разнородный","ex":["A heterogeneous sample hides more than it shows."],"u":"S09U16"},{"id":"lex.05254","w":"homogeneous","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌhoʊməˈdʒiːniəs","uz":"bir xil tarkibli","ru":"однородный","ex":["The village looks homogeneous and is not."],"u":"S09U16"},{"id":"lex.05255","w":"heterogeneity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌhetəroʊdʒəˈniːɪti","uz":"xilma-xillik","ru":"неоднородность","ex":["The heterogeneity of the sample explains the wide result."],"u":"S09U16"},{"id":"lex.05256","w":"homogeneity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌhoʊmoʊdʒəˈniːɪti","uz":"bir xillik","ru":"однородность","ex":["Apparent homogeneity disappeared once the data were split."],"u":"S09U16"},{"id":"lex.05257","w":"dispersion","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˈspɜrʒən","uz":"tarqoqlik","ru":"разброс, дисперсия","ex":["The average is the same; the dispersion is not."],"u":"S09U16"},{"id":"lex.05258","w":"dispersal","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˈspɜrsəl","uz":"tarqalish","ru":"рассеяние, расселение","ex":["Dispersal of the population began after the flood."],"u":"S09U16"},{"id":"lex.05259","w":"convergence","pos":"noun","ipa":"kənˈvɜrdʒəns","uz":"bir nuqtaga kelish","ru":"сближение, конвергенция","ex":["Convergence between the two regions stopped in 1998."],"u":"S09U16"},{"id":"lex.05260","w":"asymmetry","pos":"noun","ipa":"eɪˈsɪmɪtri","uz":"nomutanosiblik","ru":"асимметрия","ex":["The asymmetry of information favours the seller."],"u":"S09U16"},{"id":"lex.05261","w":"symmetry","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsɪmɪtri","uz":"simmetriya","ru":"симметрия","ex":["The symmetry of the facade is broken by one window."],"u":"S09U16"},{"id":"lex.05262","w":"gradation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɡrəˈdeɪʃən","uz":"bosqichma-bosqich o'zgarish","ru":"градация","ex":["The scale has seven gradations and uses three."],"u":"S09U16"},{"id":"lex.05263","w":"congruent","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈkɑŋɡruənt","uz":"mos, ustma-ust tushuvchi","ru":"конгруэнтный, согласующийся","ex":["The two accounts are congruent on every checkable point."],"u":"S09U16"},{"id":"lex.05264","w":"analogous","pos":"adj","ipa":"əˈnæləɡəs","uz":"o'xshash","ru":"аналогичный","ex":["The case is analogous but not identical."],"u":"S09U16"},{"id":"lex.05265","w":"comparative","pos":"adj","ipa":"kəmˈpærətɪv","uz":"qiyosiy","ru":"сравнительный","ex":["The comparative method is older than the discipline."],"u":"S09U16"},{"id":"lex.05266","w":"unqualified","pos":"adj","ipa":"ʌnˈkwɑlɪfaɪd","uz":"so'zsiz, shartsiz; malakasiz","ru":"безоговорочный; неквалифицированный","ex":["An unqualified success, and he said so twice."],"u":"S09U16"},{"id":"lex.05267","w":"moral","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈmɔrəl","uz":"axloqiy","ru":"нравственный, моральный","ex":["The objection is moral and the answer is technical."],"u":"S09U16"},{"id":"lex.05268","w":"acrimony","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈækrɪmoʊni","uz":"achchiqlik, keskinlik","ru":"желчность, озлобленность","ex":["The negotiation ended in acrimony."],"u":"S09U17"},{"id":"lex.05269","w":"animus","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈænɪməs","uz":"adovat","ru":"неприязнь, враждебность","ex":["The report shows a clear animus against the department."],"u":"S09U17"},{"id":"lex.05270","w":"spite","pos":"noun","ipa":"spaɪt","uz":"o'chakishish","ru":"злоба, назло","ex":["The wall was built out of pure spite."],"u":"S09U17"},{"id":"lex.05271","w":"rancour","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈræŋkər","uz":"kek","ru":"злоба, затаённая обида","ex":["She left without rancour and never came back."],"u":"S09U17"},{"id":"lex.05272","w":"scorn","pos":"noun","ipa":"skɔrn","uz":"nafrat, mensimaslik","ru":"презрение","ex":["He poured scorn on the whole proposal."],"u":"S09U17"},{"id":"lex.05273","w":"derision","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˈrɪʒən","uz":"masxara","ru":"осмеяние","ex":["The plan was greeted with derision."],"u":"S09U17"},{"id":"lex.05274","w":"condescension","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌkɑndɪˈsenʃən","uz":"mensimay muomala","ru":"снисходительность","ex":["The tone of the letter is pure condescension."],"u":"S09U17"},{"id":"lex.05275","w":"servility","pos":"noun","ipa":"sərˈvɪlɪti","uz":"xushomadgo'ylik","ru":"раболепие","ex":["The servility of the minutes is embarrassing to read."],"u":"S09U17"},{"id":"lex.05276","w":"pedantry","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpedəntri","uz":"maydachilik","ru":"педантизм","ex":["This is pedantry, and the pedant happens to be right."],"u":"S09U17"},{"id":"lex.05277","w":"banality","pos":"noun","ipa":"bəˈnælɪti","uz":"bachkanalik","ru":"банальность","ex":["The banality of the report is its most striking feature."],"u":"S09U17"},{"id":"lex.05278","w":"credulity","pos":"noun","ipa":"krɪˈduːlɪti","uz":"ishonuvchanlik","ru":"легковерие","ex":["The scheme depended on the credulity of the elderly."],"u":"S09U17"},{"id":"lex.05279","w":"gullibility","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌɡʌləˈbɪlɪti","uz":"aldanuvchanlik","ru":"доверчивость","ex":["Gullibility is not the same as trust."],"u":"S09U17"},{"id":"lex.05280","w":"naivety","pos":"noun","ipa":"naɪˈiːvti","uz":"soddadillik","ru":"наивность","ex":["There is naivety in the plan and honesty in the accounts."],"u":"S09U17"},{"id":"lex.05281","w":"vanity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈvænɪti","uz":"manmanlik","ru":"тщеславие","ex":["The building is a monument to one man's vanity."],"u":"S09U17"},{"id":"lex.05282","w":"ostentation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌɑstenˈteɪʃən","uz":"ko'z-ko'z qilish","ru":"показная роскошь","ex":["The hall was rebuilt with some ostentation."],"u":"S09U17"},{"id":"lex.05283","w":"pomp","pos":"noun","ipa":"pɑmp","uz":"dabdaba","ru":"пышность","ex":["The ceremony had more pomp than the occasion required."],"u":"S09U17"},{"id":"lex.05284","w":"estrangement","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪˈstreɪndʒmənt","uz":"begonalashuv","ru":"отчуждение, разрыв","ex":["After the estrangement they wrote once a year."],"u":"S09U17"},{"id":"lex.05285","w":"scaffold","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈskæfoʊld","uz":"iskala","ru":"строительные леса","ex":["The scaffold came down after nine months."],"u":"S09U18"},{"id":"lex.05286","w":"compendium","pos":"noun","ipa":"kəmˈpendiəm","uz":"to'plam, qomus","ru":"свод, компендиум","ex":["The compendium runs to nine hundred pages."],"u":"S09U18"},{"id":"lex.05287","w":"profile","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈproʊfaɪl","uz":"yon ko'rinish; ocherk","ru":"профиль; очерк","ex":["The profile of the ridge is unmistakable."],"u":"S09U18"},{"id":"lex.05288","w":"contour","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkɑntʊr","uz":"chiziq, kontur","ru":"контур, горизонталь","ex":["The contours on the map are twenty metres apart."],"u":"S09U18"},{"id":"lex.05289","w":"curve","pos":"noun","ipa":"kɜrv","uz":"egri chiziq","ru":"кривая","ex":["The curve flattens after 1990."],"u":"S09U18"},{"id":"lex.05290","w":"arc","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɑrk","uz":"yoy","ru":"дуга","ex":["The arc of the bridge is a single span."],"u":"S09U18"},{"id":"lex.05291","w":"silhouette","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌsɪluˈet","uz":"qorasi, siluet","ru":"силуэт","ex":["The citadel was a silhouette against the last light."],"u":"S09U18"},{"id":"lex.05292","w":"grain","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɡreɪn","uz":"tola, naqsh","ru":"текстура, волокно","ex":["Cut with the grain, never across it."],"u":"S09U18"},{"id":"lex.05293","w":"groove","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɡruːv","uz":"o'yiq","ru":"желобок, паз","ex":["A groove in the stone shows where the rope ran."],"u":"S09U18"},{"id":"lex.05294","w":"furrow","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfɜroʊ","uz":"egat","ru":"борозда","ex":["The furrows run straight down the slope, which is the whole problem."],"u":"S09U18"},{"id":"lex.05295","w":"rut","pos":"noun","ipa":"rʌt","uz":"iz, bir xillik","ru":"колея, рутина","ex":["The ruts fill with water and freeze."],"u":"S09U18"},{"id":"lex.05296","w":"seam","pos":"noun","ipa":"siːm","uz":"chok; qatlam","ru":"шов; пласт","ex":["The seam runs two hundred metres under the village."],"u":"S09U18"},{"id":"lex.05297","w":"quarry","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkwɔri","uz":"karer","ru":"карьер, каменоломня","ex":["The quarry closed in 1962 and filled with water."],"u":"S09U18"},{"id":"lex.05298","w":"strand","pos":"noun","ipa":"strænd","uz":"tola, yo'nalish","ru":"нить, линия","ex":["Two strands of the argument never meet."],"u":"S09U18"},{"id":"lex.05299","w":"tapestry","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtæpɪstri","uz":"gilam-surat, chigal manzara","ru":"гобелен; сложная картина","ex":["The tapestry took eleven years to weave."],"u":"S09U18"},{"id":"lex.05300","w":"maze","pos":"noun","ipa":"meɪz","uz":"chigal yo'l, labirint","ru":"лабиринт","ex":["A maze of committees stands between the idea and the money."],"u":"S09U18"},{"id":"lex.05301","w":"labyrinth","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈlæbərɪnθ","uz":"labirint","ru":"запутанная система ходов","ex":["The archive is a labyrinth with one working light."],"u":"S09U18"},{"id":"lex.05302","w":"slipshod","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈslɪpʃɑd","uz":"beparvo bajarilgan","ru":"небрежный","ex":["The record-keeping was slipshod for a decade."],"u":"S09U19"},{"id":"lex.05303","w":"desultory","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈdesəltɔri","uz":"tartibsiz, beixtiyor","ru":"бессистемный, вялый","ex":["A desultory search of two drawers."],"u":"S09U19"},{"id":"lex.05304","w":"sanguine","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈsæŋɡwɪn","uz":"umidvor","ru":"оптимистичный","ex":["He remains sanguine about the deadline."],"u":"S09U19"},{"id":"lex.05305","w":"pessimistic","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌpesɪˈmɪstɪk","uz":"badbin","ru":"пессимистичный","ex":["The pessimistic estimate turned out to be the accurate one."],"u":"S09U19"},{"id":"lex.05306","w":"abiding","pos":"adj","ipa":"əˈbaɪdɪŋ","uz":"barqaror, doimiy","ru":"неизменный, стойкий","ex":["Her abiding interest was in the eighteenth century."],"u":"S09U19"},{"id":"lex.05307","w":"ephemeral","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪˈfemərəl","uz":"o'tkinchi","ru":"эфемерный, недолговечный","ex":["The fashion was ephemeral; the damage was not."],"u":"S09U19"},{"id":"lex.05308","w":"evanescent","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌevəˈnesənt","uz":"tez yo'qoluvchi","ru":"мимолётный","ex":["An evanescent light on the water before dawn."],"u":"S09U19"},{"id":"lex.05309","w":"perennial","pos":"adj","ipa":"pəˈreniəl","uz":"har yili takrorlanuvchi","ru":"постоянный, многолетний","ex":["Drainage is the perennial complaint of the lower village."],"u":"S09U19"},{"id":"lex.05310","w":"inveterate","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪnˈvetərət","uz":"ashaddiy","ru":"закоренелый","ex":["An inveterate note-taker, which is why the record survives."],"u":"S09U19"},{"id":"lex.05311","w":"ingrained","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪnˈɡreɪnd","uz":"ildiz otgan","ru":"укоренившийся","ex":["The practice is ingrained in the whole profession."],"u":"S09U19"},{"id":"lex.05312","w":"subtle","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈsʌtəl","uz":"nozik","ru":"тонкий, едва уловимый","ex":["The difference is subtle and it decides the case."],"u":"S09U19"},{"id":"lex.05313","w":"delicate","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈdelɪkət","uz":"nozik, ehtiyot talab","ru":"деликатный, хрупкий","ex":["A delicate negotiation that one letter could have ruined."],"u":"S09U19"},{"id":"lex.05314","w":"crude","pos":"adj","ipa":"kruːd","uz":"qo'pol, ishlov berilmagan","ru":"грубый, неочищенный","ex":["A crude estimate, and the only one available."],"u":"S09U19"},{"id":"lex.05315","w":"coarse","pos":"adj","ipa":"kɔrs","uz":"dag'al","ru":"грубый","ex":["Coarse cloth that lasted three winters."],"u":"S09U19"},{"id":"lex.05316","w":"doggedness","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdɔɡɪdnəs","uz":"qat'iyat","ru":"упорство","ex":["Sheer doggedness got the archive catalogued."],"u":"S09U19"},{"id":"lex.05317","w":"fortitude","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfɔrtɪtuːd","uz":"matonat","ru":"стойкость","ex":["She bore two years of it with fortitude."],"u":"S09U19"},{"id":"lex.05318","w":"frailty","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfreɪlti","uz":"nochorlik, zaiflik","ru":"хрупкость, слабость","ex":["Age and frailty kept him from the hearing."],"u":"S09U19"},{"id":"lex.05319","w":"craftsmanship","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkræftsmənʃɪp","uz":"hunarmandlik mahorati","ru":"мастерство ремесленника","ex":["The craftsmanship in the doors survived the fire."],"u":"S09U20"},{"id":"lex.05320","w":"workmanship","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈwɜrkmənʃɪp","uz":"ish sifati","ru":"качество работы","ex":["The workmanship is poor and the design is worse."],"u":"S09U20"},{"id":"lex.05321","w":"artistry","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɑrtɪstri","uz":"badiiy mahorat","ru":"артистизм, мастерство","ex":["There is real artistry in the way the argument is arranged."],"u":"S09U20"},{"id":"lex.05322","w":"virtuosity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌvɜrtʃuˈɑsɪti","uz":"virtuozlik","ru":"виртуозность","ex":["The virtuosity is dazzling and the piece says nothing."],"u":"S09U20"},{"id":"lex.05323","w":"elegance","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈeləɡəns","uz":"nafislik","ru":"изящество","ex":["The proof has an elegance the textbook version loses."],"u":"S09U20"},{"id":"lex.05324","w":"grandeur","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɡrændʒər","uz":"ulug'vorlik","ru":"величие","ex":["The grandeur of the hall makes the meetings worse, not better."],"u":"S09U20"},{"id":"lex.05325","w":"magnificence","pos":"noun","ipa":"mæɡˈnɪfɪsəns","uz":"go'zallik va ulug'vorlik","ru":"великолепие","ex":["The magnificence of the tilework is the reason people come."],"u":"S09U20"},{"id":"lex.05326","w":"opulence","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɑpjələns","uz":"hashamat","ru":"роскошь","ex":["The opulence of the entrance hall is not repeated upstairs."],"u":"S09U20"},{"id":"lex.05327","w":"splendour","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsplendər","uz":"salobat, jimjimadorlik","ru":"блеск, великолепие","ex":["The splendour of the courtyard at midday is hard to photograph."],"u":"S09U20"},{"id":"lex.05328","w":"picturesque","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌpɪktʃəˈresk","uz":"go'zal manzarali","ru":"живописный","ex":["The village is picturesque and has no reliable water."],"u":"S09U20"},{"id":"lex.05329","w":"uncanny","pos":"adj","ipa":"ʌnˈkæni","uz":"g'alati, vahimali","ru":"жутковатый, сверхъестественный","ex":["An uncanny resemblance to the earlier draft."],"u":"S09U20"},{"id":"lex.05330","w":"timbre","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtæmbər","uz":"tembr","ru":"тембр","ex":["You would know the timbre of that voice anywhere."],"u":"S09U20"},{"id":"lex.05331","w":"resonance","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈrezənəns","uz":"jaranglash, aks-sado","ru":"резонанс, отзвук","ex":["The phrase has a resonance the translation loses."],"u":"S09U20"},{"id":"lex.05332","w":"tempo","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtempoʊ","uz":"sur'at","ru":"темп","ex":["The tempo of the second half is far too fast."],"u":"S09U20"},{"id":"lex.05333","w":"lilt","pos":"noun","ipa":"lɪlt","uz":"ohangdorlik","ru":"певучесть, напевность","ex":["There is a lilt in the way they speak in the west."],"u":"S09U20"},{"id":"lex.05334","w":"drawl","pos":"noun","ipa":"drɔl","uz":"cho'zib gapirish","ru":"протяжная речь","ex":["He answered in a drawl that gave nothing away."],"u":"S09U20"},{"id":"lex.05335","w":"hue","pos":"noun","ipa":"hjuː","uz":"rang tusi","ru":"оттенок","ex":["The walls have taken on a yellow hue."],"u":"S09U20"},{"id":"lex.05336","w":"enmity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈenmɪti","uz":"dushmanlik","ru":"вражда","ex":["The enmity outlasted everyone who remembered its cause."],"u":"S09U21"},{"id":"lex.05337","w":"kinship","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkɪnʃɪp","uz":"qarindoshlik","ru":"родство","ex":["Kinship decided who inherited the land."],"u":"S09U21"},{"id":"lex.05338","w":"affinity","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈfɪnɪti","uz":"yaqinlik, o'xshashlik","ru":"сродство, близость","ex":["He has an affinity for languages and no patience for grammar."],"u":"S09U21"},{"id":"lex.05339","w":"rift","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪft","uz":"yoriq, nizo","ru":"разрыв, трещина","ex":["The rift between the two departments lasted a decade."],"u":"S09U21"},{"id":"lex.05340","w":"schism","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈskɪzəm","uz":"parchalanish","ru":"раскол","ex":["The schism of 1904 has never been repaired."],"u":"S09U21"},{"id":"lex.05341","w":"feud","pos":"noun","ipa":"fjuːd","uz":"qon-qasos, uzoq janjal","ru":"вражда, распря","ex":["The feud outlived both of the men who started it."],"u":"S09U21"},{"id":"lex.05342","w":"rivalry","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈraɪvəlri","uz":"raqobat","ru":"соперничество","ex":["The rivalry between the two schools is friendly and permanent."],"u":"S09U21"},{"id":"lex.05343","w":"agglomeration","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˌɡlɑməˈreɪʃən","uz":"to'planma","ru":"скопление, агломерация","ex":["The city is an agglomeration of eleven former villages."],"u":"S09U21"},{"id":"lex.05344","w":"chokepoint","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtʃoʊkpɔɪnt","uz":"tor o'tish joyi","ru":"узкое место","ex":["The single bridge is the chokepoint of the whole district."],"u":"S09U21"},{"id":"lex.05345","w":"transmission","pos":"noun","ipa":"trænzˈmɪʃən","uz":"uzatish","ru":"передача","ex":["Transmission of the text depends on two manuscripts."],"u":"S09U21"},{"id":"lex.05346","w":"tremor","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtremər","uz":"silkinish, titroq","ru":"толчок, дрожь","ex":["A tremor was felt as far as the coast."],"u":"S09U21"},{"id":"lex.05347","w":"aftershock","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈæftərʃɑk","uz":"takroriy zilzila","ru":"афтершок, повторный толчок","ex":["The aftershocks went on for three weeks."],"u":"S09U21"},{"id":"lex.05348","w":"deluge","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdeljuːdʒ","uz":"to'fon","ru":"потоп, ливень","ex":["The deluge of 1962 took the lower bridge."],"u":"S09U21"},{"id":"lex.05349","w":"downpour","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdaʊnpɔr","uz":"jala","ru":"ливень","ex":["They waited out the downpour under the eaves."],"u":"S09U21"},{"id":"lex.05350","w":"gale","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɡeɪl","uz":"kuchli shamol","ru":"штормовой ветер","ex":["The gale took the roof off the school."],"u":"S09U21"},{"id":"lex.05351","w":"gust","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɡʌst","uz":"shamol shiddati","ru":"порыв ветра","ex":["A gust took the papers off the table."],"u":"S09U21"},{"id":"lex.05352","w":"squall","pos":"noun","ipa":"skwɔl","uz":"bo'ron, shiddatli shamol","ru":"шквал","ex":["A squall came off the lake without warning."],"u":"S09U21"},{"id":"lex.05353","w":"forthwith","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˌfɔrθˈwɪθ","uz":"zudlik bilan","ru":"незамедлительно","ex":["The licence is revoked forthwith."],"u":"S09U22"},{"id":"lex.05354","w":"inasmuch","pos":"adv","ipa":"ˌɪnəzˈmʌtʃ","uz":"shu darajadaki","ru":"постольку поскольку","ex":["The rule applies inasmuch as the land is registered."],"u":"S09U22"},{"id":"lex.05355","w":"wherein","pos":"adv","ipa":"werˈɪn","uz":"unda, qay jihatdan","ru":"в чём, где","ex":["The clause, wherein the duty is set out, was never amended."],"u":"S09U22"},{"id":"lex.05356","w":"flicker","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈflɪkər","uz":"miltillash","ru":"мерцание, проблеск","ex":["A flicker of light showed under the door."],"u":"S09U22"},{"id":"lex.05357","w":"glimmer","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɡlɪmər","uz":"xira yorug'lik","ru":"слабый отблеск","ex":["A glimmer of lamplight across the courtyard."],"u":"S09U22"},{"id":"lex.05358","w":"shimmer","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈʃɪmər","uz":"jilva","ru":"мерцание, переливание","ex":["The shimmer of heat over the road at noon."],"u":"S09U22"},{"id":"lex.05359","w":"sheen","pos":"noun","ipa":"ʃiːn","uz":"yaltiroqlik","ru":"блеск, лоск","ex":["The sheen on the old table came from a century of use."],"u":"S09U22"},{"id":"lex.05360","w":"lustre","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈlʌstər","uz":"yaltiroqlik, shon","ru":"мягкое сияние","ex":["The glaze has lost none of its lustre in six hundred years."],"u":"S09U22"},{"id":"lex.05361","w":"patina","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpætɪnə","uz":"vaqt izi, patina","ru":"патина, налёт времени","ex":["A green patina on the bronze."],"u":"S09U22"},{"id":"lex.05362","w":"tint","pos":"noun","ipa":"tɪnt","uz":"engil tus","ru":"лёгкий оттенок","ex":["A blue tint in the old window glass."],"u":"S09U22"},{"id":"lex.05363","w":"mist","pos":"noun","ipa":"mɪst","uz":"tuman","ru":"туман, дымка","ex":["Mist lies in the valley until nine most mornings."],"u":"S09U22"},{"id":"lex.05364","w":"haze","pos":"noun","ipa":"heɪz","uz":"g'uborli havo","ru":"дымка, марево","ex":["A haze of dust hung over the quarry all afternoon."],"u":"S09U22"},{"id":"lex.05365","w":"murk","pos":"noun","ipa":"mɜrk","uz":"qorong'ilik","ru":"мрак, мгла","ex":["They found the gate by feel in the murk."],"u":"S09U22"},{"id":"lex.05366","w":"drone","pos":"noun","ipa":"droʊn","uz":"g'uvillash","ru":"гул, монотонный звук","ex":["The drone of the generator carried across the water."],"u":"S09U22"},{"id":"lex.05367","w":"hum","pos":"noun","ipa":"hʌm","uz":"shovqin, g'uvur","ru":"гул, гудение","ex":["The hum of the transformer never quite stops."],"u":"S09U22"},{"id":"lex.05368","w":"swarm","pos":"noun","ipa":"swɔrm","uz":"to'da, gala","ru":"рой, толпа","ex":["A swarm of bees settled on the gate."],"u":"S09U22"},{"id":"lex.05369","w":"throng","pos":"noun","ipa":"θrɔŋ","uz":"olomon","ru":"толпа","ex":["A throng filled the square by eight in the morning."],"u":"S09U22"},{"id":"lex.05370","w":"bulwark","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈbʊlwərk","uz":"himoya qalqoni","ru":"оплот, бастион","ex":["An independent press is a bulwark against exactly this."],"u":"S09U23"},{"id":"lex.05371","w":"caprice","pos":"noun","ipa":"kəˈpriːs","uz":"injiqlik","ru":"каприз, прихоть","ex":["The timetable changes at the caprice of one official."],"u":"S09U23"},{"id":"lex.05372","w":"whim","pos":"noun","ipa":"wɪm","uz":"hafsala, xohish","ru":"прихоть","ex":["He bought the house on a whim and kept it forty years."],"u":"S09U23"},{"id":"lex.05373","w":"vagary","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈveɪɡəri","uz":"beqarorlik, o'zgaruvchanlik","ru":"причуда, непредсказуемость","ex":["The harvest depends on the vagaries of the monsoon."],"u":"S09U23"},{"id":"lex.05374","w":"vacillation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌvæsəˈleɪʃən","uz":"ikkilanish","ru":"колебания, нерешительность","ex":["Two years of vacillation and then a decision in an afternoon."],"u":"S09U23"},{"id":"lex.05375","w":"propriety","pos":"noun","ipa":"prəˈpraɪɪti","uz":"odob, o'rinlilik","ru":"приличие, уместность","ex":["He questioned the propriety of the appointment, not its legality."],"u":"S09U23"},{"id":"lex.05376","w":"decorum","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˈkɔrəm","uz":"odob-axloq qoidalari","ru":"приличия, этикет","ex":["Decorum was maintained and nothing was said."],"u":"S09U23"},{"id":"lex.05377","w":"frugality","pos":"noun","ipa":"fruːˈɡælɪti","uz":"isrofdan qochish","ru":"нерасточительность","ex":["Her frugality was a habit, not a necessity."],"u":"S09U23"},{"id":"lex.05378","w":"parsimony","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpɑrsɪmoʊni","uz":"xasislik; soddalik tamoyili","ru":"скупость; экономия принципов","ex":["The parsimony of the budget shows in every corridor."],"u":"S09U23"},{"id":"lex.05379","w":"largesse","pos":"noun","ipa":"lɑrˈdʒes","uz":"saxovat","ru":"щедрость","ex":["The library was built out of one family's largesse."],"u":"S09U23"},{"id":"lex.05380","w":"zeal","pos":"noun","ipa":"ziːl","uz":"g'ayrat","ru":"рвение, усердие","ex":["He pursued the reform with a zeal that alarmed his allies."],"u":"S09U23"},{"id":"lex.05381","w":"fervour","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfɜrvər","uz":"jo'shqinlik","ru":"пыл, страсть","ex":["The fervour of the first year did not survive the second."],"u":"S09U23"},{"id":"lex.05382","w":"ardour","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɑrdər","uz":"ishtiyoq","ru":"пыл, рвение","ex":["His ardour for the project cooled once the costing arrived."],"u":"S09U23"},{"id":"lex.05383","w":"vehemence","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈviːəməns","uz":"qattiqqo'llik, shiddat","ru":"горячность, неистовость","ex":["The vehemence of the denial surprised everyone."],"u":"S09U23"},{"id":"lex.05384","w":"languor","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈlæŋɡər","uz":"bo'shashganlik","ru":"томление, вялость","ex":["The languor of the afternoon stopped all work."],"u":"S09U23"},{"id":"lex.05385","w":"lassitude","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈlæsɪtuːd","uz":"holsizlik","ru":"усталость, апатия","ex":["A general lassitude followed the second refusal."],"u":"S09U23"},{"id":"lex.05386","w":"apathy","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈæpəθi","uz":"loqaydlik","ru":"апатия, безразличие","ex":["Apathy, not hostility, explains the turnout."],"u":"S09U23"},{"id":"lex.05387","w":"torpor","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtɔrpər","uz":"uyquga o'xshash holat","ru":"оцепенение, вялость","ex":["The department sank into a torpor nobody disturbed."],"u":"S09U24"},{"id":"lex.05388","w":"countenance","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkaʊntənəns","uz":"yuz ifodasi","ru":"выражение лица","ex":["His countenance gave nothing away at all."],"u":"S09U24"},{"id":"lex.05389","w":"demeanour","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˈmiːnər","uz":"o'zini tutishi","ru":"манера держаться","ex":["Her demeanour in the hearing was faultless."],"u":"S09U24"},{"id":"lex.05390","w":"gait","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɡeɪt","uz":"yurish tarzi","ru":"походка","ex":["You could recognise his gait from the far end of the yard."],"u":"S09U24"},{"id":"lex.05391","w":"revival","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈvaɪvəl","uz":"qayta jonlanish","ru":"возрождение, возобновление","ex":["The revival of the craft began with two families."],"u":"S09U24"},{"id":"lex.05392","w":"renaissance","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌrenəˈsɑns","uz":"uyg'onish davri","ru":"возрождение, ренессанс","ex":["The town has had a modest renaissance since the road reopened."],"u":"S09U24"},{"id":"lex.05393","w":"resurgence","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈsɜrdʒəns","uz":"qayta kuchayish","ru":"возрождение, подъём","ex":["A resurgence of interest followed the anniversary."],"u":"S09U24"},{"id":"lex.05394","w":"quarterly","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈkwɔrtərli","uz":"choraklik","ru":"ежеквартальный","ex":["The quarterly return is due on the fifteenth."],"u":"S09U24"},{"id":"lex.05395","w":"cultural","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈkʌltʃərəl","uz":"madaniy","ru":"культурный","ex":["The cultural argument for the building outlived the economic one."],"u":"S09U24"},{"id":"lex.05396","w":"social","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈsoʊʃəl","uz":"ijtimoiy","ru":"социальный, общественный","ex":["Social mobility stalled in the same decade."],"u":"S09U24"},{"id":"lex.05397","w":"symbolic","pos":"adj","ipa":"sɪmˈbɑlɪk","uz":"ramziy","ru":"символический","ex":["The payment was symbolic and everyone understood it as such."],"u":"S09U24"},{"id":"lex.05398","w":"infirmity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪnˈfɜrmɪti","uz":"nochorlik","ru":"немощь","ex":["Infirmity kept him from the last two meetings."],"u":"S09U24"},{"id":"lex.05399","w":"vigour","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈvɪɡər","uz":"jo'shqinlik, quvvat","ru":"энергия, сила","ex":["He defended the plan with unexpected vigour."],"u":"S09U24"},{"id":"lex.05400","w":"vitality","pos":"noun","ipa":"vaɪˈtælɪti","uz":"hayotiylik","ru":"жизненная сила","ex":["The vitality of the bazaar has survived every plan to improve it."],"u":"S09U24"},{"id":"lex.05401","w":"diffusion","pos":"noun","ipa":"dɪˈfjuːʒən","uz":"asta-sekin tarqalish","ru":"распространение, диффузия","ex":["Diffusion of the technique took two generations."],"u":"S09U24"},{"id":"lex.05402","w":"audacity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɔˈdæsɪti","uz":"jasorat; beadablik","ru":"дерзость, смелость","ex":["The audacity of the proposal is what recommends it."],"u":"S09U24"},{"id":"lex.05403","w":"abject","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈæbdʒekt","uz":"tubandan tuban","ru":"жалкий, крайний","ex":["Abject poverty within a mile of the new offices."],"u":"S09U24"},{"id":"lex.05404","w":"bestow","pos":"verb","ipa":"bɪˈstoʊ","uz":"in'om etmoq","ru":"даровать, жаловать","ex":["The title was bestowed in 1911 and has meant nothing since."],"u":"S09U24"},{"id":"lex.05405","w":"disinterested","pos":"adj","ipa":"dɪsˈɪntrəstɪd","uz":"manfaatdor bo'lmagan","ru":"беспристрастный","ex":["A disinterested review, which is not the same as an uninterested one."],"u":"S09U24"},{"id":"lex.05406","w":"archaic","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɑrˈkeɪɪk","uz":"eskirgan, arxaik","ru":"архаичный","ex":["The wording is archaic and nobody has amended it since 1911."],"u":"S10U01"},{"id":"lex.05407","w":"hoary","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈhɔri","uz":"eskirib qolgan","ru":"избитый, замшелый","ex":["The hoary argument about standards appears every generation."],"u":"S10U01"},{"id":"lex.05408","w":"hackneyed","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈhæknid","uz":"ko'p ishlatilib zerikarli bo'lgan","ru":"избитый, затасканный","ex":["The phrase is hackneyed and he used it three times."],"u":"S10U01"},{"id":"lex.05409","w":"banal","pos":"adj","ipa":"bəˈnɑl","uz":"bachkana, oddiy","ru":"банальный","ex":["The conclusion is banal and the method is not."],"u":"S10U01"},{"id":"lex.05410","w":"quotidian","pos":"adj","ipa":"kwoʊˈtɪdiən","uz":"kundalik, oddiy","ru":"повседневный","ex":["The diary records the quotidian business of a small office."],"u":"S10U01"},{"id":"lex.05411","w":"mundane","pos":"adj","ipa":"mʌnˈdeɪn","uz":"zerikarli, kundalik","ru":"будничный, приземлённый","ex":["Most of the archive is mundane and two pages are not."],"u":"S10U01"},{"id":"lex.05412","w":"prosaic","pos":"adj","ipa":"proʊˈzeɪɪk","uz":"quruq, badiiy bo'lmagan","ru":"прозаичный","ex":["The prosaic answer is that nobody had the key."],"u":"S10U01"},{"id":"lex.05413","w":"rudimentary","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌrudɪˈmentəri","uz":"boshlang'ich, sodda","ru":"рудиментарный, зачаточный","ex":["The filing system is rudimentary and it has survived a century."],"u":"S10U01"},{"id":"lex.05414","w":"facile","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈfæsəl","uz":"yuzaki, yengil-yelpi","ru":"поверхностный, лёгкий","ex":["That is a facile comparison and it will not survive a question."],"u":"S10U01"},{"id":"lex.05415","w":"jejune","pos":"adj","ipa":"dʒɪˈdʒun","uz":"sayoz, yetuk emas","ru":"поверхностный, незрелый","ex":["The essay is jejune in its first half and serious in its second."],"u":"S10U01"},{"id":"lex.05416","w":"insipid","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪnˈsɪpɪd","uz":"mazasiz, jonsiz","ru":"пресный, безвкусный","ex":["The prose is insipid and the argument underneath it is not."],"u":"S10U01"},{"id":"lex.05417","w":"vapid","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈvæpɪd","uz":"bo'sh, mazmunsiz","ru":"пустой, бессодержательный","ex":["A vapid speech that took forty minutes."],"u":"S10U01"},{"id":"lex.05418","w":"anodyne","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈænədaɪn","uz":"betaraf, zararsiz","ru":"нейтральный, обтекаемый","ex":["The statement was anodyne, which was its purpose."],"u":"S10U01"},{"id":"lex.05419","w":"pellucid","pos":"adj","ipa":"pəˈlusɪd","uz":"tiniq, ravshan","ru":"прозрачный, ясный","ex":["Her prose is pellucid on a subject that defeats most writers."],"u":"S10U01"},{"id":"lex.05420","w":"limpid","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈlɪmpɪd","uz":"tiniq, sof","ru":"прозрачный, чистый","ex":["A limpid account of a very tangled affair."],"u":"S10U01"},{"id":"lex.05421","w":"lucid","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈlusɪd","uz":"aniq, tushunarli","ru":"ясный, вразумительный","ex":["He was lucid for an hour each morning."],"u":"S10U01"},{"id":"lex.05422","w":"perspicuous","pos":"adj","ipa":"pərˈspɪkjuəs","uz":"ravshan ifodalangan","ru":"вразумительный, внятный","ex":["A perspicuous statement of a position I disagree with."],"u":"S10U01"},{"id":"lex.05423","w":"abstruse","pos":"adj","ipa":"əbˈstrus","uz":"tushunish qiyin, murakkab","ru":"труднопонимаемый, отвлечённый","ex":["The argument is abstruse and it is not obscure."],"u":"S10U01"},{"id":"lex.05424","w":"recondite","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈrekəndaɪt","uz":"chuqur bilim talab qiladigan","ru":"малоизвестный, узкоспециальный","ex":["A recondite question that two people in the world can answer."],"u":"S10U01"},{"id":"lex.05425","w":"esoteric","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌesəˈterɪk","uz":"tor doiraga tushunarli","ru":"эзотерический, узкий","ex":["The dispute is esoteric and the consequences are not."],"u":"S10U01"},{"id":"lex.05426","w":"arcane","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɑrˈkeɪn","uz":"sirli, kam ma'lum","ru":"таинственный, тёмный","ex":["An arcane procedure that two clerks still remember."],"u":"S10U01"},{"id":"lex.05427","w":"hermetic","pos":"adj","ipa":"hərˈmetɪk","uz":"yopiq, kirib bo'lmas","ru":"герметичный, замкнутый","ex":["The department is hermetic and proud of it."],"u":"S10U01"},{"id":"lex.05428","w":"opaque","pos":"adj","ipa":"oʊˈpeɪk","uz":"xira, tushunarsiz","ru":"непрозрачный, невразумительный","ex":["The accounts are opaque and the auditor said so."],"u":"S10U01"},{"id":"lex.05429","w":"sardonic","pos":"adj","ipa":"sɑrˈdɑnɪk","uz":"zaharxanda","ru":"сардонический","ex":["A sardonic note in the margin, unsigned."],"u":"S10U02"},{"id":"lex.05430","w":"saturnine","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈsætərnaɪn","uz":"ma'yus, qovoq soluvchi","ru":"угрюмый по натуре","ex":["A saturnine man who turned out to be the kindest of them."],"u":"S10U02"},{"id":"lex.05431","w":"wry","pos":"adj","ipa":"raɪ","uz":"kinoyali, achchiq kulgili","ru":"кривой, ироничный","ex":["A wry note at the end of an otherwise formal letter."],"u":"S10U02"},{"id":"lex.05432","w":"acerbic","pos":"adj","ipa":"əˈsɜrbɪk","uz":"achchiq, keskin","ru":"едкий, язвительный","ex":["His acerbic review ended a friendship."],"u":"S10U02"},{"id":"lex.05433","w":"sententious","pos":"adj","ipa":"senˈtenʃəs","uz":"nasihatgo'y","ru":"нравоучительный","ex":["The final paragraph is sententious and the rest is not."],"u":"S10U02"},{"id":"lex.05434","w":"laconic","pos":"adj","ipa":"ləˈkɑnɪk","uz":"kamgap, ixcham","ru":"лаконичный","ex":["His laconic reply was one word and it settled the matter."],"u":"S10U02"},{"id":"lex.05435","w":"taciturn","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈtæsɪtɜrn","uz":"kamgap","ru":"молчаливый","ex":["A taciturn driver who knew every road in the district."],"u":"S10U02"},{"id":"lex.05436","w":"reticent","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈretɪsənt","uz":"kamgap, o'zini tiygan","ru":"сдержанный, неразговорчивый","ex":["She is reticent about the years in Moscow."],"u":"S10U02"},{"id":"lex.05437","w":"oblique","pos":"adj","ipa":"oʊˈblik","uz":"bilvosita, ishorali","ru":"косвенный, непрямой","ex":["An oblique reference that only two readers would catch."],"u":"S10U02"},{"id":"lex.05438","w":"surreptitious","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌsɜrəpˈtɪʃəs","uz":"yashirincha","ru":"тайный, украдкой","ex":["A surreptitious glance at the clock."],"u":"S10U02"},{"id":"lex.05439","w":"furtive","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈfɜrtɪv","uz":"o'g'rincha","ru":"вороватый, скрытный","ex":["There was something furtive about the whole transaction."],"u":"S10U02"},{"id":"lex.05440","w":"clandestine","pos":"adj","ipa":"klænˈdestɪn","uz":"maxfiy, yashirin","ru":"подпольный, тайный","ex":["A clandestine meeting in a building neither of them owned."],"u":"S10U02"},{"id":"lex.05441","w":"insouciance","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪnˈsusiəns","uz":"beparvolik, xotirjamlik","ru":"беспечность","ex":["He signed with an insouciance the lawyers found alarming."],"u":"S10U02"},{"id":"lex.05442","w":"levity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈlevɪti","uz":"yengiltaklik","ru":"легкомыслие","ex":["A moment of levity in an otherwise grim afternoon."],"u":"S10U02"},{"id":"lex.05443","w":"flippant","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈflɪpənt","uz":"yengil-yelpi munosabatda","ru":"легкомысленный, несерьёзный","ex":["The answer was flippant and the question was not."],"u":"S10U02"},{"id":"lex.05444","w":"jocular","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈdʒɑkjələr","uz":"hazilkash","ru":"шутливый","ex":["A jocular chairman who got through the agenda in an hour."],"u":"S10U02"},{"id":"lex.05445","w":"ribald","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈrɪbəld","uz":"beadab hazilli","ru":"скабрёзный","ex":["A ribald song that the older men still knew."],"u":"S10U02"},{"id":"lex.05446","w":"risible","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈrɪzəbəl","uz":"kulgili darajada yomon","ru":"смехотворный","ex":["The defence was risible and the court said so."],"u":"S10U02"},{"id":"lex.05447","w":"piquant","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈpikənt","uz":"o'tkir, qiziqarli","ru":"пикантный, острый","ex":["A piquant detail that the official account omits."],"u":"S10U02"},{"id":"lex.05448","w":"pungent","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈpʌndʒənt","uz":"o'tkir hidli; keskin","ru":"едкий, острый","ex":["A pungent smell of smoke on the upper floor."],"u":"S10U02"},{"id":"lex.05449","w":"bathos","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈbeɪθɑs","uz":"pafosdan kulgiga tushish","ru":"переход от возвышенного к смешному","ex":["The speech ended in bathos with a remark about parking."],"u":"S10U02"},{"id":"lex.05450","w":"lampoon","pos":"noun","ipa":"læmˈpun","uz":"hajviy hujum","ru":"памфлет, сатира","ex":["The lampoon was anonymous and everyone knew the author."],"u":"S10U02"},{"id":"lex.05451","w":"repartee","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌrepərˈti","uz":"hozirjavoblik","ru":"остроумные реплики","ex":["The repartee was the only memorable part of the evening."],"u":"S10U02"},{"id":"lex.05452","w":"badinage","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌbædɪˈnɑʒ","uz":"hazil-mutoyiba","ru":"подтрунивание","ex":["Ten minutes of badinage before anyone mentioned the agenda."],"u":"S10U03"},{"id":"lex.05453","w":"screed","pos":"noun","ipa":"skrid","uz":"uzun jahldor maqola","ru":"пространная тирада","ex":["A four-page screed that nobody answered."],"u":"S10U03"},{"id":"lex.05454","w":"harangue","pos":"noun","ipa":"həˈræŋ","uz":"qattiq nutq","ru":"гневная речь, разнос","ex":["The meeting opened with a harangue about timekeeping."],"u":"S10U03"},{"id":"lex.05455","w":"invective","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪnˈvektɪv","uz":"haqorat, so'kish","ru":"брань, инвектива","ex":["The letter descends into invective on the second page."],"u":"S10U03"},{"id":"lex.05456","w":"vitriol","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈvɪtriəl","uz":"zahar-zaqqum tanqid","ru":"злоба, яд","ex":["The vitriol in the review said more about its author."],"u":"S10U03"},{"id":"lex.05457","w":"vituperate","pos":"verb","ipa":"vaɪˈtupəreɪt","uz":"qattiq so'kmoq","ru":"поносить, бранить","ex":["He vituperated against the committee for an hour."],"u":"S10U03"},{"id":"lex.05458","w":"fulminate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈfʊlmɪneɪt","uz":"qattiq norozilik bildirmoq","ru":"метать громы и молнии","ex":["He fulminated against the reform in every issue for a year."],"u":"S10U03"},{"id":"lex.05459","w":"inveigh","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪnˈveɪ","uz":"qarshi keskin chiqmoq","ru":"обрушиваться с нападками","ex":["She inveighed against the practice for thirty years and then it stopped."],"u":"S10U03"},{"id":"lex.05460","w":"lambast","pos":"verb","ipa":"læmˈbæst","uz":"qattiq tanqid qilmoq","ru":"резко критиковать","ex":["The report lambasts a department that no longer exists."],"u":"S10U03"},{"id":"lex.05461","w":"upbraid","pos":"verb","ipa":"ʌpˈbreɪd","uz":"tanbeh bermoq","ru":"упрекать, отчитывать","ex":["She upbraided him for signing without reading it."],"u":"S10U03"},{"id":"lex.05462","w":"berate","pos":"verb","ipa":"bɪˈreɪt","uz":"urishmoq, koyimoq","ru":"бранить, распекать","ex":["He berated the clerk over a delay that was not hers."],"u":"S10U03"},{"id":"lex.05463","w":"castigate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈkæstɪɡeɪt","uz":"qattiq qoralamoq","ru":"подвергать резкой критике","ex":["The judgment castigates both parties and helps neither."],"u":"S10U03"},{"id":"lex.05464","w":"admonish","pos":"verb","ipa":"ədˈmɑnɪʃ","uz":"ogohlantirib tanbeh bermoq","ru":"увещевать, делать замечание","ex":["The chair admonished him mildly and moved on."],"u":"S10U03"},{"id":"lex.05465","w":"chasten","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈtʃeɪsən","uz":"hovridan tushirmoq","ru":"смирять, отрезвлять","ex":["The result chastened everyone who had predicted it."],"u":"S10U03"},{"id":"lex.05466","w":"decry","pos":"verb","ipa":"dɪˈkraɪ","uz":"ochiq qoralamoq","ru":"осуждать, порицать","ex":["Two ministers decried a practice their own department used."],"u":"S10U03"},{"id":"lex.05467","w":"denigrate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈdenɪɡreɪt","uz":"obro'sizlantirmoq","ru":"очернять","ex":["Nothing in the report denigrates the staff who stayed."],"u":"S10U03"},{"id":"lex.05468","w":"disparage","pos":"verb","ipa":"dɪˈspærɪdʒ","uz":"kamsitmoq","ru":"принижать, умалять","ex":["He disparaged the method and then adopted it."],"u":"S10U03"},{"id":"lex.05469","w":"deride","pos":"verb","ipa":"dɪˈraɪd","uz":"masxara qilmoq","ru":"высмеивать","ex":["The proposal was derided and adopted eleven years later."],"u":"S10U03"},{"id":"lex.05470","w":"malign","pos":"verb","ipa":"məˈlaɪn","uz":"tuhmat qilmoq","ru":"злословить, клеветать","ex":["The much-maligned second inspection found the crack."],"u":"S10U03"},{"id":"lex.05471","w":"traduce","pos":"verb","ipa":"trəˈdus","uz":"buzib ko'rsatib obro'sizlantirmoq","ru":"порочить, клеветать","ex":["The pamphlet traduces a man who could not reply."],"u":"S10U03"},{"id":"lex.05472","w":"vilify","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈvɪlɪfaɪ","uz":"badnom qilmoq","ru":"поносить, чернить","ex":["She was vilified for four years and then quietly vindicated."],"u":"S10U03"},{"id":"lex.05473","w":"calumny","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkæləmni","uz":"tuhmat","ru":"клевета","ex":["The charge was calumny and the paper printed it twice."],"u":"S10U03"},{"id":"lex.05474","w":"obloquy","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɑbləkwi","uz":"umumiy qoralash, sharmandalik","ru":"поношение, позор","ex":["He lived his last years in obloquy and was right all along."],"u":"S10U03"},{"id":"lex.05475","w":"conundrum","pos":"noun","ipa":"kəˈnʌndrəm","uz":"jumboq","ru":"головоломка, дилемма","ex":["The funding conundrum has defeated three committees."],"u":"S10U04"},{"id":"lex.05476","w":"quandary","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkwɑndəri","uz":"ikkilanish holati","ru":"затруднительное положение","ex":["The quandary was real and the deadline was not moving."],"u":"S10U04"},{"id":"lex.05477","w":"nebulous","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈnebjələs","uz":"noaniq, mavhum","ru":"расплывчатый","ex":["The plan is nebulous where it needs to be exact."],"u":"S10U04"},{"id":"lex.05478","w":"amorphous","pos":"adj","ipa":"əˈmɔrfəs","uz":"shaklsiz","ru":"аморфный, бесформенный","ex":["An amorphous group with no officers and considerable influence."],"u":"S10U04"},{"id":"lex.05479","w":"inchoate","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪnˈkoʊət","uz":"shakllanmagan","ru":"зачаточный, неоформленный","ex":["An inchoate plan that took another decade to become one."],"u":"S10U04"},{"id":"lex.05480","w":"protean","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈproʊtiən","uz":"o'zgaruvchan","ru":"изменчивый, многоликий","ex":["A protean term that means something different in each chapter."],"u":"S10U04"},{"id":"lex.05481","w":"multifarious","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌmʌltɪˈferiəs","uz":"rang-barang","ru":"многообразный","ex":["The multifarious duties of a village registrar."],"u":"S10U04"},{"id":"lex.05482","w":"variegated","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈveriəɡeɪtɪd","uz":"xilma-xil, rang-barang","ru":"пёстрый, разнообразный","ex":["A variegated collection that no catalogue has ever ordered."],"u":"S10U04"},{"id":"lex.05483","w":"sundry","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈsʌndri","uz":"turli-tuman","ru":"разный, всякий","ex":["Sundry expenses came to more than the main item."],"u":"S10U04"},{"id":"lex.05484","w":"singular","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈsɪŋɡjələr","uz":"g'oyat o'ziga xos","ru":"исключительный, необычайный","ex":["A singular achievement for a department of four people."],"u":"S10U04"},{"id":"lex.05485","w":"apocryphal","pos":"adj","ipa":"əˈpɑkrɪfəl","uz":"to'qima, asossiz","ru":"недостоверный, апокрифический","ex":["The story is apocryphal and it has been told for a century."],"u":"S10U04"},{"id":"lex.05486","w":"dissonance","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈdɪsənəns","uz":"nomuvofiqlik","ru":"диссонанс, разлад","ex":["There is a dissonance between the summary and the findings."],"u":"S10U04"},{"id":"lex.05487","w":"consonant","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈkɑnsənənt","uz":"mos, uyg'un","ru":"созвучный, согласующийся","ex":["The finding is consonant with everything else we know."],"u":"S10U04"},{"id":"lex.05488","w":"euphony","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈjufəni","uz":"ohangdorlik","ru":"благозвучие","ex":["He rewrote the line for euphony and lost the sense."],"u":"S10U04"},{"id":"lex.05489","w":"shibboleth","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈʃɪbəleθ","uz":"guruh belgisi bo'lgan so'z","ru":"пароль, отличительный признак","ex":["The pronunciation became a shibboleth during the dispute."],"u":"S10U04"},{"id":"lex.05490","w":"anathema","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈnæθəmə","uz":"nafratlanarli narsa","ru":"анафема, нечто неприемлемое","ex":["Delay was anathema to him and he caused most of it."],"u":"S10U04"},{"id":"lex.05491","w":"paragon","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpærəɡɑn","uz":"namuna, ibrat","ru":"образец, эталон","ex":["She was no paragon and she was better than the alternative."],"u":"S10U04"},{"id":"lex.05492","w":"pariah","pos":"noun","ipa":"pəˈraɪə","uz":"chetlatilgan odam","ru":"изгой","ex":["He was a pariah for four years and then the report appeared."],"u":"S10U04"},{"id":"lex.05493","w":"panacea","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌpænəˈsiə","uz":"hamma dardga davo","ru":"панацея","ex":["Nobody claims the scheme is a panacea, and the press did."],"u":"S10U04"},{"id":"lex.05494","w":"sinecure","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsaɪnɪkjʊr","uz":"ishsiz maosh o'rni","ru":"синекура","ex":["The chairmanship was a sinecure until the inquiry began."],"u":"S10U04"},{"id":"lex.05495","w":"coterie","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkoʊtəri","uz":"tor doira","ru":"узкий круг, клика","ex":["A coterie of four decided everything for a decade."],"u":"S10U04"},{"id":"lex.05496","w":"amalgam","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈmælɡəm","uz":"aralashma","ru":"смесь, амальгама","ex":["The rule is an amalgam of three older ones and fits none of them."],"u":"S10U04"},{"id":"lex.05497","w":"vestige","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈvestɪdʒ","uz":"qoldiq iz","ru":"след, остаток","ex":["A vestige of the old boundary survives in the field names."],"u":"S10U04"},{"id":"lex.05498","w":"obsequious","pos":"adj","ipa":"əbˈsikwiəs","uz":"haddan ortiq xushomad qiluvchi","ru":"подобострастный","ex":["His manner with the director was obsequious and everyone noticed."],"u":"S10U05"},{"id":"lex.05499","w":"obsequiousness","pos":"noun","ipa":"əbˈsikwiəsnəs","uz":"laganbardorlik odati","ru":"раболепие перед начальством","ex":["The obsequiousness of the whole meeting was hard to sit through."],"u":"S10U05"},{"id":"lex.05500","w":"servile","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈsɜrvəl","uz":"qullarcha tobe","ru":"рабский, угодливый","ex":["The tone of the letter is servile where it should be firm."],"u":"S10U05"},{"id":"lex.05501","w":"sycophant","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsɪkəfænt","uz":"laganbardor","ru":"подхалим","ex":["He surrounded himself with sycophants and heard nothing useful."],"u":"S10U05"},{"id":"lex.05502","w":"unctuous","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈʌŋktʃuəs","uz":"yasama iltifotli","ru":"елейный","ex":["The unctuous introduction lasted four minutes and said nothing."],"u":"S10U05"},{"id":"lex.05503","w":"supercilious","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌsupərˈsɪliəs","uz":"mensimay qaraydigan","ru":"высокомерный, презрительный","ex":["A supercilious glance at the questioner, and then no answer."],"u":"S10U05"},{"id":"lex.05504","w":"imperious","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪmˈpɪriəs","uz":"hukmron ohangdagi","ru":"властный","ex":["She waved the objection away with one imperious gesture."],"u":"S10U05"},{"id":"lex.05505","w":"peremptory","pos":"adj","ipa":"pəˈremptəri","uz":"e'tirozga o'rin qoldirmaydigan","ru":"безапелляционный","ex":["A peremptory note told them the meeting had moved to Tuesday."],"u":"S10U05"},{"id":"lex.05506","w":"officious","pos":"adj","ipa":"əˈfɪʃəs","uz":"o'zini oraga suqadigan","ru":"назойливо-услужливый","ex":["An officious clerk sent her back for a form nobody else asked for."],"u":"S10U05"},{"id":"lex.05507","w":"hauteur","pos":"noun","ipa":"hoʊˈtɜr","uz":"takabburona viqor","ru":"надменность","ex":["She received the apology with some hauteur and did not sit down."],"u":"S10U05"},{"id":"lex.05508","w":"obeisance","pos":"noun","ipa":"oʊˈbeɪsəns","uz":"ta'zim, itoat izhori","ru":"почтительный поклон","ex":["The opening paragraph is pure obeisance to the committee."],"u":"S10U05"},{"id":"lex.05509","w":"solicitous","pos":"adj","ipa":"səˈlɪsɪtəs","uz":"g'amxo'r, e'tiborli","ru":"заботливый, внимательный","ex":["He was solicitous about the journey and asked twice if she had eaten."],"u":"S10U05"},{"id":"lex.05510","w":"congenial","pos":"adj","ipa":"kənˈdʒinjəl","uz":"ko'ngilga yaqin","ru":"близкий по духу","ex":["They found each other congenial and the work went quickly."],"u":"S10U05"},{"id":"lex.05511","w":"affable","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈæfəbəl","uz":"xushmuomala","ru":"приветливый","ex":["The chairman is affable in the corridor and immovable in the chair."],"u":"S10U05"},{"id":"lex.05512","w":"gregarious","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɡrɪˈɡeriəs","uz":"davrani sevadigan","ru":"общительный","ex":["She is gregarious and the flat is never empty."],"u":"S10U05"},{"id":"lex.05513","w":"urbane","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɜrˈbeɪn","uz":"nazokatli, ziyoli","ru":"учтивый, светский","ex":["An urbane host who could keep three difficult guests apart."],"u":"S10U05"},{"id":"lex.05514","w":"winsome","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈwɪnsəm","uz":"yoqimtoy","ru":"обаятельный","ex":["A winsome performance that the critics found hard to dislike."],"u":"S10U05"},{"id":"lex.05515","w":"ingenuous","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪnˈdʒenjuəs","uz":"sodda, ishonuvchan","ru":"простодушный","ex":["The question was ingenuous and it embarrassed the whole table."],"u":"S10U05"},{"id":"lex.05516","w":"guileless","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈɡaɪlləs","uz":"makrsiz","ru":"бесхитростный","ex":["A guileless answer that gave away the whole position."],"u":"S10U05"},{"id":"lex.05517","w":"artless","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈɑrtləs","uz":"sun'iylikdan xoli","ru":"безыскусный, естественный","ex":["The letter is artless and all the more convincing for it."],"u":"S10U05"},{"id":"lex.05518","w":"diffident","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈdɪfɪdənt","uz":"o'ziga ishonchsiz, tortinchoq","ru":"неуверенный в себе, робкий","ex":["He was diffident about the paper until the third reader praised it."],"u":"S10U05"},{"id":"lex.05519","w":"temerity","pos":"noun","ipa":"təˈmerɪti","uz":"o'rinsiz jur'at","ru":"дерзость, безрассудная смелость","ex":["She had the temerity to ask the minister for the figures."],"u":"S10U05"},{"id":"lex.05520","w":"effrontery","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪˈfrʌntəri","uz":"uyatsiz dadillik","ru":"наглость","ex":["He had the effrontery to send the invoice twice."],"u":"S10U05"},{"id":"lex.05521","w":"bombast","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈbɑmbæst","uz":"dabdabali bo'sh gap","ru":"напыщенность, пустословие","ex":["Strip the bombast out and two sentences of argument remain."],"u":"S10U06"},{"id":"lex.05522","w":"grandiloquent","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɡrænˈdɪləkwənt","uz":"dabdabali so'zlaydigan","ru":"высокопарный","ex":["A grandiloquent title for a report about parking."],"u":"S10U06"},{"id":"lex.05523","w":"florid","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈflɔrɪd","uz":"haddan ortiq bezakli","ru":"витиеватый","ex":["The florid opening paragraph was cut before printing."],"u":"S10U06"},{"id":"lex.05524","w":"turgid","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈtɜrdʒɪd","uz":"og'ir va cho'zilgan","ru":"тяжеловесный, напыщенный","ex":["Forty turgid pages that three plain ones would have covered."],"u":"S10U06"},{"id":"lex.05525","w":"ponderous","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈpɑndərəs","uz":"og'ir, zerikarli","ru":"грузный, тягучий","ex":["A ponderous introduction that lost half the audience."],"u":"S10U06"},{"id":"lex.05526","w":"prolix","pos":"adj","ipa":"proʊˈlɪks","uz":"ortiqcha so'zli","ru":"многословный","ex":["The judgment is prolix and its central paragraph is buried."],"u":"S10U06"},{"id":"lex.05527","w":"fulsome","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈfʊlsəm","uz":"me'yordan ortiq maqtovli","ru":"чрезмерный, приторный","ex":["The fulsome tribute embarrassed the person it was about."],"u":"S10U06"},{"id":"lex.05528","w":"effusive","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪˈfjusɪv","uz":"hissiyotini ochiq to'kadigan","ru":"экспансивный","ex":["An effusive welcome from someone who had never met him."],"u":"S10U06"},{"id":"lex.05529","w":"mellifluous","pos":"adj","ipa":"məˈlɪfluəs","uz":"shirin ohangdor","ru":"сладкозвучный","ex":["A mellifluous voice reading a very dull list."],"u":"S10U06"},{"id":"lex.05530","w":"voluble","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈvɑljəbəl","uz":"ravon va uzoq gapiradigan","ru":"говорливый","ex":["He is voluble on any subject he has read about that morning."],"u":"S10U06"},{"id":"lex.05531","w":"loquacious","pos":"adj","ipa":"loʊˈkweɪʃəs","uz":"gapdon","ru":"словоохотливый","ex":["A loquacious neighbour who knew the history of every wall."],"u":"S10U06"},{"id":"lex.05532","w":"garrulous","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈɡærələs","uz":"ezma","ru":"болтливый, многоречивый","ex":["The garrulous witness took an hour to reach the street."],"u":"S10U06"},{"id":"lex.05533","w":"prattle","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈprætəl","uz":"valdiramoq","ru":"тараторить о пустяках","ex":["He prattled about the weather while the room waited for the figures."],"u":"S10U06"},{"id":"lex.05534","w":"homily","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈhɑməli","uz":"nasihat","ru":"нравоучение","ex":["The report ends with a homily about personal responsibility."],"u":"S10U06"},{"id":"lex.05535","w":"encomium","pos":"noun","ipa":"enˈkoʊmiəm","uz":"madhiya","ru":"панегирик","ex":["The obituary is an encomium and tells you almost nothing."],"u":"S10U06"},{"id":"lex.05536","w":"panegyric","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌpænɪˈdʒɪrɪk","uz":"maqtov nutqi","ru":"хвалебная речь","ex":["The panegyric ran to twenty minutes and mentioned no dates."],"u":"S10U06"},{"id":"lex.05537","w":"plaudit","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈplɔdɪt","uz":"olqish","ru":"рукоплескания, похвалы","ex":["The plaudits came from people who had not read the thing."],"u":"S10U06"},{"id":"lex.05538","w":"accolade","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈækəleɪd","uz":"e'tirof nishoni","ru":"награда, знак признания","ex":["The accolade arrived nine years after the work was done."],"u":"S10U06"},{"id":"lex.05539","w":"adulation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌædʒəˈleɪʃən","uz":"ortiqcha ulug'lash","ru":"раболепное восхваление","ex":["Ten years of adulation had made him impossible to edit."],"u":"S10U06"},{"id":"lex.05540","w":"approbation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌæprəˈbeɪʃən","uz":"rasmiy ma'qullash","ru":"официальное одобрение","ex":["The scheme went ahead without the approbation of the council."],"u":"S10U06"},{"id":"lex.05541","w":"laud","pos":"verb","ipa":"lɔd","uz":"ulug'lamoq","ru":"восхвалять","ex":["The paper lauded a reform it had attacked the previous spring."],"u":"S10U06"},{"id":"lex.05542","w":"extol","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪkˈstoʊl","uz":"ko'klarga ko'tarmoq","ru":"превозносить","ex":["The brochure extols a location that is forty minutes from anywhere."],"u":"S10U06"},{"id":"lex.05543","w":"lionise","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈlaɪənaɪz","uz":"mashhur qilib ko'tarmoq","ru":"носить на руках, делать знаменитостью","ex":["The city lionised him for a discovery he had made elsewhere."],"u":"S10U06"},{"id":"lex.05544","w":"exhort","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪɡˈzɔrt","uz":"da'vat etmoq","ru":"призывать, увещевать","ex":["The letter exhorts members to read the rules before voting."],"u":"S10U07"},{"id":"lex.05545","w":"enjoin","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪnˈdʒɔɪn","uz":"rasman buyurmoq","ru":"предписывать","ex":["The court enjoined the company from selling the remaining plots."],"u":"S10U07"},{"id":"lex.05546","w":"promulgate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈprɑməlɡeɪt","uz":"e'lon qilib joriy etmoq","ru":"обнародовать","ex":["The regulation was promulgated in March and applied from June."],"u":"S10U07"},{"id":"lex.05547","w":"proscribe","pos":"verb","ipa":"proʊˈskraɪb","uz":"rasman taqiqlamoq","ru":"запрещать","ex":["The practice was proscribed in 1994 and continued until 2001."],"u":"S10U07"},{"id":"lex.05548","w":"abrogate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈæbrəɡeɪt","uz":"bekor qilmoq","ru":"аннулировать, отменять","ex":["The treaty was abrogated by one side without notice."],"u":"S10U07"},{"id":"lex.05549","w":"accede","pos":"verb","ipa":"əkˈsid","uz":"rozilik bermoq","ru":"соглашаться, уступать","ex":["The board acceded to the request after a long private discussion."],"u":"S10U07"},{"id":"lex.05550","w":"remonstrate","pos":"verb","ipa":"rɪˈmɑnstreɪt","uz":"e'tiroz bildirmoq","ru":"возражать, выговаривать","ex":["She remonstrated with the driver and got the fare corrected."],"u":"S10U07"},{"id":"lex.05551","w":"expostulate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪkˈspɑstʃəleɪt","uz":"qaytarishga urinib bahslashmoq","ru":"отговаривать, увещевать","ex":["His friends expostulated for an hour and he went anyway."],"u":"S10U07"},{"id":"lex.05552","w":"recant","pos":"verb","ipa":"rɪˈkænt","uz":"fikridan ommaviy qaytmoq","ru":"отрекаться","ex":["He recanted under pressure and returned to the position later."],"u":"S10U07"},{"id":"lex.05553","w":"repudiate","pos":"verb","ipa":"rɪˈpjudieɪt","uz":"rad etmoq, tan olmaslik","ru":"отвергать","ex":["The party repudiated the pamphlet within a day of publication."],"u":"S10U07"},{"id":"lex.05554","w":"renege","pos":"verb","ipa":"rɪˈniɡ","uz":"va'dasidan tonmoq","ru":"отказываться от обещанного","ex":["They reneged on the schedule and offered no new date."],"u":"S10U07"},{"id":"lex.05555","w":"gainsay","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌɡeɪnˈseɪ","uz":"aytilganni inkor etmoq","ru":"отрицать сказанное","ex":["There is no gainsaying the figures; the question is what they mean."],"u":"S10U07"},{"id":"lex.05556","w":"confute","pos":"verb","ipa":"kənˈfjut","uz":"dalil bilan rad etmoq","ru":"опровергать","ex":["One measurement confuted a theory that had stood for a decade."],"u":"S10U07"},{"id":"lex.05557","w":"impugn","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪmˈpjun","uz":"shubha ostiga olmoq","ru":"ставить под сомнение честность","ex":["Nothing in the review impugns her handling of the data."],"u":"S10U07"},{"id":"lex.05558","w":"aver","pos":"verb","ipa":"əˈvɜr","uz":"qat'iy da'vo qilmoq","ru":"утверждать","ex":["The witness averred that the gate had been locked all evening."],"u":"S10U07"},{"id":"lex.05559","w":"stricture","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈstrɪktʃər","uz":"qattiq tanqid; cheklov","ru":"строгое порицание; ограничение","ex":["The strictures on advertising apply to the website as well."],"u":"S10U07"},{"id":"lex.05560","w":"codicil","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkɑdəsəl","uz":"vasiyatnomaga qo'shimcha","ru":"дополнение к завещанию","ex":["A codicil signed in 1998 left the house to her sister."],"u":"S10U07"},{"id":"lex.05561","w":"recital","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈsaɪtəl","uz":"shartnomaning kirish qismi","ru":"преамбула договора","ex":["The recitals explain why the parties are signing at all."],"u":"S10U07"},{"id":"lex.05562","w":"galley","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɡæli","uz":"dastlabki bosma nusxa","ru":"гранка","ex":["The galleys went out to three reviewers in September."],"u":"S10U07"},{"id":"lex.05563","w":"typesetting","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtaɪpsetɪŋ","uz":"harf terish","ru":"набор текста","ex":["The typesetting was done in Tashkent and the paper came from Almaty."],"u":"S10U07"},{"id":"lex.05564","w":"marginalia","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌmɑrdʒɪˈneɪliə","uz":"chekkaga yozilgan izohlar","ru":"заметки на полях","ex":["His marginalia are more interesting than the book they surround."],"u":"S10U07"},{"id":"lex.05565","w":"palimpsest","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpælɪmpsest","uz":"eski yozuvi ko'rinib turgan qo'lyozma","ru":"палимпсест","ex":["The oldest text on the palimpsest is four centuries older than the top one."],"u":"S10U07"},{"id":"lex.05566","w":"calque","pos":"noun","ipa":"kælk","uz":"kalka, so'zma-so'z o'zlashma","ru":"калька","ex":["'Skyscraper' entered many languages as a calque rather than a loan."],"u":"S10U07"},{"id":"lex.05567","w":"metonymy","pos":"noun","ipa":"məˈtɑnəmi","uz":"metonimiya","ru":"метонимия","ex":["'The Kremlin said' is metonymy: a building standing for a government."],"u":"S10U08"},{"id":"lex.05568","w":"chiaroscuro","pos":"noun","ipa":"kiˌɑrəˈskʊroʊ","uz":"yorug'lik va soya o'yini","ru":"светотень","ex":["The chiaroscuro pulls your eye to the hand and away from the face."],"u":"S10U08"},{"id":"lex.05569","w":"mimesis","pos":"noun","ipa":"mɪˈmisɪs","uz":"san'atda hayotga taqlid","ru":"мимесис, подражание","ex":["The chapter argues that mimesis was never the point of the form."],"u":"S10U08"},{"id":"lex.05570","w":"polyphony","pos":"noun","ipa":"pəˈlɪfəni","uz":"ko'povozlilik","ru":"полифония","ex":["The polyphony of the novel keeps any one character from winning."],"u":"S10U08"},{"id":"lex.05571","w":"narratology","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌnærəˈtɑlədʒi","uz":"narratologiya","ru":"нарратология","ex":["Narratology gives you terms for what every reader already senses."],"u":"S10U08"},{"id":"lex.05572","w":"metafiction","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌmetəˈfɪkʃən","uz":"o'z-o'zini ochib beruvchi badiiy asar","ru":"метапроза","ex":["The narrator stops to discuss the chapter he is writing: metafiction."],"u":"S10U08"},{"id":"lex.05573","w":"intertextuality","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌɪntərtekstʃuˈælɪti","uz":"matnlararo bog'liqlik","ru":"интертекстуальность","ex":["The intertextuality is heavy: four allusions in the first page."],"u":"S10U08"},{"id":"lex.05574","w":"exegesis","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌeksɪˈdʒisɪs","uz":"matn sharhi","ru":"экзегеза, толкование","ex":["Six hundred pages of exegesis on a poem of forty lines."],"u":"S10U08"},{"id":"lex.05575","w":"hermeneutics","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌhɜrməˈnutɪks","uz":"germenevtika","ru":"герменевтика","ex":["Hermeneutics asks what a reader brings before a word is read."],"u":"S10U08"},{"id":"lex.05576","w":"philology","pos":"noun","ipa":"fɪˈlɑlədʒi","uz":"filologiya","ru":"филология","ex":["Philology traced the word to a border dialect and then lost it."],"u":"S10U08"},{"id":"lex.05577","w":"palaeography","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌpeɪliˈɑɡrəfi","uz":"paleografiya","ru":"палеография","ex":["Palaeography dated the copy a century later than the text."],"u":"S10U08"},{"id":"lex.05578","w":"historiography","pos":"noun","ipa":"hɪˌstɔriˈɑɡrəfi","uz":"tarixshunoslik","ru":"историография","ex":["The first chapter is historiography and the rest is archive work."],"u":"S10U08"},{"id":"lex.05579","w":"periodisation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌpɪriədaɪˈzeɪʃən","uz":"tarixni davrlarga bo'lish","ru":"периодизация","ex":["Any periodisation hides as much as it shows."],"u":"S10U08"},{"id":"lex.05580","w":"prosody","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈprɑsədi","uz":"vazn va urg'u tizimi","ru":"просодия","ex":["English prosody is built on stress, not on the number of syllables."],"u":"S10U08"},{"id":"lex.05581","w":"elision","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪˈlɪʒən","uz":"tovushning tushib qolishi","ru":"выпадение звука","ex":["The elision in 'comf'table' is normal, not careless."],"u":"S10U08"},{"id":"lex.05582","w":"isomorphism","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌaɪsəˈmɔrfɪzəm","uz":"tuzilishdagi mosluk","ru":"изоморфизм","ex":["The paper claims an isomorphism between the two networks."],"u":"S10U08"},{"id":"lex.05583","w":"homology","pos":"noun","ipa":"həˈmɑlədʒi","uz":"kelib chiqishi bir xillikdan tug'ilgan o'xshashlik","ru":"гомология","ex":["A wing and an arm share a homology that a wing and a fin do not."],"u":"S10U08"},{"id":"lex.05584","w":"falsifiability","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌfɔlsɪfaɪəˈbɪlɪti","uz":"rad etilishi mumkinligi","ru":"фальсифицируемость","ex":["A claim with no falsifiability can be interesting and still not be science."],"u":"S10U08"},{"id":"lex.05585","w":"skew","pos":"verb","ipa":"skju","uz":"natijani qiyshaytirmoq","ru":"искажать, смещать","ex":["Two very large accounts skew the average beyond use."],"u":"S10U08"},{"id":"lex.05586","w":"hysteresis","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌhɪstəˈrisɪs","uz":"o'tgan holatning saqlanib qolgan ta'siri","ru":"гистерезис","ex":["Unemployment shows hysteresis: the recession ends and the damage stays."],"u":"S10U08"},{"id":"lex.05587","w":"reification","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌriəfɪˈkeɪʃən","uz":"mavhum tushunchani narsaga aylantirish","ru":"овеществление","ex":["The reification of 'the market' lets everyone avoid naming anyone."],"u":"S10U08"},{"id":"lex.05588","w":"reify","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈriəfaɪ","uz":"mavhumlikni moddiylashtirmoq","ru":"овеществлять","ex":["The index reifies a judgement and then reports it as a fact."],"u":"S10U08"},{"id":"lex.05589","w":"essentialise","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪˈsenʃəlaɪz","uz":"butun guruhni bir xil deb umumlashtirmoq","ru":"эссенциализировать","ex":["The chapter essentialises a region of forty languages."],"u":"S10U08"},{"id":"lex.05590","w":"discursive","pos":"adj","ipa":"dɪˈskɜrsɪv","uz":"mavzudan mavzuga o'tadigan","ru":"сбивчивый, отвлекающийся","ex":["The essay is discursive and much better for it."],"u":"S10U09"},{"id":"lex.05591","w":"expatiate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪkˈspeɪʃieɪt","uz":"batafsil to'xtalmoq","ru":"распространяться о чём-либо","ex":["He expatiated on the drainage for twenty minutes."],"u":"S10U09"},{"id":"lex.05592","w":"ruminate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈrumɪneɪt","uz":"uzoq o'ylab yurmoq","ru":"размышлять, обдумывать","ex":["He ruminated on the offer for a week and then refused it."],"u":"S10U09"},{"id":"lex.05593","w":"cogitate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈkɑdʒɪteɪt","uz":"chuqur mulohaza yuritmoq","ru":"размышлять, обдумывать вопрос","ex":["Give me a day to cogitate and I will send you a number."],"u":"S10U09"},{"id":"lex.05594","w":"peruse","pos":"verb","ipa":"pəˈruz","uz":"sinchiklab o'qib chiqmoq","ru":"внимательно прочитывать","ex":["She perused the contract twice before signing anything."],"u":"S10U09"},{"id":"lex.05595","w":"glean","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɡlin","uz":"oz-ozdan ma'lumot yig'moq","ru":"выуживать, собирать по крупицам","ex":["What we gleaned from the minutes filled half a page."],"u":"S10U09"},{"id":"lex.05596","w":"garner","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈɡɑrnər","uz":"to'plab olmoq","ru":"накапливать, собирать","ex":["The scheme garnered support from every district but one."],"u":"S10U09"},{"id":"lex.05597","w":"winnow","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈwɪnoʊ","uz":"saralab ajratmoq","ru":"отсеивать, просеивать","ex":["Four hundred applications winnowed down to eleven."],"u":"S10U09"},{"id":"lex.05598","w":"elide","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪˈlaɪd","uz":"tushirib qoldirmoq; qo'shib yubormoq","ru":"опускать; сливать воедино","ex":["The summary elides the difference between cost and price."],"u":"S10U09"},{"id":"lex.05599","w":"juxtapose","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈdʒʌkstəpoʊz","uz":"yonma-yon qo'yib solishtirmoq","ru":"сопоставлять рядом","ex":["The exhibition juxtaposes the two photographs without a caption."],"u":"S10U09"},{"id":"lex.05600","w":"conjoin","pos":"verb","ipa":"kənˈdʒɔɪn","uz":"birlashtirmoq","ru":"соединять воедино","ex":["The clause conjoins two duties that have nothing to do with each other."],"u":"S10U09"},{"id":"lex.05601","w":"coalesce","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌkoʊəˈles","uz":"asta-sekin birlashib ketmoq","ru":"сливаться воедино","ex":["Three small complaints coalesced into a formal case."],"u":"S10U09"},{"id":"lex.05602","w":"dissipate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈdɪsɪpeɪt","uz":"tarqalib yo'qolmoq","ru":"рассеиваться, развеиваться","ex":["The goodwill dissipated over two badly handled weeks."],"u":"S10U09"},{"id":"lex.05603","w":"distend","pos":"verb","ipa":"dɪˈstend","uz":"ichkaridan kengayib shishmoq","ru":"раздуваться","ex":["The pipe distends under pressure before it fails."],"u":"S10U09"},{"id":"lex.05604","w":"permeate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈpɜrmieɪt","uz":"hamma yerga singib ketmoq","ru":"пропитывать, проникать всюду","ex":["Damp had permeated the lower two floors."],"u":"S10U09"},{"id":"lex.05605","w":"pervade","pos":"verb","ipa":"pərˈveɪd","uz":"butunlay qamrab olmoq","ru":"пронизывать","ex":["A quiet anxiety pervades the whole second half of the book."],"u":"S10U09"},{"id":"lex.05606","w":"emanate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈeməneɪt","uz":"manbadan tarqalmoq","ru":"исходить, распространяться","ex":["A low hum emanated from somewhere behind the wall."],"u":"S10U09"},{"id":"lex.05607","w":"undulate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈʌndʒəleɪt","uz":"to'lqinsimon harakatlanmoq","ru":"колыхаться, идти волнами","ex":["The land undulates gently for forty kilometres and then drops."],"u":"S10U09"},{"id":"lex.05608","w":"sinuous","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈsɪnjuəs","uz":"ilon izi kabi egri-bugri","ru":"извилистый, гибкий","ex":["A sinuous road that adds an hour and is worth it."],"u":"S10U09"},{"id":"lex.05609","w":"tortuous","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈtɔrtʃuəs","uz":"chalkash va uzun","ru":"извилистый, запутанный","ex":["A tortuous chain of companies ending in one post box."],"u":"S10U09"},{"id":"lex.05610","w":"languid","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈlæŋɡwɪd","uz":"sust, erinchoq","ru":"томный, вялый","ex":["A languid afternoon with nothing settled and nothing lost."],"u":"S10U09"},{"id":"lex.05611","w":"listless","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈlɪstləs","uz":"beholdan, ishtiyoqsiz","ru":"апатичный, вялый","ex":["The team was listless for the first half and unrecognisable after it."],"u":"S10U09"},{"id":"lex.05612","w":"torpid","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈtɔrpɪd","uz":"uyquchan, harakatsiz","ru":"оцепенелый, вялый","ex":["The market stayed torpid until the rate decision."],"u":"S10U09"},{"id":"lex.05613","w":"erudite","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈerjədaɪt","uz":"bilimdon, mutaxassis darajada o'qimishli","ru":"эрудированный","ex":["An erudite footnote that quietly corrects the whole chapter."],"u":"S10U10"},{"id":"lex.05614","w":"savant","pos":"noun","ipa":"sæˈvɑnt","uz":"allomasifat bilimdon","ru":"учёный муж, савант","ex":["The lecture drew every savant in the region and forty students."],"u":"S10U10"},{"id":"lex.05615","w":"iconoclast","pos":"noun","ipa":"aɪˈkɑnəklæst","uz":"an'anaviy qarashlarni buzuvchi","ru":"иконоборец, ниспровергатель","ex":["The iconoclast of 1985 is the establishment of 2010."],"u":"S10U10"},{"id":"lex.05616","w":"neophyte","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈniəfaɪt","uz":"yangi kelgan, havaskor","ru":"новичок, неофит","ex":["The manual is written for the neophyte and read by everyone."],"u":"S10U10"},{"id":"lex.05617","w":"pedagogue","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpedəɡɑɡ","uz":"qattiqqo'l ustoz","ru":"педагог, наставник","ex":["The pedagogue in him takes over about ten minutes into any dinner."],"u":"S10U10"},{"id":"lex.05618","w":"martinet","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌmɑrtɪˈnet","uz":"qat'iy intizom talab qiluvchi","ru":"педант, солдафон","ex":["The new supervisor is a martinet about the sign-in sheet."],"u":"S10U10"},{"id":"lex.05619","w":"philistine","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈfɪləstin","uz":"san'atga befarq odam","ru":"обыватель, мещанин","ex":["Calling your opponents philistines is not an argument."],"u":"S10U10"},{"id":"lex.05620","w":"zealot","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈzelət","uz":"mutaassib tarafdor","ru":"фанатик, ревнитель","ex":["The reform needed believers and attracted zealots."],"u":"S10U10"},{"id":"lex.05621","w":"doctrinaire","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌdɑktrɪˈner","uz":"aqidaga qat'iy yopishgan","ru":"доктринёрский","ex":["A doctrinaire reading of the rule would close the school."],"u":"S10U10"},{"id":"lex.05622","w":"hidebound","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈhaɪdbaʊnd","uz":"eskilikka yopishib olgan","ru":"закоснелый","ex":["A hidebound department that has used the same form since 1978."],"u":"S10U10"},{"id":"lex.05623","w":"catholic","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈkæθəlɪk","uz":"keng qamrovli, turfa didli","ru":"широкий, разносторонний","ex":["Her taste in music is catholic and her taste in tea is not."],"u":"S10U10"},{"id":"lex.05624","w":"eclectic","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪˈklektɪk","uz":"turli manbalardan olingan","ru":"эклектичный","ex":["An eclectic method that borrows whatever works."],"u":"S10U10"},{"id":"lex.05625","w":"mercurial","pos":"adj","ipa":"mərˈkjʊriəl","uz":"kayfiyati tez o'zgaruvchan","ru":"переменчивый, непостоянный","ex":["A mercurial editor: two pages of praise, then silence for a month."],"u":"S10U10"},{"id":"lex.05626","w":"volatile","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈvɑlətəl","uz":"beqaror, portlashga moyil","ru":"неустойчивый, взрывоопасный","ex":["The market stayed volatile for six weeks after the announcement."],"u":"S10U10"},{"id":"lex.05627","w":"equable","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈekwəbəl","uz":"mo'tadil, bosiq","ru":"ровный, уравновешенный","ex":["An equable man who has never once raised his voice in a meeting."],"u":"S10U10"},{"id":"lex.05628","w":"phlegmatic","pos":"adj","ipa":"fleɡˈmætɪk","uz":"sovuqqon, vazmin","ru":"флегматичный","ex":["He was phlegmatic about the loss and back at work on Monday."],"u":"S10U10"},{"id":"lex.05629","w":"placid","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈplæsɪd","uz":"tinch, xotirjam","ru":"безмятежный, спокойный","ex":["A placid child who watched everything and said little."],"u":"S10U10"},{"id":"lex.05630","w":"stoic","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈstoʊɪk","uz":"chidamli, sabrli","ru":"стоический","ex":["She was stoic about the diagnosis and furious about the waiting list."],"u":"S10U10"},{"id":"lex.05631","w":"stolid","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈstɑlɪd","uz":"hissiyotsiz, og'ir","ru":"флегматично-бесстрастный","ex":["A stolid defence that gave nothing away for ninety minutes."],"u":"S10U10"},{"id":"lex.05632","w":"staid","pos":"adj","ipa":"steɪd","uz":"jiddiy va zerikarli darajada bosiq","ru":"степенный, чопорный","ex":["A staid institution that has just hired its first designer."],"u":"S10U10"},{"id":"lex.05633","w":"dour","pos":"adj","ipa":"daʊr","uz":"qovog'i soliq, quruq","ru":"суровый, угрюмый","ex":["A dour man who turned out to be the kindest on the floor."],"u":"S10U10"},{"id":"lex.05634","w":"morose","pos":"adj","ipa":"məˈroʊs","uz":"ma'yus va tund","ru":"мрачный, угрюмый","ex":["He went morose for a week and then told us what had happened."],"u":"S10U10"},{"id":"lex.05635","w":"lugubrious","pos":"adj","ipa":"luˈɡubriəs","uz":"haddan ortiq g'amgin","ru":"скорбный, унылый","ex":["A lugubrious speech at a party that was going perfectly well."],"u":"S10U10"},{"id":"lex.05636","w":"ineffable","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪnˈefəbəl","uz":"so'z bilan ifodalab bo'lmaydigan","ru":"невыразимый","ex":["Calling it ineffable saves the writer the work of describing it."],"u":"S10U11"},{"id":"lex.05637","w":"infelicitous","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌɪnfɪˈlɪsɪtəs","uz":"o'rinsiz tanlangan","ru":"неудачный, неуместный","ex":["An infelicitous phrase in an otherwise careful letter."],"u":"S10U11"},{"id":"lex.05638","w":"felicitous","pos":"adj","ipa":"fɪˈlɪsɪtəs","uz":"juda o'rinli tanlangan","ru":"удачный, меткий","ex":["A felicitous choice of example that ended the argument."],"u":"S10U11"},{"id":"lex.05639","w":"transmute","pos":"verb","ipa":"trænzˈmjut","uz":"butunlay boshqa narsaga aylantirmoq","ru":"превращать, преобразовывать","ex":["Time transmutes an embarrassment into an anecdote."],"u":"S10U11"},{"id":"lex.05640","w":"efface","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪˈfeɪs","uz":"izini butunlay o'chirmoq","ru":"стирать, изглаживать","ex":["Forty years of weather had effaced the inscription."],"u":"S10U11"},{"id":"lex.05641","w":"embellish","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪmˈbelɪʃ","uz":"bezab, qo'shib gapirmoq","ru":"приукрашивать","ex":["He embellishes every story and nobody minds."],"u":"S10U11"},{"id":"lex.05642","w":"extenuate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪkˈstenjueɪt","uz":"aybni yengillashtiradigan holatni ko'rsatmoq","ru":"смягчать вину","ex":["Nothing in the file extenuates what was done in March."],"u":"S10U11"},{"id":"lex.05643","w":"expiate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈekspieɪt","uz":"gunohini yuvmoq","ru":"искупать","ex":["He spent the next decade trying to expiate one afternoon."],"u":"S10U11"},{"id":"lex.05644","w":"exculpate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈekskʌlpeɪt","uz":"aybsiz ekanini isbotlamoq","ru":"оправдывать, снимать вину","ex":["The second recording exculpated the driver entirely."],"u":"S10U11"},{"id":"lex.05645","w":"disabuse","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌdɪsəˈbjuz","uz":"noto'g'ri fikridan qaytarmoq","ru":"разубеждать","ex":["Let me disabuse you of the idea that this is quick."],"u":"S10U11"},{"id":"lex.05646","w":"inure","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪˈnʊr","uz":"ko'niktirib qo'ymoq","ru":"приучать, закалять","ex":["Ten winters there inure you to a kind of cold you cannot describe."],"u":"S10U11"},{"id":"lex.05647","w":"evince","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪˈvɪns","uz":"aniq namoyon qilmoq","ru":"проявлять, обнаруживать","ex":["The reply evinced no interest in the question at all."],"u":"S10U11"},{"id":"lex.05648","w":"adumbrate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈædəmbreɪt","uz":"umumiy chizgilarini bermoq","ru":"намечать в общих чертах","ex":["The introduction adumbrates an argument the book never quite makes."],"u":"S10U11"},{"id":"lex.05649","w":"arrogate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈærəɡeɪt","uz":"o'ziga noo'rin huquq da'vo qilmoq","ru":"присваивать себе","ex":["The committee arrogated to itself a veto nobody had given it."],"u":"S10U11"},{"id":"lex.05650","w":"aggrandise","pos":"verb","ipa":"əˈɡrændaɪz","uz":"o'z mavqeini bo'rttirib kengaytirmoq","ru":"возвеличивать, усиливать","ex":["Every reorganisation aggrandised the same three offices."],"u":"S10U11"},{"id":"lex.05651","w":"debase","pos":"verb","ipa":"dɪˈbeɪs","uz":"qadrini tushirmoq","ru":"обесценивать, унижать","ex":["Using the word for everything has debased it."],"u":"S10U11"},{"id":"lex.05652","w":"defile","pos":"verb","ipa":"dɪˈfaɪl","uz":"muqaddas narsani bulg'amoq","ru":"осквернять","ex":["The site had been defiled and the community rebuilt it twice."],"u":"S10U11"},{"id":"lex.05653","w":"despoil","pos":"verb","ipa":"dɪˈspɔɪl","uz":"talon-taroj qilmoq","ru":"разорять, опустошать","ex":["The hillside was despoiled for gravel in under two years."],"u":"S10U11"},{"id":"lex.05654","w":"desiccate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈdesɪkeɪt","uz":"butunlay quritib yubormoq","ru":"высушивать","ex":["The samples are desiccated before they are weighed."],"u":"S10U11"},{"id":"lex.05655","w":"extirpate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈekstərpeɪt","uz":"ildizi bilan yo'q qilmoq","ru":"искоренять","ex":["The species was extirpated from the delta by 1960."],"u":"S10U11"},{"id":"lex.05656","w":"raze","pos":"verb","ipa":"reɪz","uz":"tep-tekis qilib buzmoq","ru":"сносить до основания","ex":["The quarter was razed in 1966 and rebuilt as four towers."],"u":"S10U11"},{"id":"lex.05657","w":"sully","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈsʌli","uz":"nomiga dog' tushirmoq","ru":"запятнать","ex":["One paragraph sullied a reputation built over thirty years."],"u":"S10U11"},{"id":"lex.05658","w":"vex","pos":"verb","ipa":"veks","uz":"asabini buzmoq; boshog'riq bo'lmoq","ru":"досаждать; не давать покоя","ex":["The same clause has vexed lawyers for a century."],"u":"S10U11"},{"id":"lex.05659","w":"subaltern","pos":"noun","ipa":"səˈbɔltərn","uz":"quyi, ovozsiz qatlam vakili","ru":"подчинённый, бесправный слой","ex":["The book asks whether the subaltern can be quoted at all."],"u":"S10U12"},{"id":"lex.05660","w":"habitus","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈhæbɪtəs","uz":"ijtimoiy muhitdan yuqqan odatlar majmui","ru":"габитус","ex":["Habitus explains why the same advice works in one school and not another."],"u":"S10U12"},{"id":"lex.05661","w":"anomie","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈænəmi","uz":"qadriyatlar yo'qolgan holat","ru":"аномия","ex":["The chapter reads the strike as anomie rather than as protest."],"u":"S10U12"},{"id":"lex.05662","w":"precarity","pos":"noun","ipa":"prɪˈkerɪti","uz":"doimiy noaniqlikdagi turmush","ru":"прекарность, нестабильность","ex":["Precarity is measured badly because it falls between two categories."],"u":"S10U12"},{"id":"lex.05663","w":"legitimation","pos":"noun","ipa":"lɪˌdʒɪtɪˈmeɪʃən","uz":"hokimiyatni haqli deb tan oldirish jarayoni","ru":"легитимация","ex":["The election served as legitimation rather than as a choice."],"u":"S10U12"},{"id":"lex.05664","w":"clientelism","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌkliənˈtelɪzəm","uz":"homiylik-sadoqat tizimi","ru":"клиентелизм","ex":["Clientelism survives every reform because it delivers something."],"u":"S10U12"},{"id":"lex.05665","w":"corporatism","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkɔrpərətɪzəm","uz":"davlat, ish beruvchi va kasaba uyushmasi kelishuvi tizimi","ru":"корпоративизм","ex":["Post-war corporatism produced stability and very slow change."],"u":"S10U12"},{"id":"lex.05666","w":"syndicalism","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsɪndɪkəlɪzəm","uz":"sindikalizm","ru":"синдикализм","ex":["Syndicalism lost the argument and left its vocabulary behind."],"u":"S10U12"},{"id":"lex.05667","w":"subsidiarity","pos":"noun","ipa":"səbˌsɪdiˈærɪti","uz":"qarorni quyi bo'g'inga qoldirish tamoyili","ru":"субсидиарность","ex":["Subsidiarity is invoked by whichever level is losing."],"u":"S10U12"},{"id":"lex.05668","w":"rentier","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɑnˈtjeɪ","uz":"mulkidan daromad oluvchi","ru":"рантье","ex":["A rentier economy rewards holding and punishes building."],"u":"S10U12"},{"id":"lex.05669","w":"securitisation","pos":"noun","ipa":"sɪˌkjʊrɪtaɪˈzeɪʃən","uz":"qarzlarni sotiladigan qimmatli qog'ozga aylantirish","ru":"секьюритизация","ex":["Securitisation moved the risk and nobody could say where it went."],"u":"S10U12"},{"id":"lex.05670","w":"haircut","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈherkʌt","uz":"qarzni qaytarishda majburiy chegirma","ru":"списание части долга","ex":["Bondholders took a forty per cent haircut and called it a settlement."],"u":"S10U12"},{"id":"lex.05671","w":"bureaucratisation","pos":"noun","ipa":"bjʊˌrɑkrətaɪˈzeɪʃən","uz":"byurokratlashuv","ru":"бюрократизация","ex":["Bureaucratisation began as a defence against favouritism."],"u":"S10U12"},{"id":"lex.05672","w":"individualisation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌɪndɪˌvɪdʒuəlaɪˈzeɪʃən","uz":"mas'uliyatni yakka shaxsga yuklash jarayoni","ru":"индивидуализация","ex":["Individualisation turns a public problem into a personal failure."],"u":"S10U12"},{"id":"lex.05673","w":"disenchantment","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌdɪsɪnˈtʃæntmənt","uz":"sehrdan mahrumlik, hafsalasi pir bo'lish","ru":"расколдовывание; разочарование","ex":["Disenchantment is the price a society pays for explanation."],"u":"S10U12"},{"id":"lex.05674","w":"historicise","pos":"verb","ipa":"hɪˈstɔrɪsaɪz","uz":"tarixiy sharoitga bog'lab tushuntirmoq","ru":"историзировать","ex":["The chapter historicises a category everyone had treated as permanent."],"u":"S10U12"},{"id":"lex.05675","w":"relativise","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈrelətɪvaɪz","uz":"nisbiy deb qaramoq","ru":"релятивизировать","ex":["To relativise a claim is not the same as denying it."],"u":"S10U12"},{"id":"lex.05676","w":"hegemonic","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌhedʒɪˈmɑnɪk","uz":"hukmronlik qilib, tabiiy deb qabul qilingan","ru":"гегемонный","ex":["The hegemonic account is the one nobody feels the need to defend."],"u":"S10U12"},{"id":"lex.05677","w":"apologia","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌæpəˈloʊdʒiə","uz":"o'z pozitsiyasini himoya qilib yozilgan asar","ru":"апология","ex":["The memoir is an apologia and should be read as one."],"u":"S10U12"},{"id":"lex.05678","w":"abduction","pos":"noun","ipa":"æbˈdʌkʃən","uz":"eng ishonarli izohga asoslangan xulosa chiqarish","ru":"абдукция","ex":["Diagnosis is abduction: the best available explanation, not a proof."],"u":"S10U12"},{"id":"lex.05679","w":"concordance","pos":"noun","ipa":"kənˈkɔrdəns","uz":"so'z ko'rsatkichi, konkordans","ru":"конкорданс, словоуказатель","ex":["A concordance of the letters showed he used the word only twice."],"u":"S10U12"},{"id":"lex.05680","w":"bifurcate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈbaɪfərkeɪt","uz":"ikkiga ajralmoq","ru":"раздваиваться","ex":["The path bifurcates above the spring and both branches rejoin."],"u":"S10U12"},{"id":"lex.05681","w":"madrasa","pos":"noun","ipa":"məˈdræsə","uz":"madrasa","ru":"медресе","ex":["The madrasa on Registan Square taught astronomy as well as law."],"u":"S10U12"},{"id":"lex.05682","w":"chicanery","pos":"noun","ipa":"ʃɪˈkeɪnəri","uz":"ayyorona hiyla","ru":"крючкотворство, махинации","ex":["Procedural chicanery kept the case out of court for nine years."],"u":"S10U13"},{"id":"lex.05683","w":"casuistry","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkæʒuɪstri","uz":"ayyorona axloqiy asoslash","ru":"казуистика","ex":["The defence is casuistry of a high order and still a defence of theft."],"u":"S10U13"},{"id":"lex.05684","w":"sophistry","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsɑfɪstri","uz":"soxta mantiq","ru":"софистика","ex":["Strip away the sophistry and the claim is simply false."],"u":"S10U13"},{"id":"lex.05685","w":"perfidy","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpɜrfɪdi","uz":"xiyonat","ru":"вероломство","ex":["The perfidy was discovered in a footnote to an audit."],"u":"S10U13"},{"id":"lex.05686","w":"mendacious","pos":"adj","ipa":"menˈdeɪʃəs","uz":"yolg'onchi","ru":"лживый","ex":["A mendacious prospectus that named a port which does not exist."],"u":"S10U13"},{"id":"lex.05687","w":"venal","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈvinəl","uz":"poraga sotiladigan","ru":"продажный","ex":["A venal inspector can undo ten years of building standards."],"u":"S10U13"},{"id":"lex.05688","w":"venality","pos":"noun","ipa":"vɪˈnælɪti","uz":"poraxo'rlikka moyillik","ru":"продажность","ex":["The report measures venality by how long a permit takes."],"u":"S10U13"},{"id":"lex.05689","w":"turpitude","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtɜrpɪtud","uz":"axloqiy tubanlik","ru":"низость, моральная испорченность","ex":["The visa rule excludes crimes of moral turpitude and defines none of them."],"u":"S10U13"},{"id":"lex.05690","w":"malfeasance","pos":"noun","ipa":"mælˈfizəns","uz":"mansab suiiste'moli","ru":"должностное преступление","ex":["Two findings of malfeasance and no criminal charge."],"u":"S10U13"},{"id":"lex.05691","w":"usury","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈjuʒəri","uz":"sudxo'rlik","ru":"ростовщичество","ex":["Usury laws set a ceiling that three lenders crossed by December."],"u":"S10U13"},{"id":"lex.05692","w":"suborn","pos":"verb","ipa":"səˈbɔrn","uz":"pora berib jinoyatga ko'ndirmoq","ru":"подкупать, склонять к лжесвидетельству","ex":["Two witnesses had been suborned before the hearing opened."],"u":"S10U13"},{"id":"lex.05693","w":"connive","pos":"verb","ipa":"kəˈnaɪv","uz":"ko'z yumib sherik bo'lmoq","ru":"потворствовать, быть в сговоре","ex":["The office did not order it; the office connived at it for a year."],"u":"S10U13"},{"id":"lex.05694","w":"occlude","pos":"verb","ipa":"əˈklud","uz":"to'sib qo'ymoq","ru":"закрывать, загораживать","ex":["The new tower occludes the only view the square had."],"u":"S10U13"},{"id":"lex.05695","w":"impunity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪmˈpjunɪti","uz":"jazosiz qolish","ru":"безнаказанность","ex":["Three firms dumped waste there with impunity until 2008."],"u":"S10U13"},{"id":"lex.05696","w":"iniquity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪˈnɪkwɪti","uz":"zulm, adolatsizlik","ru":"беззаконие, несправедливость","ex":["The iniquity of the old system was obvious and it lasted anyway."],"u":"S10U13"},{"id":"lex.05697","w":"ignominy","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɪɡnəmɪni","uz":"sharmandalik","ru":"позор, бесчестье","ex":["He resigned to avoid the ignominy of a vote."],"u":"S10U13"},{"id":"lex.05698","w":"opprobrium","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈproʊbriəm","uz":"ommaviy qoralash","ru":"поношение, общественное осуждение","ex":["The decision drew opprobrium from people who had asked for it."],"u":"S10U13"},{"id":"lex.05699","w":"umbrage","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈʌmbrɪdʒ","uz":"o'rinsiz xafa bo'lish","ru":"обида, недовольство","ex":["He took umbrage at a sentence that was not about him."],"u":"S10U13"},{"id":"lex.05700","w":"nugatory","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈnuɡətɔri","uz":"hech qanday ahamiyatga ega bo'lmagan","ru":"ничтожный, бесполезный","ex":["A nugatory penalty that the firm paid out of petty cash."],"u":"S10U13"},{"id":"lex.05701","w":"illicit","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪˈlɪsɪt","uz":"noqonuniy","ru":"незаконный, недозволенный","ex":["An illicit market in permits grew up beside the legal one."],"u":"S10U13"},{"id":"lex.05702","w":"profligate","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈprɑflɪɡət","uz":"isrofgar","ru":"расточительный","ex":["A profligate decade left the ministry with no reserve at all."],"u":"S10U13"},{"id":"lex.05703","w":"prodigal","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈprɑdɪɡəl","uz":"isrofgarchilik bilan sarflaydigan","ru":"расточительный, щедрый до безрассудства","ex":["Prodigal with praise, and the praise stopped meaning anything."],"u":"S10U13"},{"id":"lex.05704","w":"spendthrift","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈspendθrɪft","uz":"pulni sovuruvchi","ru":"мот, транжира","ex":["The estate passed to a spendthrift and was gone in two generations."],"u":"S10U13"},{"id":"lex.05705","w":"tendentious","pos":"adj","ipa":"tenˈdenʃəs","uz":"bir tomonlama, maqsadli yozilgan","ru":"тенденциозный","ex":["A tendentious summary of a balanced report."],"u":"S10U14"},{"id":"lex.05706","w":"efficacious","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌefɪˈkeɪʃəs","uz":"samara beradigan","ru":"действенный","ex":["The treatment is efficacious in trials and hard to deliver in practice."],"u":"S10U14"},{"id":"lex.05707","w":"deleterious","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌdelɪˈtɪriəs","uz":"zararli ta'sir ko'rsatadigan","ru":"вредный, пагубный","ex":["The deleterious effects showed up only in the ten-year data."],"u":"S10U14"},{"id":"lex.05708","w":"pernicious","pos":"adj","ipa":"pərˈnɪʃəs","uz":"sekin va chuqur zarar keltiradigan","ru":"пагубный, тлетворный","ex":["The most pernicious part of the myth is how reasonable it sounds."],"u":"S10U14"},{"id":"lex.05709","w":"virulent","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈvɪrjələnt","uz":"o'ta kuchli va zararli; keskin dushmanona","ru":"вирулентный; злобный","ex":["A virulent strain that filled two wards in a week."],"u":"S10U14"},{"id":"lex.05710","w":"noisome","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈnɔɪsəm","uz":"badbo'y, jirkanch","ru":"зловонный, отвратительный","ex":["A noisome channel ran behind the market until the 1990s."],"u":"S10U14"},{"id":"lex.05711","w":"baleful","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈbeɪlfəl","uz":"yovuz, qo'rqinchli","ru":"зловещий","ex":["A baleful glance across the table ended the discussion."],"u":"S10U14"},{"id":"lex.05712","w":"inimical","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪˈnɪmɪkəl","uz":"zid, dushmanlik qiluvchi","ru":"враждебный, неблагоприятный","ex":["Constant reorganisation is inimical to careful work."],"u":"S10U14"},{"id":"lex.05713","w":"innocuous","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪˈnɑkjuəs","uz":"zararsiz","ru":"безобидный","ex":["An innocuous sentence that turned out to carry the whole liability."],"u":"S10U14"},{"id":"lex.05714","w":"salubrious","pos":"adj","ipa":"səˈlubriəs","uz":"sog'lomlashtiruvchi; obro'li","ru":"целебный; благопристойный","ex":["The salubrious air was the reason the sanatorium was built there."],"u":"S10U14"},{"id":"lex.05715","w":"salutary","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈsæljəteri","uz":"saboq beruvchi, foydali","ru":"отрезвляющий, полезный","ex":["The audit was a salutary shock and the department is better for it."],"u":"S10U14"},{"id":"lex.05716","w":"propitious","pos":"adj","ipa":"prəˈpɪʃəs","uz":"qulay sharoit yaratuvchi","ru":"благоприятный","ex":["The moment was not propitious and they waited four months."],"u":"S10U14"},{"id":"lex.05717","w":"auspicious","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɔˈspɪʃəs","uz":"xayrli, yaxshilikdan darak beruvchi","ru":"благоприятный, многообещающий","ex":["An auspicious start: three orders in the first week."],"u":"S10U14"},{"id":"lex.05718","w":"augur","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈɔɡər","uz":"darak bermoq","ru":"предвещать","ex":["Two resignations in a month do not augur well."],"u":"S10U14"},{"id":"lex.05719","w":"harbinger","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈhɑrbɪndʒər","uz":"darakchi, xabarchi belgi","ru":"предвестник","ex":["The first closure was a harbinger and nobody read it as one."],"u":"S10U14"},{"id":"lex.05720","w":"portentous","pos":"adj","ipa":"pɔrˈtentəs","uz":"dahshatli voqeadan darak beruvchi; haddan jiddiy","ru":"зловещий; напыщенно-многозначительный","ex":["A portentous pause, and then a perfectly ordinary announcement."],"u":"S10U14"},{"id":"lex.05721","w":"minatory","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈmɪnətɔri","uz":"do'q-po'pisa ohangidagi","ru":"угрожающий","ex":["A minatory letter from a firm nobody had heard of."],"u":"S10U14"},{"id":"lex.05722","w":"redoubtable","pos":"adj","ipa":"rɪˈdaʊtəbəl","uz":"hurmat uyg'otadigan darajada kuchli","ru":"грозный, внушающий уважение","ex":["A redoubtable chair who has never lost a vote she called."],"u":"S10U14"},{"id":"lex.05723","w":"prodigious","pos":"adj","ipa":"prəˈdɪdʒəs","uz":"hayratlanarli darajada katta","ru":"громадный, поразительный","ex":["A prodigious memory for names and none at all for faces."],"u":"S10U14"},{"id":"lex.05724","w":"inordinate","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪnˈɔrdɪnət","uz":"me'yoridan ortiq","ru":"чрезмерный","ex":["An inordinate amount of time went on the cover."],"u":"S10U14"},{"id":"lex.05725","w":"profuse","pos":"adj","ipa":"prəˈfjus","uz":"mo'l-ko'l, serob","ru":"обильный","ex":["Profuse apologies and no change to the schedule."],"u":"S10U14"},{"id":"lex.05726","w":"plenitude","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈplenɪtud","uz":"to'kinlik","ru":"изобилие, полнота","ex":["A plenitude of evidence and no agreement about what it shows."],"u":"S10U14"},{"id":"lex.05727","w":"apogee","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈæpədʒi","uz":"eng yuqori nuqta","ru":"апогей","ex":["The style reached its apogee about 1908 and then looked dated."],"u":"S10U14"},{"id":"lex.05728","w":"draconian","pos":"adj","ipa":"drəˈkoʊniən","uz":"haddan ortiq qattiq","ru":"драконовский","ex":["Draconian penalties for late filing and none at all for bad filing."],"u":"S10U15"},{"id":"lex.05729","w":"exigent","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈeksɪdʒənt","uz":"shoshilinch, kechiktirib bo'lmas","ru":"неотложный, настоятельный","ex":["In exigent circumstances the officer may act without the warrant."],"u":"S10U15"},{"id":"lex.05730","w":"abeyance","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈbeɪəns","uz":"vaqtincha to'xtatib turish holati","ru":"состояние приостановки","ex":["The rule was held in abeyance while the review ran."],"u":"S10U15"},{"id":"lex.05731","w":"bequeath","pos":"verb","ipa":"bɪˈkwið","uz":"vasiyat qilib qoldirmoq","ru":"завещать","ex":["She bequeathed the whole collection to the city library."],"u":"S10U15"},{"id":"lex.05732","w":"divest","pos":"verb","ipa":"daɪˈvest","uz":"ulushdan voz kechmoq; huquqdan mahrum qilmoq","ru":"избавляться от активов; лишать","ex":["The fund divested from the sector over eighteen months."],"u":"S10U15"},{"id":"lex.05733","w":"sequester","pos":"verb","ipa":"sɪˈkwestər","uz":"ajratib qo'ymoq, hibsga olmoq","ru":"изымать, секвестровать","ex":["The assets were sequestered pending the outcome."],"u":"S10U15"},{"id":"lex.05734","w":"relegate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈrelɪɡeɪt","uz":"pastga tushirmoq, chetga surmoq","ru":"понижать, отодвигать","ex":["The finding was relegated to a footnote and stayed there."],"u":"S10U15"},{"id":"lex.05735","w":"requite","pos":"verb","ipa":"rɪˈkwaɪt","uz":"qaytarmoq, evaziga javob bermoq","ru":"воздавать, отплачивать","ex":["The help was never requited and never mentioned again."],"u":"S10U15"},{"id":"lex.05736","w":"pecuniary","pos":"adj","ipa":"pɪˈkjunieri","uz":"pul bilan bog'liq","ru":"денежный, финансовый","ex":["He declared no pecuniary interest and owned a third of the supplier."],"u":"S10U15"},{"id":"lex.05737","w":"penurious","pos":"adj","ipa":"pəˈnʊriəs","uz":"qashshoq; qurumsoq","ru":"бедствующий; скупой","ex":["A penurious decade that the family still measures other years against."],"u":"S10U15"},{"id":"lex.05738","w":"impecunious","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌɪmpɪˈkjuniəs","uz":"puli yo'q, kambag'al","ru":"безденежный","ex":["An impecunious student who is now on the board."],"u":"S10U15"},{"id":"lex.05739","w":"indigent","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈɪndɪdʒənt","uz":"muhtoj, kam ta'minlangan","ru":"неимущий, нуждающийся","ex":["The fund exists for indigent applicants and is spent on legal fees."],"u":"S10U15"},{"id":"lex.05740","w":"frugal","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈfruɡəl","uz":"tejamkor","ru":"бережливый","ex":["A frugal household that gave away more than its neighbours."],"u":"S10U15"},{"id":"lex.05741","w":"parsimonious","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌpɑrsɪˈmoʊniəs","uz":"xasis darajada tejamkor","ru":"скупой, прижимистый","ex":["A parsimonious settlement that cost more in court than it saved."],"u":"S10U15"},{"id":"lex.05742","w":"provident","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈprɑvɪdənt","uz":"oldindan g'amlaydigan","ru":"предусмотрительный","ex":["A provident council put aside four years of maintenance money."],"u":"S10U15"},{"id":"lex.05743","w":"munificent","pos":"adj","ipa":"mjuˈnɪfɪsənt","uz":"saxovatli","ru":"щедрый, великодушный","ex":["A munificent gift with conditions attached to every line."],"u":"S10U15"},{"id":"lex.05744","w":"squander","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈskwɑndər","uz":"behuda sovurmoq","ru":"транжирить, упускать","ex":["They squandered a two-year lead in a single autumn."],"u":"S10U15"},{"id":"lex.05745","w":"stint","pos":"verb","ipa":"stɪnt","uz":"qisib bermoq, tejab qolmoq","ru":"скупиться, урезать","ex":["They stinted on the foundations and paid for it in year three."],"u":"S10U15"},{"id":"lex.05746","w":"fetter","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈfetər","uz":"qo'l-oyog'ini bog'lab qo'ymoq","ru":"сковывать, связывать","ex":["The agreement fetters the council's own planning powers."],"u":"S10U15"},{"id":"lex.05747","w":"encumber","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪnˈkʌmbər","uz":"yuk bo'lib bog'lab qo'ymoq","ru":"обременять","ex":["The property is encumbered by a right of way nobody uses."],"u":"S10U15"},{"id":"lex.05748","w":"impair","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪmˈper","uz":"ishlashini susaytirmoq","ru":"ухудшать, ослаблять","ex":["Long shifts impair judgement long before anyone feels tired."],"u":"S10U15"},{"id":"lex.05749","w":"jettison","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈdʒetɪsən","uz":"ortiqchasini tashlab yubormoq","ru":"выбрасывать за борт, отказываться от","ex":["They jettisoned two chapters and the book improved."],"u":"S10U15"},{"id":"lex.05750","w":"forbear","pos":"verb","ipa":"fɔrˈber","uz":"o'zini tiyib turmoq","ru":"воздерживаться","ex":["He forbore to mention the earlier version, which was kind of him."],"u":"S10U15"},{"id":"lex.05751","w":"fastidious","pos":"adj","ipa":"fæˈstɪdiəs","uz":"injiq darajada ozoda va talabchan","ru":"привередливый, дотошный","ex":["A fastidious editor who queries the spacing as well as the argument."],"u":"S10U16"},{"id":"lex.05752","w":"punctilious","pos":"adj","ipa":"pʌŋkˈtɪliəs","uz":"rasm-rusumga qat'iy amal qiladigan","ru":"педантично-щепетильный","ex":["Punctilious about the minutes, and the minutes were always right."],"u":"S10U16"},{"id":"lex.05753","w":"sedulous","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈsedʒələs","uz":"tinimsiz, tirishqoq","ru":"усердный, прилежный","ex":["Sedulous checking caught an error that had survived three editions."],"u":"S10U16"},{"id":"lex.05754","w":"judicious","pos":"adj","ipa":"dʒuˈdɪʃəs","uz":"oqilona, o'ylangan","ru":"рассудительный, взвешенный","ex":["A judicious cut of forty pages saved the book."],"u":"S10U16"},{"id":"lex.05755","w":"sagacious","pos":"adj","ipa":"səˈɡeɪʃəs","uz":"donishmand","ru":"прозорливый, мудрый","ex":["A sagacious guess in 1998 that looks like foresight now."],"u":"S10U16"},{"id":"lex.05756","w":"sagacity","pos":"noun","ipa":"səˈɡæsɪti","uz":"donishmandlik","ru":"прозорливость, мудрость","ex":["The sagacity of the design shows in how little maintenance it needs."],"u":"S10U16"},{"id":"lex.05757","w":"perspicacity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌpɜrspɪˈkæsɪti","uz":"zehni o'tkirligi","ru":"проницательность","ex":["Her perspicacity about people made the interviews short."],"u":"S10U16"},{"id":"lex.05758","w":"probity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈproʊbɪti","uz":"halollik, poklik","ru":"честность, неподкупность","ex":["Thirty years of probity and one careless signature."],"u":"S10U16"},{"id":"lex.05759","w":"rectitude","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈrektɪtud","uz":"axloqiy poklik","ru":"нравственная безупречность","ex":["His rectitude was real and it made him difficult to work with."],"u":"S10U16"},{"id":"lex.05760","w":"mettle","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈmetəl","uz":"matonat","ru":"стойкость, твёрдость духа","ex":["The second winter tested everyone's mettle."],"u":"S10U16"},{"id":"lex.05761","w":"prowess","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpraʊɪs","uz":"mahorat, epchillik","ru":"доблесть, мастерство","ex":["Her prowess as a negotiator is discussed more than her results."],"u":"S10U16"},{"id":"lex.05762","w":"alacrity","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈlækrɪti","uz":"astoydil shaylik","ru":"готовность, живость","ex":["He accepted with an alacrity that surprised the committee."],"u":"S10U16"},{"id":"lex.05763","w":"serendipity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌserənˈdɪpɪti","uz":"tasodifan yaxshi narsa topish","ru":"счастливая случайность","ex":["The discovery was serendipity and the follow-up was ten years of work."],"u":"S10U16"},{"id":"lex.05764","w":"dilatory","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈdɪlətɔri","uz":"ishni cho'zadigan","ru":"медлительный, затягивающий","ex":["A dilatory reply after eleven weeks and two reminders."],"u":"S10U16"},{"id":"lex.05765","w":"indolent","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈɪndələnt","uz":"dangasa","ru":"ленивый, праздный","ex":["An indolent summer that produced one very good chapter."],"u":"S10U16"},{"id":"lex.05766","w":"sloth","pos":"noun","ipa":"slɔθ","uz":"erinchoqlik","ru":"лень, праздность","ex":["The delay was sloth dressed up as due process."],"u":"S10U16"},{"id":"lex.05767","w":"soporific","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌsɑpəˈrɪfɪk","uz":"uyqu keltiradigan","ru":"усыпляющий","ex":["A soporific first hour and then twenty minutes that mattered."],"u":"S10U16"},{"id":"lex.05768","w":"tepid","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈtepɪd","uz":"iliq; sovuqqon munosabatdagi","ru":"тепловатый; прохладный (о приёме)","ex":["Tepid applause from an audience that had expected more."],"u":"S10U16"},{"id":"lex.05769","w":"feckless","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈfekləs","uz":"mas'uliyatsiz, uquvsiz","ru":"безответственный, никчёмный","ex":["Calling the tenants feckless saved the landlord an explanation."],"u":"S10U16"},{"id":"lex.05770","w":"hapless","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈhæpləs","uz":"baxtsiz, omadi yurishmagan","ru":"незадачливый, злополучный","ex":["The hapless clerk who signed it had been in post for four days."],"u":"S10U16"},{"id":"lex.05771","w":"maladroit","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌmæləˈdrɔɪt","uz":"noshud, uquvsiz","ru":"неловкий, нескладный","ex":["A maladroit apology that offended a second group."],"u":"S10U16"},{"id":"lex.05772","w":"fatuous","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈfætʃuəs","uz":"bema'ni va o'zidan mamnun","ru":"глупый, самодовольный","ex":["A fatuous comparison that the speaker clearly thought was profound."],"u":"S10U16"},{"id":"lex.05773","w":"puerile","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈpjʊrəl","uz":"bolalarcha, yengiltak","ru":"ребяческий, инфантильный","ex":["The exchange grew puerile and the chair closed the session."],"u":"S10U16"},{"id":"lex.05774","w":"contrite","pos":"adj","ipa":"kənˈtraɪt","uz":"chin dildan pushaymon","ru":"раскаивающийся","ex":["A contrite letter that did not ask for anything in return."],"u":"S10U17"},{"id":"lex.05775","w":"abnegation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌæbnɪˈɡeɪʃən","uz":"o'z manfaatidan voz kechish","ru":"самоотречение","ex":["Years of abnegation that the family never once discussed."],"u":"S10U17"},{"id":"lex.05776","w":"assuage","pos":"verb","ipa":"əˈsweɪdʒ","uz":"og'riqni yumshatmoq","ru":"смягчать, утолять","ex":["Nothing in the statement assuaged the families."],"u":"S10U17"},{"id":"lex.05777","w":"allay","pos":"verb","ipa":"əˈleɪ","uz":"xavotirni bosmoq","ru":"развеивать, успокаивать","ex":["The inspection allayed most of the concerns and confirmed one."],"u":"S10U17"},{"id":"lex.05778","w":"emollient","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪˈmɑljənt","uz":"yumshatuvchi, murosaga chorlovchi","ru":"успокаивающий, примирительный","ex":["An emollient speech that gave away nothing at all."],"u":"S10U17"},{"id":"lex.05779","w":"propitiate","pos":"verb","ipa":"prəˈpɪʃieɪt","uz":"ko'nglini olmoq, rozi qilmoq","ru":"умилостивить","ex":["The concession was made to propitiate two members and lost four."],"u":"S10U17"},{"id":"lex.05780","w":"cajole","pos":"verb","ipa":"kəˈdʒoʊl","uz":"erkalab ko'ndirmoq","ru":"уговаривать, улещивать","ex":["She cajoled three departments into sharing one budget line."],"u":"S10U17"},{"id":"lex.05781","w":"beguile","pos":"verb","ipa":"bɪˈɡaɪl","uz":"mahliyo qilib aldamoq","ru":"обольщать, завлекать","ex":["The prospectus beguiled investors who should have known better."],"u":"S10U17"},{"id":"lex.05782","w":"importune","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌɪmpɔrˈtun","uz":"qayta-qayta yalinib so'ramoq","ru":"докучать просьбами","ex":["He importuned the ministry for two years and got the road."],"u":"S10U17"},{"id":"lex.05783","w":"loath","pos":"adj","ipa":"loʊθ","uz":"istamaydigan, xohlamaydigan","ru":"не желающий, нерасположенный","ex":["I am loath to reopen a question that took a year to close."],"u":"S10U17"},{"id":"lex.05784","w":"recalcitrant","pos":"adj","ipa":"rɪˈkælsɪtrənt","uz":"bo'ysunmaydigan","ru":"непокорный, строптивый","ex":["One recalcitrant supplier held up the whole line for a month."],"u":"S10U17"},{"id":"lex.05785","w":"refractory","pos":"adj","ipa":"rɪˈfræktəri","uz":"bo'ysunmas, davolashga chidamli","ru":"упорный, не поддающийся","ex":["A refractory case that responded to nothing for eighteen months."],"u":"S10U17"},{"id":"lex.05786","w":"obdurate","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈɑbdərət","uz":"qaysar, fikridan qaytmaydigan","ru":"упрямый, непреклонный","ex":["The board was obdurate until the auditors arrived."],"u":"S10U17"},{"id":"lex.05787","w":"implacable","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪmˈplækəbəl","uz":"murosasiz, bosib bo'lmaydigan","ru":"неумолимый, непримиримый","ex":["An implacable opponent of the scheme from the first day to the last."],"u":"S10U17"},{"id":"lex.05788","w":"adamant","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈædəmənt","uz":"qat'iy turib olgan","ru":"непреклонный","ex":["She was adamant that the figures be published in full."],"u":"S10U17"},{"id":"lex.05789","w":"resolute","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈrezəlut","uz":"qat'iyatli","ru":"решительный","ex":["Resolute in a way that made the rest of the team calm."],"u":"S10U17"},{"id":"lex.05790","w":"tenacious","pos":"adj","ipa":"təˈneɪʃəs","uz":"qo'yib yubormaydigan, o'jar","ru":"цепкий, упорный","ex":["A tenacious reporter who called every week for a year."],"u":"S10U17"},{"id":"lex.05791","w":"dogged","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈdɔɡɪd","uz":"tinimsiz, qat'iy","ru":"упорный, настойчивый","ex":["Dogged work over four winters produced the first full map."],"u":"S10U17"},{"id":"lex.05792","w":"pertinacious","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌpɜrtɪˈneɪʃəs","uz":"o'ta o'jar va qat'iy","ru":"упорствующий","ex":["A pertinacious claimant who outlasted three ministers."],"u":"S10U17"},{"id":"lex.05793","w":"craven","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈkreɪvən","uz":"qo'rqoq va tuban","ru":"малодушный, трусливый","ex":["A craven retreat from a position he had defended in print."],"u":"S10U17"},{"id":"lex.05794","w":"pusillanimous","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌpjusɪˈlænɪməs","uz":"jur'atsiz","ru":"малодушный","ex":["A pusillanimous statement that named nobody and blamed the weather."],"u":"S10U17"},{"id":"lex.05795","w":"timorous","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈtɪmərəs","uz":"qo'rqoqroq, hadiksirab turadigan","ru":"боязливый, робкий","ex":["A timorous first question, and then she did not stop for an hour."],"u":"S10U17"},{"id":"lex.05796","w":"quail","pos":"verb","ipa":"kweɪl","uz":"qo'rqib orqaga tisarilmoq","ru":"дрогнуть, струсить","ex":["He did not quail under questioning that lasted five hours."],"u":"S10U17"},{"id":"lex.05797","w":"temperate","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈtempərət","uz":"mo'tadil","ru":"умеренный","ex":["A temperate reply to a letter that did not deserve one."],"u":"S10U18"},{"id":"lex.05798","w":"ascetic","pos":"adj","ipa":"əˈsetɪk","uz":"tarki dunyo qilgan, zohid","ru":"аскетический","ex":["An ascetic routine that he kept for fifty years."],"u":"S10U18"},{"id":"lex.05799","w":"austere","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɔˈstɪr","uz":"qattiqqo'l, bezaksiz","ru":"строгий, суровый","ex":["An austere building that everyone said they would hate and nobody does."],"u":"S10U18"},{"id":"lex.05800","w":"reverent","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈrevərənt","uz":"chuqur ehtirom bilan","ru":"благоговейный","ex":["A reverent silence that lasted rather longer than planned."],"u":"S10U18"},{"id":"lex.05801","w":"emulate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈemjəleɪt","uz":"o'rnak olib, teng bo'lishga intilmoq","ru":"подражать, равняться на","ex":["Three cities tried to emulate the scheme and one succeeded."],"u":"S10U18"},{"id":"lex.05802","w":"edify","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈedɪfaɪ","uz":"ma'naviy jihatdan boyitmoq","ru":"просвещать, наставлять","ex":["The lecture was meant to edify and it merely exhausted."],"u":"S10U18"},{"id":"lex.05803","w":"inculcate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪnˈkʌlkeɪt","uz":"takrorlab singdirmoq","ru":"внушать, прививать","ex":["The drills inculcate a habit that saves seconds when it matters."],"u":"S10U18"},{"id":"lex.05804","w":"disconcert","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˌdɪskənˈsɜrt","uz":"dovdiratib qo'ymoq","ru":"смущать, приводить в замешательство","ex":["The question disconcerted him and the pause was long."],"u":"S10U18"},{"id":"lex.05805","w":"discomfit","pos":"verb","ipa":"dɪsˈkʌmfɪt","uz":"noqulay ahvolga solmoq","ru":"сбивать с толку, ставить в неловкое положение","ex":["One accurate figure discomfited the whole panel."],"u":"S10U18"},{"id":"lex.05806","w":"nettle","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈnetəl","uz":"jig'iga tegmoq","ru":"задевать, раздражать","ex":["The remark nettled her and she answered it three days later."],"u":"S10U18"},{"id":"lex.05807","w":"irascible","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪˈræsəbəl","uz":"tez jahli chiqadigan","ru":"вспыльчивый","ex":["An irascible man who never once held a grudge."],"u":"S10U18"},{"id":"lex.05808","w":"petulant","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈpetʃələnt","uz":"arzimagan narsaga xafa bo'lib injiqlik qiladigan","ru":"капризный, раздражительный","ex":["A petulant footnote attacking a reviewer by name."],"u":"S10U18"},{"id":"lex.05809","w":"querulous","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈkwerələs","uz":"doim nolib turadigan","ru":"ворчливый, жалующийся","ex":["A querulous letter about a bus that had run on time for a decade."],"u":"S10U18"},{"id":"lex.05810","w":"fractious","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈfrækʃəs","uz":"janjalkash, injiq","ru":"сварливый, капризный","ex":["A fractious meeting that produced a surprisingly good decision."],"u":"S10U18"},{"id":"lex.05811","w":"churlish","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈtʃɜrlɪʃ","uz":"qo'pol, noshukur","ru":"грубый, неучтивый","ex":["It would be churlish not to thank them for the room."],"u":"S10U18"},{"id":"lex.05812","w":"truculent","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈtrʌkjələnt","uz":"janjalga tayyor, qahrli","ru":"агрессивный, задиристый","ex":["Truculent in the first session and cooperative in every one after."],"u":"S10U18"},{"id":"lex.05813","w":"bellicose","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈbelɪkoʊs","uz":"urushqoq ohangdagi","ru":"воинственный","ex":["Bellicose speeches at home and quiet talks abroad."],"u":"S10U18"},{"id":"lex.05814","w":"pugnacious","pos":"adj","ipa":"pʌɡˈneɪʃəs","uz":"urishqoq, bahsga chanqoq","ru":"драчливый, задиристый","ex":["A pugnacious style of debate that works badly in writing."],"u":"S10U18"},{"id":"lex.05815","w":"belabour","pos":"verb","ipa":"bɪˈleɪbər","uz":"bir gapni cho'zib ta'kidlayvermoq","ru":"разжёвывать, долбить одно и то же","ex":["I will not belabour the point: the deadline has passed."],"u":"S10U18"},{"id":"lex.05816","w":"askance","pos":"adv","ipa":"əˈskæns","uz":"shubha bilan qiyalab","ru":"косо, с недоверием","ex":["The committee looked askance at a budget with no contingency."],"u":"S10U18"},{"id":"lex.05817","w":"asperity","pos":"noun","ipa":"æˈsperɪti","uz":"ohangdagi keskinlik","ru":"резкость, суровость","ex":["He said it with an asperity nobody had heard from him before."],"u":"S10U18"},{"id":"lex.05818","w":"ancillary","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈænsəleri","uz":"yordamchi, qo'shimcha","ru":"вспомогательный","ex":["Ancillary services cost more than the building they serve."],"u":"S10U19"},{"id":"lex.05819","w":"expedient","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪkˈspidiənt","uz":"vaqtinchalik chora","ru":"целесообразная мера, уловка","ex":["The rota was an expedient in 1998 and is now the system."],"u":"S10U19"},{"id":"lex.05820","w":"extricate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈekstrɪkeɪt","uz":"qiyin ahvoldan chiqarib olmoq","ru":"высвобождать, выпутывать","ex":["It took two years to extricate the company from that contract."],"u":"S10U19"},{"id":"lex.05821","w":"eschew","pos":"verb","ipa":"esˈtʃu","uz":"ataylab chetlab o'tmoq","ru":"воздерживаться, избегать","ex":["The report eschews adjectives and is stronger for it."],"u":"S10U19"},{"id":"lex.05822","w":"immutable","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪˈmjutəbəl","uz":"o'zgarmas","ru":"неизменный","ex":["Very few of the rules treated as immutable were written down."],"u":"S10U19"},{"id":"lex.05823","w":"impervious","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪmˈpɜrviəs","uz":"o'tkazmaydigan; ta'sir qilmaydigan","ru":"непроницаемый; невосприимчивый","ex":["The layer is impervious to water and useless against heat."],"u":"S10U19"},{"id":"lex.05824","w":"inscrutable","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪnˈskrutəbəl","uz":"ich-ichini bilib bo'lmaydigan","ru":"непроницаемый, загадочный","ex":["An inscrutable expression that could have meant either answer."],"u":"S10U19"},{"id":"lex.05825","w":"impassive","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪmˈpæsɪv","uz":"hissiyot bildirmaydigan","ru":"бесстрастный","ex":["He stayed impassive while the figures were read out."],"u":"S10U19"},{"id":"lex.05826","w":"palpable","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈpælpəbəl","uz":"sezilib turgan, aniq","ru":"ощутимый, явный","ex":["The relief in the room was palpable."],"u":"S10U19"},{"id":"lex.05827","w":"indelible","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪnˈdeləbəl","uz":"o'chmas","ru":"несмываемый, неизгладимый","ex":["The week left an indelible mark on everyone who worked it."],"u":"S10U19"},{"id":"lex.05828","w":"incongruous","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪnˈkɑŋɡruəs","uz":"atrofiga mos kelmaydigan","ru":"неуместный, несообразный","ex":["An incongruous glass entrance on a building from 1890."],"u":"S10U19"},{"id":"lex.05829","w":"rife","pos":"adj","ipa":"raɪf","uz":"avjiga chiqqan, keng tarqalgan","ru":"широко распространённый","ex":["Rumour was rife for a fortnight and almost all of it was wrong."],"u":"S10U19"},{"id":"lex.05830","w":"tantamount","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈtæntəmaʊnt","uz":"amalda teng, aynan shunday","ru":"равносильный","ex":["Silence here is tantamount to consent."],"u":"S10U19"},{"id":"lex.05831","w":"viable","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈvaɪəbəl","uz":"hayotga qobil, amalda ishlaydigan","ru":"жизнеспособный","ex":["Only one of the four routes is commercially viable."],"u":"S10U19"},{"id":"lex.05832","w":"tractable","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈtræktəbəl","uz":"boshqarish oson, yechimli","ru":"поддающийся, послушный","ex":["Break it into three tractable problems and it is a week's work."],"u":"S10U19"},{"id":"lex.05833","w":"malleable","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈmæliəbəl","uz":"shakllanuvchan, egiluvchan","ru":"податливый, ковкий","ex":["Opinion was malleable for about a week and then it set."],"u":"S10U19"},{"id":"lex.05834","w":"quiescent","pos":"adj","ipa":"kwiˈesənt","uz":"hozircha jim, harakatsiz","ru":"бездействующий, затихший","ex":["The fault has been quiescent since 1948."],"u":"S10U19"},{"id":"lex.05835","w":"rarefied","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈrerɪfaɪd","uz":"tor doiraga xos, seskaralgan","ru":"рафинированный, узкий (о круге)","ex":["A rarefied debate conducted in four journals by nine people."],"u":"S10U19"},{"id":"lex.05836","w":"redolent","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈredələnt","uz":"eslatib turadigan; hidi anqib turgan","ru":"напоминающий; пропитанный запахом","ex":["A phrase redolent of committee papers from the 1970s."],"u":"S10U19"},{"id":"lex.05837","w":"predilection","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌpredəˈlekʃən","uz":"moyillik, xush ko'rish","ru":"пристрастие, склонность","ex":["A predilection for long sentences that his editor has never cured."],"u":"S10U19"},{"id":"lex.05838","w":"proclivity","pos":"noun","ipa":"proʊˈklɪvɪti","uz":"tabiiy moyillik","ru":"склонность, наклонность","ex":["A proclivity for reorganisation that has cost three good teams."],"u":"S10U19"},{"id":"lex.05839","w":"extant","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈekstənt","uz":"bugungacha saqlanib qolgan","ru":"сохранившийся, существующий","ex":["Four copies are extant and three of them are in one library."],"u":"S10U19"},{"id":"lex.05840","w":"ameliorate","pos":"verb","ipa":"əˈmiljəreɪt","uz":"ahvolni bir oz yaxshilamoq","ru":"улучшать, смягчать","ex":["The grant ameliorated the worst of it and solved nothing."],"u":"S10U20"},{"id":"lex.05841","w":"adroit","pos":"adj","ipa":"əˈdrɔɪt","uz":"chaqqon va mohir","ru":"ловкий, искусный","ex":["An adroit answer that conceded nothing and offended nobody."],"u":"S10U20"},{"id":"lex.05842","w":"ardent","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈɑrdənt","uz":"qizg'in, ishtiyoqli","ru":"страстный, пылкий","ex":["An ardent defender of a policy he had opposed for a decade."],"u":"S10U20"},{"id":"lex.05843","w":"arduous","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈɑrdʒuəs","uz":"mashaqqatli","ru":"трудоёмкий, тяжёлый","ex":["An arduous four years that produced a book of ninety pages."],"u":"S10U20"},{"id":"lex.05844","w":"avid","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈævɪd","uz":"ishtiyoqmand, berilib ketgan","ru":"страстный, заядлый","ex":["An avid reader of other people's footnotes."],"u":"S10U20"},{"id":"lex.05845","w":"beget","pos":"verb","ipa":"bɪˈɡet","uz":"keltirib chiqarmoq","ru":"порождать","ex":["One exception begat four more within the year."],"u":"S10U20"},{"id":"lex.05846","w":"bereft","pos":"adj","ipa":"bɪˈreft","uz":"mahrum bo'lgan","ru":"лишённый, осиротевший","ex":["The department was bereft of anyone who remembered the decision."],"u":"S10U20"},{"id":"lex.05847","w":"blithe","pos":"adj","ipa":"blaɪð","uz":"beg'am, xotirjam","ru":"беспечный","ex":["A blithe assumption that the data would arrive on time."],"u":"S10U20"},{"id":"lex.05848","w":"burgeon","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈbɜrdʒən","uz":"tez o'smoq, avj olmoq","ru":"бурно расти","ex":["Demand burgeoned and the supply chain did not."],"u":"S10U20"},{"id":"lex.05849","w":"callous","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈkæləs","uz":"berahm, hissiyotsiz","ru":"бессердечный, чёрствый","ex":["A callous phrase in a letter about a death."],"u":"S10U20"},{"id":"lex.05850","w":"cavalier","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌkævəˈlɪr","uz":"beparvo, yengil qaraydigan","ru":"бесцеремонный, легкомысленный","ex":["A cavalier attitude to record-keeping that cost the case."],"u":"S10U20"},{"id":"lex.05851","w":"censorious","pos":"adj","ipa":"senˈsɔriəs","uz":"doim ayb topadigan","ru":"осуждающий, придирчивый","ex":["A censorious review that missed the point of the book."],"u":"S10U20"},{"id":"lex.05852","w":"deprecate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈdeprɪkeɪt","uz":"qoralamoq, ma'qullamasligini bildirmoq","ru":"осуждать, не одобрять","ex":["The guidance deprecates the practice without forbidding it."],"u":"S10U20"},{"id":"lex.05853","w":"ebullient","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪˈbʊljənt","uz":"quvnoq va jo'shqin","ru":"кипучий, жизнерадостный","ex":["Ebullient on the first day and unreachable by the third."],"u":"S10U20"},{"id":"lex.05854","w":"effete","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪˈfit","uz":"holdan toygan, kuchsizlangan","ru":"истощённый, изнеженный","ex":["He called the whole tradition effete and then borrowed from it."],"u":"S10U20"},{"id":"lex.05855","w":"egregious","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪˈɡridʒəs","uz":"yaqqol, dahshatli darajada yomon","ru":"вопиющий","ex":["An egregious error on the first page of the summary."],"u":"S10U20"},{"id":"lex.05856","w":"enervate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈenərveɪt","uz":"holdan toydirmoq","ru":"обессиливать, изнурять","ex":["Three months of meetings enervated the whole team."],"u":"S10U20"},{"id":"lex.05857","w":"ennui","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɑnˈwi","uz":"zerikish, ruhiy toliqish","ru":"скука, тоска","ex":["A general ennui settled on the office in the second year."],"u":"S10U20"},{"id":"lex.05858","w":"enormity","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪˈnɔrmɪti","uz":"qilmishning dahshatli darajadagi yovuzligi","ru":"чудовищность","ex":["The enormity of what had been ordered took years to admit."],"u":"S10U20"},{"id":"lex.05859","w":"execrable","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈeksɪkrəbəl","uz":"o'ta sifatsiz","ru":"отвратительный, никудышный","ex":["An execrable translation of a book that deserved better."],"u":"S10U20"},{"id":"lex.05860","w":"exult","pos":"verb","ipa":"ɪɡˈzʌlt","uz":"quvonchdan yayramoq","ru":"ликовать, торжествовать","ex":["They exulted for an evening and started again on Monday."],"u":"S10U20"},{"id":"lex.05861","w":"antipathy","pos":"noun","ipa":"ænˈtɪpəθi","uz":"chuqur nafrat, yoqtirmaslik","ru":"антипатия","ex":["The antipathy between the two departments predates everyone in them."],"u":"S10U21"},{"id":"lex.05862","w":"aversion","pos":"noun","ipa":"əˈvɜrʒən","uz":"jirkanish, qochish istagi","ru":"отвращение, неприязнь","ex":["An aversion to meetings that has served him extremely well."],"u":"S10U21"},{"id":"lex.05863","w":"avarice","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈævərɪs","uz":"ochko'zlik, molparastlik","ru":"алчность","ex":["The scheme depended on the avarice of people who already had enough."],"u":"S10U21"},{"id":"lex.05864","w":"hubris","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈhjubrɪs","uz":"manmanlik, o'zini hamma narsaga qodir deb bilish","ru":"гордыня","ex":["The expansion was hubris and everyone said so afterwards."],"u":"S10U21"},{"id":"lex.05865","w":"nadir","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈneɪdər","uz":"eng past nuqta","ru":"надир, низшая точка","ex":["The nadir came in February and nobody recognised it as the turn."],"u":"S10U21"},{"id":"lex.05866","w":"nefarious","pos":"adj","ipa":"nɪˈferiəs","uz":"yovuz, qabih","ru":"гнусный, злодейский","ex":["Nothing nefarious was going on: it was one badly designed form."],"u":"S10U21"},{"id":"lex.05867","w":"odious","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈoʊdiəs","uz":"jirkanchli, nafratga loyiq","ru":"отвратительный, гнусный","ex":["An odious comparison that the speaker refused to withdraw."],"u":"S10U21"},{"id":"lex.05868","w":"onerous","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈɑnərəs","uz":"og'ir yuk bo'ladigan","ru":"обременительный","ex":["Onerous reporting requirements for firms with four employees."],"u":"S10U21"},{"id":"lex.05869","w":"ostracise","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈɑstrəsaɪz","uz":"jamoadan chetlatmoq","ru":"подвергать остракизму","ex":["He was ostracised for two years and then quietly rehabilitated."],"u":"S10U21"},{"id":"lex.05870","w":"rapacious","pos":"adj","ipa":"rəˈpeɪʃəs","uz":"talonchi, to'ymas","ru":"хищнический, ненасытный","ex":["Rapacious lending in the good years and no lending at all in the bad."],"u":"S10U21"},{"id":"lex.05871","w":"reprobate","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈreprəbeɪt","uz":"buzuq, axloqsiz odam","ru":"негодяй, пропащий человек","ex":["The old reprobate turned up to the funeral in a borrowed coat."],"u":"S10U21"},{"id":"lex.05872","w":"scurrilous","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈskɜrələs","uz":"tuhmatli, haqoratomuz","ru":"клеветнический","ex":["A scurrilous pamphlet that three newspapers repeated as fact."],"u":"S10U21"},{"id":"lex.05873","w":"licentious","pos":"adj","ipa":"laɪˈsenʃəs","uz":"axloq me'yorlarini mensimaydigan","ru":"распущенный","ex":["The book was called licentious by people who had not opened it."],"u":"S10U21"},{"id":"lex.05874","w":"meretricious","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌmerɪˈtrɪʃəs","uz":"tashqi ko'rinishi jozibali, mazmuni bo'sh","ru":"показной, мишурный","ex":["A meretricious design that photographs well and leaks."],"u":"S10U21"},{"id":"lex.05875","w":"wanton","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈwɑntən","uz":"atayin va sababsiz qilingan","ru":"бессмысленный, беспричинный","ex":["Wanton damage to a building that had survived two wars."],"u":"S10U21"},{"id":"lex.05876","w":"vociferous","pos":"adj","ipa":"voʊˈsɪfərəs","uz":"baland ovoz bilan talab qiladigan","ru":"громогласный, шумный","ex":["A vociferous minority that turned out to be right."],"u":"S10U21"},{"id":"lex.05877","w":"strident","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈstraɪdənt","uz":"quloqni qomatga keltiradigan; keskin","ru":"резкий, пронзительный","ex":["The strident tone cost the campaign its moderate support."],"u":"S10U21"},{"id":"lex.05878","w":"stultify","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈstʌltɪfaɪ","uz":"ma'nosini yo'qotib, sustlashtirmoq","ru":"выхолащивать, обессмысливать","ex":["Endless approval stages stultify the very work they protect."],"u":"S10U21"},{"id":"lex.05879","w":"stymie","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈstaɪmi","uz":"yo'lini to'sib qo'ymoq","ru":"ставить в тупик, блокировать","ex":["The project was stymied by a single unsigned form."],"u":"S10U21"},{"id":"lex.05880","w":"vaunt","pos":"verb","ipa":"vɔnt","uz":"maqtanmoq","ru":"хвастаться, кичиться","ex":["The much-vaunted system failed in its first week."],"u":"S10U21"},{"id":"lex.05881","w":"whet","pos":"verb","ipa":"wet","uz":"charxlamoq; ishtahani ochmoq","ru":"точить; разжигать (аппетит)","ex":["The first chapter whets the appetite and the second satisfies it."],"u":"S10U21"},{"id":"lex.05882","w":"assail","pos":"verb","ipa":"əˈseɪl","uz":"hujum qilmoq","ru":"атаковать, обрушиваться","ex":["The report was assailed from both sides within an hour."],"u":"S10U21"},{"id":"lex.05883","w":"besiege","pos":"verb","ipa":"bɪˈsidʒ","uz":"qamal qilmoq; talablar bilan bosmoq","ru":"осаждать","ex":["The office was besieged with calls for three days."],"u":"S10U21"},{"id":"lex.05884","w":"beleaguer","pos":"verb","ipa":"bɪˈliɡər","uz":"qiyinchiliklar bilan qurshab olmoq","ru":"изматывать, осаждать","ex":["A beleaguered department with two vacancies and four inquiries."],"u":"S10U21"},{"id":"lex.05885","w":"venerate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈvenəreɪt","uz":"ehtirom bilan ulug'lamoq","ru":"почитать, благоговеть","ex":["The building is venerated locally and listed by nobody."],"u":"S10U22"},{"id":"lex.05886","w":"preeminent","pos":"adj","ipa":"priˈemɪnənt","uz":"eng peshqadam","ru":"выдающийся, первенствующий","ex":["The preeminent authority on the period published almost nothing."],"u":"S10U22"},{"id":"lex.05887","w":"stalwart","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈstɔlwərt","uz":"sodiq va ishonchli tarafdor","ru":"верный сторонник","ex":["Four stalwarts kept the association alive through the 1990s."],"u":"S10U22"},{"id":"lex.05888","w":"idyllic","pos":"adj","ipa":"aɪˈdɪlɪk","uz":"jannatdek go'zal va tinch","ru":"идиллический","ex":["An idyllic week, and the road was closed on the eighth day."],"u":"S10U22"},{"id":"lex.05889","w":"halcyon","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈhælsiən","uz":"osoyishta va baxtli (o'tmish haqida)","ru":"безмятежный (о прошлом)","ex":["The halcyon years were 1986 to 1991 and nobody noticed at the time."],"u":"S10U22"},{"id":"lex.05890","w":"ethereal","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪˈθɪriəl","uz":"nihoyatda nafis, samoviy","ru":"неземной, воздушный","ex":["An ethereal opening that the brass section ends abruptly."],"u":"S10U22"},{"id":"lex.05891","w":"gratuitous","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɡrəˈtuɪtəs","uz":"keraksiz, sababsiz qilingan","ru":"беспричинный, излишний","ex":["A gratuitous insult in a paragraph that did not need one."],"u":"S10U22"},{"id":"lex.05892","w":"fortuitous","pos":"adj","ipa":"fɔrˈtuɪtəs","uz":"tasodifiy","ru":"случайный","ex":["The meeting was fortuitous and it changed both their careers."],"u":"S10U22"},{"id":"lex.05893","w":"fervid","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈfɜrvɪd","uz":"olovli, jo'shqin","ru":"пылкий, горячий","ex":["A fervid introduction to a very cautious set of findings."],"u":"S10U22"},{"id":"lex.05894","w":"filial","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈfɪliəl","uz":"farzandlik burchiga oid","ru":"сыновний, дочерний","ex":["Filial duty brought him back for eleven years."],"u":"S10U22"},{"id":"lex.05895","w":"mien","pos":"noun","ipa":"min","uz":"qiyofa, turish-turmush","ru":"облик, манера держаться","ex":["He came in with the mien of a man who already knew the answer."],"u":"S10U22"},{"id":"lex.05896","w":"wistful","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈwɪstfəl","uz":"hasratli, sog'inchli","ru":"тоскливый, задумчиво-грустный","ex":["A wistful paragraph about a city he left at nineteen."],"u":"S10U22"},{"id":"lex.05897","w":"maudlin","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈmɔdlɪn","uz":"ko'zda yosh bilan ortiqcha hissiyotga berilgan","ru":"слезливо-сентиментальный","ex":["The speech turned maudlin at about the twenty-minute mark."],"u":"S10U22"},{"id":"lex.05898","w":"mawkish","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈmɔkɪʃ","uz":"yasama his-tuyg'uga to'la","ru":"приторно-сентиментальный","ex":["The tribute is mawkish where a plain sentence would have worked."],"u":"S10U22"},{"id":"lex.05899","w":"trepidation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌtrepɪˈdeɪʃən","uz":"hadik, xavotir","ru":"трепет, боязнь","ex":["She opened the results with some trepidation and then laughed."],"u":"S10U22"},{"id":"lex.05900","w":"vicissitude","pos":"noun","ipa":"vɪˈsɪsɪtud","uz":"taqdir o'zgarishi, sinov","ru":"превратность судьбы","ex":["The firm survived the vicissitudes of four currencies."],"u":"S10U22"},{"id":"lex.05901","w":"zenith","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈzinɪθ","uz":"cho'qqi, eng yuksak nuqta","ru":"зенит, вершина","ex":["At its zenith the route carried freight from three countries."],"u":"S10U22"},{"id":"lex.05902","w":"travesty","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈtrævɪsti","uz":"masxaraomuz buzib ko'rsatish","ru":"пародия, извращение","ex":["The hearing was a travesty and the verdict was quashed."],"u":"S10U22"},{"id":"lex.05903","w":"satiate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈseɪʃieɪt","uz":"to'yintirib qo'ymoq","ru":"пресыщать","ex":["Two hours of detail satiated even the specialists."],"u":"S10U22"},{"id":"lex.05904","w":"voracious","pos":"adj","ipa":"vəˈreɪʃəs","uz":"to'ymas, ochko'z","ru":"ненасытный, прожорливый","ex":["A voracious reader who finishes four books on a long weekend."],"u":"S10U22"},{"id":"lex.05905","w":"viscous","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈvɪskəs","uz":"quyuq va sekin oqadigan","ru":"вязкий","ex":["The mixture is viscous at room temperature and runs when warmed."],"u":"S10U22"},{"id":"lex.05906","w":"aqueduct","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈækwɪdʌkt","uz":"suv o'tkazgich, akveduk","ru":"акведук","ex":["The aqueduct carried water forty kilometres to the old town."],"u":"S10U23"},{"id":"lex.05907","w":"caravanserai","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌkerəˈvænsəraɪ","uz":"karvonsaroy","ru":"караван-сарай","ex":["The caravanserai outside Bukhara housed forty camels a night."],"u":"S10U23"},{"id":"lex.05908","w":"cloister","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈklɔɪstər","uz":"ustunli aylanma yo'lak","ru":"крытая галерея, клуатр","ex":["The cloister is the coolest place in the building by two o'clock."],"u":"S10U23"},{"id":"lex.05909","w":"colonnade","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌkɑləˈneɪd","uz":"ustunlar qatori","ru":"колоннада","ex":["A colonnade of fourteen columns, two of them modern copies."],"u":"S10U23"},{"id":"lex.05910","w":"cornice","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈkɔrnɪs","uz":"karniz","ru":"карниз","ex":["The cornice was replaced in fibreglass and nobody has noticed."],"u":"S10U23"},{"id":"lex.05911","w":"desalination","pos":"noun","ipa":"diˌsælɪˈneɪʃən","uz":"suvni sho'rsizlantirish","ru":"опреснение","ex":["Desalination solved the supply and doubled the energy bill."],"u":"S10U23"},{"id":"lex.05912","w":"eaves","pos":"noun","ipa":"ivz","uz":"tom chekkasi","ru":"свес крыши","ex":["Swallows nest under the eaves every April."],"u":"S10U23"},{"id":"lex.05913","w":"effluent","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈefluənt","uz":"oqova suv","ru":"сточные воды","ex":["The effluent was within the limit and the limit was written in 1972."],"u":"S10U23"},{"id":"lex.05914","w":"escarpment","pos":"noun","ipa":"ɪˈskɑrpmənt","uz":"tik yon bag'ir","ru":"уступ, крутой склон","ex":["The road climbs the escarpment in eleven turns."],"u":"S10U23"},{"id":"lex.05915","w":"fen","pos":"noun","ipa":"fen","uz":"botqoqli pastlik","ru":"болотистая низина","ex":["The fen was drained in the 1930s and the soil is still sinking."],"u":"S10U23"},{"id":"lex.05916","w":"gable","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɡeɪbəl","uz":"tomning uchburchak peshtoqi","ru":"фронтон","ex":["The date is cut into the stone gable: 1897."],"u":"S10U23"},{"id":"lex.05917","w":"inlay","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɪnleɪ","uz":"qadama naqsh","ru":"инкрустация","ex":["Mother-of-pearl inlay in a door that has been outside for a century."],"u":"S10U23"},{"id":"lex.05918","w":"lacquer","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈlækər","uz":"lak qoplama","ru":"лак","ex":["Eleven coats of lacquer, each one polished before the next."],"u":"S10U23"},{"id":"lex.05919","w":"lintel","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈlɪntəl","uz":"eshik ustidagi to'sin","ru":"перемычка, притолока","ex":["The lintel is a single piece of stone two metres long."],"u":"S10U23"},{"id":"lex.05920","w":"mausoleum","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌmɔsəˈliəm","uz":"maqbara","ru":"мавзолей","ex":["The mausoleum was restored in 1988 and again in 2014."],"u":"S10U23"},{"id":"lex.05921","w":"minaret","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˌmɪnəˈret","uz":"minora","ru":"минарет","ex":["The minaret leans by about a metre and has done for four hundred years."],"u":"S10U23"},{"id":"lex.05922","w":"pylon","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpaɪlɑn","uz":"elektr uzatish minorasi","ru":"опора ЛЭП","ex":["A line of pylons crosses the valley where the road cannot."],"u":"S10U23"},{"id":"lex.05923","w":"refining","pos":"noun","ipa":"rɪˈfaɪnɪŋ","uz":"tozalash, qayta ishlash","ru":"переработка, очистка","ex":["Refining happens near the port and the crude comes by pipeline."],"u":"S10U23"},{"id":"lex.05924","w":"smelting","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsmeltɪŋ","uz":"ruda eritish","ru":"выплавка","ex":["Smelting began here in the 1930s and closed in 2004."],"u":"S10U23"},{"id":"lex.05925","w":"substation","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈsʌbsteɪʃən","uz":"elektr podstansiyasi","ru":"подстанция","ex":["The substation failed and four districts went dark at once."],"u":"S10U23"},{"id":"lex.05926","w":"transhumance","pos":"noun","ipa":"trænsˈhjuməns","uz":"mavsumiy ko'chish, yaylovga chiqish","ru":"отгонное животноводство","ex":["Transhumance still shapes the calendar in the upper valleys."],"u":"S10U23"},{"id":"lex.05927","w":"vicarious","pos":"adj","ipa":"vaɪˈkeriəs","uz":"o'zgalar tajribasi orqali his qilinadigan","ru":"опосредованный, чужой (об опыте)","ex":["A vicarious pleasure in a journey he will never make."],"u":"S10U23"},{"id":"lex.05928","w":"fickle","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈfɪkəl","uz":"beqaror, o'zgaruvchan","ru":"непостоянный, переменчивый","ex":["A fickle audience that loved the first book and ignored the second."],"u":"S10U24"},{"id":"lex.05929","w":"flag","pos":"verb","ipa":"flæɡ","uz":"holdan toymoq, susaymoq","ru":"ослабевать, выдыхаться","ex":["Attention flagged in the second hour and the chair called a break."],"u":"S10U24"},{"id":"lex.05930","w":"fraught","pos":"adj","ipa":"frɔt","uz":"tarang, muammoga to'la","ru":"напряжённый, чреватый","ex":["A fraught meeting that ended better than it began."],"u":"S10U24"},{"id":"lex.05931","w":"impetuous","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪmˈpetʃuəs","uz":"shoshqaloq, o'ylamay ish qiladigan","ru":"порывистый, импульсивный","ex":["An impetuous resignation that he withdrew within a week."],"u":"S10U24"},{"id":"lex.05932","w":"itinerant","pos":"adj","ipa":"aɪˈtɪnərənt","uz":"ko'chib yuruvchi, sayyor","ru":"странствующий, бродячий","ex":["An itinerant teacher who covered nine villages by bicycle."],"u":"S10U24"},{"id":"lex.05933","w":"nonplussed","pos":"adj","ipa":"nɑnˈplʌst","uz":"dovdirab qolgan","ru":"озадаченный, сбитый с толку","ex":["He was nonplussed by a question nobody had thought to ask."],"u":"S10U24"},{"id":"lex.05934","w":"parochial","pos":"adj","ipa":"pəˈroʊkiəl","uz":"tor doiradagi, mahalliy manfaatga berilgan","ru":"ограниченный, местечковый","ex":["A parochial debate about a problem that is the same in forty countries."],"u":"S10U24"},{"id":"lex.05935","w":"peripatetic","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˌperɪpəˈtetɪk","uz":"joydan joyga ko'chib ishlaydigan","ru":"странствующий, разъездной","ex":["A peripatetic career across four institutions and two languages."],"u":"S10U24"},{"id":"lex.05936","w":"pragmatic","pos":"adj","ipa":"præɡˈmætɪk","uz":"amaliy, hayotiy yondashadigan","ru":"прагматичный","ex":["A pragmatic compromise that nobody defends and everybody uses."],"u":"S10U24"},{"id":"lex.05937","w":"precocious","pos":"adj","ipa":"prɪˈkoʊʃəs","uz":"erta rivojlangan","ru":"не по годам развитый","ex":["A precocious reader who found the library before the playground."],"u":"S10U24"},{"id":"lex.05938","w":"penchant","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈpentʃɑnt","uz":"xush ko'rish, moyillik","ru":"склонность, пристрастие","ex":["A penchant for footnotes that his readers have learned to enjoy."],"u":"S10U24"},{"id":"lex.05939","w":"quixotic","pos":"adj","ipa":"kwɪkˈsɑtɪk","uz":"orzuparast, amalga oshmaydigan","ru":"донкихотский","ex":["A quixotic attempt to reopen a line closed in 1964."],"u":"S10U24"},{"id":"lex.05940","w":"vacillate","pos":"verb","ipa":"ˈvæsəleɪt","uz":"ikkilanib turmoq","ru":"колебаться","ex":["The committee vacillated for three months and the offer expired."],"u":"S10U24"},{"id":"lex.05941","w":"vacuous","pos":"adj","ipa":"ˈvækjuəs","uz":"mazmunsiz, bo'sh","ru":"бессодержательный, пустой","ex":["A vacuous statement that took four people a day to draft."],"u":"S10U24"},{"id":"lex.05942","w":"wrest","pos":"verb","ipa":"rest","uz":"tortib olmoq","ru":"вырывать, отвоёвывать","ex":["They wrested the concession from a ministry that had refused twice."],"u":"S10U24"},{"id":"lex.05943","w":"inexorable","pos":"adj","ipa":"ɪnˈeksərəbəl","uz":"to'xtatib bo'lmaydigan","ru":"неумолимый, неотвратимый","ex":["The inexorable arithmetic of an ageing population."],"u":"S10U24"},{"id":"lex.05944","w":"bucolic","pos":"adj","ipa":"bjuˈkɑlɪk","uz":"qishloq hayotiga xos","ru":"сельский, пасторальный","ex":["A bucolic scene on the label and a factory behind the photographer."],"u":"S10U24"},{"id":"lex.05945","w":"skein","pos":"noun","ipa":"skeɪn","uz":"kalava, o'ram","ru":"моток; клубок","ex":["Six skeins of undyed wool and a pattern from her grandmother."],"u":"S10U24"},{"id":"lex.05946","w":"gloaming","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈɡloʊmɪŋ","uz":"shom qorong'usi","ru":"сумерки","ex":["They walked back in the gloaming without saying much."],"u":"S10U24"},{"id":"lex.05947","w":"rivulet","pos":"noun","ipa":"ˈrɪvjəlɪt","uz":"jilg'a","ru":"ручеёк","ex":["A rivulet crosses the path and disappears under the road."],"u":"S10U24"},{"id":"lex.05948","w":"loam","pos":"noun","ipa":"loʊm","uz":"unumdor tuproq","ru":"суглинок, плодородная почва","ex":["Deep loam along the river and stony ground fifty metres up."],"u":"S10U24"}]